                               "Reused naming from the reference module. Directive: a decision prescribes. Used where corporate decisions gate development (2.2.3 narrative)." ;
                  rdfs:label "Go/No-Go Decision" ;
                  skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes whether to proceed or not proceed with a course of action." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#GoToMarketStrategy
ex:GoToMarketStrategy rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                      rdfs:comment "Output of 3.3.8. Directive (Formulation)." ;
                      rdfs:label "Go-to-Market Strategy" ;
                      skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes how a company will execute a product release, promotion, and sale to customers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#GovernanceBody
ex:GovernanceBody rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00001180 ;
                  rdfs:comment "Participant minted for ex:P10914 (the board of directors and audit committee that the establishment act constitutes). Modeled as an Organization (independent continuant) that bears the governance mandate, never as an ICE." ;
                  rdfs:label "Governance Body" ;
                  skos:definition "An Organization constituted within or over a focal Organization to direct, oversee, or assure its activities, such as a board of directors or an audit committee." .


