                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10928
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10929
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Setting targets for periodic tax liabilities. Assess the tax impact of various activities such as the acquisition or disposal of fixed assets or a deliberate change in number of employee." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10765" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (planning -> directive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Assessment of tax impact of activities is a typical sub-step, recorded here rather than as a restriction (Phase-3 necessity)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop tax strategy and plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that sets targets for the organization's periodic tax liabilities and produces a tax strategy prescribing how those liabilities are to be planned and met." ;
          skos:example "A tax department sets next year's effective-tax-rate target and documents the plan to achieve it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10766
ex:P10766 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10930
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10931
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10932
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10933
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10934
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10935
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10936
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Processing the taxes of the organization in line with the regional taxation structure, including corporate, property, excise, and service taxes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10766" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction to the neutral cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), and the has output ex:TaxReturn existential DROPPED. Two coupled defects fixed: (1) GENUS/OUTPUT disagreement -- ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction is a money-transfer act, yet the sole asserted output was ex:TaxReturn, a Descriptive reporting product (the 'pay' genus and the 'file' output describe two different acts). (2) The node is a standing file-and-pay umbrella: the source ('Processing the taxes ... corporate, property, excise, service taxes') and example ('runs the quarterly cycle that files and pays all taxes') span both filing and payment, and NONE of its seven children is itself an ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (10930 Formulation, 10931/10932/10936 Reporting, 10933/10934 Accounting, 10935 Monitoring) -- so the transaction genus was not exemplified by any part. No single definitional output spans both filing and payment, so the umbrella carries none; ex:TaxReturn (filing) and Monetary Payment (payment) are produced by the respective children. REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (over-commits to the 'pay' facet)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process taxes" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that carries out the organization's tax obligations in line with the regional taxation structure -- encompassing corporate, property, excise, and service taxes -- and that has as process parts the planning, filing, accounting, monitoring, and payment of those taxes." ;
          skos:example "A finance shared-service center runs the quarterly cycle that files and pays all corporate and indirect taxes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10767
ex:P10767 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Forecasting and monitoring changes in foreign currency value or interest rates around the world that play an important role in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.10.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10767" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternationalFundsManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: monitoring/forecasting yields a Descriptive ICE (the forecast), not a directive." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor international rates" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input market rate data and has as output a financial forecast describing anticipated changes in foreign-currency values and interest rates relevant to the organization." ;
          skos:example "A treasury analyst tracks global FX and interest-rate movements and issues a weekly currency-rate forecast." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10768
ex:P10768 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing any transfer of funds in the course of conducting cross-border trades or investments, including conversion across currencies. Find the most suitable alternative for making payments, while saving taxes and avoiding any unwarranted regulation, with the objective of protecting capital." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.10.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10768" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternationalFundsManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (cco:ont00000228). Operations process: the transferred funds are a MATERIAL participant (ex:PaymentInstrument via obo:BFO_0000057, not has output); the audit record is the informational has output (ex:TransactionRecord). Tax-optimization and regulatory-avoidance objectives are typical sub-considerations, recorded here rather than as definitional restrictions." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that transfers funds across borders in the course of trade or investment, converting between currencies, and produces a monetary payment and a record of the transaction." ;
          skos:example "A treasury operation converts EUR to USD and remits an intercompany payment to settle a cross-border purchase." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10769
ex:P10769 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing exposure to potential financial losses as a result of changes in the value of currencies. Forecast the impact of movements in foreign currency values. Enter into financial transactions designed to offset or limit potential exposure to loss." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.10.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10769" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternationalFundsManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to ex:ActOfAnalysis (false-friend on the label word 'Monitor'). The source verb is 'Assessing exposure to potential financial losses ... Forecast the impact of movements' -- a bounded discernment/judgement producing a risk assessment and forecast, i.e. analysis, not continuous status-observation against expected parameters (the ex:ActOfMonitoring differentia, which fits standing oversight such as ex:P19583). This aligns the exposure-assessment core with the methodology's parallel treatment of identical content in 9.7.5: ex:P19580 'Determine foreign exchange exposure' and ex:P19576 'Determine interest rate exposure', both ex:ActOfAnalysis producing ex:RiskAssessment from ex:MarketRateData (D2 sibling/parallel-row consistency). HEDGING FACET (second defect, intentionally collapsed at 9.10's coarse grain): the label is compound ('...hedge currency') and the source's third sentence ('Enter into financial transactions designed to offset or limit potential exposure to loss') names hedging as a core facet. APQC 9.10 is modeled coarse-grained and does NOT mint separate child rows for it; the hedge decision and execution are first-class acts in the finer-grained 9.7.5 decomposition -- ex:P19581 (ex:ActOfSelection -> Directive ex:HedgeRequirementSpecification, the decision-to-hedge / GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE directive facet) and ex:P19582 (ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction, trade execution). This row is therefore scoped to the assessment/forecast facet and cross-references that decomposition rather than mislabelling hedging as a mere non-definitional 'typical consequence'. REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfMonitoring (continuous-oversight reading; diverges from the 9.7.5 siblings)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor currency exposure/hedge currency" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines market rate data and produces a financial risk assessment and a financial forecast describing the organization's exposure to losses from movements in foreign-currency values." ;
          skos:example "A treasurer measures net open EUR exposure and forecasts its loss potential (the offsetting hedge decision/execution being modeled finer-grained at 9.7.5: ex:P19581 / ex:P19582)." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10770
ex:P10770 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Documenting and reporting accounting entries to formally report financial gains or losses experienced as a result of foreign exchange activity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.10.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10770" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternationalFundsManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting (cco:ont00000366). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: reporting produces a Descriptive ICE (the financial report). The accounting entries reported on are modeled as ex:TransactionRecord inputs." ;
          rdfs:label "Report results" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input transaction records of foreign-exchange accounting entries and has as output a financial report that formally states the gains or losses realized from foreign-exchange activity." ;
          skos:example "Accounting documents realized FX gains and issues the period's foreign-exchange results report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10771
ex:P10771 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Formulating financial budgetary guidelines and strategies. Develop a framework for rules and regulations regarding budgets. Create a step-by-step process to achieve financial goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10771" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): formulating rules/procedures yields Directive ICEs (cco:ont00000965), so the act genus is ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and maintain budget policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes budgetary guidelines and produces a financial policy and a financial procedure governing how budgets are set." ;
          skos:example "A controller drafts the corporate budgeting policy and the step-by-step budgeting procedure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10772
ex:P10772 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating reports on a quarterly or annual basis for fund allocation. Create a financial statement that estimates revenues and expenses over a specific period of time. (Leverage budget methods such as cost-based and zero-based budgeting techniques, in light of the periodic targets outlined during Develop and maintain budget policies and procedures [10771].)" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10772" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): a budget prescribes intended allocation (cco:ont00000965). Method references (cost-based/zero-based budgeting) and the budget policies from 10771 are typical, not definitional, so not promoted to restrictions." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare periodic budgets and plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that allocates funds over a period and produces a budget prescribing estimated revenues and expenses." ;
          skos:example "The annual departmental budget estimating next year's revenues and expenses." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10773
ex:P10773 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000371 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating estimates of the projected income and expenses required over a predetermined time frame. Develop the projections of profit and loss statements, balance sheets, and the cash flow forecast." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10773" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis to cco:ont00000371 (Act of Prediction). The source text is purely predictive ('Creating estimates of the projected income and expenses ... Develop the projections of profit and loss statements, balance sheets, and the cash flow forecast') and CCO ships a dedicated verified class for exactly this: cco:ont00000371 (Act of Prediction) = 'A Planned Act that involves the generation of a Predictive Information Content entity that is intended to describe an uncertain possible future event, value, entity, or attribute', whose own examples include predicting a stock's future value. REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfAnalysis (under Act of Information Processing): it is correct but under-committal and obscures the predictive nature; reuse-before-mint (D5) prefers the fitting verified CCO class over a broader local genus. Output ex:FinancialForecast retyped under cco:ont00000626 (Predictive ICE, still a Descriptive ICE), so the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE holds under either genus and this is a pure act-genus specificity fix. P&L, balance-sheet, and cash-flow projections are facets of the one forecast." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare periodic financial forecasts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Prediction that examines financial data and generates a financial forecast projecting income and expenses over a predetermined time frame." ;
          skos:example "A quarterly cash-flow and P&L forecast for the next four quarters." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10774
ex:P10774 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting accounting for assets, and finding reasons for changes (depreciation, obsolescence, deterioration, change in customer taste, increased demand, decreased market supply, etc.)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10774" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output: accounting records/statements (cco:ont00000853). The fixed-asset register is the definitional input that is updated; the financial statement is the definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform inventory accounting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records inventory and asset values and accounts for the causes of their change, producing a financial statement of those assets." ;
          skos:example "Recording depreciation and obsolescence write-downs against the fixed-asset register." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10775
ex:P10775 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Studying expenses directly associated with product. Analyze the cost of sales, which is the cost of manufacturing products." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10775" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853). Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: examining cost data to produce an understanding." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform cost of sales analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the expenses directly associated with products and produces a cost analysis of the cost of sales." ;
          skos:example "Breaking down manufacturing cost of goods sold by component." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10776
ex:P10776 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Studying and finding out the relevant cost center for a product by studying every resource used in its making." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10776" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853). Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: derives a cost figure from resource-usage data." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform product costing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines every resource consumed in making a product and produces a cost analysis attributing the product's cost to the relevant cost center." ;
          skos:example "Allocating direct material, labor, and overhead to compute a unit product cost." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10777
ex:P10777 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:VarianceAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Discovering the changes between forecasted and actual costing. Analyze actual and planned behavior by reviewing the amount of a variance on a trend line in order to maintain control over a business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10777" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853). Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis. Distinct from 20136 (variance against forecasts/budgets at the planning level); this one operates on cost data." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform variance analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that compares planned and actual costing and produces a variance analysis of the differences." ;
          skos:example "Plotting actual-vs-standard cost variances on a trend line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10778
ex:P10778 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostDriverSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining cost drivers for a particular activity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10778" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853): a register of identified drivers. Genus ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense), reused from apqc-ext." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine key cost drivers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the factors driving the cost of an activity and produces a cost-driver specification registering them." ;
          skos:example "Identifying machine-hours and order-count as the drivers of a warehousing activity's cost." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10779
ex:P10779 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000345 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostDriverSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostDriverMeasurement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Calculating cost drivers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10779" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring) because the act literally quantifies driver magnitudes against a standard. Descriptive measurement output (cco:ont00000853). The cost-driver specification from 10778 is the definitional input. Explicit rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) added so the act-anchor chain is visible to the standalone SHACL run (ont00000345 is a CCO subclass of ont00000228, but the closure is not merged for Gate C)." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure cost drivers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Measuring that calculates the magnitude of identified cost drivers and produces a cost-driver measurement." ;
          skos:example "Counting the machine-hours consumed per product line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10780
ex:P10780 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CriticalActivityDetermination
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine the activities that hinder the progress of finance activities. This requires the organization to determine those business activities carried out by the financial function of the organization and which are indispensable. This undertaking helps the organization triangulate those activities which are essential and where costs cannot be slashed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10780" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853): a register marking which activities are essential. Genus ex:ActOfIdentification." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine critical activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns which finance activities are indispensable and produces a critical-activity determination." ;
          skos:example "Flagging payroll and regulatory reporting as indispensable, non-cuttable finance activities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10781
ex:P10781 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AssetDeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Distributing or allocating asset resources in different processes for optimal utilization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10781" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): an allocation plan prescribes how resources are deployed (cco:ont00000965), so the genus is ex:ActOfFormulation. Modeled as a bounded allocation exercise (a single deployment decision), not the standing 'manage' sense." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage asset resource deployment and utilization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that allocates asset resources across processes and produces an asset-deployment plan prescribing their optimal utilization." ;
          skos:example "Reassigning capital equipment between plants to improve utilization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10782
ex:P10782 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterFile
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Studying product demand and targeted customer preferences. Study customers' demands or preferences after deducting the cost of delivering the final product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10782" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates/judges profitability. Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess customer and product profitability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the profitability of customers and products after deducting delivery cost and produces a profitability analysis." ;
          skos:example "Ranking customer segments by net margin after cost-to-serve." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10783
ex:P10783 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NewProductEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking demand about a specific product by a customer segment. Conduct a detailed study--or research a customer behavior or preference for a product--in order to determine its production and profitability in a specific market." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10783" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853): a judgement of the product's viability." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate new products" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the demand and projected profitability of a new product in a market and produces a new-product evaluation." ;
          skos:example "Assessing whether a proposed product line is worth producing for a target segment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10784
ex:P10784 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LifeCycleCostAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the cost of delivering an end product at different stages of production. Study the total life cycle of a product/process to determine how much revenue and production cost will be incurred at every stage in order to make strategic decisions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10784" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853). Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: derives stage-by-stage cost understanding from cost data." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform life cycle costing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines a product's full life cycle and produces a life-cycle cost analysis of the revenue and cost incurred at each stage." ;
          skos:example "Computing total cost of ownership across a product's design, production, and disposal stages." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10785
ex:P10785 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductMixDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating the best fit between a product and the end user. Maximize the customer base by providing different products in the market." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10785" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): choosing an optimal mix from candidate combinations yields a decision (cco:ont00000965), so the genus is ex:ActOfSelection, reused from apqc-ext." ;
          rdfs:label "Optimize customer and product mix" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses the customer and product mix giving the best fit between products and end users and produces a product-mix decision prescribing that mix." ;
          skos:example "Selecting which products to offer to which segments to maximize the customer base." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10786
ex:P10786 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMeasure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Observing the behavior of a new set of customers for different products. Prepare strategies to improve sales and profits." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10786" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853): tracked performance metrics. Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring. The follow-on 'prepare strategies to improve sales' is a downstream, non-definitional step, so it is noted here rather than promoted to a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Track performance of new-customer and product strategies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes the behavior of new customers toward products and produces a performance measure of those new-customer and product strategies." ;
          skos:example "Monitoring repeat-purchase rates of customers acquired under a new product strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10787
ex:P10787 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMeasure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating performance based on different sets of activities created by management to measure performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10787" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853): a performance measure is a representation of measured performance. Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: computes metrics from activity data." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare activity-based performance measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that derives performance metrics from activity data and produces activity-based performance measures." ;
          skos:example "Computing cost-per-transaction and cycle-time metrics for finance activities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10788
ex:P10788 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10741
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting activities to improve cost distribution regularly. Follow or adopt different ways of reducing costs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10788" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5 = capability (R6). 'Continuous/regularly' denotes a standing function with no identifiable single beginning and end, so it is an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), not a bounded process. It is realized in cost-improvement acts and is realized-in-attached to its parent 10741 (the capability is realized in the process, per BFO_0000054 domain=realizable/range=process)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage continuous cost improvement (capability)" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an organization in virtue of its capacity to regularly improve cost distribution, realized in recurring acts of cost reduction." ;
          skos:example "A standing kaizen-style cost-improvement program run every quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10789
ex:P10789 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating guidelines for providing advances. Set up credit standards, credit terms, and collection policies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10789" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation (Directive output) per the Golden Principle: a policy is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish credit policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes credit standards, terms, and collection guidelines and produces a credit policy." ;
          skos:example "A controller sets the firm's credit standards and collection terms for the coming year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10790
ex:P10790 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterFile
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountApprovalDecision
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking and accepting new requests based on eligibility criteria. Analyze the status of applicants and requirements to be met for a new account." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10790" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges applicant status. Dual output -- a Descriptive credit assessment and a Directive approval decision." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze/Approve new account applications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates new-account applicants against eligibility criteria and produces a credit assessment and an account approval decision." ;
          skos:example "A credit analyst checks an applicant's status and approves a new account." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10791
ex:P10791 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterFile
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating existing account holders and their past performance. Regularly review existing accounts to get the required information about the status at present." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10791" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges account-holder performance/status." ;
          rdfs:label "Review existing accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates existing account holders and their past performance and produces an account statement of their present status." ;
          skos:example "A credit team reviews active accounts and reports each holder's current standing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10792
ex:P10792 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing account payable reports about payments to be made according to accounting rules and principles, and providing the reports to management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10792" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Reporting (Descriptive output): the report represents, rather than prescribes." ;
          rdfs:label "Produce credit/collection reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles credit and collection information into a financial report provided to management." ;
          skos:example "Accounting prepares a monthly collections report for senior management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10793
ex:P10793 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Closing or restarting accounts according to changes made in credit policies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10793" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operational accounting act on account records; takes the governing credit policy as input." ;
          rdfs:label "Reinstate or suspend accounts based on credit policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that closes or restarts customer accounts in accordance with current credit policy and updates the resulting account statement." ;
          skos:example "A clerk suspends an account that breaches the revised credit policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10794
ex:P10794 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterFile
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and updating a record of customers and the products being purchased by them in a database. This process element requires the organization to maintain a database of customers and their purchases. Such a master-file can be used to ensure customer touch point, enhance customer satisfaction, explore cross selling opportunities, and identify future trends. This database will include several particulars about the personal details of the organization's customers and a tracking of the products being sold." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10794" ;
          rdfs:comment "Record-maintenance accounting act; output is the Descriptive customer master file." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain customer/product master files" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that creates and updates records of customers and the products they purchase and produces a customer master file." ;
          skos:example "A clerk updates the customer master file after a new product is sold." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10795
ex:P10795 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing detailed reports about products purchased by customers. Record and generate a detail account of transactions made by customers fat a particular time and location. Include all details about products such as price, quantity, and name." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10795" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output modeled as ex:FinancialData (Descriptive ICE) covering price/quantity/product detail." ;
          rdfs:label "Generate customer billing data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records and compiles the details of a customer's purchase transactions and produces customer billing data." ;
          skos:example "The billing system generates the line-item billing data for a customer's monthly statement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10796
ex:P10796 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Invoice
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing information to customers about purchases made by them. Communicate the details of purchases. Provide customers with a copy of details for their reference." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10796" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication). Transmit-only per the ex:ActOfReporting carve-out: its rdfs:comment states 'Where a node only transmits an already-prepared report to a party, the group module reuses cco:ont00000402 instead.' The source text is delivery-only ('Providing information to customers ... Communicate the details ... Provide customers with a copy'); no new ICE is produced -- the invoice already exists from ex:P10743/ex:P10795. The invoice is therefore the transmitted ICE (has input), not an output, and the Customer is the recipient participant. cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06): 'A Planned Act in which some Information Content Entity is transferred from some Agent to Another.' Same transmit-only test applied to sibling 'provide a copy' nodes." ;
          rdfs:label "Transmit billing data to customers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that conveys a customer's purchase and billing details to that customer by delivering a copy of an already-prepared invoice." ;
          skos:example "The system emails a customer a copy of their invoice." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10797
ex:P10797 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Registering transactions and their scheduled payments." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10797" ;
          rdfs:comment "Posting/registration accounting act; output is the Descriptive transaction record." ;
          rdfs:label "Post receivable entries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that registers receivable transactions and their scheduled payments and produces a transaction record." ;
          skos:example "Accounting posts the receivable entry for a newly invoiced sale." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10798
ex:P10798 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking and solving billing queries raised by customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10798" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Resolution of billing records; the Customer participates as the inquiring party." ;
          rdfs:label "Resolve customer billing inquiries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that checks customer billing queries against the records and produces a corrected or clarified account statement resolving them." ;
          skos:example "A billing agent investigates and corrects an over-charge a customer disputed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10799
ex:P10799 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating rules and regulations to be followed in case of credit sales to customers. Create rules and procedures to follow at the time of sale (e.g., the allowable number of installments)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10799" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (Financial Policy) -> Act of Formulation per the Golden Principle." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish AR policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the rules and procedures governing credit sales and produces a financial policy for accounts receivable." ;
          skos:example "Finance sets the allowable installment terms for credit sales." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10800
ex:P10800 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collecting cash from customers. Deposit it into bank account. Make entries into the books of accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10800" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category permits material I/O: the input is a Monetary Payment (material entity); the booked entries are a Descriptive transaction record." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive/Deposit customer payments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that receives monetary payment from a customer, deposits it into a bank account, and books the corresponding entries as a transaction record." ;
          skos:example "A cashier deposits a customer's cash payment and records the receipt." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10801
ex:P10801 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BankingPartner
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking and moving funds between countries for business activities, typically through authorized remittance agents." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10801" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:BankingPartnerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Material input is a Monetary Payment (the remitted funds); the BankingPartner participates as the authorized remittance agent." ;
          rdfs:label "Apply cash remittances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that checks and moves monetary payments, typically through authorized remittance agents, and records the applied remittance." ;
          skos:example "Treasury applies an inbound cross-border remittance to the customer's account via an authorized agent." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10802
ex:P10802 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing reports that detail balances due or what to collect from customers at a certain point in time." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10802" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Reporting (Descriptive output)." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare AR reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles outstanding receivable balances at a point in time into a financial report." ;
          skos:example "Accounting produces an aged-receivables report at month-end." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10803
ex:P10803 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing the general ledger for account receivables from journals. Place all journal entries related to accounts receivables in the general ledger accounts of a business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10803" ;
          rdfs:comment "Posting accounting act; output is the General Ledger (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Post AR activity to the general ledger" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that transfers accounts-receivable journal entries into the general ledger accounts." ;
          skos:example "The accountant posts the AR sub-ledger entries to the general ledger." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10804
ex:P10804 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a process to follow in case of a failed payment by account holders. Create rules and regulations for the account holder who has failed to make at least the minimum monthly payment by the due date." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10804" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (Financial Policy) -> Act of Formulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish policies for delinquent accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the rules to follow when an account holder fails to make required payments and produces a financial policy for delinquent accounts." ;
          skos:example "Collections defines the dunning policy for accounts past due." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10805
ex:P10805 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountStatement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining balance statements of accountholders who failed to make required payments. Study or review the account details of customers' past payments when preparing negotiations policies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10805" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Analysis (information processing into a Descriptive judgement); input is the account statement." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze delinquent account balances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the balance statements and past payments of delinquent account holders and produces a credit assessment informing negotiation." ;
          skos:example "An analyst studies a defaulter's payment history before settlement talks." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10806
ex:P10806 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine ways for customers in default to repay debts (e.g., allowing more time or discounts)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10806" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: the definitional output is a prescribed repayment arrangement (Directive ICE). The defaulting Customer participates." ;
          rdfs:label "Correspond/Negotiate with delinquent accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that, through correspondence with a defaulting customer, determines and prescribes a repayment arrangement as a financial procedure." ;
          skos:example "A collections officer agrees an extended-time repayment plan with a customer in default." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10807
ex:P10807 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining rules for handling accounts. Discuss and plan with internal parties (department heads, managers, and senior management) about rules to follow in coming months." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10807" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (Financial Procedure) -> Act of Formulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Discuss account resolution with internal parties" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation in which internal parties determine and prescribe the rules for handling accounts and produce a financial procedure." ;
          skos:example "Department heads agree the rules for handling overdue accounts next quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10808
ex:P10808 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining reserves for write-offs and adjustments. Adjust or write off certain expenses and losses." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10808" ;
          rdfs:comment "Posting/adjustment accounting act; output is the Descriptive transaction record." ;
          rdfs:label "Process adjustments/write off balances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that adjusts or writes off uncollectible balances and maintains the related reserves, producing a transaction record." ;
          skos:example "Accounting writes off a bad debt and updates the allowance reserve." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10809
ex:P10809 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating guidelines to follow in case of adjustments to business processes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10809" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (Financial Procedure) -> Act of Formulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish policies/procedures for adjustments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the guidelines to follow when making account adjustments and produces a financial procedure." ;
          skos:example "Finance documents the procedure for posting account adjustments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10810
ex:P10810 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:VarianceAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking changes made in accounts during the year. Examine the alterations made in final accounts to rectify errors/omissions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10810" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Analysis (information processing into a Descriptive analysis)." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze adjustments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the alterations made in the final accounts during the year and produces a variance analysis identifying errors or omissions to rectify." ;
          skos:example "An accountant reviews the year's account adjustments to flag posting errors." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10811
ex:P10811 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing suitable offers to customers. Present different offers (e.g., discounts) available for customers or buyers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10811" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: the definitional output is a prescribed offer (Directive ICE). The Customer participates." ;
          rdfs:label "Correspond/Negotiate with customer" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that, through correspondence with a customer, determines and prescribes a suitable offer such as a discount as a financial procedure." ;
          skos:example "An agent offers a customer a settlement discount to clear an adjustment dispute." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10812
ex:P10812 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Discussing and planning with internal parties (department heads, managers, and senior management) about rules to follow in coming months." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10812" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (Financial Procedure) -> Act of Formulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Discuss resolution with internal parties" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation in which internal parties discuss and prescribe the rules to follow for handling adjustments in the coming months and produce a financial procedure." ;
          skos:example "Managers agree the rules for processing customer deductions next quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10813
ex:P10813 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Invoice
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a mechanism for consumer protection in case of a higher price charged. When a supplier sells a product at a higher price to the distributor than the price they have set with the end user, submit a chargeback to the supplier to recover the money lost in the transaction." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10813" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SupplierRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:Invoice (Descriptive ICE) is the chargeback document; the Supplier participates as the chargeback recipient." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare chargeback invoices" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that prepares a chargeback invoice submitted to a supplier to recover an over-charged amount and produces that invoice." ;
          skos:example "A distributor issues a supplier chargeback invoice for an over-billed shipment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10814
ex:P10814 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recording business transactions as they occur in order to provide a balanced accounts for financial reporting." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10814" ;
          rdfs:comment "Posting accounting act; output is the Descriptive transaction record." ;
          rdfs:label "Process related entries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records related business transactions as they occur to maintain balanced accounts for financial reporting and produces a transaction record." ;
          skos:example "The ledger clerk records the offsetting entries for a processed deduction." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10815
ex:P10815 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceLevelAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Agreeing upon terms and conditions. Negotiate an agreement between two or more parties, the customer and service providers. Specify scope, quality, and responsibilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10815" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation (output a Directive ICE) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: a negotiated SLA prescribes obligations." ;
          rdfs:label "Negotiate service-level agreements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that negotiates terms among parties and produces a service-level agreement specifying scope, quality, and responsibilities." ;
          skos:example "A shared-services finance team negotiating an SLA with an internal customer." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10816
ex:P10816 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing policies and procedures to prepare financial statements, including methods, measurement systems, and procedures for providing disclosures." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10816" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:FinancialPolicyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: output is a Financial Policy (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish accounting policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the accounting policies and procedures governing how financial statements and disclosures are prepared." ;
          skos:example "A controller adopting a revenue-recognition policy for the organization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10817
ex:P10817 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ApprovalLimitSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing parameters for accounting. Apply set conditions for any approval process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10817" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:FinancialPolicyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: output is an Approval Limit Specification (Directive ICE) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Set and enforce approval limits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that sets the monetary thresholds and conditions governing financial-approval processes and prescribes their enforcement." ;
          skos:example "Defining tiered sign-off thresholds for expenditure approvals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10818
ex:P10818 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing processes and procedures to exercise financial control and accountability. Record, verify, and report transactions that affect revenues, expenditures, assets, and liabilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10818" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:FinancialPolicyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: output is a Financial Procedure (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish common financial systems" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the processes and procedures for exercising financial control and accountability over transactions affecting revenues, expenditures, assets, and liabilities." ;
          skos:example "Standing up a common ledger-posting and control procedure across business units." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10819
ex:P10819 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChartOfAccounts
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing trial balance account from general ledgers. List all accounts used in the general ledger. Alter accounts according to business requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10819" ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain chart of accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that lists and updates the set of accounts used in the general ledger to produce a current chart of accounts." ;
          skos:example "Adding a new expense account to the chart of accounts for a new business line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10820
ex:P10820 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making ledger and trial balance accounts from journal entries. This process requires the organization to record every transaction into accounts done by business. It is a base documents for preparing final accounts of company." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10820" ;
          rdfs:label "Process journal entries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records transactions as journal entries and posts them to produce the general ledger." ;
          skos:example "Posting the period's sales and purchase journals to the ledger." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10821
ex:P10821 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Allocating funds across functions. Apportion funds in line with the budgets created. Formalize allocations in centralized internal records." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10821" ;
          rdfs:comment "Budget is a definitional input (the basis for apportionment); allocations are recorded as transaction records." ;
          rdfs:label "Process allocations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that apportions funds across functions in line with the budget and records the allocations in centralized internal records." ;
          skos:example "Allocating shared overhead to business units per the approved budget." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10822
ex:P10822 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Updating journal entries to adjust the balance of income and expenses at the end of an accounting period." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10822" ;
          rdfs:label "Process period end adjustments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that updates journal entries to adjust income and expense balances at the close of an accounting period, updating the general ledger." ;
          skos:example "Booking accruals and deferrals at month-end close." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10823
ex:P10823 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking accounts separately for a parent and subsidiary company. Manage relationship between a parent company and subsidiaries. Document intercompany transactions in separate financial statements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10823" ;
          rdfs:comment "Subsidiaries are typical participants; recorded here as commentary rather than a definitional restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Post and reconcile intercompany transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that posts and reconciles transactions between a parent company and its subsidiaries and documents them in the general ledger." ;
          skos:example "Reconciling an intercompany loan between a parent and its subsidiary." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10824
ex:P10824 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing general ledger accounts for a parent and subsidiaries companies. Validate the integrity of account balances on the company's general ledger of accounts. Review and compare general ledger accounts balances with source documents to ensure that balances match." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10824" ;
          rdfs:label "Reconcile general ledger accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that compares general-ledger account balances against source documents to validate their integrity and produce a reconciled general ledger." ;
          skos:example "Tying cash-account balances to bank statements during close." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10825
ex:P10825 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aggregating different processes in the business. Eliminate discontinued processes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10825" ;
          rdfs:label "Perform consolidations and process eliminations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that aggregates accounts across business processes and eliminates discontinued items to produce a consolidated general ledger." ;
          skos:example "Eliminating intercompany balances when consolidating group accounts." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10826
ex:P10826 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrialBalance
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Balancing debit and credit balances of trial balance to preparing final accounts. Calculate the total debits and credits in company's accounts. Correspond the sum of all debits with the sum of all credits. Adjust entries as appropriate." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "10826" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output corrected from ex:GeneralLedger to ex:TrialBalance: 'Prepare trial balance' produces a balanced trial balance (a distinct derived statement), not the general ledger. ex:GeneralLedger is retained as the definitional has input (the trial balance is computed from it)." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare trial balance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that totals debit and credit balances to produce a balanced trial balance as the basis for final accounts." ;
          skos:example "Producing the adjusted trial balance prior to drafting statements." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10827
ex:P10827 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Accounting for changes due to country-level policy changes. Record adjustments made by management in the accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "10827" ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare and post management adjustments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records management- and policy-driven adjustments in the accounts, updating the general ledger." ;
          skos:example "Posting a management override to reclassify expenses after a tax-law change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10828
ex:P10828 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating rules for fixed assets market valuation. Make rules and regulations for fixed assets regarding depreciation, provisions, resale, usage, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10828" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: output is a Financial Procedure (Directive ICE) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish fixed-asset policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the rules and procedures governing fixed-asset valuation, depreciation, provisions, resale, and usage." ;
          skos:example "Setting the straight-line depreciation policy for plant and equipment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10829
ex:P10829 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Keeping reports up-to-date regarding fixed assets. Create a fixed assets database detailing price, life cycle, depreciation rate, resale value, installation information, usage information, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10829" ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain fixed-asset master data files" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that creates and keeps current the fixed-asset master data detailing price, life cycle, depreciation, and usage." ;
          skos:example "Updating an asset's useful-life parameter in the fixed-asset register." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10830
ex:P10830 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Keeping a summary of sales and purchases of assets. Record any expenses made for new assets purchased and sales of any old assets during the fiscal year." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10830" ;
          rdfs:label "Process and record fixed-asset additions and retires" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records additions and retirements of fixed assets during the fiscal year in the fixed-asset register." ;
          skos:example "Capitalizing a newly purchased machine and writing off a retired one." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10831
ex:P10831 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Keeping a summary of expenses for installing and modifying assets. Record any expenses made for new assets purchased, any expenses incurred on improvements, the valuation of assets to reach current market price, and any transfer assets from one location to another during the fiscal year." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10831" ;
          rdfs:label "Process and record fixed-asset adjustments, enhancements, revaluations, and transfers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records fixed-asset adjustments, enhancements, revaluations, and inter-location transfers in the fixed-asset register." ;
          skos:example "Revaluing a building to current market price and recording the uplift." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10832
ex:P10832 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining a record of expenses necessitated for repairs and the preservation of assets. Administer and oversee the maintenance and repair of any fixed assets. Record all related transactions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10832" ;
          rdfs:label "Process and record fixed-asset maintenance and repair expenses" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records the maintenance and repair expenses incurred to preserve fixed assets in the fixed-asset register." ;
          skos:example "Expensing a routine servicing cost against a vehicle asset." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10833
ex:P10833 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Carrying out accounting for depreciation over fixed assets. Compute the sums necessitated. Maintain a record of the cost value of fixed assets over their useful life in the book of accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10833" ;
          rdfs:label "Calculate and record depreciation expense" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that computes periodic depreciation on fixed assets and records the resulting expense and carrying value in the fixed-asset register." ;
          skos:example "Booking monthly straight-line depreciation for the asset base." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10834
ex:P10834 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Balancing the ledger account balance for fixed assets. Correct errors in the books of fixed assets. Provide correct information in relevant accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10834" ;
          rdfs:label "Reconcile fixed-asset ledger" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that balances and corrects the fixed-asset ledger so that its account balances are accurate." ;
          skos:example "Reconciling the fixed-asset subledger to the general ledger control account." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10835
ex:P10835 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking and updating the record of all raw materials and fixed assets. Track all fixes asset. Maintain a record of all inventory items." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "10835" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Monitoring (not Accounting): the act observes assets over time and reconciles them to a physical count, maintaining a representational record." ;
          rdfs:label "Track fixed-assets including physical inventory" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that checks fixed assets against physical inventory over time and updates the fixed-asset register to reflect their current state." ;
          skos:example "An annual physical-inventory count reconciled to the asset register." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10836
ex:P10836 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FixedAssetRegister
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Showing market value and related expenses on fixed assets data for taxation. Provide complete information recorded in the books of fixed assets about purchase price, depreciation, installation charges, resale market value etc. for tax and regulatory purposes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.3.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "10836" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Reporting: the act disseminates fixed-asset information; the Fixed-Asset Register is the definitional input and the conveyed Financial Report the output." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide fixed-asset data to support tax, statutory, and regulatory reporting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles fixed-asset data from the register and conveys it to support tax, statutory, and regulatory reporting." ;
          skos:example "Supplying depreciation schedules to the tax team for a return." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10837
ex:P10837 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making reports of subsidiaries units to show profits generated from them. Prepare financial statements (balance sheets, income statements, cash flow statements and statements of shareholders' equity) for a single unit of a business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10837" ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare business unit financial statements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares the financial statements of a single business unit from its general-ledger balances." ;
          skos:example "Producing a division's standalone income statement and balance sheet." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10838
ex:P10838 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsolidatedFinancialStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making final accounts for all units of company together. Prepare combined financial statements of a parent company and its subsidiaries (i.e., separate legal entities controlled by a parent company) showing assets, liabilities, equity, income, expenses, and cash flows." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10838" ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare consolidated financial statements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that combines the accounts of a parent company and its subsidiaries to produce consolidated financial statements." ;
          skos:example "Preparing group consolidated statements at year-end." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10839
ex:P10839 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making reports for units/subsidiaries to help management in decision making. Prepare financial statements (balance sheets, income statements, cash flow statements, and statements of shareholders' equity) for a single unit of a business. Break down profits and losses by function/unit, clients, products, and region." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10839" ;
          rdfs:label "Perform business unit reporting/review management reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares and reviews business-unit management reports breaking down results by function, client, product, and region." ;
          skos:example "Issuing a divisional profitability pack for the monthly management review." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10840
ex:P10840 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsolidatedFinancialStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making reports for all units to help higher management in decision making. Prepare combined financial statements of a parent company and its all subsidiaries (separate legal entities controlled by a parent company) showing assets, liabilities, equity, income, expenses and cash flows, and also going through periodic reports which shows the actual and estimated costs and their variances." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10840" ;
          rdfs:comment "Variance analysis is a typical reviewed input; recorded as commentary rather than a definitional restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform consolidated reporting/review of cost management reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares consolidated management reports combining all units' results and reviewing actual-versus-estimated cost variances." ;
          skos:example "Reviewing group cost variances alongside the consolidated results." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10841
ex:P10841 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing a draft of financial statements for the board to review before they are sent to the auditor." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10841" ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare statements for board review" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares a draft of the financial statements for board review prior to audit." ;
          skos:example "Circulating draft annual statements to the audit committee." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10842
ex:P10842 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialStatement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making and presenting financial reports to stakeholders. Create annual and quarterly financial statements for reporting purposes. Prepare shareholder reports with details of the profit-and-loss account, balance sheet, and past year's business activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10842" ;
          rdfs:label "Produce quarterly/annual filings and shareholder reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that produces quarterly and annual financial filings and shareholder reports and presents them to stakeholders." ;
          skos:example "Publishing the annual report and 10-K filing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10843
ex:P10843 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialStatement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryFiling
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting raw or summary data for final accounts following rules and regulations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10843" ;
          rdfs:label "Produce regulatory reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles final-account data in accordance with rules and regulations to produce a regulatory filing." ;
          skos:example "Filing statutory accounts with the securities regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10844
ex:P10844 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating procedures and policies to follow for investing in capital projects. Create rules and regulations regarding large investment plans, which require in-depth forecasting for expenditure and revenue." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10844" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (inlined) because creating policies/procedures composes Directive ICEs (Golden Principle: Formulation -> Directive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop capital investment policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the financial policies and procedures governing investment in capital projects." ;
          skos:example "Treasury drafts the corporate capital-investment policy and the accompanying approval procedure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10845
ex:P10845 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating budgets, and soliciting approvals for capital projects. Prepare budgets for projects that require heavy investments. Secure approvals from management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10845" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: developing a budget composes a Directive ICE. The 'approve' facet ratifies the same budget and does not introduce a separate candidate set, so no separate selection act is modeled." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and approve capital expenditure plans and budgets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that prepares a capital-expenditure plan and budget for a heavy-investment project and secures management approval of it." ;
          skos:example "A project manager builds a multi-year capital-expenditure budget and obtains sign-off from the board." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10846
ex:P10846 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectApprovalDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating and supporting capital investments in projects and fixed assets. Confirm details of capital projects. Secure approvals from managements for large investments." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10846" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to ex:ActOfSelection to satisfy the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: the sole asserted output is ex:ProjectApprovalDecision, a Directive ICE (cco:ont00000965), whereas an Act of Appraisal characteristically yields a DESCRIPTIVE judgement ('judges without committing', per apqc-ext). The act fuses a review/evaluate facet with an authorize/approve facet; the definitional product is the authorization (a go/no-go choice among the proposed investments), which is exactly what ex:ActOfSelection was minted for ('chooses ... and produces a Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the chosen option(s)'). REJECTED candidate cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): retained for the evaluative facet only would force a Descriptive output and split the act; here the directive approval is definitional, so Selection is the correct genus. Aligned with sibling ex:P10851 (also a go/no-go decision -> ex:ActOfSelection)." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and approve capital projects and fixed-asset acquisitions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that reviews proposed capital projects and fixed-asset acquisitions and authorizes which are to proceed, producing a project approval decision." ;
          skos:example "An investment committee reviews a capital project's details and approves the acquisition of the related fixed assets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10847
ex:P10847 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialJustification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing all project business cases in order to substantiate projected financial gains. Validate any project's business case. Juxtapose the benefits derived from moving a project forward against the associated costs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10847" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates a business case's value. Output ex:FinancialJustification is a Descriptive ICE (it represents an argument, it does not prescribe). Cost data is a typical input, recorded as comment not restriction (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct financial justification for project approval" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that juxtaposes the projected benefits of a capital project against its costs and produces a financial justification substantiating the project's expected financial gains." ;
          skos:example "An analyst validates a project's business case and documents a cost-benefit justification recommending approval." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10848
ex:P10848 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectAccountCode
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Giving reference codes for every project." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10848" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting (creating classification codes within a system of accounts). Output ex:ProjectAccountCode is a Descriptive ICE; ex:ChartOfAccounts (the master structure) was rejected as too broad for a single per-project code." ;
          rdfs:label "Create project account codes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that assigns a reference account code to each capital project so that its transactions can be classified and tracked." ;
          skos:example "The ledger administrator opens a new project and issues it a unique cost-collection account code." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10849
ex:P10849 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Noting every transaction during a project in a common financial database. Document all transactions associated with any project. Maintain a centralized repository of all such financial data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10849" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting. Output ex:TransactionRecord is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Record project-related transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that documents every financial transaction associated with a capital project into a centralized repository, producing the project's transaction records." ;
          skos:example "A clerk posts each invoice and payment for a construction project to the shared project ledger." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10850
ex:P10850 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:VarianceAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating project progress and funds invested. Observe and track significant funds invested on any long-term project. Compare to budget." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10850" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring. The Budget is definitional (the comparison reference), so it is asserted as an input restriction; cost data is a typical input recorded in comment only (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and track capital projects and budget spending" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes the funds invested in a capital project, compares actual spending against its budget, and produces a variance analysis." ;
          skos:example "A controller tracks a project's cumulative spend against its approved budget and reports the variance each month." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10851
ex:P10851 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectContinuationDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking for returns generated from projects for decision making. Evaluate capital projects that require heavy investments. Decide whether to proceed based on the revenues generated." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10851" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAccounting to ex:ActOfSelection (D2 / Phase-1 fix). The verbatim apqcSourceText is an APPRAISAL-and-DECISION act: 'Checking for returns generated from projects for decision making. Evaluate capital projects ... Decide whether to proceed based on the revenues generated.' It never mentions closing or capitalizing onto the fixed-asset register; the previous 'close/capitalize' genus and ex:FixedAssetRegister output were supplied from the LABEL, discarding the row's evaluate+decide meaning. Per D2 the genus must come from the de-conflated description, which describes evaluation of returns plus a go/no-go decision -- the same act kind as its 9.4.2 siblings ex:P10846 (review+approve) and ex:P10852 (measure returns). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE + sibling consistency: the definitional product is a Directive go/no-go decision (ex:ProjectContinuationDecision), so the genus is ex:ActOfSelection (chooses among proceed/not-proceed, produces a Directive ICE), aligned with ex:P10846. REJECTED candidates: ex:ActOfAccounting (label-driven, asserts a bookkeeping capitalization the description does not describe) and cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) (would pair an Appraisal genus with a Directive decision output, breaking genus-output agreement -- see ex:P10846). ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis (returns data) is the Descriptive input baseline. If a genuine bookkeeping 'capitalize onto fixed-asset register' facet is intended, it should be split into a separate Act of Accounting child rather than overwriting this PCF row's evaluative meaning." ;
          rdfs:label "Close/capitalize projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that evaluates the returns generated by a capital project and decides whether to proceed with it, producing a project continuation decision." ;
          skos:example "On reviewing a project's realized returns, the committee decides to continue (or halt) the investment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10852
ex:P10852 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Comparing a finished project's profitability with forecasted returns. Scrutinize revenues generated by completed projects that required heavy investments. Determine profitability." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.4.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10852" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it measures/judges the project's return. The financial forecast is definitional (the comparison baseline), asserted as an input restriction; output ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure financial returns on completed capital projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that compares a completed capital project's actual returns against its forecasted returns and produces a profitability analysis." ;
          skos:example "A finance analyst measures a finished plant project's realized IRR against the forecast and reports its profitability." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10853
ex:P10853 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing policies and procedures for the HR function to calculate compensation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10853" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (output is a Directive ICE) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: developing policies/procedures produces a prescription, not a description." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a financial procedure prescribing how compensation is to be calculated." ;
          skos:example "HR drafts the standard operating procedure for computing employee compensation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10854
ex:P10854 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TimeRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking billing hours of each employee on daily basis." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10854" ;
          rdfs:label "Collect and record employee time worked" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that collects the daily hours worked by each employee and produces an employee time record." ;
          skos:example "Recording every employee's clock-in and billable hours each day." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10855
ex:P10855 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TimeRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LeaveRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking leaves allowed and taken by employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10855" ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze and report paid and unpaid leave" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input employee time records and produces a leave report describing the paid and unpaid leave allowed to and taken by employees." ;
          skos:example "Producing a monthly leave-balance report from recorded time data." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10856
ex:P10856 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TimeRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Observing the number of hours worked by an employees on daily basis. Track the number of hours worked by an employee, as well as the number of hours worked beyond normal working hour's according to company standards." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10856" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring: ongoing daily observation of hours against company standards, output is a descriptive record." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor regular, overtime, and other hours" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks the regular, overtime, and other hours worked by employees and produces an employee time record registering them." ;
          skos:example "Daily tracking of overtime hours against the standard work week." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10857
ex:P10857 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TimeRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmployeeUtilizationReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring the number of productive hours for employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10857" ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze and report employee utilization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input employee time records and produces an employee utilization report describing employees' productive hours." ;
          skos:example "Computing and reporting each employee's billable-utilization ratio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10858
ex:P10858 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TimeRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking the number of hours worked for the payroll system. Register the number of hours worked by an employee into the payroll system for the purpose of calculating salaries or wages." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10858" ;
          rdfs:label "Enter employee time worked into payroll system" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as input an employee time record and registers the hours worked into the payroll system as a transaction record for salary calculation." ;
          skos:example "Importing approved timesheet hours into the payroll engine before a pay run." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10859
ex:P10859 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EarningsInformation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking and oversee salary breakups of employees. This process requires the organization to manage and update information pertaining to the structure of every employee's salary. This would involve the updating any changes to the salary structures of the employees, in a central repository which can be accessed by pertinent departments." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10859" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to ex:ActOfAccounting (false-friend fix). The source text ('manage and update information pertaining to the structure of every employee's salary ... updating any changes ... in a central repository') describes record creation/maintenance, not observation. ex:ActOfMonitoring is defined as observing an ongoing process/position over time AGAINST EXPECTED PARAMETERS; maintaining a salary-structure repository involves no comparison against expected parameters and is not status observation -- it is records upkeep, which ex:ActOfAccounting's scope ('produces or UPDATES a Descriptive ICE ... maintain ledgers/master files') covers. The Descriptive output (ex:EarningsInformation) and R5 hold; only the act genus changes. Anchored identically to its 'Maintain and administer' twin ex:P10860." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain and administer employee earnings information" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that maintains and updates the employee earnings information held in a central repository, producing an updated employee-earnings record." ;
          skos:example "Updating an employee's salary-structure record after a raise." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10860
ex:P10860 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PayrollDeductionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Processing salary deductions for tax purposes. Keep and manage the details of every employee's salary deductions based on their expenses and investments during the year." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10860" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to ex:ActOfAccounting (same false-friend fix as its twin ex:P10859). The source verb is literally 'Processing'/'Keep and manage' ('Processing salary deductions for tax purposes. Keep and manage the details of every employee's salary deductions ...'), i.e. maintaining deduction records, not observing a position against expected parameters (the ex:ActOfMonitoring differentia). Records upkeep falls under ex:ActOfAccounting ('produces or UPDATES a Descriptive ICE ... maintain ledgers/master files'). Output ex:PayrollDeductionRecord (Descriptive) and R5 are unchanged. Anchored identically to ex:P10859 so the 'Maintain and administer' pair is consistent." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain and administer applicable deductions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that keeps current the details of each employee's salary deductions and produces a payroll deduction record." ;
          skos:example "Recording an employee's updated investment declarations to adjust deductions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10861
ex:P10861 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking changes in the salary structure of employees for tax deductions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10861" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring: ongoing tracking of tax-status changes; output is descriptive tax data." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor changes in tax status of employees" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks changes in employees' tax status and produces updated tax data for payroll deduction." ;
          skos:example "Detecting an employee's change of tax bracket and flagging it for the next pay run." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10862
ex:P10862 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRemuneration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Processing and distributing salaries to all employees. Execute the payroll management function through the dispensation of employee salaries. Leverage a centralized database of all payroll expenses." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10862" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction to ex:ActOfRemuneration (the verified CCO leaf cco:ont00000449): an unambiguous employer->employee salary disbursement -- the exact differentia of Remuneration. The disbursed payment is a MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output." ;
          rdfs:label "Process and distribute payments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Remuneration that disburses salaries to employees, producing a monetary payment to each employee in compensation for services performed." ;
          skos:example "Paying every employee's net salary by direct deposit on payday." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10863
ex:P10863 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling incorrect/omitted salary payments." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10863" ;
          rdfs:comment "The monetary payment is a MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output; the off-cycle manual check corrects a prior payroll error. Substantively an Act of Remuneration (cco:ont00000449) but kept under ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction: as an error-correction disbursement its differentia is rectifying an omission, one step removed from the canonical compensation-for-services run (cf. ex:P10862, which moves to ex:ActOfRemuneration)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process and distribute manual checks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that issues a manual payment to correct an incorrect or omitted salary payment, producing a monetary payment to the affected employee." ;
          skos:example "Cutting a manual check for an employee whose overtime was missed in the main run." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10864
ex:P10864 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PayrollDeductionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PeriodEndAdjustmentRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Adjusting salary deductions for tax purposes at the end of the year." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10864" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting: reconciling/adjusting financial records; output is a descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Process period-end adjustments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that reconciles and adjusts employees' salary deductions at the close of a tax period and produces a payroll period-end adjustment record." ;
          skos:example "Recomputing year-end tax deductions and posting the correcting adjustments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10865
ex:P10865 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PayrollInquiryResponse
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Addressing salary-related queries raised by employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "10865" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:label "Respond to employee payroll inquiries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that addresses an employee's salary-related query and produces a payroll inquiry response." ;
          skos:example "Answering an employee's question about why a deduction changed this month." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10866
ex:P10866 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Paying tax according to appropriate deductions made from salaries. Calculate and pay the tax liabilities according to the salaries and tax regulations of employees with the help of certified chartered accountants." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10866" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:TaxManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "The remitted Monetary Payment is a MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output; calculation per tax regulations is a sub-step. Certified accountants typically participate (rdfs:comment, not definitional)." ;
          rdfs:label "Calculate and pay applicable payroll taxes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that calculates the payroll-tax liability owed on employees' salaries and pays it to the tax authority, producing a monetary payment of tax." ;
          skos:example "Computing and remitting withheld income tax for the period to the revenue authority." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10867
ex:P10867 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmployeeTaxStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing tax deductions statements created by certified chartered accountants to every employee for their reference or refunds." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10867" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting: compiling and issuing a statement; output is a descriptive ICE delivered to employees." ;
          rdfs:label "Produce and distribute employee annual tax statements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles and issues an employee annual tax statement describing the tax withheld from each employee's salary." ;
          skos:example "Issuing each employee a year-end statement of wages and taxes withheld." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10868
ex:P10868 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryFiling
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Filling taxes, and highlighting different sources of income and expenditures made." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10868" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting: compiling and issuing a filing to an authority; output is a descriptive ICE (regulatory filing)." ;
          rdfs:label "File regulatory payroll tax forms" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles and submits the required payroll-tax forms to a regulatory authority, producing a regulatory filing." ;
          skos:example "Submitting the quarterly payroll-tax return to the revenue authority." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10869
ex:P10869 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:VendorMasterFile
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentMatchResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Matching records of bills to be paid with accounts. Check accounts payable entries with vendor's account for every payment made." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10869" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges an entry against a reference record, yielding a descriptive match judgement (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Verify AP pay file with purchase order vendor master file" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that checks accounts-payable pay-file entries against the vendor master file and produces a payment match result." ;
          skos:example "An AP clerk three-way-matching an invoice to the PO and vendor master before release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10870
ex:P10870 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking all online transactions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10870" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366): the source ('Tracking all online transactions') is longitudinal observation of a transaction stream, not a one-shot analysis. The status output is descriptive (TransactionRecord)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain/Manage electronic commerce" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks an organization's online accounts-payable transactions and produces a record of their status." ;
          skos:example "An e-commerce settlement console tracking the day's online supplier payments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10871
ex:P10871 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Invoice
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AuditJudgement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring and evaluating bills registered in accounts books. Check all invoices. Maintain records." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10871" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternalAuditManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): auditing/evaluating registered bills judges them against records and yields a descriptive finding. Invoice is a typical input (commented, not definitional)." ;
          rdfs:label "Audit invoices and key data in AP system" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates invoices and key data registered in the accounts-payable system and produces an invoice audit judgement." ;
          skos:example "An AP auditor reviewing posted invoices for accuracy and policy compliance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10872
ex:P10872 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentApproval
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Processing payments for products/services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10872" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) -- the §6-documented TOP intentional-act anchor -- because the act is an AUTHORIZATION/RATIFICATION of a single already-settled payment, for which CCO 2.0 has no dedicated act kind. REJECTED candidates (D5/§6 step 3): (1) cco:ont00000636 'Act of Appraisal' -- an Appraisal characteristically yields a DESCRIPTIVE judgement ('judges without committing'), but the definitional product here is the Directive ex:PaymentApproval (an authorization that prescribes release), so re-anchoring to Appraisal would break the GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE genus-output agreement; the act commits rather than merely judges. (2) ex:ActOfSelection -- there is no candidate set; approval ratifies one already-settled payment, and the apqc-ext ActOfSelection note explicitly routes 'ratifying a single already-settled option' to cco:ont00000228. The bare Planned Act is therefore the nearest correct class whose genus does not contradict the Directive output. Anchored identically to its 9.6 approval siblings ex:P10882 and ex:P20934 (sibling consistency)." ;
          rdfs:label "Approve payments" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that authorizes a settled payment for products or services and produces a payment approval decision." ;
          skos:example "A controller approving a vetted supplier payment for release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10873
ex:P10873 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling transactions for accruals and reversals. Record transactions in the books of accounts on an accrual basis (irrespective of the actual cash flow) and reversals basis (cancel out the adjusting entries) for balancing accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10873" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting (cco:ont00000366): bookkeeping entries are recorded into a descriptive ledger artifact." ;
          rdfs:label "Process financial accruals and reversals" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that records accrual and reversal entries in the books of accounts and produces the corresponding transaction records." ;
          skos:example "Month-end posting of accrued expenses and the reversal of the prior period's adjusting entries." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10874
ex:P10874 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxReturn
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Filing the amount of taxes that a company owes as of the balance sheet date. Prepare tax returns, including the income tax filing for an individual or business entity from earnings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10874" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting (cco:ont00000366): tax data is compiled into a return (Descriptive ICE) for submission." ;
          rdfs:label "Process payables taxes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares and files the payables taxes owed by an organization and produces a tax return." ;
          skos:example "Preparing and filing withholding/income tax returns tied to payables as of the balance-sheet date." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10875
ex:P10875 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExceptionResolutionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Resolving any atypical or inconsistent situation concerning payments to be made by the organization. Address any exceptional case of accounts payable on an ad hoc basis, by seeking counsel or carrying out any necessary research." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10875" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored directly to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): ad hoc research/resolution of a payable anomaly producing a descriptive disposition record." ;
          rdfs:label "Research/Resolve payable exceptions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that investigates an atypical or inconsistent accounts-payable situation and produces a payable exception resolution record." ;
          skos:example "An AP analyst researching a duplicate-payment exception and recording its resolution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10876
ex:P10876 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making payments for products/services on due dates (payment cycle) decided by parties involved." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "10876" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SupplierRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (cco:ont00000228). The disbursed monetary payment is a MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output (operations material-I/O rule). The supplier is a definitional participant (it receives the payment)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process payments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that disburses monetary payment for products or services on the due dates of an agreed payment cycle." ;
          skos:example "Releasing a scheduled ACH run to suppliers on invoice due dates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10877
ex:P10877 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Clarifying or address queries relating to the particulars of AP such as date, discounts, amount, and installments. Coordinate with concerned parties about the fulfillment of bills payable." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "10877" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SupplierRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication, a Planned Act in which an ICE is transferred from one Agent to another). The transferred clarification is descriptive; the supplier is the definitional recipient/participant. Explicit rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) added so the act-anchor chain is visible to the standalone SHACL run (ont00000402 is a CCO subclass of ont00000228, but the closure is not merged for Gate C). VERIFICATION (D6/§6): cco:ont00000402 verified against the pinned CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06) closure -- rdfs:label 'Act of Communication'@en, skos:definition 'A Planned Act in which some Information Content Entity is transferred from some Agent to Another', rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). This is the correct verified communication class and is NOT the §6 false-friend reject cco:ont00001261 'Act of Identifying' (an Act of Representative Communication for discernment); ont00000402 genuinely denotes agent-to-agent ICE transfer, the act kind required for an inquiry response. It should be added to the §6 verified-core-terms table as the canonical Act-of-Communication anchor used corpus-wide (transmit-only nodes)." ;
          rdfs:label "Respond to AP inquiries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that clarifies queries about accounts-payable particulars and transfers the clarifying information to the inquiring party." ;
          skos:example "AP staff answering a supplier's query about a payment date and discount taken." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10878
ex:P10878 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Keeping bills of every transaction for future reference." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "10878" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAccounting to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) directly, and the I/O direction corrected. Two defects fixed: (1) Genus stretch -- ex:ActOfAccounting is defined as recording, classifying, posting, or reconciling transactions; retaining/archiving bills 'for future reference' is records retention/storage, none of those verbs, so it is generic records-management information processing. (2) Wrong I/O direction -- 'has output some ex:TransactionRecord' was a semantic inversion: retention does not PRODUCE a transaction record; the record already exists and is being preserved, so it is an input/object, not an output generated at the end (contra cco:ont00001986's 'output present at end because the process made it'). The retained record is therefore modeled as has input." ;
          rdfs:label "Retain records" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that preserves the bills and transaction records of every accounts-payable transaction for future reference." ;
          skos:example "Archiving paid invoices and remittance advices to the records repository." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10879
ex:P10879 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Rectifying for alterations occurred in accounts while recording." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.1.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "10879" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting (cco:ont00000366): correcting bookkeeping entries updates a descriptive record." ;
          rdfs:label "Adjust accounting records" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that rectifies alterations that occurred while recording in the accounts and produces corrected transaction records." ;
          skos:example "Posting correcting journal entries for a mis-keyed invoice amount." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10880
ex:P10880 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Explaining policies and procedures related to reimbursements requests by employees. Set policies regarding reimbursement process and amount limits etc. Inform employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10880" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (inlined; cco:ont00000511): setting reimbursement policy and limits composes a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Communicating it to employees is a typical downstream adjunct, not a separate definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and communicate expense reimbursement policies and approval limits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that sets the policies and approval limits governing employee expense reimbursements and produces a financial policy." ;
          skos:example "Finance issuing an updated travel-and-expense policy with per-diem caps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10881
ex:P10881 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collecting and reporting all pertinent information regarding the taxes paid by the organization's employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10881" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting (cco:ont00000366): pertinent information is compiled into a descriptive tax-data report." ;
          rdfs:label "Capture and report relevant tax data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that collects and reports the tax information pertinent to taxes paid by an organization's employees and produces tax data." ;
          skos:example "Compiling employee per-diem and reimbursement amounts for payroll-tax reporting." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10882
ex:P10882 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000063 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10883
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentApproval
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Permitting expense reimbursement requests from employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10882" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) -- the §6 TOP intentional-act anchor -- as an AUTHORIZATION/RATIFICATION of a single already-settled request (no candidate set), for which CCO 2.0 has no dedicated act kind. REJECTED candidates (D5/§6 step 3), uniform with sibling ex:P10872: (1) cco:ont00000636 'Act of Appraisal' -- would pair an Appraisal genus (Descriptive judgement, 'judges without committing') with the Directive ex:PaymentApproval output, breaking GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE agreement; the act commits/authorizes rather than merely judging. (2) ex:ActOfSelection -- no candidate set; the apqc-ext ActOfSelection note routes 'ratifying a single already-settled option' to cco:ont00000228. The employee is the definitional participant whose request is approved. Anchored identically to ex:P10872 and ex:P20934 (sibling consistency)." ;
          rdfs:label "Approve reimbursements and advances" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that authorizes an employee's expense-reimbursement or advance request and produces a payment approval decision." ;
          skos:example "A manager approving an employee's travel-advance request." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10883
ex:P10883 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentApproval
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Paying for expense reimbursement requests from employees. (Follow Approve reimbursements and advances [10882] according to policies and conditions.)" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10883" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (cco:ont00000228). The disbursed monetary payment is a MATERIAL participant; the employee is the definitional recipient. The source cross-reference licenses bfo:precedes from 10882 (see precedence block)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process reimbursements and advances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction that disburses monetary payment to employees in settlement of approved expense-reimbursement and advance requests." ;
          skos:example "Paying an employee's approved expense claim by direct deposit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10884
ex:P10884 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining accounts of individuals who are connected with business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.6.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10884" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: despite the 'Manage' label the source ('Maintaining accounts') denotes discrete record-maintenance acts over personnel-account records, a bounded occurrent, not a no-end standing function. Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting (cco:ont00000366)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage personnel accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that maintains the financial accounts of individuals connected with the business and produces updated account statements." ;
          skos:example "Updating an employee's advance/reimbursement balance after a settlement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10885
ex:P10885 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TreasuryGovernanceCharter
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Selecting opportunities and the authoritative body for investments in trading in bonds, currencies, financial derivatives, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10885" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:TreasuryManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: establishing scope and authority composes a prescriptive directive." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish scope and governance of treasury operations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a treasury governance charter prescribing the scope of treasury operations and its authoritative governing body." ;
          skos:example "A board committee sets the mandate and approval authority for the treasury desk." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10886
ex:P10886 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and providing investment regulations for the organization. Establish policies and procedures for investments to optimize liquidity in treasury operations. Create a written copy of it." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10886" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output). Reuses shared ex:FinancialPolicy (treasury investment policy)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and publish treasury policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a financial policy that prescribes the organization's investment regulations." ;
          skos:example "Treasury issues and circulates the written corporate investment policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10887
ex:P10887 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making processes for investing. Create steps for investments in bonds, currencies, and financial derivatives in order to optimize company's liquidity, invest excess cash, and reduce its financial risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10887" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output). Reuses shared ex:FinancialProcedure." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop treasury procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a financial procedure prescribing the steps for executing investments." ;
          skos:example "Treasury drafts the step-by-step procedure for placing a bond trade." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10888
ex:P10888 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking treasury processes in order to optimize company's liquidity, invest excess cash, and reduce its financial risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10888" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (Descriptive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: ongoing checking yields a judgement. Reuses shared ex:FinancialProcedure and ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor treasury procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input a financial procedure and has as output a control-effectiveness assessment of treasury processes." ;
          skos:example "A treasury controller periodically reviews adherence to investment procedures." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10889
ex:P10889 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Auditing the treasury function." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10889" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternalAuditManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): auditing evaluates and judges, producing a Descriptive ICE. Reuses shared ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Audit treasury procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that examines the treasury function and has as output a control-effectiveness assessment." ;
          skos:example "Internal audit reviews treasury controls and issues an assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10890
ex:P10890 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reassessing all treasury procedures based on audit findings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10890" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output): revising reformulates a prescriptive procedure. Reuses shared ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment and ex:FinancialProcedure." ;
          rdfs:label "Revise treasury procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a control-effectiveness assessment and has as output a revised financial procedure." ;
          skos:example "Treasury updates its trading procedures in response to audit findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10891
ex:P10891 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InternalControlPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and managing the internal control systems for investments in bonds, currencies, and financial derivatives to verify procedures." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10891" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output). Reuses shared ex:InternalControlPolicy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and confirm internal controls for treasury" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an internal-control policy governing treasury investment activity." ;
          skos:example "Treasury defines the segregation-of-duties controls over derivative trades." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10892
ex:P10892 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SystemSecurityRequirement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Describing the need of system security requirements for controlling access, reliability of information, accountability, and availability of information in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "10892" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output). Output ex:SystemSecurityRequirement minted locally." ;
          rdfs:label "Define system security requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a system security requirement prescribing controls over access, reliability, accountability, and availability of treasury information." ;
          skos:example "Treasury IT specifies the access-control and audit-trail requirements for the dealing system." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10893
ex:P10893 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CashPosition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Correcting cash differences in the books of accounts. Make optimum utilization of funds available in the business. Check for differences to rectify." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10893" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:TreasuryManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAccounting (info-processing; Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:GeneralLedger; output ex:CashPosition minted locally." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage and reconcile cash positions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that has as input a general ledger and has as output a reconciled cash position." ;
          skos:example "Treasury reconciles bank statements against the ledger and corrects discrepancies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10894
ex:P10894 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking care of all cash-related activities in the business. Utilize short-term assets that can be easily convertible into cash, such as marketable securities, commercial paper and short-term government bonds, and treasury bills." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10894" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing function of maintaining cash-equivalent holdings, no natural end -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage cash equivalents" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of holding and utilizing short-term assets readily convertible into cash." ;
          skos:example "Treasury parks surplus cash in treasury bills and commercial paper." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10895
ex:P10895 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supervising all online transactions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10895" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Operations category: the material filler ex:PaymentInstrument is the transferred MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output (has output is reserved for ICE outputs)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process and oversee electronic fund transfers (EFTs)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which monetary payments are transferred electronically between accounts." ;
          skos:example "Treasury executes a wire transfer to settle a supplier invoice." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10896
ex:P10896 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000371 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing forecasts for the cash generated or used by the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10896" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000371 (Act of Prediction) to reconcile a cross-group inconsistency: the SAME output type (ex:FinancialForecast) is produced by ex:P10773 'Prepare periodic financial forecasts', and both are forecasts, i.e. predictive projections rather than mere compilation/reporting of existing results. ex:P10773 was re-anchored to cco:ont00000371 (Act of Prediction, output a Predictive ICE); this row is aligned to that precedent so the same artifact is not anchored under two different genera across groups (Gate-F reconciliation). REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfReporting: reporting compiles existing results, whereas producing a forecast generates a Predictive ICE about an uncertain future state. Reuses shared ex:FinancialData (input) and ex:FinancialForecast (output, now a Predictive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop cash flow forecasts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Prediction that examines financial data and generates a financial forecast of cash to be generated or used by the organization." ;
          skos:example "Treasury builds a 13-week rolling cash-flow forecast." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10897
ex:P10897 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Delaying the outflow of funds as long as possible, but encourage the inflow of as fast as possible." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10897" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing optimization function with no natural end -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage cash flows" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of optimizing the timing of cash inflows and outflows." ;
          skos:example "Treasury accelerates receivables collection while extending payables." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10898
ex:P10898 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Presenting reports on all cash-related activities. Collect and manage short-term investing activities. Prepare reports of all transactions done." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10898" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfReporting (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:TransactionRecord and ex:FinancialReport." ;
          rdfs:label "Produce cash management accounting transactions and reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input transaction records and has as output a financial report on cash-management activity." ;
          skos:example "Treasury issues the monthly cash-management activity report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10899
ex:P10899 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining and directing the course of relationships with banking partners." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10899" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing relationship-maintenance function with no natural end -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage and oversee banking relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of maintaining and directing relationships with banking partners." ;
          skos:example "Treasury holds quarterly reviews with its relationship banks." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10900
ex:P10900 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BankFeeAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Studying and finalizing bank fees for services provided by banks. Negotiate and finalize nominal fees that bank charges for various services, such as requesting a deposit slip or counter check or certifying papers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "10900" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (Descriptive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: the dominant act is studying and determining fees. Reuses shared ex:FinancialData; output ex:BankFeeAnalysis minted locally." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze, negotiate, resolve, and confirm bank fees" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input financial data and has as output a bank fee analysis determining the fees charged by a banking partner." ;
          skos:example "Treasury benchmarks and negotiates a bank's transaction-fee schedule." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10901
ex:P10901 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining subsidiaries' company accounts opened with bank inside the corporation. Manage different financial services provided by in-house bank structure for parent companies' subsidiaries or branches." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10901" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing account-maintenance function for subsidiaries, no natural end -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage in-house bank accounts for subsidiaries" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of maintaining and servicing subsidiary accounts held within the corporation's in-house bank." ;
          skos:example "The in-house bank maintains a current account for each operating subsidiary." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10902
ex:P10902 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000884 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Subsidiary
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arranging loans for subsidiaries from in-house banks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10902" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SubsidiaryRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction to the verified CCO leaf cco:ont00000884 (Act of Loaning): the in-house bank gives a Financial Instrument to the subsidiary as Debtor to receive repayments -- exactly 884's differentia, closer than the generic transaction genus. cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) co-asserted because 884 is outside the standalone-SHACL S2 allowlist (884 -> 836 -> 566 -> 228). The loaned funds are a MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage and facilitate inter-company borrowing transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Loaning in which the in-house bank (Creditor) extends a loan to a subsidiary (Debtor) to receive repayments of greater financial value." ;
          skos:example "The in-house bank books an intercompany loan to a foreign subsidiary." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10903
ex:P10903 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Subsidiary
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling payments made for subsidiaries by parent company." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10903" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SubsidiaryRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Material filler ex:PaymentInstrument is the definitional MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057, the payment disbursed), not has output." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage centralized outgoing payments on behalf of subsidiaries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which the parent disburses monetary payments outward on behalf of its subsidiaries." ;
          skos:example "The parent pays a subsidiary's vendor through the central payments factory." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10904
ex:P10904 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Subsidiary
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling payments received by parent company for subsidiaries." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10904" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SubsidiaryRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Material filler ex:PaymentInstrument is definitional (the payment collected)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage central incoming payments on behalf of subsidiaries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which the parent collects monetary payments inward on behalf of its subsidiaries." ;
          skos:example "The parent receives a customer remittance owed to a subsidiary." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10905
ex:P10905 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking care of all business outflows and recording as whole. Manage making all payments for the organization and its units or subsidiaries. Track in books of accounts of parent company." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10905" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording produces a transaction record (Descriptive ICE), the definitional has output; the netted monetary payment is the MATERIAL participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage internal payments and netting transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which internal payments across organizational units are settled on a netted basis and recorded." ;
          skos:example "The in-house bank nets intercompany balances and posts the residual settlement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10906
ex:P10906 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Computing all expenses paid to and receivables collected over the organization's banking activity. Calculate all charges and receivables, towards interest, fees, and any other payments over its own bank accounts. Record transactions in the books of accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10906" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAccounting (info-processing; Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:GeneralLedger and ex:TransactionRecord." ;
          rdfs:label "Calculate interest and fees for in-house bank accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that has as input a general ledger and has as output transaction records of computed interest and fees on in-house bank accounts." ;
          skos:example "The in-house bank computes and posts monthly interest on subsidiary balances." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10907
ex:P10907 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Subsidiary
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AccountStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Facilitating account statements for all in-house banking activity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10907" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SubsidiaryRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication). The source ('Facilitating account statements for all in-house banking activity') and the verb 'Provide/facilitate' read as delivering/transmitting an already-produced statement, not compiling it; the compilation is the sibling ex:P10906 'Calculate interest and fees for in-house bank accounts' (which records the transactions and from which the statement is drawn). The ex:ActOfReporting carve-out routes transmit-only nodes to cco:ont00000402: 'Where a node only transmits an already-prepared report to a party, the group module reuses cco:ont00000402 instead.' Keeping ex:ActOfReporting would double-count the production step. The account statement is therefore the transmitted ICE (has input), and the subsidiary account holder is the recipient participant. cco:ont00000402 verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06)." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide account statements for in-house bank accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that delivers an already-prepared account statement for in-house banking activity to the account holder." ;
          skos:example "The in-house bank issues each subsidiary its monthly account statement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10908
ex:P10908 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining smooth relations with financial investment banks that help availing loans and services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10908" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing relationship-maintenance function -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage financial intermediary relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of maintaining relationships with financial intermediaries that provide loans and services." ;
          skos:example "Treasury maintains its panel of investment-banking counterparties." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10909
ex:P10909 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing and maintaining enough liquidity in form of cash and cash equivalents in the business to meet urgent and timely requirements" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10909" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing liquidity-maintenance function with no natural end -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage liquidity" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of maintaining sufficient cash and cash equivalents to meet the organization's obligations." ;
          skos:example "Treasury keeps a liquidity buffer sized to a stressed cash-outflow scenario." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10910
ex:P10910 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the exposure incurred by the issuer for providing credit to the borrower." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10910" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing exposure-control function -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage issuer exposure" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of controlling the credit exposure incurred toward issuers and borrowers." ;
          skos:example "Treasury monitors and caps exposure to each bond issuer in the portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10911
ex:P10911 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking loans taken and money invested in different options. Arrange and supervise loans from banks and individuals and investments in different available and profitable options." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10911" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording yields a transaction record (Descriptive ICE), included as a definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Process and oversee debt and investment transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which loans are taken or investments are placed and the resulting positions are recorded." ;
          skos:example "Treasury draws a term loan and books the proceeds and schedule." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10912
ex:P10912 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arranging and supervising foreign exchange rate changes to avoid loss on foreign-currency transactions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10912" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording yields a transaction record (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process and oversee foreign currency transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which foreign-currency positions are exchanged and the resulting transactions are recorded." ;
          skos:example "Treasury converts EUR proceeds to USD and records the settled trade." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10913
ex:P10913 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating transactions report of loans and investments. Prepare and maintain records of loans and investment transactions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10913" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfReporting (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:TransactionRecord and ex:FinancialReport." ;
          rdfs:label "Produce debt and investment accounting transaction reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input transaction records and has as output a financial report on debt and investment activity." ;
          skos:example "Treasury issues the quarterly debt-and-investment portfolio report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10914
ex:P10914 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GovernanceBody
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing board of directors and auditing committee in order to assign roles and responsibilities for internal controls." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10914" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfFormulation to ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment (false-friend fix: 'establish a committee' is not 'formulate a directive'). The lead verb 'Establishing a board / audit committee' primarily denotes CONSTITUTING/SEATING a governance body (an organizational establishment act on independent continuants), not composing-and-articulating a directive ICE. The control-responsibility assignment (ex:ControlResponsibilityAssignment, Directive) is a downstream byproduct of seating the body, not the definitional output of every instance, so it is recorded here per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule rather than promoted to a has output restriction (which would over-commit and reverse-engineer an output to justify a planning genus). REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): would treat the responsibility directive as the definitional product. The constituted governance body (ex:GovernanceBody, covering the board and audit committee) is the definitional participant. TYPICAL/secondary output (commented, not restricted): ex:ControlResponsibilityAssignment." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish board of directors and audit committee" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Organizational Establishment that constitutes and seats a board of directors and audit committee to assign roles and responsibilities for internal controls." ;
          skos:example "Shareholders seat an audit committee and document its internal-control oversight mandate." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10915
ex:P10915 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CodeOfEthics
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining and communicating a code of ethics act responsibly." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10915" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output ex:CodeOfEthics). The communication step is a typical downstream act, not definitional, so it is noted here rather than restricted." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and communicate code of ethics" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a code of ethics prescribing the standards of responsible conduct for an organization's personnel." ;
          skos:example "A compliance office drafts the corporate code of ethics and distributes it to staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10916
ex:P10916 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ControlResponsibilityAssignment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining roles, responsibilities, and accountabilities for effectiveness and proficiency of operations and reliability of financial reporting." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10916" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output ex:ControlResponsibilityAssignment): assigning accountabilities prescribes a control arrangement." ;
          rdfs:label "Assign roles and responsibility for internal controls" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that prescribes the roles, responsibilities, and accountabilities of agents for internal-control effectiveness and reliable financial reporting." ;
          skos:example "A controller documents which positions own each key financial control." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10918
ex:P10918 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InternalControlPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing the activities for internal controls. Observe the effectiveness of policies, procedures, techniques, and mechanisms actions taken to minimize risk." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10918" ;
          rdfs:comment "Monitoring -> Descriptive output ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor control effectiveness" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes the operation of internal-control policies, procedures, and mechanisms and produces a control-effectiveness assessment of their adequacy in minimizing risk." ;
          skos:example "An auditor reviews whether reconciliation controls operated as designed and reports their effectiveness." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10919
ex:P10919 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveActionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking corrective measures for policies, procedures, techniques, and mechanisms actions taken to minimize risk. (Conduct in accordance with Monitor control effectiveness [10918] in order to determine and rectify the control deficiencies.)" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10919" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): remediation executes corrective measures rather than processing information (rejected ex:ActOfMonitoring) or formulating a directive. Input ex:ControlEffectivenessAssessment carries the identified deficiencies; output ex:CorrectiveActionRecord documents the remediation." ;
          rdfs:label "Remediate control deficiencies" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that takes corrective measures against deficiencies in internal-control policies, procedures, and mechanisms identified by control-effectiveness monitoring." ;
          skos:example "After a monitoring finding, the team reinstates a missing dual-approval control and logs the fix." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10923
ex:P10923 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Auditor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting to external auditors. This process requires the organization to report to external auditors about the regulations for any critical data that the organization is holding." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10923" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:AuditorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication). The source ('Reporting to external auditors ...') is pure transmission of an already-prepared compliance report whose PRODUCTION is the parent ex:P10764 (9.8.3); the ex:ActOfReporting definition is the production/compilation step and its comment routes transmit-only nodes to cco:ont00000402. The previous has output ex:ComplianceReport over-asserted that each instance independently compiles its OWN report, when all four 9.8.3.x children distribute the single report produced by 9.8.3; ex:ComplianceReport is therefore consumed/transmitted (has input), not produced. Recipient ex:Auditor is the definitional recipient participant. cco:ont00000402 verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06). REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfReporting (§6 false-friend caution: communication-sense vs production-sense)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report to external auditors" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transmits an already-prepared internal-controls compliance report to external auditors regarding the regulations governing critical data held by the organization." ;
          skos:example "Management furnishes the external audit firm with its internal-controls compliance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10924
ex:P10924 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryFiling
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting to regulators, shareholders, debt holders, securities exchanges, etc. about IT regulations and pertinent data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10924" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication), consistent with its 9.8.3.x transmit-only siblings ex:P10923/ex:P10925/ex:P10926. The compliance report is produced by the parent ex:P10764 (9.8.3) and merely transmitted here, so ex:ComplianceReport is has input, not has output. EXCEPTION retained per the Gate-F note: ex:RegulatoryFiling IS genuinely compiled/produced in the act of filing with the regulator, so it is kept as a has output. Recipient ex:RegulatoryAuthority is the definitional recipient participant. cco:ont00000402 verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06). REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfReporting for the compliance-report transmission (§6 false-friend caution)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report to regulators, share-/debt-holders, securities exchanges, etc." ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transmits an already-prepared internal-controls compliance report to regulators, shareholders, debt holders, and securities exchanges, producing in the process a regulatory filing of the pertinent data." ;
          skos:example "A listed company files its internal-controls compliance attestation with the securities regulator and notifies bondholders." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10925
ex:P10925 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting to suppliers, customers, and partners that are doing business with the company about IT regulations and pertinent data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10925" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ,
                          ex:SupplierRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication), consistent with its 9.8.3.x transmit-only siblings. The compliance report is produced by the parent ex:P10764 (9.8.3) and only distributed here, so ex:ComplianceReport is has input, not has output. Recipients ex:Supplier and ex:Customer are the definitional recipient participants. cco:ont00000402 verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06). REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfReporting (§6 false-friend caution)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report to third parties" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transmits an already-prepared internal-controls compliance report to suppliers, customers, and business partners regarding IT regulations and pertinent data." ;
          skos:example "A vendor-management team shares the firm's data-controls compliance summary with key suppliers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10926
ex:P10926 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting to internal management (all employees, directors, and management) about IT regulations and pertinent data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10926" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication), consistent with its 9.8.3.x transmit-only siblings. The compliance report is produced by the parent ex:P10764 (9.8.3) and only distributed here, so ex:ComplianceReport is has input, not has output. Recipient ex:Employee (covering staff, directors, and management as internal personnel) is the definitional recipient participant. cco:ont00000402 verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06). REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfReporting (§6 false-friend caution)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report to internal management" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transmits an already-prepared internal-controls compliance report to an organization's employees, directors, and management regarding IT regulations and pertinent data." ;
          skos:example "Leadership circulates an internal memo summarizing the company's controls-compliance status to all staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10927
ex:P10927 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a tax strategy for foreign, national, state, local administration. Set up tax strategies for foreign trade in imports and exports and at national, state, and local level." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10927" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Directive output (Tax Strategy) -> ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop foreign, national, state, and local tax strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a tax strategy governing the organization's tax position across foreign, national, state, and local jurisdictions." ;
          skos:example "A multinational drafts a transfer-pricing and import/export tax strategy spanning its operating jurisdictions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10928
ex:P10928 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Combining and enhancing a rational analysis of a financial condition or plan from a tax perspective in order to align financial goals through efficient tax planning." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10928" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Although it draws on prior analysis of financial condition (a typical input, left as comment per Phase-3), its product is a consolidated directive plan, so genus is ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Consolidate and optimize total tax plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that combines and optimizes the organization's component tax plans into a single total tax plan aligning financial goals through efficient tax planning." ;
          skos:example "A finance team merges per-jurisdiction tax strategies into one optimized group tax plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10929
ex:P10929 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining a master file about the rational analysis of a financial condition or plan from a tax perspective in order to align financial goals through efficient tax planning." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10929" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Tax Data master file). Re-anchored from the bare cco:ont00000366 to ex:ActOfAccounting (which is itself subClassOf cco:ont00000366): the earlier 'No shared maintain genus fits' claim was false. ex:ActOfAccounting is defined as an act that 'produces or UPDATES a Descriptive ICE ... such as a ledger, journal, or account record', and its PROPOSE-EXT scope explicitly lists 'maintain ledgers/master files' -- 'Maintaining a master file' is exactly that pattern. Anchoring this master-file-maintenance act to the bare parent while its descriptive-output siblings ex:P10933 and ex:P10934 (also output ex:TaxData) use ex:ActOfAccounting was an avoidable inconsistency. Descriptive output agrees with the info-processing genus (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain tax master data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that maintains and updates the tax master data file recording the reference data underpinning the organization's tax planning." ;
          skos:example "A tax analyst updates jurisdiction codes and rates in the tax master file each quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10930
ex:P10930 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and implementing strategies for taxes to be paid or collected by the business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10930" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Directive output (Tax Strategy) -> ex:ActOfFormulation. The implementation aspect is carried out by the sibling transaction/accounting processes; here the definitional product is the strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform tax planning/strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates strategies for the taxes to be paid or collected by the organization and prescribes their implementation." ;
          skos:example "A tax team designs a strategy for collecting and remitting indirect taxes on sales." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10931
ex:P10931 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxReturn
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing and submitting tax reports for every employee to the tax department in order to show the tax paid and deducted from their salaries in the year." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10931" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Tax Return) -> ex:ActOfReporting. Employees are subjects of the per-employee filings (typical participant, left as comment); Tax Data is a typical input." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare tax returns" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares and submits a tax return reporting the tax paid by and deducted on behalf of the organization and its employees to the relevant tax authority." ;
          skos:example "Payroll files year-end employee tax statements with the tax department." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10932
ex:P10932 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxReturn
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing reports about paid or accrued foreign taxes to an overseas country." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10932" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Tax Return covering foreign tax) -> ex:ActOfReporting." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare foreign taxes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares a tax return reporting the foreign taxes paid or accrued by the organization to an overseas taxing jurisdiction." ;
          skos:example "A subsidiary's controller prepares the foreign-tax accrual report for an overseas jurisdiction." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10933
ex:P10933 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Calculating the income that has been realized when the tax on that income has not." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10933" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Tax Data) -> ex:ActOfAccounting (info-processing genus; agrees with descriptive output). Financial data is a typical input." ;
          rdfs:label "Calculate deferred taxes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that computes the organization's deferred tax positions arising where income is recognized in a period different from the period in which the related tax is incurred, producing tax data on those positions." ;
          skos:example "An accountant computes the deferred tax liability from timing differences between book and tax depreciation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10934
ex:P10934 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the organization's financial accounts for the purpose of taxation. Prepare and maintain the tax paid by the organization to the country they have business in." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10934" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Tax Data) -> ex:ActOfAccounting. General ledger / financial data are typical inputs (left as comment per Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Account for taxes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that maintains the organization's financial accounts for tax purposes and records the tax paid in each country in which it operates, producing tax data." ;
          skos:example "A controller books and reconciles the tax accounts at period close." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10935
ex:P10935 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking and correcting the tax policies according to the rules and regulations set by the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "10935" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Compliance Report) -> ex:ActOfMonitoring. Tax Data / Financial Policy are typical inputs (left as comment per Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor tax compliance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that checks the organization's tax policies and practices against applicable rules and regulations and produces a compliance report identifying and prompting correction of deviations." ;
          skos:example "An internal-controls reviewer audits VAT treatment against the tax code and flags exceptions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10936
ex:P10936 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxInquiryResponse
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Addressing any tax queries by any regulatory or government authorities. Review historical records related to taxation within the organization in order to respond to queries." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.9.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "10936" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "R5=process. Descriptive output (Tax Inquiry Response) -> ex:ActOfReporting. The Regulatory Authority that raised the query is definitional to the act, so it is a participant restriction; reviewed historical records (Tax Data) are a typical input left as comment." ;
          rdfs:label "Address tax inquiries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that reviews the organization's historical taxation records and produces a tax inquiry response answering a query raised by a regulatory or government authority." ;
          skos:example "A tax manager researches prior filings and replies to an information request from the revenue authority." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10937
ex:P10937 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10941
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10943
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10944
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning, acquiring, and managing facilities, workspaces, and supporting assets. Acquire, configure, and manage facilities and workspaces, to include supporting equipment and materials." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10937" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 10.1 as a curatorial aggregate occurrent. Its dotted children that are reality-layer processes are process parts (cco:ont00001777), not subclasses. 10.1.4 'Manage facilities operations' is a standing function (Organization Capability), so it is not a process part; the underlying location-change acts are reachable as parts of the operational facet instead." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and acquire assets" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent plans for, acquires, and configures the facilities, workspaces, and supporting assets required by an organization." ;
          skos:example "An organization's end-to-end cycle of strategizing, acquiring, and fitting out a new office building." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10941
ex:P10941 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10955
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10956
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10957
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PropertyStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Strategizing a long-term vision for managing properties. Prepare strategies and a long-term vision for managing purchased/retained properties." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10941" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: 'Develop ... strategy/vision' yields a Directive ICE (Property Strategy)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop property strategy and long term vision" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a property strategy and long-term vision prescribing how an organization will manage its purchased or retained properties." ;
          skos:example "A real-estate committee drafts a ten-year property strategy for the firm's owned portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10943
ex:P10943 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10958
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10959
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10960
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10961
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10962
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the needs of facility users in order to construct a project proposal that meets those needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10943" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): producing a project proposal/plan is a Directive ICE. Hosts its activities as process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan facility" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that recognizes the needs of facility users and composes a facility project proposal that prescribes how those needs will be met." ;
          skos:example "A project team turns user requirements into a costed facility proposal for sign-off." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10944
ex:P10944 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10963
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10964
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the provision of the workspace and its assets. Arrange an office space with all assets (tables, chairs, computers, admin staff, etc.) according to requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10944" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: a bounded provisioning act, modeled as ex:ActOfAcquisition (Planned Act) rather than a standing function, because it has an identifiable begin/end (the workspace is provisioned). Hosts its activities as process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide workspace and facilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains and arranges a workspace together with its supporting assets according to organizational requirements." ;
          skos:example "A facilities team stands up a new floor of desks, chairs, and computers ready for occupancy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10947
ex:P10947 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000950 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing prophylactic maintenance in an effort to avoid corrective or unplanned repairs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10947" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance). Operations category: the serviced productive asset is a material entity, attached as a definitional has-input filler (D4)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform preventative asset maintenance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Maintenance that acts upon a productive asset prophylactically to preserve its designed functions and avert future corrective or unplanned repairs." ;
          skos:example "A technician lubricates and calibrates a machine on its scheduled preventive interval." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10952
ex:P10952 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P18592
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21577
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AssetExitStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a strategy for managing asset exits." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10952" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (ex:AssetExitStrategy) -> Act of Formulation (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Children are monitoring and analysis acts that feed the strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop exit strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that examines the condition and economics of assets and produces an asset exit strategy prescribing how and when assets are to be exited." ;
          skos:example "An asset team drafts the multi-year retirement and replacement strategy for an ageing equipment fleet." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10953
ex:P10953 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDisposition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DispositionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing the sale of assets. Achieve and complete the sale process. Deliver the end product to the customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10953" ;
          rdfs:comment "Asset is a definitional material input; ex:DispositionRecord captures the transaction. CCO 2.0 has no Act of Selling; disposition by ownership transfer anchors at ex:ActOfDisposition." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform sale or trade" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Disposition that transfers ownership of an end-of-life asset to a buyer through sale or trade and produces a disposition record of the transaction." ;
          skos:example "A fleet manager sells a retired delivery van to a dealer and records the sale." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10955
ex:P10955 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PropertyRequirementsSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PropertyAlignmentAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating alignment between the requirement of properties and the overall business strategy. This process requires the organization to align the requirement of properties in accordance with its business strategies of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10955" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): 'Confirm alignment' judges/evaluates consistency, yielding a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm alignment of property requirements with business strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a property requirements specification and a business strategy and has as output a property alignment assessment judging their consistency." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio analyst confirms that the requested floor space aligns with the firm's growth strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10956
ex:P10956 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExternalEnvironmentAppraisal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the impact of the external environment. Evaluate the circumstances, objects, events, and aspects surrounding an organization that affects its actions and selections and that recognizes its opportunities and risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10956" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal); output is a Descriptive ICE (ex:ExternalEnvironmentAppraisal) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Appraise the external environment" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the forces, circumstances, and events surrounding an organization and has as output an external environment appraisal of its opportunities and risks." ;
          skos:example "A facilities team appraises regional economic and regulatory conditions before committing to a site." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10957
ex:P10957 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BuildBuyLeaseDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deciding whether to buy or build properties. Study the market forces about property prices and cost of construction in order to take decisions based on the market research." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10957" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection (Act of Information Processing): a candidate set (build/buy/lease) is reduced to a chosen option, yielding a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: selection -> directive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine build, buy, or lease decision" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input market data and chooses among building, buying, or leasing, producing a build/buy/lease decision." ;
          skos:example "After studying construction costs and lease rates, management decides to lease rather than build." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10958
ex:P10958 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FacilityDesign
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing and analyzing different designs for a facility in order to finalize which design will be the most suitable option." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10958" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning); a facility design is a Directive ICE (a blueprint/specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Design facility" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that prepares and evaluates candidate facility designs and has as output a finalized facility design." ;
          skos:example "Architects develop and down-select to a final layout for a new warehouse." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10959
ex:P10959 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BudgetAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the feasibility of budgets prepared for the construction of facilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10959" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (Act of Information Processing); output is a Descriptive ICE (ex:BudgetAnalysis) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze budget" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a budget and has as output a budget analysis evaluating the feasibility of the funds prepared for facility construction." ;
          skos:example "A finance analyst tests whether the proposed construction budget covers the design's costs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10960
ex:P10960 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PropertyRequirementsSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PropertySelectionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing and choosing the appropriate property. Analyze the property requirements. Review the available property options. Finalize the most suitable option." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "10960" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfSelection (Act of Information Processing): a candidate set of properties is reduced to a chosen one, yielding a Directive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Select property" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input a property requirements specification, reviews available property options, and produces a directive selection of the most suitable property." ;
          skos:example "A site-selection team reviews three buildings against requirements and commits to one." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10961
ex:P10961 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfNegotiation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FacilityTermsAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Discussing the terms and conditions of facilities to be occupied according to the business requirements and availability of budgets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10961" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfNegotiation (PROPOSE-EXT, Planned Act): an interactive deliberation between parties yielding a binding Directive ICE (ex:FacilityTermsAgreement). Rejected cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning) -- the act is an inter-agent bargaining rather than making a plan to achieve an objective." ;
          rdfs:label "Negotiate terms for facility" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Negotiation that discusses the terms and conditions for occupying a facility and produces a facility terms agreement reconciling business requirements and budget." ;
          skos:example "Facilities and a landlord negotiate lease length, rent, and fit-out responsibilities into an agreement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10962
ex:P10962 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000051 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionContractor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Facility
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ManageBuildingRenovation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Constructing the buildings. Manage renovations according to requirements and demands." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "10962" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ConstructionContractorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: although the APQC name says 'Manage', the Element Description ('Constructing the buildings. Manage renovations') denotes bounded constructive/modifying acts, so it is a process, not a standing function. De-conflated (Gate-F, Phase 1): the 'construct buildings' sense keeps the primary class at cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction); the 'manage renovations' sense is the modify-existing-artifact genus cco:ont00000970 (Act of Artifact Modification), modeled as the supporting process ex:ManageBuildingRenovation and attached here as a process part rather than collapsed into Construction. Operations layer (10.0) permits the material output ex:Facility. has-input ex:FacilityDesign is typical, recorded here rather than as a definitional restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage construction or modification to building" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Construction that builds a building on site as prescribed by a facility design or contract and has as output a facility, and that has the management of building renovations as a process part." ;
          skos:example "A general contractor erects the warehouse shell per the approved design and manages later renovations to it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10963
ex:P10963 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Workspace
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Attaining the office space with all assets (tables, chairs, computers, admin staff, etc.) according to requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10963" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAcquisition (Planned Act). Operations layer permits the material output ex:Workspace." ;
          rdfs:label "Acquire workspace and facilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains an office workspace together with its supporting assets according to organizational requirements." ;
          skos:example "Procurement secures a leased floor and furnishes it with the required equipment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10964
ex:P10964 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000970 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Workspace
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Modifying the formation of the workspace and its assets. Make necessary changes in an office space with all assets (tables, chairs, computers, admin staff, interior designing, etc.) according to requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10964" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from the over-general cco:ont00000908 (Act of Material Artifact Processing) to its nearest correct child cco:ont00000970 (Act of Artifact Modification): the source ('Modifying the formation of the workspace and its assets ... Make necessary changes ... according to requirements') is precisely 'an existing Material Artifact is acted upon in a manner that changes ... its Qualities, Dispositions, or Functions' (ont00000970). This matches the sibling-pattern 10.2.3.4 'Augment existing assets' (ex:P19233), which anchors the same modify-existing-artifact act at ont00000970. ont00000908 retained as the (over-general) parent reached transitively. Rejected cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance), which only preserves/restores existing qualities rather than altering fit/form/function. Operations layer permits the material input/output ex:Workspace." ;
          rdfs:label "Change fit/form/function of workspace and facilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Artifact Modification that modifies the fit, form, or function of a workspace and its assets according to changed organizational requirements." ;
          skos:example "A facilities crew reconfigures an open-plan floor into team pods with new partitions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10965
ex:P10965 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000065 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FacilityManagementPersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelocatedPersonnel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Shifting staff or employees from one place to another place according to changes in business requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "10965" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:FacilityManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:FacilityManagerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000065 (Act of Location Change): the location of an Object is changed by an Agent. Realizes the standing ex:FacilityManagementCapability (10.1.4). Corrected (Gate-F): the moved Object is the relocated population (ex:RelocatedPersonnel), NOT ex:FacilityManagementPersonnel. The earlier model wrongly asserted that the facility managers (who PERFORM the move) were the relocated party; ex:FacilityManagementPersonnel is retained as a SEPARATE participant restriction representing the performers, not as the moved party." ;
          rdfs:label "Relocate people" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Location Change that moves the relocated staff or employees of an organization from one location to another, performed by facility-management personnel, in response to changed business requirements." ;
          skos:example "An HR/facilities team moves a department to a different building floor." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10966
ex:P10966 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000065 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Relocating the tools and raw materials. Shift raw or finished material and machines of company from one place to another place according to changes in business requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.1.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10966" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:FacilityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000065 (Act of Location Change). Realizes the standing ex:FacilityManagementCapability (10.1.4). Operations layer permits the material participant ex:ProductiveAsset (machines/tools relocated)." ;
          rdfs:label "Relocate material and tools" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Location Change that moves an organization's materials, tools, and machines from one location to another in response to changed business requirements." ;
          skos:example "A logistics crew relocates machine tools and stock to a newly acquired warehouse." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10967
ex:P10967 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfForecasting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenanceRequirementsForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating assets in order to project future requirements for maintenance. Evaluate the present working condition of assets. Determine the future maintenance requirements of assets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "10967" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfForecasting (Act of Prediction, cco:ont00000371): the definitional output is a Predictive ICE (ex:MaintenanceRequirementsForecast) describing an UNCERTAIN FUTURE state -- the source text 'project future requirements' / 'determine the future maintenance requirements' makes this a prediction, not a plain analysis of an existing subject. Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis (Act of Information Processing): that genus fits acts whose output is a plain Descriptive ICE about an EXISTING subject; a forecast of an uncertain future is the Predictive specialization (cco:ont00000626 subClassOf cco:ont00000853), produced by an Act of Prediction." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze assets and predict maintenance requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Forecasting that examines the present working condition of productive assets and has as output a maintenance requirements forecast projecting their uncertain future maintenance needs." ;
          skos:example "An asset analyst reviews equipment condition data and forecasts the parts and servicing needed next year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P10968
ex:P10968 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenanceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising a methodology and procedure for assimilating the works of planned maintenance into the schedule scheme for the processing of finished products that utilizes the same machinery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "10968" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Maintenance Schedule) coordinating maintenance with production." ;
          rdfs:label "Integrate preventive maintenance into operations schedule" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that assimilates planned preventive maintenance into the production operations timetable and has as output a maintenance schedule." ;
          skos:example "A planner slots preventive servicing into windows when the shared line is idle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11010
ex:P11010 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:InvestorRelationsCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CultivateAnalystRelations
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CultivateLenderRelations
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11037
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a strategic management responsibility for integrating finance, communication, marketing, and securities law compliance. Allow the most effective two-way communication among the organization, the financial community, and other constituencies. Enlist the investor relations function to provide market intelligence to corporate management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11010" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InvestorRelationsCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as an Organization Capability (R6), not a process: APQC describes a standing 'strategic management responsibility' / 'investor relations function' with no natural end. Specializes the shared ex:InvestorRelationsCapability. Two of its three APQC children (12.1.1, 12.1.2) are themselves standing functions re-judged as capabilities under R5 (ex:LenderRelationsManagementCapability, ex:AnalystRelationsManagementCapability); a capability is realized only in PROCESSES (BFO_0000054), so this umbrella capability is realized in the bounded episode acts ex:CultivateLenderRelations / ex:CultivateAnalystRelations and in the shareholder-communication process ex:P11037, not in the sub-capabilities." ;
          rdfs:label "Build investor relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Investor Relations Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to realize the integrated two-way engagement of the organization with lenders, analysts, and shareholders." ;
          skos:example "An organization's standing investor-relations office that cultivates lender, analyst, and shareholder relationships across fiscal periods." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11012
ex:P11012 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11042
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11043
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining relations with representatives of the stockholders. Establish corporate management-related policies and to make decisions on major company issues. Implement practices designed to engender communication, trust, and cooperation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11012" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5 = capability, not a process: 'manage/maintain relations' denotes a standing function with no natural beginning or end, so it is modeled as an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568) realized in its underlying acts (R6), not as a bounded occurrent. Subsumed under the shared StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability. The realized-in restrictions link it to the bounded acts that exercise it." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage relations with board of directors" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to sustain communicative and reporting relations with its board of directors and the stockholders the board represents." ;
          skos:example "A corporate secretariat's ongoing capacity to deliver financial and audit reporting to the board and shareholders." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11013
ex:P11013 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11044
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11046
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11050
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11051
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11052
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11053
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11054
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing legal practices to abide by the law, as well as ethical practices." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11013" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5/R6: 'Manage legal and ethical issues' is a standing function with no natural end, so it is an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), not a process. Realized in the modeled child acts. Narrower, pcf-bearing refinement of the shared ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability. NOTE: 12.4.4 (P11047 Ensure compliance) is itself re-judged as a sub-capability under R5 (Gate-F), and a capability is realized only in processes, so this umbrella capability is realized in P11047's bounded acts ex:P11053 / ex:P11054 rather than in the P11047 sub-capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage legal and ethical issues" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that an Organization realizes in the acts by which it manages its legal and ethical practices so as to abide by the law." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11035
ex:P11035 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:LenderRelationsManagementCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CultivateLenderRelations
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Building and managing relations with bankers or lenders through strong products/services strategies that bankers would want to invest in. Foster a receptive environment for low rates of interest, easy access to loans, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11035" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:LenderRelationsManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F, R5 cross-row consistency): previously modeled as a bounded ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement. 'Plan, build, and manage an ongoing relation ... foster a receptive environment' has no natural beginning or end; it is a standing capacity realized in recurring episodes -- exactly the R5 'standing function -> capability' branch already applied to the parallel 'Manage ... relations' rows 12.2.1 (P11038), 12.2.2 (P11039), 12.2.3 (P11040). Leaf-vs-nonleaf is NOT the R5 ground (R5 is per-node bounded-occurrent, independent of whether children were enumerated), so the prior split mistyped parallel rows. Now an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568) specializing ex:LenderRelationsManagementCapability, realized in the bounded ex:CultivateLenderRelations episodes (obo:BFO_0000054). The Lender participates in those episode acts, not in the capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan, build, and manage lender relations" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to build, maintain, and advance ongoing relationships with bankers and lenders so as to foster a receptive environment for favorable lending terms." ;
          skos:example "An organization's standing treasury function that nurtures banking relationships across fiscal periods to secure low-rate credit lines." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11036
ex:P11036 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:AnalystRelationsManagementCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CultivateAnalystRelations
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and maintaining long-term relations with analysts. Involve analysts in strategy and product decisions in order to elicit valuable information." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11036" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AnalystRelationsManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F, R5 cross-row consistency): previously modeled as a bounded ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement. 'Creating and maintaining LONG-TERM relations with analysts' is the paradigm of a standing function with no natural end -- 'long-term' actively signals the no-natural-end (standing-capacity) branch of R5 -- the same pattern the module treats as a capability at 12.2.1-3. Reconciled to the same R5 verdict chosen for P11035. Now an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568) specializing ex:AnalystRelationsManagementCapability, realized in the bounded ex:CultivateAnalystRelations episodes (analyst meetings, briefings) via obo:BFO_0000054. The FinancialAnalyst participates in those episode acts, not in the capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan, build, and manage analyst relations" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to create and maintain long-term relationships with financial analysts so as to elicit market intelligence." ;
          skos:example "An organization's standing investor-relations function that maintains relationships with sell-side analysts covering the firm across reporting cycles." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11037
ex:P11037 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Shareholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ShareholderCommunication
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Practicing regular, transparent communication with shareholders through annual shareholders' meetings, quarterly earnings calls, shareholders letters, one-on-one emails or calls, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11037" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ShareholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) because the act consists in transferring an Information Content Entity from the organization to its shareholders. The output ShareholderCommunication is a Descriptive ICE and is definitional (every instance produces communicated content), so it is promoted to a restriction; the Shareholder is a definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate with shareholders" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transfers information from an organization to its shareholders and produces a shareholder communication." ;
          skos:example "A company holds its quarterly earnings call and issues a shareholders' letter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11038
ex:P11038 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12869
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12870
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12871
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12872
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12873
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12874
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Persuading public and government policy at the local, regional, national, and global level (subject to government regulations)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11038" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing function ('Manage ...'), no natural end => Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), not a process. Realized in its APQC child acts (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage government relations" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to establish, assess, monitor, and advance relationships with government bodies in order to influence public and government policy." ;
          skos:example "A corporate government-affairs office's ongoing program of engaging legislators and agencies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11039
ex:P11039 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12875
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12876
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12877
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12878
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing relations with quasi-governmental organizations, corporations, businesses, or any other agency that is treated by national laws and principles to be under the supervision of the government but also distinct and self-directed from the government." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11039" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing function => Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568). Realized in its APQC child acts (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage relations with quasi-government bodies" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to establish, maintain, and advance relationships with quasi-government bodies." ;
          skos:example "An organization's ongoing engagement with a quasi-governmental regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11040
ex:P11040 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12879
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12880
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12881
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing relations with organizations established and financed by businesses that operate in a specific industry. Participate in public relations actions such as lobbying and publishing, advertising, education, and political donations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11040" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing function => Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568). Realized in its APQC child acts (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage relations with trade or industry groups" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to evaluate, establish, monitor, extend, and modify relationships with trade or industry groups." ;
          skos:example "An organization's ongoing membership and lobbying activity within an industry association." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11041
ex:P11041 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing lobbying activities to affect government policies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11041" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:StakeholderRelationshipManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing function ('Manage ...'), no natural end and no decomposed APQC children => Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), not a process." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage lobby activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to conduct and coordinate lobbying activities aimed at affecting government policies." ;
          skos:example "A firm's ongoing lobbying program directed at pending legislation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11042
ex:P11042 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001922 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BoardOfDirectors
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialResultsReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting financial results to management, and releasing results to the public. Report financial statements, including the income statement, balance sheet, and statement of cash flows." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11042" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: a representative-communication (reporting) act asserting facts, so the definitional output ex:FinancialResultsReport is a Descriptive ICE (cco:ont00000853). Financial data is a definitional input (one cannot report results without it). The Board of Directors / management are modeled as recipients of the communicated report; release to the public is a typical further recipient noted in the source text." ;
          rdfs:label "Report financial results" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input financial data and has as output a financial results report asserting an organization's financial statements to management and the public." ;
          skos:example "A controller's office issues the quarterly income statement, balance sheet, and statement of cash flows to the board and to the public." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11043
ex:P11043 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AuditInquiry
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001922 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BoardOfDirectors
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AuditFindingsReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting audit findings to management. Practice an internal audit with criteria for confirming a problem, a description of the situation, and the root cause of the problem. Make recommendations that resolve the issue." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11043" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: a representative-communication (reporting) act, so the definitional output ex:AuditFindingsReport is a Descriptive ICE (cco:ont00000853). The internal-audit inquiry that surfaces the findings is the definitional input. The conducting of the internal audit itself is a separate appraisal act outside this reporting node; here only the reporting (transfer of asserted findings to the board/management) is modeled. The Board of Directors / management are the recipients." ;
          rdfs:label "Report audit findings" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input an audit inquiry and has as output an audit findings report asserting confirmed problems, their situation and root cause, and recommendations to management." ;
          skos:example "Internal audit issues a findings report to the audit committee of the board, stating the confirmed control gap, its root cause, and remediation recommendations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11044
ex:P11044 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EthicsPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a code of ethics that communicate the organization's philosophy to employees, vendors, customers, clients, and the public." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11044" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: output EthicsPolicy is a Directive ICE, so the act genus is Formulation (Act of Planning), not Information Processing." ;
          rdfs:label "Create ethics policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a code of ethics and has as output an ethics policy expressing the organization's philosophy." ;
          skos:example "A compliance team drafts and publishes the company code of ethics." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11045
ex:P11045 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering the system of rules, practices, and processes through which a company is directed and controlled. Balance stakeholder interests including shareholders, management, customers, suppliers, financiers, government, and the community. Outline a strategy for achieving organizational goals, from action plans and internal controls to performance measurement and corporate disclosure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11045" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5/R6: administering the standing governance 'system' has no natural end, so it is an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568). The corporate governance policy it maintains is the shared ex:CorporateGovernancePolicy (a Directive ICE) produced by the underlying formulation acts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage corporate governance policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that an Organization realizes in administering the system of rules, practices, and processes through which it is directed and controlled while balancing stakeholder interests." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11046
ex:P11046 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PreventiveLawProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and applying programs and activities. Encourage the adherence preventive laws, such as environmental law, sex discrimination, computer law, estate planning, corporate compliance, business planning, and property transactions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11046" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output PreventiveLawProgram is a Directive ICE (a program prescribing activities), so the genus is Formulation. 'Perform' is realization of the program; the definitional move is its creation." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and perform preventive law programs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates programs and activities encouraging adherence to preventive laws and has as output a preventive law program." ;
          skos:example "Legal counsel rolls out an environmental-law and corporate-compliance preventive program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11047
ex:P11047 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11053
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11054
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring the organization's compliance position. Validate compliance with different statutes, regulatory directions, and legal principles (using Establish compliance framework and policies [17468]). Coordinate with compliance and risk management personnel." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11047" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F, R5 / genus-vs-parts tension): previously a single bounded Act of Appraisal. (a) 'Ensuring the organization's compliance position' / 'coordinate with personnel' reads as a standing oversight function with no natural end -- like its modeled-as-Capability siblings P11045/P11048/P11049. (b) It was given cco:has process part to a FORMULATION act (P11053 design a compliance program) and an EXECUTION act (P11054), neither of which is an occurrent part of judging compliance -- an appraisal does not have 'design a program' as a part. Re-modeled as an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568) specializing ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability, realized (obo:BFO_0000054) in its bounded child acts P11053 and P11054, which are thereby re-parented as realizations of the capability rather than process parts of an appraisal. The bounded validation judgement against ex:RegulatoryRequirement, performed with ex:CompliancePersonnel, is itself one of the acts that realize this capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Ensure compliance" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to ensure and oversee its compliance position by designing compliance programs and validating adherence to statutes, regulatory directions, and legal principles." ;
          skos:example "A standing compliance office that designs anti-trust programs and continually validates the firm's standing against SEC and consumer-protection statutes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11048
ex:P11048 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11056
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11057
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11058
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11059
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11060
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11061
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing professionals, sought externally for assistance over legal and ethical concerns. Administer and oversee assistance from subject matter experts and professionals for sourcing expert opinion and counseling over legal and ethical matters." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11048" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5/R6: a standing 'administer and oversee' function with no natural end, so an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568). Realized in its six bounded child acts (12.4.5.1-12.4.5.6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage outside counsel" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that an Organization realizes in the acts by which it engages, oversees, pays, and monitors externally sourced professionals for legal and ethical assistance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11049
ex:P11049 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:IntellectualPropertyManagementCapability ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11062
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11063
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11064
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11065
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Safeguarding the intellectual property of the organization. This process requires the organization to protect a wide variety of intellectual property created by it. It involves creating and managing non-disclosure agreements (NDAs), following up on current developments in the areas where the organization holds patents, tracking the use of the organization's copyrighted material, creating and upholding licensing terms, and administering policies for safeguarding intellectual property." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11049" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:IntellectualPropertyManagementCapability ,
                                ex:LegalAndComplianceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5/R6: an ongoing 'safeguarding/administering policies' function with no natural end, so an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568). Realized in its four bounded child acts (12.4.6.1-12.4.6.4). Narrower, pcf-bearing refinement of the shared ex:IntellectualPropertyManagementCapability." ;
          rdfs:label "Protect intellectual property" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that an Organization realizes in the acts by which it safeguards, registers, licenses, and polices its intellectual property." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11050
ex:P11050 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfNegotiation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DisputeResolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Resolving disputes or civil lawsuits internally or externally." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11050" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F sibling consistency): previously ex:ActOfFormulation (=> cco:ont00000511 'Act of Planning' = making a plan to achieve an objective), but a dispute resolution is reached through negotiation or adjudication BETWEEN adverse parties -- a Social Act, not a solo planning act (the slice's own skos:example says the team 'negotiates a settlement'). The parallel binding-settlement sibling P11052 'Negotiate and document agreements' correctly uses ex:ActOfNegotiation (a Social Act), so P11050 is anchored consistently. Output DisputeResolution (Directive ICE) is retained: ex:ActOfNegotiation is defined as producing a Directive ICE such as a contract/settlement that prescribes the agreed terms, so the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE holds (negotiation's bargained output is directive). OutsideCounsel is a typical, non-definitional participant (external resolution only)." ;
          rdfs:label "Resolve disputes and litigations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Negotiation that settles a dispute or civil lawsuit between adverse parties, internally or externally, and has as output a dispute resolution." ;
          skos:example "The legal team negotiates a settlement that ends a supplier lawsuit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11051
ex:P11051 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Advisor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LegalAdvice
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing legal advice concerning the substance or procedure of a law in relation to a particular situation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11051" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:AdvisorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): providing advice transfers an ICE from adviser to recipient. Output LegalAdvice is a Descriptive ICE (it represents/explains the legal position rather than prescribing a binding action), satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE for an information/advisory act. Advisor is a definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide legal advice/counseling" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that conveys legal advice concerning the substance or procedure of a law in relation to a particular situation and has that legal advice as output." ;
          skos:example "Counsel advises management on the disclosure obligations triggered by an acquisition." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11052
ex:P11052 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfNegotiation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Contract
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Negotiating terms to reach a final draft of a contract that is acceptable to all parties." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11052" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses PROPOSE-EXT genus ex:ActOfNegotiation (a Social Act). Output Contract is a Directive ICE, consistent with a negotiated, binding agreement." ;
          rdfs:label "Negotiate and document agreements/contracts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Negotiation that exchanges offers among parties to reach a final draft of a contract acceptable to all of them and has that contract as output." ;
          skos:example "Counsel negotiates and finalizes a master services agreement with a vendor." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11053
ex:P11053 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Employing an internal system or process to identify and reduce the risk of breaching the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Remedy any breach. Create a culture of compliance. Design compliance programs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11053" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ComplianceProgram is a Directive ICE, so the genus is Formulation (Act of Planning)." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and initiate compliance program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that designs an internal system to identify and reduce the risk of statutory breach and has as output a compliance program." ;
          skos:example "A compliance lead designs and launches an anti-trust compliance program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11054
ex:P11054 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompliancePersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing the established compliance program in order to meet the government laws and regulations. Create a compliance team that scrutinizes the rules set out by government bodies such as the Securities and Exchange Commission." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11054" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ComplianceOfficerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): execution is prescribed by the ComplianceProgram (Directive ICE), modeled as a held prescription via cco:ont00001921 (has input). It produces no new definitional ICE of its own." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute compliance program" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that implements an established compliance program to meet government laws and regulations, prescribed by that compliance program." ;
          skos:example "A compliance team carries out the scheduled controls and audits defined by the program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11056
ex:P11056 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DetermineLegalWorkRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LegalProblemStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining the problems and deciding the action requirements for engaging outside counsel. This process element calls upon the organization to internally analyze the issues for which assistance from external counsel is needed. Additionally, the organization needs to break-down the issue, identifying the tasks and exercises where outside counsel can help." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11056" ;
          rdfs:comment "SPLIT (Gate-F GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE / Phase-1): previously a single Act of Appraisal carrying TWO definitional existential outputs of opposite kind -- ex:LegalProblemStatement (Descriptive, the judgement, agreeing with Appraisal) and ex:WorkRequirementsSpecification (Directive, the determined action requirements). A Directive specification is a planning/decision facet, so the appraisal genus disagreed with one of its own mandatory outputs. The compound row is de-conflated: P11056 retains only its Descriptive output (LegalProblemStatement), and the Directive-producing facet is the supporting ex:ActOfFormulation class ex:DetermineLegalWorkRequirements, linked via cco:has process part (cco:ont00001777)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess problem and determine work requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that examines the legal issues for which external counsel is needed and has as output a legal problem statement, and which has as process part the determination of the legal work requirements." ;
          skos:example "In-house counsel scopes a dispute (the appraisal) and, as a part, specifies the tasks to hand to outside counsel." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11057
ex:P11057 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OutsideCounsel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkRequirementsSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recruiting the assistance of outside counsel for any legal and/or ethical concerns. Engage and/or retain any external counsel sought from subject matter experts and professionals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11057" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:OutsideCounselRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses shared genus ex:ActOfAcquisition: the organization obtains counsel services it did not previously hold. WorkRequirementsSpecification from 12.4.5.1 is a definitional input; OutsideCounsel is a definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Engage/Retain outside counsel if necessary" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains the assistance of outside counsel for legal or ethical concerns, taking a work requirements specification as input." ;
          skos:example "The legal department retains an external IP firm to handle a patent suit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11058
ex:P11058 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making a financial plan. This strategy sets out, using figures, an organization's expected future results. Enlist the finance function to support work generated by other business functions in order to build and secure their support for the budget." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11058" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): an input ICE (the Budget, a Directive ICE) is received. Budget is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive strategy/budget" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that receives a budget, a financial plan setting out expected future results in figures, for the engaged legal work." ;
          skos:example "The legal team receives the finance-approved budget for an outside-counsel engagement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11059
ex:P11059 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OutsideCounsel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LegalWorkProduct
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkProductValidationRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Receiving deliverables from outside counsel, and monitoring the efforts committed by them. Track the progress of, collect, and validate the required work product from the subject matter experts and professionals engaged as external counsel. Verify the amount of effort dedicated by these counsels to the issue at hand, in order to confirm their fees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11059" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:OutsideCounselRole ;
          rdfs:comment "I/O CORRECTED (Gate-F, Phase-3): previously the identical class ex:WorkProductDeliverable was asserted as BOTH has-input and has-output, making the input/output distinction vacuous and over-committing (thin-class risk). The received raw deliverable (input) and the validated tracking/effort record the act produces (output) are different ICEs. Now has-input the received deliverable ex:LegalWorkProduct and has-output the distinct ex:WorkProductValidationRecord (the validated effort/fee-confirmation record). Reuses PROPOSE-EXT genus ex:ActOfMonitoring; OutsideCounsel is a definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive work product and manage/monitor case and work performed" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that receives the work product of engaged outside counsel, tracks and validates the committed effort, and has as output a work product validation record used to confirm fees." ;
          skos:example "In-house counsel logs and verifies a law firm's filed briefs and billed hours before approving fees." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11060
ex:P11060 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfPayment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Advisor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentInstrument
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Invoice
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making payments to legal advisers for their services. Payments include addressing issues or suits by customers, suppliers, competitors, bankers, government agencies, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11060" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:AdvisorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses PROPOSE-EXT genus ex:ActOfPayment. Definitional informational output is the Descriptive ICE ex:PaymentRecord (the remittance/payment record); the transferred money ex:PaymentInstrument is the material entity moved by the act and is modeled as a definitional participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not as a has-output filler, because process outputs in this domain are ICEs (S3 OutputIsICE). Invoice is the informational (Descriptive ICE) input; Advisor is a definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Process payment for legal services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Payment that transfers consideration to a legal adviser for services rendered, taking an invoice as input, transferring a payment as a material participant, and having a payment record as its informational output." ;
          skos:example "Accounts payable settles an outside-counsel invoice for litigation services and logs the remittance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11061
ex:P11061 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LegalActivityRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Keeping track of the legal activities and performance of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11061" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses PROPOSE-EXT genus ex:ActOfMonitoring; its descriptive output LegalActivityRecord records ongoing legal activity, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Track legal activity/performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks the legal activities and performance of the organization and has as output a legal activity record." ;
          skos:example "The legal operations team maintains a register of active matters and outcomes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11062
ex:P11062 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:IntellectualPropertyRight
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the patents and copyrights already held or sought by the organization. Administer and oversee applying for, securing, and maintaining intellectual property rights in the form of patents and copyrights. Submit applications for such rights. Handle associated legal issues. Draft and communicate proper attributions. Collect royalties. Monitor any misuse of the intellectual property rights." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11062" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F false-friend): previously ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (=> cco:ont00000433 'Act of Association' = 'an Agent unites with some other Agent in a Planned Act, enterprise or business'). The source describes administering an IP ASSET portfolio -- applying for, securing, maintaining rights; submitting applications; collecting royalties; monitoring misuse -- with no uniting-with-an-external-Agent to ground an Act of Association; the dominant definitional move is obtaining/securing the IntellectualPropertyRight, i.e. acquisition, not social uniting. 'Manage' -> RelationshipManagement was a surface-word false friend (D2/§6). Re-anchored to the shared genus ex:ActOfAcquisition (a Planned Act in which an Agent obtains an entity it did not previously hold), keeping the IntellectualPropertyRight (Directive ICE) as definitional output. Royalty collection and misuse monitoring remain typical, non-definitional sub-steps (this comment, not restrictions). Evaluated minting a dedicated ex:ActOfPortfolioAdministration (=> cco:ont00000228) but the acquisition core is captured by the existing shared genus, so no new genus is minted (reuse-before-mint, D5)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage copyrights, patents, and trademarks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that applies for, secures, and maintains the organization's patents, copyrights, and trademarks and has as output the resulting intellectual property right." ;
          skos:example "The IP office files and renews patents and pursues infringers of company trademarks." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11063
ex:P11063 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:IntellectualPropertyPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the upkeep of intellectual property rights by creating and managing a framework of rules, policies, procedures, and restrictions. Outline a clear policy for any possible scenario of their use by any external agent." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11063" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output IntellectualPropertyPolicy is a Directive ICE, so the genus is Formulation (Act of Planning), not relationship management; the definitional move is composing the policy framework." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain intellectual property rights and restrictions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates a framework of rules, procedures, and restrictions governing the use of the organization's intellectual property and has as output an intellectual property policy." ;
          skos:example "Legal drafts the company policy governing third-party use of its patents." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11064
ex:P11064 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LicensingTerms
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering and overseeing the terms and policies associated with licensing the organization's intellectual property. Create and manage the policies and terms governing the possible granting of a license to any external agent. Demarcate a clear framework that governs the licensing of any patents or copyrights held by the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11064" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output LicensingTerms is a Directive ICE, so the genus is Formulation; the definitional move is composing the licensing framework rather than ongoing oversight." ;
          rdfs:label "Administer licensing terms" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates the policies and terms governing the licensing of the organization's intellectual property and has as output licensing terms." ;
          skos:example "Legal demarcates the standard royalty and field-of-use terms for licensing company patents." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11065
ex:P11065 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LicensingTerms
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing options regarding licensing agreements. Follow favorable terms and conditions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.4.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11065" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F false-friend, same pattern as P11062): previously ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (=> cco:ont00000433 'Act of Association'). There is no uniting-with-an-external-Agent here -- exercising/overseeing contractual options is decision/management over a Directive ICE (the governing ex:LicensingTerms), not a social uniting; 'administer/manage' -> Act of Association was a surface-word false friend. Re-anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), keeping P11065 in the same corrected Planned-Act genus family as the reconciled P11062 (ex:ActOfAcquisition => Planned Act) rather than both defaulting to Act of Association. Considered ex:ActOfSelection (Information Processing) but rejected it: the source 'follow favorable terms' is overseeing/exercising an already-granted option, and the apqc-ext caveat notes that ratifying a single already-settled option is NOT Selection (no candidate set), so the generic Planned Act is the correct anchor. LicensingTerms is the definitional input governing the options." ;
          rdfs:label "Administer options" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that administers and exercises the options available under the organization's licensing agreements so as to follow favorable terms and conditions, taking the governing licensing terms as input." ;
          skos:example "The IP office exercises a renewal option on a favorable inbound licensing agreement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11066
ex:P11066 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Community
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing and administering community relations. Establish business connections with the people constituting the environment the organization operates in and draws resources from in order to foster mutual understanding, trust, and support. Create programs that promote the organization's image in a positive and community-oriented way." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11066" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PublicRelationsCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CommunityRole ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: bounded, repeatable relationship-management engagement (a realization of the public-relations capability), not the standing function itself. Typical output: an ex:RelationshipStatusReport; left in comment (not a someValuesFrom restriction) because not every instance produces one (Phase-3 necessity)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage community relations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Relationship Management in which an Agent develops and administers connections with the community in which an organization operates in order to foster mutual understanding, trust, and support, and has the community as participant." ;
          skos:example "A community-affairs team runs a neighbourhood sponsorship program and meets with local leaders to build goodwill." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11067
ex:P11067 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Journalist
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing and managing relations with media. Develop connections with journalists to solicit critical, third-party endorsements for a product, issue, service, or organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11067" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PublicRelationsCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:JournalistRole ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: bounded, repeatable relationship-management engagement with the press. Participant ex:Journalist is definitional (relations are developed with journalists); ex:MediaOutlet is the typical organizational counterparty and is noted here rather than asserted as a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage media relations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Relationship Management in which an Agent develops and manages connections with media outlets and journalists in order to solicit third-party endorsements for a product, issue, service, or organization, and has a journalist as participant." ;
          skos:example "A PR officer pitches a feature story to a journalist and cultivates an ongoing media contact list." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11068
ex:P11068 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdvocacy ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GovernmentBody
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Promoting political security and stability in the regions where the organization conducts business. Encourage political stability in the regions where the organization operates. Support civic programs, citizen engagement, connection platforms, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11068" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PublicRelationsCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:GovernmentBodyRole ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F false-friend): previously ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (=> cco:ont00000433 'Act of Association' = 'an Agent unites with some other Agent in a Planned Act, enterprise or business'). The de-conflated lead verbs are 'Promote / Encourage political security and stability' and 'Support civic programs, citizen engagement, connection platforms' -- the dominant intent is advocacy / influencing the societal-political environment, not bilateral uniting into a shared enterprise. The prior comment ('unites the org with civic/government parties') re-read an advocacy verb as an association verb -- exactly the false friend the methodology warns against (verify the differentia, not the surface). Re-anchored to the new shared-extension genus ex:ActOfAdvocacy (=> cco:ont00001327 Social Act). Evaluated cco:ont00000079 'Act of Social Movement' (verified: 'A Social Act composed of a series of performances, displays and campaigns directed at implementing, resisting or undoing a change in society') as the nearer Social-Act sibling: it fits campaign-driven activism but is narrower than the general supporting/promoting intent here (supporting civic programs and citizen-engagement platforms is not necessarily a movement to implement/resist/undo a societal change), so the dedicated ex:ActOfAdvocacy genus was preferred over both ont00000079 and Act of Association. (NB: the review note's 'cco:ont00000478' is NOT Act of Social Movement -- ont00000478 is 'Cuboidal', a shape; the correct Social-Movement IRI is ont00000079, verified in the closure.) ex:Community is also a typical participant (noted, not asserted)." ;
          rdfs:label "Promote political stability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Advocacy in which an Agent promotes and encourages political security and stability in the regions where an organization operates -- supporting civic programs, citizen engagement, and connection platforms -- and has a government body as participant." ;
          skos:example "A corporate-affairs unit funds a local civic-engagement platform and partners with a municipal authority to support regional stability." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11069
ex:P11069 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PressRelease
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing press releases to communicate developments and generate interest in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11069" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PublicRelationsCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: bounded, repeatable authoring act. Anchored directly under cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: its definitional output ex:PressRelease is a Descriptive ICE (a representation of developments), not a directive. Output is definitional (every instance yields a press release) so it is asserted as a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Create press releases" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing in which an Agent composes a press release that describes organizational developments in order to generate interest in the organization, and has that press release as output." ;
          skos:example "A communications writer drafts a press release announcing a new product launch." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11070
ex:P11070 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000588 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MediaOutlet
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PressRelease
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Issuing press releases to carefully selected media in distribution channels such as the web, newspapers, and social media." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11070" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PublicRelationsCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:MediaOutletRole ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: bounded, repeatable dissemination act. Anchored under cco:ont00000588 (Act of Mass Media Communication, verified: 'intended to reach a large audience using a medium such as the internet, television, radio, newspaper, and magazine'). Input ex:PressRelease and participant ex:MediaOutlet are both definitional (issuing necessarily transfers an existing press release to media)." ;
          rdfs:label "Issue press releases" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Mass Media Communication in which an Agent disseminates a press release to selected media in distribution channels such as the web, newspapers, and social media, and has a media outlet as participant." ;
          skos:example "A PR team distributes a finalized press release to wire services, newspapers, and the corporate social-media channels." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11072
ex:P11072 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11083
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11084
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11085
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11087
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11088
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BenchmarkAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Comparing organizational performance internally or externally with other organizations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11072" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) because benchmarking evaluates and judges performance relative to comparators. Children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Benchmark performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that compares an organization's performance internally or externally against other organizations and produces a benchmark analysis." ;
          skos:example "A benchmarking team compares the firm's order-cycle time against industry peers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11074
ex:P11074 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11135
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11136
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11137
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21457
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning, designing, and implementing the change. Ensure improvement in the change process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11074" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 13.4 as a bounded change-management cycle (an occurrent), not the standing 'change management' function. Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses. DELIBERATE R5 DIVERGENCE FROM SIBLING GROUP NODES (auditable, uniform criterion): a 'Manage X' group node is minted as a bounded Planned Act ONLY when X denotes a discrete initiative with a natural terminus, and as an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568, no ex:P) when X denotes an open-ended enterprise function with no natural end. A change/transformation INITIATIVE has a natural end (the target future state is reached and adoption sustained), so 13.4 is a bounded Planned Act AND additionally carries the standing-function reading ex:ChangeManagementCapability for orgs that run change as a permanent function. By contrast 13.3 'Manage enterprise quality' (P17471), 13.1 'Manage business processes' (16378), 13.5 'Manage KM' (11073), and 13.2 portfolio/program/project management are permanent functions with no natural end, so they are capability-only. See the cross-reference on ex:P17471." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage change" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent plans, designs, implements, and sustains a deliberate organizational change, comprising the planning, design, implementation, and improvement-sustainment of that change." ;
          skos:example "An organization's end-to-end transformation initiative from concept through sustained adoption." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11075
ex:P11075 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseMeasurementModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a model for organization's management systems. Develop a high-level measurement system to track performance across the enterprise or in specific functions or business units. Determine which processes to measure, which measures to use, how often to measure, and measurement targets. Review strategic decisions about how to best measure an organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11075" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (a measurement model/system is prescriptive), so anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define enterprise measurement models" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an enterprise measurement model prescribing which processes to measure, which measures to use, how often to measure, and the measurement targets across an enterprise or business unit." ;
          skos:example "A measurement office defines a balanced-scorecard-style enterprise measurement model for a business unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11083
ex:P11083 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Measuring, researching, and recording the performance of people, processes, mechanisms, or other areas of the business that the organization wants to benchmark or track." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11083" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (a recorded assessment), consistent with cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal, a kind of Act of Measuring)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct performance assessments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that measures, researches, and records the performance of people, processes, or other areas of a business and produces a performance assessment." ;
          skos:example "An analyst measures and records contact-center handle times to support a benchmarking study." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11084
ex:P11084 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Improving an organization's ability to compare its performance internally or externally, and maintaining benchmarking relationships with other organizations. Train staff in benchmarking. Develop technological solutions or other materials to aid benchmarking efforts. Consult with external entities to gain knowledge or tools to help benchmark." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11084" ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded improvement act (ex:ActOfImprovement), not as the capability itself: the standing capacity is the shared ex:BenchmarkingCapability (an Organization Capability), which this act brings about / enhances. REMOVED the prior obo:BFO_0000055 (realizes) some ex:BenchmarkingCapability restriction: 'realizes' means the act IS an exercise of that capability (capability realized IN the act), which would wrongly type this act as an instance of benchmarking. Developing/improving the benchmarking capability does NOT exercise benchmarking -- it produces/enhances the capability. The capability's own obo:BFO_0000054 (realized in) restrictions reference the genuine benchmarking acts (P21584, and the benchmarking appraisals P11083/P11085); this developing act is related to the capability descriptively here, not by a realizes axiom (a capability is not an ICE, so it is not asserted as a has-output either)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop benchmarking capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that enhances an organization's benchmarking capability by training staff, developing tools, and maintaining benchmarking relationships with other organizations." ;
          skos:example "A center of excellence trains analysts and procures a benchmarking platform, strengthening the firm's benchmarking capability." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11085
ex:P11085 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BenchmarkAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Benchmarking internal processes and against external competitors." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11085" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal); the comparison yields a Descriptive ICE (benchmark analysis)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct internal and external benchmarking" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that compares internal processes against one another and against external competitors and produces a benchmark analysis." ;
          skos:example "A team benchmarks the firm's procurement cycle both across plants and against a rival." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11087
ex:P11087 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BenchmarkAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GapAndNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining performance against benchmarked organizations or entities. Determine how much performance needs to change to meet expectations. Reach strategic goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11087" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (inlined): it processes benchmark inputs into a representation of the performance gap (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct gap analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines performance against benchmarked organizations and produces a gap and needs analysis quantifying how much performance must change to meet expectations." ;
          skos:example "An analyst computes the percentage improvement in cycle time needed to match the benchmark leader." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11088
ex:P11088 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GapAndNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeNeedStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a need for changing the performance of the organization. Make use of the gap analysis results in order to define the need for change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11088" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (a change-need statement prescribing what must change), so anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Input is the gap and needs analysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish need for change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that uses gap analysis results to compose a change need statement defining the required change in organizational performance." ;
          skos:example "Following a gap analysis, leadership issues a statement establishing the need to reduce defect rates by 30%." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11095
ex:P11095 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11100
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11102
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11103
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11104
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11105
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11106
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11107
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11108
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11109
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan for managing the organization's knowledge base. Determine what kind of specialized knowledge the organization possesses, which elements of this collective knowledge can prove beneficial, how to capture and maintain this knowledge, how to grant access to this library of information, and how the organization should proceed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11095" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:KnowledgeManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 13.5.1 as an occurrent. Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses. Output is a Directive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop KM strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and articulates a KM strategy prescribing how an organization will capture, maintain, access, and exploit its collective knowledge." ;
          skos:example "A KM team drafts the enterprise knowledge-management strategy for the coming planning cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11096
ex:P11096 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11110
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11111
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11112
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMCapabilityMaturityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the maturity of the existing initiatives in knowledge management, and evaluating existing KM approaches. Identify the gaps and needs in order to enhance the existing KM approaches. Develop and implement new KM approaches." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11096" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:KnowledgeManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 13.5.2 as an occurrent. Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses. Output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (appraisal)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess KM capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the maturity and effectiveness of an organization's existing knowledge-management capabilities and produces a KM capability maturity assessment." ;
          skos:example "A KM review board appraises current KM maturity ahead of the next planning cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11100
ex:P11100 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMGovernanceModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a structure for the governance of the organization's collective knowledge. Gather, maintain, and make accessible the collective knowledge base. Develop a standard procedure for the conservation and perpetuation of the organization's knowledge. Create policies for the usage and maintenance of this knowledge. Establish specialized roles." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11100" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (governance model) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop governance model with roles and accountability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a KM governance model prescribing the structure, standard procedures, policies, and specialized roles for governing an organization's collective knowledge." ;
          skos:example "A KM lead defines a governance model assigning knowledge-stewardship roles and usage policies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11102
ex:P11102 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Clearly determining the roles and responsibilities of all personnel involved in the management of the organization's corpus of knowledge. Flesh out the roles and responsibilities of the KM core group, as well as the operational staff involved in the upkeep of the knowledge management program." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11102" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (role-definition specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define roles and accountability of core group versus operating units" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a role-definition specification prescribing the responsibilities of the KM core group versus the operating-unit staff who maintain the knowledge-management program." ;
          skos:example "A KM governance team documents the split of accountabilities between the central KM office and business-unit knowledge owners." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11103
ex:P11103 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMFundingModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyze the organization's current approach to funding. Learn from the funding approaches of peer organizations. Evaluate the revenue potential and costs of those short-list funding models. Select funding models to implement." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11103" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection (not Formulation) because the differentiating step is choosing among short-listed candidate funding models; its output is a Directive ICE (the selected funding model)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop funding models" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that, having evaluated candidate funding approaches against revenue potential and cost, chooses and prescribes the KM funding model(s) to implement." ;
          skos:example "A KM steering group short-lists three funding approaches and selects a chargeback model to adopt." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11104
ex:P11104 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMInitiativeLinkageAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying any links that exist between the strategy for knowledge management and any other functional areas. Determine any correlations that exist between the strategic road map for the knowledge management and any other functional areas. Study each function's/unit's attributes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11104" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Descriptive ICE (a linkage analysis representing discovered correlations) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (information processing / discernment)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify links to key initiatives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the correlations between the KM strategy and other functional areas and produces a KM initiative linkage analysis registering them." ;
          skos:example "An analyst maps how the KM roadmap intersects with the data-governance and HR-learning programs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11105
ex:P11105 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMMethodologySpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating core knowledge management procedures and methodologies. Initiate developing a strategy, planning, execution, and improvement." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11105" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (methodology specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop core KM methodologies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a KM methodology specification prescribing the core procedures for strategizing, planning, executing, and improving knowledge management." ;
          skos:example "A KM center of excellence documents the standard lifecycle methodology for knowledge projects." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11106
ex:P11106 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the IT needs for developing the knowledge management strategy, and collaborating with the IT function to implement the strategy. Assess requirements for technologies such as computer hardware, software, electronics, semiconductors, internet, and telecommunications equipment in order to effectively build and implement the strategy for knowledge management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11106" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) because the differentiating step evaluates/judges technology requirements; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Engaging the IT function is a typical (non-definitional) collaboration, recorded in this comment rather than as a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT needs and engage IT function" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the information-technology requirements for building and implementing the KM strategy and produces an IT needs assessment." ;
          skos:example "A KM architect assesses the hardware and platform requirements and briefs the IT function." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11107
ex:P11107 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CommunicationPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating plans for KM training plans and conveying the knowledge management strategy within the organization. Create training programs, sessions, and activities in order to familiarize employees and management with the concept of knowledge management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11107" ;
          rdfs:comment "Dual Directive ICE output (training plan and communication plan) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop training and communication plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a training plan and a communication plan prescribing how the KM strategy will be taught and conveyed across the organization." ;
          skos:example "A KM team drafts a rollout training curriculum and a stakeholder communication plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11108
ex:P11108 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating approaches for effectively administering the changes in knowledge management. Design an approach that transforms individuals, teams, and the organization to a desired future state represented by the change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11108" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (change management plan) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop change management approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a change management plan prescribing how individuals, teams, and the organization will be transitioned to the desired KM future state." ;
          skos:example "A change lead designs the adoption approach for a new knowledge-sharing platform." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11109
ex:P11109 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing measures and indicators for evaluating the performance of the knowledge management function. Define key performance indicators such as the amount of knowledge assets created and number of knowledge projects undertaken." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.1.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11109" ;
          rdfs:comment "Establishing measures/indicators yields a Directive ICE (a specification of indicators) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE; aligns with ex:EstablishIPThreatMeasures in the GOLD slice (an Act of Planning producing a Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop strategic measures and indicators" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes and prescribes a performance-indicator specification of the key indicators used to evaluate the performance of the KM function." ;
          skos:example "A KM analyst defines KPIs such as knowledge assets created per quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11110
ex:P11110 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMCapabilityMaturityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating if initiatives are effective or should be discarded. Design a framework for assessing maturity, typically from Level 1 (undefined), Level 2 (repeatable), Level 3 (defined), and Level 4 (managed) through Level 5 (optimized)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11110" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (appraisal)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess maturity of existing KM initiatives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the maturity of existing KM initiatives against a defined maturity scale and produces a KM capability maturity assessment." ;
          skos:example "An assessor rates each KM initiative from Level 1 to Level 5 on the maturity model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11111
ex:P11111 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMApproachEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating existing procedures, policies, and guidelines for knowledge management. Study and examine the organization's approach against industry best practices by benchmarking, competitive analysis, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11111" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (appraisal). Benchmarking/competitive analysis are typical methods, noted here rather than as restrictions." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate existing KM approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the organization's existing KM procedures, policies, and guidelines against industry best practice and produces a KM approach evaluation." ;
          skos:example "A KM lead benchmarks current knowledge policies against sector best practice." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11112
ex:P11112 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMApproachEvaluation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GapAndNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the KM approach evaluations in order to identify any gaps or needs. Compare the performance of the KM approach against the desired or expected performance, as well as against the standard knowledge management industry approach." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11112" ;
          rdfs:comment "Has as input the KM approach evaluation produced by 13.5.2.2; that input is definitional for this gap analysis, so promoted to a restriction (Phase 3). Output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify gaps and needs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that, from the KM approach evaluations, discerns the gaps between actual and desired KM performance and produces a gap-and-needs analysis registering them." ;
          skos:example "An analyst compares current KM performance against the target state and lists capability gaps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11113
ex:P11113 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GapAndNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Leveraging KM evaluations and identified gap to enhance existing approaches." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11113" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImprovement (PROPOSE-EXT). Has as input the gap-and-needs analysis from 13.5.2.3; that input is definitional (the enhancement is driven by the identified gaps), so promoted to a restriction (Phase 3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Enhance/Modify existing KM approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that, leveraging KM approach evaluations and identified gaps, enhances or modifies existing KM approaches to raise their performance." ;
          skos:example "A KM team revises the knowledge-capture workflow to close gaps found in the last capability review." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11114
ex:P11114 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMMethodologySpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Designing new policies, procedures, and guidelines to support knowledge management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11114" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (methodology specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop new KM approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes new KM policies, procedures, and guidelines, prescribed as a KM methodology specification, to support knowledge management." ;
          skos:example "A KM designer drafts a new set of knowledge-capture guidelines." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11115
ex:P11115 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:KMMethodologySpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing new policies, procedures, and guidelines to support knowledge management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11115" ;
          rdfs:comment "Has as input the directive KM methodology specification it operationalizes; that input is definitional, so promoted to a restriction (Phase 3). An implementation act realizes a directive rather than producing a new ICE, so no has-output restriction is asserted." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement new KM approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that puts into effect the new KM policies, procedures, and guidelines prescribed by the KM methodology specification." ;
          skos:example "A KM team rolls out the newly approved knowledge-capture procedures across the operating units." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11117
ex:P11117 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectRequirementsStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing and defining what the project is ultimately supposed to do. Specify the capabilities, features, or attributes of the project's deliverables, as well as any kind of formal documentation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11117" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment, under cco:ont00000366), NOT the false-friend cco:ont00001261 'Act of Identifying' (a communication act) per §6. Per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (Analysis/Info-Processing -> Descriptive), the output ex:ProjectRequirementsStatement is Descriptive: this act registers the discerned required capabilities/features, parallel to its siblings ex:P16412 (-> ex:ProjectResourceRequirementsStatement, 853) and ex:P11124 (-> ex:ITRequirementsStatement, 853). Any directive force (deliverables MUST satisfy X) would be a separate downstream Directive ICE composed by a Formulation act, not authored here." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify project requirements and objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns and defines what a project is to accomplish -- the capabilities, features, and attributes of its deliverables -- registering them in a project requirements statement." ;
          skos:example "A business analyst defines the required features of the project's deliverables." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11118
ex:P11118 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectReadinessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the culture and readiness of the organizational environment is order to implement the project management approach." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11118" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges readiness; output is the Descriptive ex:ProjectReadinessAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess culture and readiness for project management approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the culture and readiness of an organizational environment for adopting a project-management approach and produces a project readiness assessment." ;
          skos:example "A PMO surveys readiness for agile adoption before launching a project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11119
ex:P11119 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectManagementMethodologySelection
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and implementing the techniques and procedures for managing business projects. Identify the most appropriate models, which are to be employed by the project managers for the purpose of designing, planning, implementing, and achieving project objectives. Examine and assess various project management methodologies such as adaptive project framework, agile development, crystal methods, and feature-driven development." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11119" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection (reused): the differentiating step ('Identify the most appropriate models ... Examine and assess various ... methodologies') chooses one option from a candidate set, yielding a Directive ICE. Output ex:ProjectManagementMethodologySelection is Directive (the producing act being a selection whose output prescribes the chosen methodology)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify appropriate project management methodologies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that examines and chooses the most appropriate project-management methodology from candidate models and produces a project management methodology selection." ;
          skos:example "A PMO assesses agile vs feature-driven development and selects the methodology for the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11120
ex:P11120 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessCase
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a document that includes the current situation, proposed solution, financial analysis, conclusion, etc. Convince a decision maker and investors to approve the project. Obtain funding." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11120" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (under cco:ont00000366): it assembles a reasoned justification (a Descriptive ICE) rather than prescribing a course of action. Output ex:BusinessCase is correctly Descriptive (an argument/justification representing a situation); the go/no-go approval it supports is a separate Directive decision, not modeled here." ;
          rdfs:label "Create business case" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the current situation, proposed solution, and financial analysis and produces a business case justifying the project to decision makers." ;
          skos:example "A sponsor writes the business case making the financial argument to fund the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11121
ex:P11121 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing procedures and indictors to assess performance of business projects. Design and develop metrics and indicators--such as cost, schedule, resources, risk, and quality--that exhibit the performance of the business projects." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11121" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: designing measures yields a Directive ICE (the shared ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification, whose comment lists 13.2.3.1.5 as a consumer)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop project measures and indicators" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that designs and prescribes the metrics and indicators -- cost, schedule, resources, risk, and quality -- used to assess project performance, producing a performance indicator specification." ;
          skos:example "A project manager defines the cost, schedule, and quality KPIs for the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11123
ex:P11123 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the resources and their roles in the business projects." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11123" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: outlining roles/resources yields a Directive ICE (the shared ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define roles and resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines and assigns the roles and resources of a business project, producing a role definition specification." ;
          skos:example "A project manager documents who fills each project role and the resources assigned." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11124
ex:P11124 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the IT requirements for specific business projects. Identify the requirements of computers and telecommunications equipment to store, retrieve, transmit, and manipulate data related to the project. Consider factors such as functional requirements, design requirements, project phases, and project schedule." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11124" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment), NOT cco:ont00001261. Output is the Descriptive ex:ITRequirementsStatement (an enumeration of discerned requirements), agreeing with the information-processing genus per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify specific IT requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the information-technology requirements of a specific business project and registers them in an IT requirements statement." ;
          skos:example "A project's IT lead lists the hardware and telecom requirements for the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11125
ex:P11125 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CommunicationPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Designing a plan for equipping the project team with the necessary skills and abilities to fulfill their roles and responsibilities in the project effectively and efficiently. Offer formal training, mentoring, or coaching. Initiate informal conversations. Communicate messages during the project." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11125" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: dual Directive ICE output (training plan and communication plan)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create training and communication plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a training plan and a communication plan for equipping the project team with the necessary skills and for communicating during the project." ;
          skos:example "A project manager drafts the team training curriculum and the project communication plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11127
ex:P11127 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecognitionAndRewardPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan for recognizing and rewarding extraordinary performances within the business projects. Use incentives, bonuses, and certificates for recognition and rewarding purposes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11127" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (the shared ex:RecognitionAndRewardPlan) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Design recognition and reward approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a recognition and reward plan prescribing the incentives, bonuses, and recognition for extraordinary performance within a project." ;
          skos:example "A project manager designs a bonus-and-certificate scheme for outstanding project work." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11128
ex:P11128 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectLaunchPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan specifying when to initiate the project, and introducing it to the target audience. Clearly define the project team, objectives, timelines, and milestone." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11128" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (project launch plan) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Design and plan launch of project" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a project launch plan prescribing when to initiate the project and how to introduce it to its target audience, including team, objectives, timelines, and milestones." ;
          skos:example "A project manager plans the kickoff timing, audience, and milestones for the launch." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11129
ex:P11129 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Putting the project into position by effectively bringing it into action." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11129" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228): deployment enacts the project plan rather than producing an ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Deploy the project" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that puts a business project into position and brings it into action per its project plan." ;
          skos:example "A project manager mobilizes the team and kicks off project execution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11131
ex:P11131 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectManagementImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the impact of business project management on the measures and outcomes of the projects. Gauge non-financial measures, frequency of measurement, action plan, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11131" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges impact; output is the Descriptive ex:ProjectManagementImpactAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate impact of project management (strategy and projects) on measures and outcomes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the impact of project-management strategy and projects on the organization's measures and outcomes and produces a project management impact assessment." ;
          skos:example "A PMO assesses how the chosen PM approach affected delivery outcomes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11132
ex:P11132 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Encouraging and sustaining the activities and involvement while executing projects. Promote the execution activities of the projects. Encourage employee involvement in project implementation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11132" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228): enacting the engagement/promotion activities that keep the project moving; no single definitional ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Promote and sustain activity and involvement" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that encourages and sustains the execution activities and employee involvement during project implementation." ;
          skos:example "A project lead runs engagement activities to keep the team involved through delivery." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11133
ex:P11133 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reorganizing and stimulating the approach and strategy for managing business projects. Make improvements based on the project scope and on findings from Evaluate the impact of project management (strategy and projects) on measures and outcomes [11131]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11133" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImprovement (under cco:ont00000228): it modifies the existing PM approach/strategy toward better performance. The project management impact assessment from 11131 is a typical driving input, noted here." ;
          rdfs:label "Realign and refresh project management strategy and approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that reorganizes and refreshes an organization's project-management strategy and approaches based on impact findings to raise their effectiveness." ;
          skos:example "A PMO revises its delivery methodology based on the impact assessment findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11135
ex:P11135 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11152
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11153
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11154
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11155
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11156
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11157
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11158
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11159
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20145
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing plans for change management, training, communication, and rewards/incentives. Establish metrics for measuring the change adoption. Clarify new roles for employees. Identify budgets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11135" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChangeManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): its definitional outputs are Directive ICEs (plans/specs). APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Design the change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops the change management, training, communication, and rewards plans, the adoption metrics, and the new-role definitions that together design how a change will be enacted." ;
          skos:example "The team produces the suite of plans and metrics that constitute the change design." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11136
ex:P11136 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11160
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11161
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11162
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11163
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20146
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Effectuating the change within the desired impact areas of the organization. Ensure adequate commitment from all corners of the organization for the desired change. Create support structures. Refashion all processes deemed necessary. Observe the progress." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11136" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChangeManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228 Planned Act): it executes the change design rather than producing a plan. APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that effectuates a designed change within the targeted areas of the organization by building commitment, reengineering processes, supporting transitions, and observing progress." ;
          skos:example "The organization rolls out the redesigned processes and support structures for the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11137
ex:P11137 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11164
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11165
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11166
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Sustaining the impact of the change process in order to enact continual process improvement. Monitor the performance of re-engineered business processes. Identify best practices and potential issues. Effectuate remedial steps." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11137" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChangeManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImprovement (under cco:ont00000228 Planned Act): it adjusts and reinforces the changed processes toward continually better performance. APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Sustain improvement" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that sustains the impact of a change by monitoring re-engineered process performance, capturing lessons, and effecting remedial steps for continual improvement." ;
          skos:example "After go-live the team tracks the new process, captures lessons, and applies fixes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11138
ex:P11138 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessImprovementMethodologySelection
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing and choosing methodologies to identify, analyze, and improve existing processes within an organization to meet new goals and objective. Assess the various methodologies available such as process mapping, statistical process control, and simulation. Choose the most appropriate and effective methodology." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11138" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection: it chooses one option from a candidate set (Lean, Six Sigma, SPC, simulation) and yields a Directive ICE recording the choice." ;
          rdfs:label "Select process improvement methodology" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses the most appropriate process-improvement methodology from available candidates and produces a process improvement methodology selection." ;
          skos:example "A black belt selects Six Sigma over process mapping for a defect-reduction effort." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11139
ex:P11139 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeReadinessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the level of preparedness of the conditions, attitudes, and resources at all levels in the organization needed for change to happen successfully. Define scope of the proposed change. Select the tools for a change readiness assessment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11139" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the level of preparedness; output is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess readiness for change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the preparedness of an organization's conditions, attitudes, and resources for a change and produces a change readiness assessment." ;
          skos:example "A readiness survey across business units yields a change readiness assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11140
ex:P11140 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StakeholderAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and communicating with shareholders affected by the change. Consider internal and external stakeholders that will be affected by the change. Determine the amount of influence the change will have on them. Ensure the involvement of these stakeholders in the change process by effectively communicating with them." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11140" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Identification (discernment): the definitional product is the Descriptive ex:StakeholderAssessment registering the discerned stakeholders and their influence; the stakeholders themselves are continuant participants (has-agent), not the output." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine stakeholders" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the internal and external stakeholders affected by a change and produces a stakeholder assessment registering them and their influence." ;
          skos:example "A change team enumerates affected departments and external parties and rates their influence." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11141
ex:P11141 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeChampion
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying people exhibit an extraordinary interest in the adoption, implementation, and success of the change. Engage champions in each division or team. Define the roles and responsibilities for the change champions. Determine criteria for selecting change champions. Provide training sessions to champions. Reward and recognize champions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11141" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ChangeChampionRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a set of identified Agents (the champions), not an Information Content Entity, so no has-output restriction is asserted (Phase-3). Champion-role definition occurs in 13.4.2.8 / 13.4.2.5." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify change champion(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the individuals who exhibit exceptional commitment to the success of a change and are to act as its champions." ;
          skos:example "Each division nominates an enthusiastic advocate to serve as its change champion." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11142
ex:P11142 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing a design team for implementing change throughout the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11142" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): forming a team is an organizational act that produces neither an analysis (Descriptive ICE) nor a plan (Directive ICE); no shared act genus fits, so the generic Planned Act is used." ;
          rdfs:label "Form design team" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent assembles a team tasked with designing and implementing a change throughout the organization." ;
          skos:example "A sponsor convenes a cross-functional design team for the transformation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11143
ex:P11143 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessScopeStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the extent of the area or subject matter that the change process deals with or to which it is relevant. Establish a set of tools, processes, skills, and principles for managing the people side of change to achieve the required outcomes of the change process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11143" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ProcessScopeStatement (Directive ICE) as the scope-defining output of the change effort." ;
          rdfs:label "Define scope" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that delimits and prescribes the extent of the area and subject matter that a change process addresses, producing a process scope statement." ;
          skos:example "The team documents which functions, locations, and systems fall inside the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11144
ex:P11144 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CurrentStateAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Using graphical and statistical tools such as pareto diagrams, process flow diagrams, cause-and-effect diagrams, check sheets, histograms, run charts, and scatter diagrams." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11144" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Analysis: characterizing the as-is baseline yields a Descriptive ex:CurrentStateAssessment of how things presently are; the prescribed target is the separate Formulation act 13.4.1.7 (ex:FutureStateSpecification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand current state" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the organization's as-is processes and conditions using graphical and statistical tools and produces a current state assessment." ;
          skos:example "Analysts chart current process flows and defect Pareto diagrams to characterize the baseline." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11145
ex:P11145 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FutureStateSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the state or position that the organization wants to be in after the implementation of the change. Gather necessary information about the processes, structures, and cultures. Define resource requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11145" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:FutureStateSpecification (Directive ICE): the future state is a prescribed target, not a description of present reality." ;
          rdfs:label "Define future state" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that prescribes the target state the organization intends to reach after a change, producing a future state specification." ;
          skos:example "Leadership specifies the desired post-change operating model and its resource requirements." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11146
ex:P11146 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OrganizationalRiskAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Looking beyond the immediate consequences of the threat to a critical asset and placing it in the context of what is important to the organization. Identify the impact of threats to critical assets. Create risk evaluation criteria. Evaluate the impact of threats to critical assets. Incorporate probability into the risk analysis." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11146" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Analysis: weighing asset threats by probability and consequence yields a Descriptive ex:OrganizationalRiskAnalysis (an explanatory account of exposure), not a directive risk-treatment plan." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct organizational risk analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines threats to the organization's critical assets in light of their probability and consequence and produces an organizational risk analysis." ;
          skos:example "A risk team scores asset threats by likelihood and impact for the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11147
ex:P11147 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CulturalContextAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the culture within the organization. Adopt a quantitative, multidimensional measurement approach of an organization's culture and the aspirations for it. Diagnose cultural activities, enhance leadership sections. Integrate cultures." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11147" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the state of organizational culture; output is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess cultural context" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the organization's culture along multiple dimensions and produces a cultural context assessment." ;
          skos:example "A culture survey produces a multidimensional assessment of organizational values." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11148
ex:P11148 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeManager
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and assigning the people accountable for effective change management. Hold managers accountable for ensuring change happens systematically and rigorously. Ensure that certain behaviors are rewarded or reprimanded accordingly." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.12" ;
          ex:pcfID "11148" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ChangeManagerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfFormulation to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). Source text -- 'Identifying and ASSIGNING the people accountable ... Hold managers accountable ... behaviors are rewarded or reprimanded' -- is a deontic role-assignment / organizational act of assigning accountability to specific persons, NOT the composition of a generic directive plan (Formulation). It parallels the other organizational-assignment Planned Acts P11142 'Form design team' and P20145 'Assign change champions'. DROPPED the has-output ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification restriction: that role spec is properly the output of P11158 'Establish/Clarify new roles', and reusing it here both over-committed to Formulation and double-claimed P11158's output. The assigned ex:ChangeManager is the salient participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish accountability for change management" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that identifies and assigns accountability for managing a change to specific persons, holding them responsible for ensuring the change happens systematically." ;
          skos:example "Each manager is formally made accountable for delivering the change in their unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11149
ex:P11149 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeBarrierAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the circumstances or obstacles that keep the organization from progressing. Identify who and what are the resources resisting change. Identify integration failures, threats by competitive forces, and complexity failures." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.13" ;
          ex:pcfID "11149" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Identification (discernment): recognizing obstacles and resistance registers them in the Descriptive ex:ChangeBarrierAnalysis; choosing how to overcome them is modeled by downstream Formulation/Selection acts." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify barriers to change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the obstacles and sources of resistance impeding a change and registers them in a change barrier analysis." ;
          skos:example "The team catalogs integration, resistance, and complexity obstacles to the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11150
ex:P11150 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the person(s) or thing(s)responsible for making the change possible. Consider factors such as interdependence of efforts, reward to the integrators, sharing of power and responsibility, and employee understanding of why change is essential." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.14" ;
          ex:pcfID "11150" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is the set of identified enabling entities/factors, not a single shared Information Content Entity, so no has-output restriction is asserted (Phase-3); the enabler register is typical, not definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine change enablers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the persons and factors that make a change possible." ;
          skos:example "The team names the integrators and conditions that will enable the change to succeed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11151
ex:P11151 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeAdoptionMeasureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the resource requirements, and developing measures for change. Identify the financial, material, human, and informational resources needed to successfully implement the change. Develop programs, campaigns, etc. for establishing the change within the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.15" ;
          ex:pcfID "11151" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ChangeAdoptionMeasureSpecification (Directive ICE) for the developed measures/programs; resource identification is a typical sub-step recorded here in comment, not a separate output restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify resources and develop measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that, having identified the resources a change requires, develops the measures and programs prescribed to establish the change, producing a change adoption measure specification." ;
          skos:example "The team budgets the resources and designs adoption campaigns for the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11152
ex:P11152 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Correlating the change initiative with the other initiatives. Create an alignment between the goals and objectives of the change process and that of the other initiatives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11152" ;
          rdfs:comment "No shared output ICE for the alignment finding; the alignment representation is typical rather than definitional, so no has-output restriction is asserted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess connection to other initiatives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines how a change initiative correlates with the organization's other initiatives and characterizes their alignment." ;
          skos:example "The team maps the change's goals against concurrent programs to find overlaps and conflicts." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11153
ex:P11153 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a detailed structure summary for the purposes of managing the change. Demonstrate the reasons for the change. Define the type and scope of change. Form a change management team. Create a communication plan." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11153" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: composing the ex:ChangeManagementPlan yields a Directive ICE prescribing how the change is to be managed (rationale, type, scope); enacting it is downstream implementation." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop change management plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a detailed change management plan structuring how a change will be managed." ;
          skos:example "The team drafts the master change management plan covering rationale, type, and scope." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11154
ex:P11154 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a detailed summary of all the actions relevant to teaching a person a particular skill or type of behavior. Determine who will deliver the training. Determine when and where the apprentice or trainee needs to go to receive the structured component of the training." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11154" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: composing the shared Directive ex:TrainingPlan prescribes how training is to be delivered; conducting the training itself is the separate Act of Training (cf. ex:P17507)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop training plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a training plan prescribing the actions, delivery, timing, and location for teaching the skills a change requires." ;
          skos:example "The team specifies the courses, trainers, and schedule to equip staff for the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11155
ex:P11155 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CommunicationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a plan for imparting or exchanging information relevant the to change. Define goals, objectives, and audience. Gather tools for all communications." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11155" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: composing the shared Directive ex:CommunicationPlan prescribes the goals, audiences, and channels for change communication; the act of actually communicating is a separate reporting/communication act." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop communication plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a communication plan prescribing the goals, audiences, and channels for imparting information about a change." ;
          skos:example "The team plans the announcements, channels, and cadence for the change rollout." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11156
ex:P11156 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RewardsAndIncentivesPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and designing the plan for rewarding the employees exhibiting the desired behavior. Specify rewards in recognition of service, effort, or achievement regarding the change, including bonuses, compensation, stock options, profit sharing, vacations, and flexible time." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11156" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: composing the Directive ex:RewardsAndIncentivesPlan prescribes how desired change behaviors are to be rewarded; granting the rewards is a separate enactment act (cf. ex:P17505)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop rewards/incentives plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a rewards and incentives plan prescribing how employees who exhibit the desired change behaviors are to be rewarded." ;
          skos:example "The team designs a bonus-and-recognition scheme for early adopters of the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11157
ex:P11157 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeAdoptionMeasureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a system or standard of measurement for measuring the adoption of the change. Consider activities such as the number of people who have adopted the change, how quickly have they adopted, number of unique adopters, and adopters by teams/divisions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11157" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: establishing adoption metrics composes the Directive ex:ChangeAdoptionMeasureSpecification (a prescription of what to measure and how); the adoption data later gathered against it is a separate Descriptive record." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish change adoption measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the standards of measurement for tracking change adoption, producing a change adoption measure specification." ;
          skos:example "The team defines adoption-rate and unique-adopter metrics for the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11158
ex:P11158 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and explaining the new roles to employees. Assign roles and responsibilities to resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11158" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: defining the new roles composes the Directive ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification; this is the rightful home of that output (P11148 'Establish accountability' was de-coupled from it and re-anchored to a Planned Act, per the comment there)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish/Clarify new roles" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines and assigns the new roles and responsibilities a change introduces, producing a role definition specification." ;
          skos:example "The team documents and explains each employee's role under the new operating model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11159
ex:P11159 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan of financial outlay for the newly defined roles. Determine the amount of capital the organization is willing to invest in effectuating these new roles, how would the roles be financed, and what would comprise the ROI from these flows. Coordinate personnel responsible for change management and the finance division." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11159" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a budget/financing plan (a Directive ICE). No shared budget ICE exists in the section vocabulary, so the output is recorded in comment rather than promoted to a has-output restriction (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify budget/roles" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a plan of financial outlay funding the newly defined roles required by a change." ;
          skos:example "Finance and change leads set the capital and ROI assumptions for the new roles." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11160
ex:P11160 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Kindling an organization wide commitment for effectuating the change. Effectively communicate the advantages of the desired change. Personalize the pitch for change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11160" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): building commitment is a mobilization/communication act with no single definitional Information Content Entity output." ;
          rdfs:label "Create commitment for improvement/change" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent mobilizes organization-wide commitment to a change by communicating and personalizing its advantages." ;
          skos:example "Leaders run a campaign making the case for the change to every team." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11161
ex:P11161 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Restructuring, redesigning, repurposing, and/or retrofitting existing business processes, activities, and frameworks in order to effectuate the desired change. Review pertinent processes from the ground up by starting with the desired result. (Build on Select a process improvement methodology [11138] to create business processes that perfectly fit with the road map for change.)" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11161" ;
          rdfs:comment "Builds on the methodology selected in 13.1.5.2 (PCF 11138). Reengineering existing processes to bring about the change is implementation; no single definitional ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Reengineer business processes and systems" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that restructures and redesigns existing business processes and systems in order to effectuate the desired change." ;
          skos:example "The team rebuilds the order-to-cash process from the desired outcome backward." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11162
ex:P11162 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supporting the transition of personnel to new roles and the dismissal of any existing employees, necessitated for the desired change. Create an on-boarding process for seamlessly transitioning personnel to new roles. Offer orientation and training. Address any concerns. Create a structured procedure for the discharge of incumbents from their positions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11162" ;
          rdfs:comment "Implementation support act; onboarding and discharge procedures are operational sub-steps, not a single definitional Information Content Entity output." ;
          rdfs:label "Support transition to new roles or exit strategies for incumbents" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that supports personnel through their transition to new roles and, where necessary, through structured exit from current positions during a change." ;
          skos:example "HR onboards staff into new roles and manages structured exits for redundant positions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11163
ex:P11163 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring activities in the change process in order to assess the performance of individual agents and the process as a whole. Oversee the implementation of activities needed for effectuating the change. Track the pace, impact, enthusiasm, reaction, and feedback over the change process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11163" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ActOfMonitoring. The tracked observations are recorded across heterogeneous channels (pace, impact, feedback); no single shared output ICE is definitional, so none is asserted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes and tracks the activities, pace, and reception of a change in progress in order to register the performance of the agents and of the change process as a whole." ;
          skos:example "A change office tracks adoption pace and sentiment week by week during rollout." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11164
ex:P11164 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring the performance of improved business processes. Track the key performance indicators of the upgraded processes in order to gauge its contribution to the desired change. Expedite through the use of business process management software." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11164" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ActOfMonitoring and ex:ProcessPerformanceReport (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor improved process performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks the key performance indicators of improved business processes and produces a process performance report gauging their contribution to the change." ;
          skos:example "BPM dashboards track the upgraded process KPIs against targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11165
ex:P11165 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LessonsLearnedRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Documenting and standardizing insights gleaned and the knowledge acquired from studying the change process already implemented. Create case studies/best practices guides from the process of implementing change. Include experienced personnel." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11165" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (under cco:ont00000366 Act of Information Processing): it studies the completed change and produces a Descriptive ICE (the lessons-learned record / best-practices guide)." ;
          rdfs:label "Capture and reuse lessons learned from change process" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines an implemented change process and documents the insights and knowledge gained as a lessons-learned record." ;
          skos:example "The team writes a best-practices guide capturing what worked in the rollout." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11166
ex:P11166 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implement corrective action to adjust the re-engineered processes for maximizing the desired impact. Adjust business processes and systems to implement the desired change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11166" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ActOfImprovement: corrective action modifies the changed processes toward better performance. May consume a remedial-action specification (ex:RemedialActionSpecification) as input; that input is typical rather than definitional, so no restriction is asserted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Take corrective action as necessary" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that adjusts the re-engineered business processes and systems through corrective action so as to maximize the intended impact of the change." ;
          skos:example "Post-launch, the team retunes the new workflow to remove a bottleneck." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11168
ex:P11168 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11169
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11170
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11171
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11172
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ValueProposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Refining the attributes of organizational offerings to define their value proposition for the customer. Clearly define the suite of offerings in terms of the value delivered, from the perspective of what the customer desires. Validate the benefits delivered to the customers against target market segments, using techniques such as minimum viable product. Position brands for the respective products/services, in line with their unique value proposition and aligned with customers needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11168" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is the Directive ex:ValueProposition; agrees with the Formulation genus (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define offering and customer value proposition" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that articulates the value an organization's offerings deliver from the customer's perspective and produces a customer value proposition." ;
          skos:example "A product-marketing team defines and validates the value proposition for a new offering across target segments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11169
ex:P11169 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ValueProposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining problem(s) that the organization's products/services solve for the customers, thereby determining how they are positioned in the market. Refine the product/service concepts from the perspective of customers. Succinctly outline the problem the organization's offerings solves for the customers, making a case for why the customer should buy a product or use a service. Define the offering's unique value." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11169" ;
          rdfs:label "Define offering and positioning" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the problem an organization's offerings solve for customers and produces a statement of the offering's unique value and market positioning." ;
          skos:example "A team frames the customer problem a product solves and drafts its positioning statement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11170
ex:P11170 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BrandPositioning
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ValueProposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Boosting the attractiveness of products/services to the targeted customers, and creating a unique brand projection around these features. Identify and enhance those product/service features that reinforce the attractiveness of these offerings, for these segment of customers. Underscore the perceived value delivered to the customers by clearly specifying the relevance and desirability of these products/services. Once it has been clarified how the organization's offerings meet the customer's expectations or deliver specific benefits, position the brands around these benefits." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11170" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop value proposition including brand positioning for target segments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that enhances the attractiveness of offerings to targeted customers and produces a value proposition together with brand positioning for those segments." ;
          skos:example "A brand team positions a product's brand around the benefits most desired by a target segment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11171
ex:P11171 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ValuePropositionValidation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Validating the desirability of the perceived value delivered by the organization's offerings, to the targeted customer segment. Substantiate the value of the benefits accrued to the customers through the organization's offerings. Justify the value proposition in light of the targeted segments by gathering feedback (using teaser demonstrations, surveys, interviews, primary research studies, and customer case studies). Corroborate the benefits of the organization's offerings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11171" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): validation evaluates the value proposition against evidence and yields a Descriptive judgement (ex:ValuePropositionValidation), agreeing with the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. ex:CustomerFeedback is a definitional input (the text says the value is justified 'by gathering feedback')." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate value proposition with target segments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that substantiates an offering's value proposition against a target segment by gathering customer feedback and produces a value-proposition validation result." ;
          skos:example "A team runs surveys and MVP demos to corroborate a product's value proposition with its target segment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11172
ex:P11172 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BrandingCollateral
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating branding collaterals and campaigns that carve a significant and differentiated presence for the organization's offerings. Create new collaterals, which include names, designs, and symbols, for their products/services. Ensure collaterals reflect the unique value proposition of the respective offerings through a consistent theme. Create advertising and promotion campaigns." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11172" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:BrandingCollateral is a Directive ICE (names, designs, symbols, and campaign specifications prescribing the brand's expression), agreeing with the Formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop new branding" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates branding collaterals and campaigns establishing a differentiated presence for an organization's offerings." ;
          skos:example "A creative team produces a new brand name, logo, and launch campaign for a product line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11173
ex:P11173 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan for managing the accounts of key customers in order to better maintain relationships with them. Chart a scheme for managing sales. Create a plan for administering accounts of the significant and most important customers of the organization. Coordinate the accounts of principal clients." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11173" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a Directive ICE (the account plan). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: planning genus agrees with directive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop sales/key account plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input customer data and has as output a sales plan for managing the accounts of key customers." ;
          skos:example "An account manager drafts the annual key-account plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11175
ex:P11175 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making a report about revenues generated by the organization or business unit concerned. This process requires the organization to create a report which shows how business is generating profits. Profits are the part which is left after paying all expenses directly related to the generation of the revenue, such as producing a product, and other expenses related to conducting business activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11175" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853). Genus ex:ActOfReporting: the act communicates an existing analysis as a report. The profitability analysis is the definitional input; the financial report is the definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Report on profitability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that takes a profitability analysis and produces a financial report communicating how the organization or unit generates profit." ;
          skos:example "Issuing the quarterly profitability report to management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11180
ex:P11180 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11186
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11187
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the impact of EHS offering--and the procedures it employs to process them--on the environment at large, as well as the health and safety of employees. Evaluate the environmental impact of the organization's products, services, and operations. Conduct health, safety, and environmental audits." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11180" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EHSManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (under cco:ont00000366 Act of Information Processing): 'Determine' here is discernment from audit/lifecycle data, NOT the false-friend cco:ont00001261 'Act of Identifying' (a communication act). Aggregating process; its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine environmental health and safety impacts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines audit and lifecycle data to determine the environmental, health, and safety impacts of an organization's offerings and operations." ;
          skos:example "An EHS team determines the lifecycle environmental and safety impacts of a product line from audit findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11181
ex:P11181 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11188
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11189
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11190
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11191
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identify the requirements for regulation and shareholders. Assess future risks and opportunities. Develop a policy for the EHS program. Record and manage EHS program events." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11181" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EHSManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): 'Develop ... program' is a bounded composing act that passes R5 (it has a natural end), so -- unlike the standing group node 11179 -- it is a process class, not a capability. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop EHS program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an organization's environmental, health, and safety program by establishing its requirements, risk assessment, and policy." ;
          skos:example "An EHS team develops the program: requirements, risk assessment, and a published EHS policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11182
ex:P11182 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000234 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FunctionalEmployee
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting programs such as on-the-job training sessions, group training workshops, and online training." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11182" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:TraineeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000234 (Act of Training, VERIFIED §6; parent cco:ont00000228) with explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent so Gate C sees the Act anchor. NOT Act of Communication or Act of Planning (false-friend caution): the act imparts competence. The same training genus is used corpus-wide for training rows (13.1.4.1, 13.3.4.6.3, 13.9.2.1). The definitional participant is ex:FunctionalEmployee (the training RECIPIENT, bearer of ex:TraineeRole), mirroring the ex:ProcessOwner pattern used by sibling-analog ex:P16393 'Provide process training'. REJECTED ex:Stakeholder here: that is an interested/affected PARTY, not a training recipient, so it mis-typed the definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Train and educate functional employees" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training in which environmental, health, and safety knowledge and skills are imparted to the organization's functional employees through on-the-job, workshop, and online training programs." ;
          skos:example "An EHS trainer runs safety workshops for plant operators." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11186
ex:P11186 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnvironmentalImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the impact of offerings and the auxiliary operations required to process them on the immediate ecosystem and the environment at large. Study the lifecycle of the products/services offered by the organization. Estimate any affect on the environment through metrics such as a calculation of carbon footprint." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11186" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (under cco:ont00000366): lifecycle study and footprint estimation manipulate input data into a descriptive understanding. Output is the descriptive ex:EnvironmentalImpactAssessment (a descriptive output implies analysis/appraisal, not planning, per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate environmental impact of products, services, and operations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that studies the lifecycle of an organization's products, services, and operations and produces an environmental impact assessment." ;
          skos:example "An analyst computes the carbon footprint across a product's lifecycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11187
ex:P11187 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting an inspection to verify that the organization adequately complies with the environmental, health, and safety standards. Audit procedures and records regarding responsibility for the environment, health, and safety." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11187" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): an audit is an appraisal/verification act judging conformance, producing a descriptive report. NOT Act of Planning (no plan composed) and NOT Act of Communication (no ICE-transfer is the essence)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct health and safety and environmental audits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that inspects and verifies an organization's compliance with environmental, health, and safety standards and produces an EHS audit report." ;
          skos:example "An EHS auditor inspects a facility and issues a compliance audit report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11188
ex:P11188 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSRequirementSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSRequirementRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining any protocols or standards to comply with, set by regulatory agencies or the organization's stakeholders. Closely examine all standards and matters of compliance relating to the environment, health, and safety." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11188" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment, under cco:ont00000366). REJECTED cco:ont00001261 'Act of Identifying' (the communication sense of asserting who/what a thing is) per §6: the act discerns externally-set requirements. Per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (Info-Processing -> Descriptive), the definitional has-output is the Descriptive ex:EHSRequirementRegister (a register of the discerned requirements). The externally-authored Directive ex:EHSRequirementSpecification is a has-INPUT this act captures, NOT something it composes -- composing it would be a Formulation act, contradicting the discernment genus. This restores genus<->output agreement." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify regulatory and stakeholder requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the regulatory and stakeholder protocols and standards an organization must comply with for environment, health, and safety and registers them in an EHS requirement register." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer compiles the EHS regulations and stakeholder standards the firm must meet." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11189
ex:P11189 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSRiskAndOpportunityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating any risks and opportunities that might affect the environmental, health, and safety of products/services. Leverage techniques such as cost-benefit analysis, trend extrapolation, systems analysis, social surveys, historical surveys, historical analogy, Delphi, conferences, workshops, briefings, hearings, advisory committees, moot courts, artistic judgment, on-site field investigation, scaling techniques, and scenario creation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11189" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): 'Assess' yields a descriptive judgement; output is the descriptive ex:EHSRiskAndOpportunityAssessment, agreeing with the appraisal genus (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). PREDICTIVE-CONTENT CAUTION: the label and the source techniques (trend extrapolation, Delphi, scenario creation) give this assessment forward-looking content. It is deliberately kept as a Descriptive assessment (cco:ont00000853), NOT re-typed to Predictive ICE (cco:ont00000626) and NOT re-anchored to an Act of Prediction/Forecasting (cco:ont00000371): the definitional product is a judgement of the significance of risks and opportunities, not a standalone forecast. Because Predictive ICE is a subClassOf Descriptive ICE, any predictive sub-content remains validly subsumed by the 853 assessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess future risks and opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the future risks and opportunities affecting the environmental, health, and safety of products and services and produces an EHS risk and opportunity assessment." ;
          skos:example "An EHS planner runs scenario and cost-benefit analysis to assess emerging safety risks." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11190
ex:P11190 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan for managing the environmental, health, and safety impact of products/services. Establish minimum requirements for the organization regarding the environment at large and the health and safety of employees. Develop policies, written procedures, and supporting tools to dictate how the organization will meet policy requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11190" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511): a directive output (the policy) requires a planning/formulation genus, NOT analysis or appraisal (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Output is the Directive ex:EHSPolicy." ;
          rdfs:label "Create EHS policy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an EHS policy prescribing the minimum requirements, procedures, and tools by which an organization will manage its environmental, health, and safety impact." ;
          skos:example "An EHS team issues the corporate environmental, health, and safety policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11191
ex:P11191 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSEventRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recording and managing all events and activities associated with complying with environmental, health and safety standards. Create event calendars. Assign funds. Educate employees. Conduct events." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11191" ;
          rdfs:comment "Compound-verb de-conflation (Phase 1): the bounded 'Record' act (information processing producing the descriptive ex:EHSEventRecord) is modeled here; the 'manage' standing-function aspect is carried by ex:EHSManagementCapability, not by this occurrent. Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing); the descriptive output implies a recording act, not planning." ;
          rdfs:label "Record and manage EHS events" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that records the events and activities associated with environmental, health, and safety compliance and produces an EHS event record." ;
          skos:example "An EHS coordinator logs compliance events and activities into the EHS register." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11193
ex:P11193 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSCostBenefitAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering the costs and benefits of EHS management program. Evaluate program costs to ensure that the benefits of the program always outweigh its costs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11193" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): cost-benefit evaluation is an appraisal yielding a descriptive judgement. Output is the descriptive ex:EHSCostBenefitAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage EHS costs and benefits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the costs and benefits of an EHS program and produces an EHS cost-benefit assessment of whether benefits outweigh costs." ;
          skos:example "A finance-EHS review judges whether the safety program's benefits exceed its costs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11194
ex:P11194 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000345 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EHSPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Using performance techniques and indicators. Utilize number of audits or inspections performed, safety committee meetings, the number and types of findings and observations, timely preventive maintenance tasks performed, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11194" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring, VERIFIED §6; parent cco:ont00000228) with explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent so Gate C sees the Act anchor; 'Measure and report' against indicators determines performance relative to a standard. Input is the shared ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification (whose comment lists 13.8.3.2 as a consumer); output is the descriptive ex:EHSPerformanceReport. NOT planning." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure and report EHS performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Measuring that uses defined performance indicators to measure environmental, health, and safety performance and produces an EHS performance report." ;
          skos:example "An EHS analyst computes audit and incident metrics and issues the EHS performance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11195
ex:P11195 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supporting employees in light of the organization's environmental, health, and safety policies and standards. Provide medical insurance, maternity leave, environmental education, training over safety, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11195" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): a service/provision act bundling heterogeneous deliverables (insurance, leave, education, training). Phase-1 de-conflation: the bundled deliverables are method content, not separate process classes or a single definitional ICE output; no shared service genus fits, so the generic Planned Act is used." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide EHS support" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that provides employees with support services -- such as medical insurance, leave, environmental education, and safety training -- in light of an organization's environmental, health, and safety policies and standards." ;
          skos:example "An EHS-HR function provides safety training, insurance, and leave benefits to staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11196
ex:P11196 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmergencyResponseProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing a program for organizing, coordinating, and directing available resources to respond to the event. Conduct a risk assessment to identify potential emergency scenarios in order to create a program that ensures that resources are on hand--or quickly available--in case of emergencies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11196" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228 Planned Act): 'Implement a program' enacts a Directive ICE. The directive ex:EmergencyResponseProgram is the definitional has-input it operationalizes; no new ICE is produced." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement emergency response program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that puts an emergency response program into operation so that resources are organized, coordinated, and available to respond to emergency events." ;
          skos:example "An EHS team stands up and exercises the emergency response program across sites." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11197
ex:P11197 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PollutionPreventionProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing a program that reduces or eliminates the creation of pollutants through increased efficiency in the use of raw materials, energy, water, or other resources. Implement a program to inspect facilities that store, manufacture, or use hazardous, toxic, or polluting materials." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11197" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228), mirroring sibling ex:P11196: both enact a Directive program. The directive ex:PollutionPreventionProgram is the definitional has-input." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement pollution prevention program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that puts a pollution prevention program into operation to reduce or eliminate the creation of pollutants through increased resource efficiency." ;
          skos:example "An EHS team rolls out the pollution prevention program and facility inspection regime." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11201
ex:P11201 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating plans for remediation efforts. Make a plan to address a case of environmental adulteration. Identify and treat the adulteration so that the area will become operational again." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11201" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RemediationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (subClassOf cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): the act makes a plan, so its definitional output is a Directive ICE (ex:RemediationPlan)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create remediation plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a remediation plan prescribing the corrective actions needed to treat adulteration or damage and restore an affected area to operation." ;
          skos:example "An environmental team drafts a remediation plan for a contaminated site so it can return to operational status." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11202
ex:P11202 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000379 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SubjectMatterExpert
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001844 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SubjectMatterExpert
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExpertAdvice
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Discussing and soliciting advice from experts for in order to incorporate their suggestion (regarding Create remediation plans [11201])." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11202" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RemediationManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SubjectMatterExpertRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F reconciliation: anchored under cco:ont00000379 (Act of Representative Communication, a truth-committed conveyance; subClassOf cco:ont00000402 Act of Communication), with cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) co-asserted for the standalone S2 act anchor (379 is outside the allowlist {366,636,511,228}). The act's defining axioms -- ex:SubjectMatterExpert as the has-sender (cco:ont00001844) and ex:ExpertAdvice (a Descriptive ICE) as the conveyed has-output -- describe the SME->organization advice transfer, which is a representative communication. Previously modeled as cco:ont00000133 (Act of Directive Communication) on the 'soliciting' reading; but that genus casts the soliciting organization as sender and the SME as hearer, contradicting the asserted SME-as-sender axiom, so the genus was reconciled to 379. The earlier rejection of ex:ActOfAcquisition still stands: obtaining advice by conferral is communication, not procurement (cco:ont00000228-scoped acquisition of an authorization/license/resource). ex:SubjectMatterExpert is also a definitional participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Contact and confer with experts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Representative Communication in which subject matter experts, conferred with by the organization, convey their expert advice -- committing to its truth -- so that their suggestions can be incorporated into remediation planning." ;
          skos:example "A remediation lead convenes subject matter experts and captures their advice to refine the remediation plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11203
ex:P11203 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceRequirementsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and dedicating the resources for managing remediation efforts. Discern the resources needed for remediation efforts. Dispense with resources in a sound and well-reasoned manner." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11203" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RemediationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix (false-friend genus + GOLDEN PRINCIPLE / sibling consistency): RE-ANCHORED from cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to ex:ActOfIdentification (subClassOf cco:ont00000366 Act of Information Processing). Rejected cco:ont00000636: verified in the pinned CCO file, Act of Appraisal is 'An Act of Measuring that involves evaluating, assessing, estimating, or judging the nature, VALUE, importance, condition, or QUALITY of something' (e.g. a critic rating a restaurant). The source text is NOT a value/quality judgement on a scale; it is discernment/enumeration ('DISCERN the resources NEEDED for remediation efforts'). 'Judge what resources are needed' is a surface-word false friend for 'judge the value/quality of resources'. This also matches the sibling 'Identify enterprise level risks' (P16446), an identical 'identify/discern X needed' act anchored at ex:ActOfIdentification. Output remains the Descriptive ICE ex:ResourceRequirementsAssessment, so the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (Information-Processing/discernment -> Descriptive) still holds. The downstream allocation/dedication of resources is operational and non-definitional, so it is not promoted to a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify/dedicate resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the resources needed for managing remediation efforts and produces a resource requirements assessment to guide their dedication." ;
          skos:example "A remediation manager discerns staffing, equipment, and funding needs and records a resource requirements assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11204
ex:P11204 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfInvestigation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LegalAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining regulatory and legislative frameworks. Obligate the organization to remediate any damages through compensations, fines, and any other remedial efforts necessitated to correct the situations. Analyze local environmental laws, binding international covenants, etc. in order to examine legal accuracy about the rules and procedures." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11204" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RemediationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfInvestigation (subClassOf cco:ont00000366 Act of Information Processing): the act examines input regulatory-requirement ICEs and yields a Descriptive ICE (ex:LegalAnalysis). ex:RegulatoryRequirement is definitional as input." ;
          rdfs:label "Investigate legal aspects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Investigation that examines the regulatory and legislative frameworks bearing on remediation and produces a legal analysis of the organization's obligations and the accuracy of applicable rules and procedures." ;
          skos:example "Counsel reviews environmental statutes and international covenants and issues a legal analysis of remediation liabilities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11205
ex:P11205 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfInvestigation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DamageCauseAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Studying the causes of damage, which could be environmental, physical, social, etc. at country level in order to institute better policies and regulations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11205" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RemediationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfInvestigation (subClassOf cco:ont00000366 Act of Information Processing): the act examines evidence of damage and yields a Descriptive ICE (ex:DamageCauseAnalysis)." ;
          rdfs:label "Investigate damage cause" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Investigation that studies the environmental, physical, or social causes of damage and produces a damage cause analysis that can inform better policies and regulations." ;
          skos:example "Investigators study a contamination incident and document the chain of causes that led to the damage." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11206
ex:P11206 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Crafting a new framework of policies and procedures for deploying remediation efforts, or change existing policies and procedures. Adapt the policy structure to the context of the apposite national and international regulatory frameworks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11206" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RemediationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (subClassOf cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): crafting/amending a policy-and-procedure framework yields a Directive ICE (ex:RemediationPolicy)." ;
          rdfs:label "Amend or create policy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that crafts a new framework of remediation policies and procedures, or revises an existing one, to align with applicable national and international regulatory frameworks." ;
          skos:example "A policy team revises the company-wide remediation policy to reflect new international environmental covenants." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11208
ex:P11208 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11214
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12974
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing transactions that limit investment risk with the help of derivatives, such as options and futures contracts. Manage interest rates, foreign exchange, and exposure risks. Develop and execute hedging transactions. Evaluate and refine hedging positions. Produce hedge accounting transactions and reports. Monitor credit." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11208" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing risk-and-hedging function -> Organization Capability (R6). Discrete strategy/report children are processes; market/exposure sub-functions are themselves capabilities." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and execute risk and hedging transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of developing hedging strategy, managing market and exposure risks, executing hedges, and accounting for hedging activity." ;
          skos:example "A market-risk desk running the firm's hedging programme." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11209
ex:P11209 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19575
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19576
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19577
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19578
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling risks arising from changes in the interest rate." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11209" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing interest-rate-risk function -> Organization Capability (R6). Its four tasks are processes that realize it." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage interest rate risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of collecting interest-rate market data, determining interest-rate exposure and hedge requirements, and executing interest-rate trades." ;
          skos:example "The rates desk managing the firm's interest-rate risk position." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11210
ex:P11210 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19579
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19580
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19581
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19582
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19583
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking care of foreign-exchange risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11210" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing FX-risk function -> Organization Capability (R6). Its five tasks are processes that realize it." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage foreign exchange risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of managing FX market data, determining FX exposure and hedge requirements, executing FX trades, and managing balance-sheet FX risk." ;
          skos:example "The FX desk managing the group's currency risk." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11211
ex:P11211 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19584
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19585
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19586
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19587
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking care of exposure risks. Maintain financial investments in particular investments or a portfolios that could be risky for the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11211" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing exposure-risk function -> Organization Capability (R6). Its four tasks are processes that realize it." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage exposure risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of determining customer exposures, resolving limit violations, managing collateral, and reviewing customer credit." ;
          skos:example "The credit-risk team managing counterparty exposure limits." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11213
ex:P11213 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HedgeSelectionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining options in the market for hedging investments. Select an option." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11213" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfSelection (Directive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: the act culminates in selecting an option. Output ex:HedgeSelectionDecision minted locally." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate and refine hedging positions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that examines available hedging options and has as output a hedge selection decision prescribing the chosen option." ;
          skos:example "The desk compares collar structures and selects one to refine the hedge." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11214
ex:P11214 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing and documenting accounts and records of all hedging investment transactions to reduce risks due to change in markets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11214" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfReporting (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:TransactionRecord and ex:FinancialReport." ;
          rdfs:label "Produce hedge accounting transactions and reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input transaction records and has as output a financial report documenting hedging investment activity." ;
          skos:example "Treasury issues the hedge-accounting effectiveness report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11215
ex:P11215 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditScoringHistory
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Revising credit reports periodically for accurateness and changes that could be suggestive of duplicitous activity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11215" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (Descriptive output): periodic review of credit reports yields a judgement. Reuses shared ex:CreditScoringHistory and ex:CreditAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor credit" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input a credit scoring history and has as output a credit assessment flagging inaccuracies or signs of fraudulent activity." ;
          skos:example "The team rescreens counterparty credit files each quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11221
ex:P11221 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessResilienceStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a strategy for rapidly adapting to disturbances. Maintain continuous business processes and protecting employees, assets, and overall brand equity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11221" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessResiliencyCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): its definitional output is a Directive ICE (a strategy), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Models APQC 11.4.1 as an occurrent, not the strategy artifact (ex:BusinessResilienceStrategy) nor a standing function." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop the business resilience strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and articulates a business resilience strategy prescribing how an organization rapidly adapts to disturbances while maintaining continuous operations and protecting employees, assets, and brand equity." ;
          skos:example "A resilience team drafts the enterprise's business resilience strategy for the coming planning cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11222
ex:P11222 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessContinuityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing plans to ensure continuous business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11222" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessResiliencyCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): the definitional output is a Directive ICE (a continuity plan), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform continuous business operations planning" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and articulates a business continuity plan prescribing the measures required to ensure continuous business operations." ;
          skos:example "A continuity planner produces the business continuity plan for the firm's critical processes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11223
ex:P11223 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ContinuityTestResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing ongoing activities within the organization that are not intended to stop except for in an emergency." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11223" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessResiliencyCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (inlined; Act of Appraisal cco:ont00000636; also information-processing in character): testing exercises operations against a standard and yields a Descriptive ICE (a test result), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. The business continuity plan is a typical (not definitional) input, so it is noted here rather than promoted to a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Test continuous business operations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that exercises the organization's ongoing, non-stop activities against the business continuity plan and produces a continuity test result recording whether those operations perform as intended." ;
          skos:example "A resilience team runs a failover drill and records the continuity test result." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11224
ex:P11224 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessOperationsEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating business operations. Determine which activities generate revenues, perform best, and provide good returns." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11224" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessResiliencyCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): despite the APQC label 'Maintain', the Element Description is evaluative ('Evaluating ... Determine which activities ... perform best'), so the definitional output is a Descriptive ICE (an evaluation/judgement), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain continuous business operations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates ongoing business operations to judge which activities generate revenue, perform best, and provide good returns, and produces a business operations evaluation." ;
          skos:example "An operations analyst evaluates ongoing activities and issues a business operations evaluation ranking them by return." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11236
ex:P11236 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Requesting customer feedback on the process of handling and resolving customer complaints. Obtain information about the effectiveness and performance of the customer complaint handling process from the customers through various means (e.g., online and by phone)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11236" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication, co-anchored cco:ont00000228 Planned Act for standalone SHACL); the act SOLICITS/OBTAINS feedback from the customer (the customer transfers the feedback ICE), consistent with the other solicit-feedback acts and P10336: it requests, receives, and stores input ICEs (customer feedback); definitional output is the Descriptive ex:CustomerFeedback. The Customer participates (has participant)." ;
          rdfs:label "Solicit customer feedback on complaint handling and resolution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that engages the customer to elicit and collect customer feedback on how complaints are handled and resolved." ;
          skos:example "An agent invites the customer by phone and email to rate how their complaint was resolved." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11237
ex:P11237 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerComplaint
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining the information obtained through handling and resolving complaints for development/improvement opportunities. Categorize the customer complaints data on the basis of speed, accuracy, courtesy, price, product choice, availability, hours, location, etc. Determine complaint patterns in order to diagnose areas needing enhancement." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11237" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (shared genus, cco:ont00000366): it categorizes and examines complaint data to discern improvement opportunities; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis. Input modeled as ex:CustomerComplaint (the lodged complaint records being examined)." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze customer complaint data and identify improvement opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer complaints and has as output an improvement opportunity analysis of the complaint handling process." ;
          skos:example "An analyst categorizes complaints by speed and accuracy and reports which areas most need enhancement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11238
ex:P11238 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Obtaining customer feedback/review on the quality and utility derived from the products/services after the sale is complete. Use techniques such as surveys, feedback boxes, and user activity and usability tests." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11238" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication, co-anchored cco:ont00000228 Planned Act for standalone SHACL); the act SOLICITS/OBTAINS feedback from the customer (the customer transfers the feedback ICE), consistent with the other solicit-feedback acts and P10336: it gathers/receives input ICEs (customer feedback) via surveys and usability tests; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:CustomerFeedback. The Customer participates (has participant)." ;
          rdfs:label "Gather and solicit post-sale customer feedback on products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that engages the customer after sale to elicit and collect customer feedback on the quality and utility of products and services." ;
          skos:example "A team runs a post-purchase survey and usability test to collect feedback on a product's utility." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11239
ex:P11239 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AdEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the influence of advertisements on purchasing behavior. Use techniques such as surveys and product recognition tests, questionnaires or feedback flyers, and toll-free numbers in order to encourage customer interaction after the sale." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11239" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) per Gate-F review: the APQC Element Description LEADS with an appraisal verb -- 'Assessing the influence of advertisements on purchasing behavior' -- and per Phase 1 the genus comes from the lead gerund ('Assessing' -> Appraisal), not the label verb 'Solicit'. REJECTED the prior cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing, solicit/collect) anchor: it followed the label over the description and risked dropping the ad-effectiveness judgement entirely, since the deferred analysis sibling 6.5.3.4 is about product/service satisfaction generally, not ad influence specifically. Definitional output is the Descriptive ex:AdEffectivenessAssessment, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (appraisal -> descriptive). The surveys/questionnaires/toll-free numbers are the typical method of gathering the input feedback (commentary), and the customer participates." ;
          rdfs:label "Solicit post-sale customer feedback on ad effectiveness" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that assesses the influence of advertisements on customers' purchasing behavior and produces an ad effectiveness assessment." ;
          skos:example "A team uses product-recognition tests and survey responses to assess and report whether an ad campaign drove customers' purchases." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11240
ex:P11240 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the information collected on customer satisfaction levels with products/services in order to determine areas for improvement. Examine the data and information extracted from the customer feedback and reviews to measure the satisfaction levels of the customers. Identify opportunities that could enhance the customer satisfaction levels and the overall customer service strategy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11240" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (shared genus, cco:ont00000366): it examines collected feedback to discern where products/services and the service strategy can improve; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze product and service satisfaction data and identify improvement opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer feedback and has as output an improvement opportunity analysis for products, services, and the customer service strategy." ;
          skos:example "An analyst mines post-sale survey data and lists the improvement opportunities that would most raise satisfaction." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11241
ex:P11241 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductManagementTeam
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing feedback from customers on products/services to the product management team. Analyze information collected through Gather and solicit post-sale customer feedback on products/services [11238]. Share with the product management team for consideration while improving existing offerings or developing new products/services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11241" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ProductManagerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) per Gate-F review, consistently with P18126: the act is a directed hand-off of an ICE to the named recipient ex:ProductManagementTeam (REJECTED the prior generic cco:ont00000366 Information Processing anchor, which dropped the directedness). OUTPUT corrected: the label promises 'feedback AND insights', so the definitional has output is ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis (the 'insights' / analysis product) rather than the raw ex:CustomerFeedback, which is the analyzed input. The source de-conflates 'Analyze information collected through [11238]' (the analysis is performed by sibling P11240 6.5.3.4 producing ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis) and 'Share with the product management team' (this communication act); this row models the share/transfer and conveys the insights. The cross-reference to 11238 is recorded in apqcSourceText only; precedence is not asserted as the text licenses only an informational hand-off." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide feedback and insights to appropriate teams (product design/development, marketing, manufacturing)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which the insights derived from analyzing post-sale customer feedback are transferred to the product management team for consideration in improving or developing offerings." ;
          skos:example "A service analyst packages the improvement insights drawn from customer product feedback and shares them with product management for the next release planning." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11243
ex:P11243 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmployeeFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OnboardingProgramEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the performance and effectiveness of employee on-boarding program. Examine the performance of on-boarding program through feedback and reviews from the new employees. Create web and written forms. Obtain information through face-to-face discussions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11243" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EmployeeDevelopmentCapability ,
                                ex:EmployeeOrientationAndDeploymentCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Appraisal genus (cco:ont00000636) with a Descriptive output per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate the effectiveness of the employee onboarding program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input employee feedback and has as output an onboarding program evaluation judging the performance and effectiveness of the onboarding program." ;
          skos:example "HR reviews new-hire surveys and reports on how well the induction program worked." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11250
ex:P11250 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessControlObjective
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the objectives and risks associated with a process. Delineate process goals. Determine the risks attached to it. Determine what the process is meant to accomplish, potential issues, a timeline of potential risks, the scope and potential impact of risks, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11250" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation: the primary output is a Directive process-control objective (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE); the descriptive ex:RiskAssessment is a co-output capturing the determined risks." ;
          rdfs:label "Define business process objectives and risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that prescribes the control objectives of a business process and produces a risk assessment describing the risks attached to that process." ;
          skos:example "A process owner documents the objectives of the payroll process and the risks that threaten them." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11251
ex:P11251 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskToleranceSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the risk tolerance levels of individual units, as well as the organization as a whole. Determine the specific maximum risk to take in quantitative terms for each relevant risk subcategory, including strategic, operational, financial, and compliance risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.8.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11251" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output ex:RiskToleranceSpecification): tolerances are binding limits, distinct from a descriptive ex:RiskAssessment of current exposure." ;
          rdfs:label "Define entity/unit risk tolerances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that prescribes the maximum acceptable risk, in quantitative terms, for organizational units and the organization as a whole across risk subcategories." ;
          skos:example "A risk committee sets a maximum tolerable compliance-risk threshold for each business unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11276
ex:P11276 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the construction process to ensure that activates are on task, on budget, and are being performed with safety and quality in mind." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11276" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: monitoring/oversight -> Descriptive ICE (WorkPerformanceReport). Despite the 'Managing' wording it is bounded to one construction effort, so it is a process (ex:ActOfMonitoring), not a standing capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform construction performance management" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as output a work performance report describing whether construction activities are on task, on budget, and performed with safety and quality." ;
          skos:example "A construction manager reviews daily progress against plan and reports performance to the program office." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11331
ex:P11331 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16808
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16809
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16810
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16811
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16812
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16814
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19991
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19992
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining requirements related to the creation of the product/service. Explain potential achievements that could be made." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11331" ;
          rdfs:comment "Parent of the eight requirement-derivation tasks; each is a process part." ;
          rdfs:label "Define product/service requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the requirements related to creating a product or service and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An engineering team determines and documents the full requirement set for a new device." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11417
ex:P11417 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000063 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11418
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServicePerformanceData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Regularly monitoring production runs of the production and/or delivery operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.3.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11417" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F re-anchor: from cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing). The only output is ex:ProductServicePerformanceData -- raw measured/logged run metrics, NOT a descriptive evaluative judgement against a standard. Act of Appraisal (an Act of Measuring that yields a verdict) over-committed the act to a judgement it does not produce; monitoring/logging is a measuring/information-processing act whose output is data (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: Information-Processing -> Descriptive ICE). The judgement is deferred to the downstream engineering-change act (11418), which this precedes (and feeds)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor initial production runs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that regularly monitors and logs initial production runs of the production or delivery operations and produces product/service performance data." ;
          skos:example "A line supervisor logs yield and defect rates across the first production runs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11418
ex:P11418 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EngineeringChangeOrder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Requesting changes in the production and/or delivery operations for processing the new or revised products/services. Rectify any problems identified in the manufacturing or delivery processes (through Monitor production runs [11417]). Seek changes in components, repair machinery, optimize production lines, and tweak factory assemblies through a formal notice to the concerned division, known as an engineering change order." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11418" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (under Act of Planning): the ECO is a prescriptive directive. Performance data from monitoring (11417) is a typical, non-definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Request engineering/process change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that requests changes to production or delivery operations by issuing a formal engineering change order." ;
          skos:example "An engineer files an ECO to repair tooling and optimize an assembly step." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11423
ex:P11423 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11424
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11425
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11426
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11427
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11428
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19646
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19647
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PostLaunchReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Learning from either a test or a full production run within the consumer market. Companies use this as an opportunity to both test and react to new products, ideas, or innovations based on the initial reaction of consumers on an individual level. Within this process, analytics are used to determine the relative success of a new product offering. Within this process, companies will launch key analytics to test a products acceptance. They will also review market performance and compare to similar products and against the business case or the financial plan. Companies can also measure the effectiveness of their supply chain network, and can apply what is learned from the post launch review to other new products, processes, and procedures to ensure and enhance the product quality." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11423" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal; output is a Descriptive ICE (the review) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Its seven task children are process parts via cco:ont00001777." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct post launch review" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output a post-launch review judging the market success of a newly launched product/service, and that has as process parts the constituent analytics, market, supply-chain, quality, financial, and process reviews." ;
          skos:example "A team runs post-launch analytics and compiles a review comparing actual market performance against the business case." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11424
ex:P11424 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketStudy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting customer and market analysis to review progress and identify opportunities for increasing market position. Track and review product/service response through sales reports, website statistics, direct response from customers, and survey reports." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11424" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is analysis; output is a Descriptive ICE that is about the Market per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Review market performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input sales reports and customer feedback and has as output a market study about the product/service's market position." ;
          skos:example "A team reviews sales reports and survey responses to study a product's market position." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11425
ex:P11425 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyChainPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyChainEffectivenessReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the performance of supply chain to all departments and logistics from input to shop floor. Seeking performance reviews at each intersection and communication channels. Review effectiveness of supply chain and distribution to check if it is meeting the demands of the various groups and organizations that are concerned with its activities (groups might include customers, partners, suppliers, and vendors)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11425" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Review effectiveness of supply chain and distribution network" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input supply chain performance data and has as output a supply chain effectiveness review judging whether the network meets stakeholder demands." ;
          skos:example "Logistics reviews each supply-chain intersection and judges overall network effectiveness." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11426
ex:P11426 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityPerformanceReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the quality and performance of the product/service delivered to customers. Analyze data from the customer feedback, audits, measures of customer satisfaction (such as product quality complaints and recalls), and organizational policies on delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11426" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Review quality and performance of the product/service" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input customer feedback and has as output a quality performance review judging the delivered product/service's quality and performance." ;
          skos:example "A quality team appraises complaints, recalls, and satisfaction data to judge delivered quality." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11427
ex:P11427 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating organization's financial reports and financial reporting processes. Review and document the ROI catered by the product/service delivery to the customer in the market." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11427" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct financial review" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output a financial review documenting the return on investment of the product/service delivered to market." ;
          skos:example "Finance reviews the ROI of a launched product and documents the financial review." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11428
ex:P11428 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NPDProcessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the steps involved in the development of new product, its effect on existing product, resources, and functions related to the development of the new product until its sale in the competitive market place." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11428" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is analysis; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct new product development process assessment" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as output a new-product-development process assessment of the development steps and their effect on existing products, resources, and functions." ;
          skos:example "A team analyzes the NPD steps end-to-end and assesses their impact on resources and existing products." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11465
ex:P11465 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerTradeStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesGoal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing category management strategies for customers through the use of consumer insights and understanding of customer specifics. Develop consumer and channel insights. Establish long term strategies, objectives and targets across the brand." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11465" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation: directive trade strategy (ex:CustomerTradeStrategy). Customer and channel insights (ex:CustomerInsight) are typical informational input. The brand-level objectives/targets co-emit a sales goal (ex:SalesGoal)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop customer trade strategy and customer objectives/targets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a customer trade and category-management strategy with long-term objectives and targets and produces a customer trade strategy." ;
          skos:example "A trade-marketing team sets the brand's annual customer category strategy and targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11466
ex:P11466 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExecutionRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arranging meetings with trade partners to coordinate logistics, manage critical resources, resolve bottlenecks, and schedule urgent or time-sensitive matters." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11466" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): the act makes a plan/schedule to achieve coordination objectives, output the directive ex:ExecutionRoadmap (prescribes actions, ordering, and timing). Distinguished from ex:ActOfFormulation by its operational scheduling focus rather than authoring a strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct planning activities for major trade customers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that arranges coordination of logistics, resources, and scheduling with major trade customers and produces an execution roadmap." ;
          skos:example "Account managers convene trade partners and lay out the quarter's logistics and resolution schedule." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11468
ex:P11468 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TradeMarketingCalendar
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Sending invitations and distributing information about upcoming events to customer teams and other involved entities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.12" ;
          ex:pcfID "11468" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): an ICE is transferred from one agent to another. INPUT ICE CORRECTED (Gate-F): the communicated content is the trade-event timetable from 3.4.2.10, now the dedicated ex:TradeMarketingCalendar (formerly the mismatched ex:CommunicationCalendar); it is the act's definitional informational input rather than a newly authored output." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate planning information to customer teams" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transfers planning information about upcoming events from the organization to customer teams and other involved parties." ;
          skos:example "A coordinator emails the trade-event calendar and invitations to the customer account teams." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11495
ex:P11495 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PriceList
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing schemes that offer lower pricing for a limited time as a promotional and sales incentive when launching a new product or a service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11495" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PricingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): it executes a held promotional-pricing scheme. Directive output (a discounted price list)." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement promotional pricing programs" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that runs time-limited promotional pricing schemes and produces a price list of the discounted prices." ;
          skos:example "A launch promotion applies introductory prices to a new product for a fixed window." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11496
ex:P11496 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PricingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the optimum consumer pricing for each product or service at the point of sale, based on production and distribution costs and estimated sales volume." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11496" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PricingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation, not bare execution, because the verb 'Determining the optimum consumer pricing' composes a Directive pricing plan." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement other retail pricing programs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a retail pricing plan setting optimum consumer point-of-sale prices from costs and estimated sales volume." ;
          skos:example "A retail team sets shelf prices per SKU from cost and volume estimates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11497
ex:P11497 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PriceList
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assigning new prices or pricing adjustments to products or services to replace the original base prices. Update the prices in product catalogs and databases, and disseminate the information through all involved distribution and marketing channels." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.3.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11497" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PricingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): it applies and propagates already-decided price changes. Directive output (an updated price list)." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate and implement price changes" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that assigns new prices, updates catalogs and databases, and disseminates the updated price list through distribution and marketing channels." ;
          skos:example "An operations team pushes revised prices to the catalog and all channels." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11521
ex:P11521 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:IncentiveScheme
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing business-to-business marketing campaigns and financial incentives for wholesalers, dealers, distributors and other intermediaries that the company uses to distribute its products or services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11521" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation: the trade funding/incentives are a directive ex:IncentiveScheme (per the section vocab mapping of 3.4.2.5 trade funding)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define trade programs and funding options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines business-to-business trade programs and financial incentives for distribution intermediaries and produces an incentive scheme." ;
          skos:example "A channel team defines the dealer rebate and co-op funding program for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11522
ex:P11522 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TradeMarketingCalendar
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Combining scheduled promotional, category management and trade marketing events into unified timetables. Update the calendars. Register new events." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "11522" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output) is correct. OUTPUT ICE CORRECTED (Gate-F): formerly ex:CommunicationCalendar, whose definition denotes marketing-MESSAGE-delivery scheduling; the source combines promotional/category-management/trade-marketing EVENTS into timetables, so the dedicated ex:TradeMarketingCalendar is now used (D5 reuse-before-mint: the reused ICE denoted a different artifact)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop promotional and category management calendars (trade marketing calendars)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that combines scheduled promotional, category-management, and trade-marketing events into a unified timetable and produces a trade marketing calendar." ;
          skos:example "A trade-marketing planner merges promo and category events into one master trade calendar." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11523
ex:P11523 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing long term customer sales plans to assess current sales and to determine future sales objectives, strategies for achieving the goals, and available resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "11523" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation: the per-customer sales plan is the directive ex:SalesPlan (per the section vocab mapping of 11523)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create strategic and tactical sales plans by customer" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes long-term strategic and tactical sales plans for individual customers and produces a sales plan." ;
          skos:example "An account team builds the multi-year sales plan for a strategic account, with objectives and resources." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11622
ex:P11622 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillsGapAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingProgramSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying skills, knowledge, and attributes that need enhancement in order to perform a job. Develop the appropriate training programs. These programs can be computer-based, classroom, or on-the-job training, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.1.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11622" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is Act of Formulation: definitional output is a prescriptive training program specification (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Design talent development program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a skills gap analysis and produces a training program specification for enhancing the skills, knowledge, and attributes needed to perform jobs." ;
          skos:example "L&D designs a blended training program closing identified skill gaps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11623
ex:P11623 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HRProgramSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a program to entice prospective resources to engage with the organization for a position of employment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.1.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11623" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is Act of Formulation: output is a prescriptive talent-acquisition program specification (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Design talent acquisition program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces an HR program specification for attracting prospective candidates to engage with the organization for employment." ;
          skos:example "Recruiting designs an employer-attraction and sourcing program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11687
ex:P11687 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating an avenue for which the customer can provide feedback on their experience with how their inquiry, problem, or request was handled." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11687" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication, co-anchored cco:ont00000228 Planned Act for standalone SHACL); the act SOLICITS/OBTAINS feedback from the customer (the customer transfers the feedback ICE), consistent with the other solicit-feedback acts and P10336: the act elicits, receives, and stores input ICEs (customer feedback) rather than rendering a value judgement; its definitional output is the Descriptive ex:CustomerFeedback. The Customer participates (has participant)." ;
          rdfs:label "Solicit customer feedback on customer service experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that engages the customer to elicit and collect customer feedback about their customer service experience." ;
          skos:example "A service desk emails a short post-resolution survey inviting the customer to rate the handling of their request." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11688
ex:P11688 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing customer service feedback to identify areas in which improvements can be made. Engage with management to discuss issues." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11688" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (shared genus, cco:ont00000366): it examines feedback ICEs and produces an understanding of where service can improve; its definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis. Management is a typical participant (commentary), not definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze customer service data and identify improvement opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer feedback and has as output an improvement opportunity analysis of the customer service function." ;
          skos:example "An analyst reviews survey responses and writes up the top three areas where inquiry handling can be improved." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11689
ex:P11689 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerComplaint
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplaintAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining complaint patterns in order to identify common issues. Document common problems for correction." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11689" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (shared genus, cco:ont00000366, discernment sense): it discerns and registers which complaints recur, rather than rendering a value judgement; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ComplaintAnalysis documenting the common problems." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify common customer complaints" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input customer complaints and has as output a complaint analysis registering the recurrent complaint patterns and common problems discerned." ;
          skos:example "A team groups recurring complaints and documents the most common problems for correction." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11741
ex:P11741 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaterialsMasterList
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Controlling the details of materials' storage and utilization, supplier details linked to materials, in a defined sequential manner and ensuring regular updates with permissible accessibility." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11741" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ProductDataManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the master list)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage materials master lists" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a materials master list controlling materials storage, utilization, and linked supplier details with permissible accessibility." ;
          skos:example "A master-data steward updates the materials master list with new supplier linkages." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11742
ex:P11742 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BillOfMaterials
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the purchase details/bills through regular and error free updates to applications. Create manual entries wherever necessary and ensure timely review of the laid processes and systems." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11742" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is the Directive ICE ex:BillOfMaterials (reconciled to one class)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage bills of material" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a bill of materials kept current through regular, error-free updates to the supporting applications." ;
          skos:example "An engineer updates the BOM in the PLM system after a part substitution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11743
ex:P11743 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Routing
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Controlling and executing the flow of operations from raw form to finished product in a defined format using industry applications/routing sheets for the specific product/service layout." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11743" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the routing) describing the operation flow." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage routings" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a routing specifying the flow of operations from raw form to finished product for a specific product/service layout." ;
          skos:example "A process engineer maintains routing sheets for a product line in the MES." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11744
ex:P11744 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceCharacteristicsSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Direct, supervise, and control the product/service details necessary to execute the process. Adhere to details and descriptions for product/service through identified or guided parameters towards final outcome in the market with due critical analysis formed on organizational objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11744" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Directive ICE (the specification), which prescribes product/service characteristics." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage specifications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a product/service characteristics specification controlling the product/service details necessary to execute the process." ;
          skos:example "A spec owner controls and versions the product characteristics specification in the PDM system." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11745
ex:P11745 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering the specifications of the product/service and ensure accessibility for product alteration/new product development." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11745" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Directive ICE (the design specification/drawing), which prescribes the artifact's form." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage drawings" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a design specification (drawing) administered and made accessible for product alteration and new product development." ;
          skos:example "A CAD librarian administers controlled access to product drawings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11746
ex:P11746 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductMaterialClassification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Controlling the details of the product and the input materials. Manage classification throughout the production process, and for future accessibility to new product development or product enrichment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11746" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the classification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage product/material classification" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a product/material classification controlling product and input-material details throughout the production process." ;
          skos:example "A data steward maintains the product and material classification taxonomy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11747
ex:P11747 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityInspectionDocument
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining procedures required to assess the sustainability of defined criterion for product/service delivery to customers. Retain results for further review as a procedural practice." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "11747" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management (develop and maintain the document); output is a Directive ICE (the inspection procedure document)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and maintain quality/inspection documents" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output a quality/inspection document prescribing the procedures for assessing product/service delivery criteria, retained for further review." ;
          skos:example "A quality engineer authors and retains the inspection procedure document for a product family." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11748
ex:P11748 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessSpecificationData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Directing and handling data with respect to the procedures followed across different functions and mission critical applications." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11748" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the process specification data)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain process specification data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output process specification data directing and handling the procedural data used across functions and mission-critical applications." ;
          skos:example "A data owner maintains process-specification records across ERP modules." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11749
ex:P11749 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TraceabilityData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and handling data accessed by the permitted touch points. Ensure that no data is accessible to any unnecessary recipient. Data flow should be controlled through secured access and free from unauthorized access." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11749" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the traceability data) with controlled access." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage traceability data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output traceability data controlled through secured access so that it is reachable only by permitted touch points." ;
          skos:example "A traceability administrator restricts lot-genealogy data to authorized systems." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11750
ex:P11750 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DataAccessRequest
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DataAccessDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the requests pertaining to data accessibility. Review the requester details based on internal data security policies and permit data access only if internal policies and data access parameters are met." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.4.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "11750" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ProductDataManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal (judging the request against policy); the output is a prescriptive authorization, so it is a Directive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and approve data access requests" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a data access request and has as output a data access decision permitting or denying access according to internal data-security policy." ;
          skos:example "A data-security reviewer evaluates an access request against policy and grants or denies it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11773
ex:P11773 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesLead
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning sales leads with business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11773" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). Output is a descriptive strategic-fit judgement; modeled in this comment rather than as a someValuesFrom restriction because the source does not make a single named artifact definitional for every instance (Phase-3 necessity rule)." ;
          rdfs:label "Match opportunities to business strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input sales leads and judges their alignment with an organization's business objectives." ;
          skos:example "A sales lead is assessed for fit against the firm's strategic objectives before pursuit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11779
ex:P11779 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11780
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11781
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11782
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11783
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11784
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11785
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11787
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11788
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11789
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11790
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11793
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20015
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20016
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20017
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20018
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RequestForProposal
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding and refining the customer requirements as provided in a RFP (Request for Proposal) or RFI (Request for Information).  When compiling the response, they must take into consideration whether the requirements are a match with the strategic or tactical plans of the organization and whether they are able to submit a bid/proposal that is competitive based on an understanding of the offerings of other competing organizations. The next step will be to define the pricing and scheduling of the proposed solution and determine whether the proposal will be profitable for the company if accepted. The bid is then submitted and a notification of whether or not it was successful is received." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11779" ;
          rdfs:comment "Process container for the RFP-to-notification proposal lifecycle; its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage sales proposals, bids, and quotes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selling that has as input a request for proposal and produces and submits a sales proposal in response, encompassing requirement refinement, competitive and profitability analysis, pricing, and bid submission." ;
          skos:example "A bid team responds to an RFP from requirement refinement through submission and outcome." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11780
ex:P11780 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RequestForProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Clarifying the details about procurement requests, such as the scope, timeline, data sources, type and characteristics and evaluation criteria for the goods or services to be delivered, and any additional terms, conditions or special requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "11780" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): the act manipulates the requirement ICE into a clarified form. The refined-requirements artifact is typical but not definitional for every instance (Phase-3), so it is left to this comment." ;
          rdfs:label "Refine customer requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as input a request for proposal and clarifies and elaborates the customer's stated requirements." ;
          skos:example "A solution architect clarifies scope, timeline, and evaluation criteria with the customer." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11781
ex:P11781 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RequestForProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Accepting procurement proposals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "11781" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): an ICE (the RFP) is transferred from one agent to another." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive Request For Proposal (RFP)/Request For Quote (RFQ)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which an organization receives a request for proposal transferred from a prospective customer." ;
          skos:example "A bid desk logs an incoming RFP from a prospective client." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11782
ex:P11782 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RequestForProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating individual price and delivery solicitations for their strengths and weaknesses. Analyze how closely the submitted bids respond to the requirements outlined in the RFPs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "11782" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates and judges solicitations." ;
          rdfs:label "Review RFP/RFQ request" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a request for proposal and judges the strengths and weaknesses of price and delivery solicitations against its requirements." ;
          skos:example "An analyst scores how well candidate solutions answer the RFP requirements." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11783
ex:P11783 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetitiveAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Comparing the proposals submitted by different bidders in terms of cost, efficiency and value." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "11783" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:CompetitiveAnalysis (Descriptive ICE, is about CompetingOrganization). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: analysis genus agrees with descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform competitive analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input market data and has as output a competitive analysis comparing competing bids on cost, efficiency, and value." ;
          skos:example "A bid team benchmarks rival proposals on price and value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11784
ex:P11784 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the business strategy, forecasted performance, financing and cash flow of the proposals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "11784" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). Output is a descriptive strategic-fit judgement; left to comment per Phase-3 necessity." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate with strategy/business plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges a proposal's fit with an organization's business strategy, forecasted performance, financing, and cash flow." ;
          skos:example "A finance lead checks a bid against the firm's strategy and cash-flow plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11785
ex:P11785 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerInsight
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deepening knowledge about the customer's field of operation and business needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "11785" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: analysis genus agrees with descriptive output (ex:CustomerInsight, is about Customer)." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand customer business and requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer data and has as output a customer insight describing the customer's field of operation and business needs." ;
          skos:example "A pre-sales consultant researches the customer's industry and pain points." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11787
ex:P11787 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the needs for internal resources and vacancies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "11787" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense). The staffing-requirements register is typical but not definitional for every instance (Phase-3), so it is left to this comment." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify staffing requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns and registers the internal resource and staffing needs for delivering a proposed solution." ;
          skos:example "A resourcing manager lists the roles and headcount a bid would require." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11788
ex:P11788 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PricingAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing predicted delivery costs, fees and timelines." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "11788" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): estimating value/cost is appraisal. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal genus agrees with descriptive output (ex:PricingAnalysis). Rejected ex:ActOfForecasting because the act values a proposed solution rather than projecting a future market state." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop pricing and scheduling estimates" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input cost data and has as output a pricing analysis estimating delivery costs, fees, and timelines." ;
          skos:example "A cost engineer estimates the price and schedule for the proposed scope." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11789
ex:P11789 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing profitability data. Analyze systematically all relevant metrics and parameters. Report findings and make recommendations for changes to operational strategies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "11789" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: analysis genus agrees with descriptive output (ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct profitability analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input cost data and has as output a profitability analysis of a proposed engagement." ;
          skos:example "A pricing analyst reports the projected margin on a bid." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11790
ex:P11790 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Delivering the proposal to the potential client." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.13" ;
          ex:pcfID "11790" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): the proposal ICE is transferred to the customer." ;
          rdfs:label "Submit/present bid/proposal/quote to customer" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which an organization transfers a sales proposal to a prospective customer." ;
          skos:example "A rep presents the finished bid to the client." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P11793
ex:P11793 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling proposals depending on whether they were accepted or rejected." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.15" ;
          ex:pcfID "11793" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F): the prior genus ex:ActOfMonitoring requires repeated/continuous observation of a process state over time, but the source ('Handling proposals depending on whether they were accepted or rejected') is a one-shot receive-a-notification-and-route event -- a discrete information-processing / decision-routing act, not ongoing tracking. Re-anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing), which receives the outcome notification and registers/routes the proposal. Retains the ex:SalesProposal input." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage notification outcome" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that receives the acceptance or rejection notification for a submitted proposal and registers and routes the proposal for the corresponding handling." ;
          skos:example "A bid desk records an award notification and opens the contracting step." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12045
ex:P12045 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestResult
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceTrendAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing and monitoring the occurrences of problems with a process or product. It is important that nonconformance occurrences are tracked in a standardized way so the data can easily be reviewed to assess the impact of the problem. Ongoing analysis of trends in nonconformance gives an organization the ability to make process changes to reduce the incidence and cost of nonconformances." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12045" ;
          rdfs:label "Track and analyze non-conformance trends" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines tracked nonconformance occurrences over time and produces a nonconformance trend analysis." ;
          skos:example "A quality engineer charts defect rates by cause to find a rising trend." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12046
ex:P12046 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceTrendAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Using a technique that helps people answer the question of why a problem occurred in the first place. It seeks to identify the origin of a problem using a specific set of steps, with associated tools, to find the primary cause of the problem to determine what happened, why, and how to reduce the likelihood that it will happen again." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "12046" ;
          rdfs:comment "A nonconformance trend analysis is a typical input that triggers root-cause work; asserted as has input where definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform root cause analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that traces a quality problem to its primary cause and produces a root cause analysis." ;
          skos:example "A team runs a 5-Whys investigation and documents the root cause of a defect." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12127
ex:P12127 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12128
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12129
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12131
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12132
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12133
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12135
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20057
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Instituting training to enable resources to provide service delivery to the customer. Develop a training plan. Create materials that provide for operation and technical training. Schedule, perform, and evaluate training." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12127" ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded, repeatable training-enablement cycle (partonomy anchor). Children are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the cycle composes heterogeneous parts (formulation, material production, instruction, appraisal) and is not reducible to a single act genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Enable service delivery resources" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that institutes training to enable service delivery personnel to provide service delivery, comprising planning, material development, scheduling, delivery, and evaluation of training." ;
          skos:example "An L&D team plans, builds, schedules, delivers, and evaluates onboarding for new delivery staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12128
ex:P12128 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillsTaxonomy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a detailed summary of all the actions relevant to teaching a person a particular skill or type of behavior. Determine who will deliver the training. Determine when and where the apprentice or trainee needs to go to receive the structured component of the training." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12128" ;
          rdfs:comment "Defining output is a Directive training plan, so anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop service delivery training plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a skills taxonomy and has as output a training plan detailing the actions, deliverers, timing, and location for teaching service delivery skills." ;
          skos:example "A training lead drafts the curriculum, instructors, and venue plan for a new-hire program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12129
ex:P12129 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingMaterialSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing materials necessary to provide comprehensive training for the skills or behavior needed to deliver services. This can be any number for formats such as classroom or computer based training." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12129" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): the cycle produces training materials but is not reducible to a single information-output act genus. Per D3 / S3 the definitional has output is the Descriptive ex:TrainingMaterialSpecification (the informational deliverable); the produced ex:TrainingMaterial artifact (a material entity) is consumed downstream as an input to the training-instruction acts (5.2.3.4, 5.2.3.5). The training plan input is informational (an ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop training materials" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that has as input a training plan and has as output training material used to provide comprehensive training in service delivery skills." ;
          skos:example "An instructional designer produces slide decks and an e-learning module for a technical course." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12131
ex:P12131 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing training to the employee within a manageable timeframe to meet the needs of both the individual and the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12131" ;
          rdfs:comment "Defining output is a Directive training schedule (prescribes when/where), so anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage training schedule" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a training plan and has as output a training schedule prescribing the timeframe in which training is delivered to meet individual and organizational needs." ;
          skos:example "A coordinator slots cohorts into training weeks that fit both delivery commitments and learner availability." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12132
ex:P12132 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00001075 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Educating service delivery personnel on all aspects of the operations process of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "12132" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnelRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses CCO cco:ont00001075 (Act of Training Instruction): knowledge imparted from agent to agent. Service delivery personnel (the trainees) are definitional participants; training material is a definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Deliver operations training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training Instruction that imparts knowledge of the organization's operations processes to service delivery personnel using training material." ;
          skos:example "A senior operator runs an operations-process onboarding session for new delivery staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12133
ex:P12133 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00001075 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that all personnel are trained on all technical aspects of service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12133" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnelRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses CCO cco:ont00001075 (Act of Training Instruction). Service delivery personnel are definitional participants; training material is a definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Deliver technical training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training Instruction that imparts knowledge of the technical aspects of service delivery to service delivery personnel using training material." ;
          skos:example "A technical trainer certifies field engineers on a product's installation procedures." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12135
ex:P12135 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillsCapabilityTestResult
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TrainingEffectivenessEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Eliciting feedback from various sources to evaluate the training provided. This can be achieved through testing and the practical application of skills. Additionally, manager or student feedback can be garnered to evaluate training effectiveness." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "12135" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: the has-input was changed from ex:CustomerFeedback to ex:TrainingFeedback. ex:CustomerFeedback is 'a customer's evaluation of SERVICES RENDERED', but the source for 12135 specifies 'manager or student feedback ... to evaluate training effectiveness' -- trainee/manager feedback ABOUT TRAINING, not customer feedback about services; reusing ex:CustomerFeedback was a definitional category error. Genus re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to match the 'evaluate' verb and the output ex:TrainingEffectivenessEvaluation, which is itself defined as a judgement; applied consistently with sibling ex:P20057 (also re-anchored to Act of Appraisal). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE holds either way (descriptive output)." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate training effectiveness" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a skills and capability test result and training feedback and has as output a training effectiveness evaluation judging how effectively the training imparted the targeted skills." ;
          skos:example "A training manager combines test scores and manager surveys into an end-of-program effectiveness report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12180
ex:P12180 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaterialSafetyDataSheet
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing material safety sheets. Capture material safety records to properly apply handling and disposal requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12180" ;
          rdfs:comment "Verb 'Maintain' denotes preparing/capturing records (a bounded act), not a standing function. Descriptive output (ex:MaterialSafetyDataSheet)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain material safety data sheets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that captures material safety information and produces a material safety data sheet used to apply handling and disposal requirements." ;
          skos:example "An EHS specialist compiles the safety data sheet for a newly stocked solvent." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12181
ex:P12181 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementsStatement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementsBriefing
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding and communicating hazardous material regulatory requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12181" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting, an Act of Representative Communication whose proper product is a DESCRIPTIVE account). Corrected (Gate-F, GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): the externally-authored Directive ex:RegulatoryRequirementsStatement is the COMMUNICATED CONTENT (has input via cco:ont00001921), not a product of this act -- a reporting/communication act does not AUTHOR a directive, it RELAYS it. The produced output is the descriptive ex:RegulatoryRequirementsBriefing (has output), so the descriptive genus now agrees with the descriptive output. (If on review this row is genuine authoring of the requirements, it would instead re-anchor to a directive-producing planning genus.)" ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain awareness of and communicate regulatory requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that conveys hazardous-material regulatory requirements to the personnel responsible for compliance and produces a regulatory requirements briefing accounting for them." ;
          skos:example "A compliance lead briefs the disposal team on updated transport rules for corrosives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12182
ex:P12182 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDisposition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HazardousMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning, overseeing, and tracking hazardous material handling and disposal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12182" ;
          rdfs:comment "Verb 'Maintain' here denotes conducting handling/disposal, a bounded disposition performance. Hazardous material is the definitional material input." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain hazardous material handling and disposal" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Disposition that plans, oversees, and tracks the handling and disposal of hazardous material." ;
          skos:example "A waste coordinator schedules, supervises, and logs the neutralization and disposal of a spent-acid batch." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12183
ex:P12183 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning, supporting, and documenting hazardous material audits." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "12183" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): an audit evaluates and judges compliance. Descriptive output (ex:ComplianceAuditReport)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage compliance audits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that examines hazardous-material handling against regulatory requirements and produces a compliance audit report." ;
          skos:example "An auditor reviews manifests and storage practices and issues a hazardous-waste compliance audit report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12184
ex:P12184 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DispositionNeedRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and establishing approaches to dispose of hazardous materials/waste." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12184" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense). The 'approaches to dispose' established here are typical follow-on detail, captured downstream at 10.4.11.6; the definitional output is the descriptive recognition (ex:DispositionNeedRegister)." ;
          rdfs:label "Recognize need to disposition hazardous materials/waste" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns hazardous materials or waste requiring disposition and registers the recognized disposition need." ;
          skos:example "An operator flags a quantity of expired reagent as requiring disposal." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12185
ex:P12185 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HazardousMaterial
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DispositionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating hazardous materials and waste for appropriate disposition. Apply requirements and initiate disposition activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "12185" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection: a disposition approach is chosen from candidate options, yielding a Directive ICE (ex:DispositionDecision) -> directive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine disposition and associated processing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that evaluates hazardous materials and waste against requirements and chooses an appropriate disposition, producing an asset disposition decision that initiates disposition activities." ;
          skos:example "A specialist determines that a contaminated batch must be incinerated rather than landfilled and issues the disposition decision." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12186
ex:P12186 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDisposition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HazardousMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing disposition, disposal, and reprocessing activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "12186" ;
          rdfs:comment "Verb 'Manage' here denotes performing the activities, a bounded disposition. Hazardous material is the definitional material input." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage disposition, disposal, reprocessing activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Disposition that performs the disposition, disposal, and reprocessing of hazardous materials and waste." ;
          skos:example "A licensed handler incinerates a hazardous batch and reprocesses recoverable solvent." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12187
ex:P12187 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DispositionRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReprocessingRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Documenting and reporting disposition, disposal, and reprocessing activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "12187" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting). Descriptive outputs (ex:DispositionRecord, ex:ReprocessingRecord)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage documentation and reporting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that documents and reports the disposition, disposal, and reprocessing activities performed on hazardous materials and waste, producing a disposition and disposal record." ;
          skos:example "A coordinator files the disposal manifests and reprocessing logs for the quarter's hazardous-waste shipments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12667
ex:P12667 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyTransactionReconciliation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assuring that the warranty transaction has been completed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "12667" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): reconciliation evaluates the completeness/consistency of the transaction; Descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Reconcile warranty transaction disposition" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that verifies a warranty transaction has been completed and produces a warranty transaction reconciliation." ;
          skos:example "Finance confirms the warranty payout and closure are consistent and complete." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12668
ex:P12668 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaimValidation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimDisposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Following Defining issue [20098], an approval or rejection with be made against the warranty claim. If it is deemed that the claim falls within the warranty parameters, the claim will be approved. If the claim is deemed to fall outside warranty parameters, the claim with be rejected." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "12668" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfSelection (inlined): chooses from a binary candidate set (approve/reject) and emits a Directive ClaimDisposition, agreeing with the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Approve or reject warranty claim" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input a warranty claim validation and chooses between approval and rejection, producing a claim disposition." ;
          skos:example "The warranty team approves a claim found to be within warranty parameters." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12669
ex:P12669 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfResolution ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12667
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12668
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12671
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20096
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20097
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20101
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20102
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20103
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20104
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20105
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaim
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimDisposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying, investigating, and processes warranty claims. This process includes: receipt and validation of a warranty claim; definition and diagnosis /root cause analysis of an issue and recommendation for corrective action; the determination of responsibility for settlement of the claim; the transaction being approved or denied; and the originator being notified and payment authorized. In the case of a recurring event, further investigation (definition and diagnosis or root cause analysis) is performed, and a recommendation for corrective action is made and implemented in production/design. It ends when the claim is closed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12669" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:WarrantyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded occurrent: begins at claim receipt and ends when the claim is closed. Genus ex:ActOfResolution (reconciled to cco:ont00000228 Planned Act). Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Process warranty claims" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Resolution that carries a warranty claim from receipt through validation, investigation, settlement decision, and closure." ;
          skos:example "A warranty team receives a claim, validates it, investigates the issue, decides approve/reject, authorizes payment, and closes the claim." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12671
ex:P12671 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaim
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaimValidation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that the claim falls within the parameters of the warranty in question. After validation is made, the claim must be investigated." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12671" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates the claim against the warranty parameters; output is a Descriptive judgement." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate warranty claim" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a warranty claim and a warranty policy and has as output a warranty claim validation judging whether the claim falls within the warranty parameters." ;
          skos:example "An administrator checks a claim against the policy and records that it is in scope." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12672
ex:P12672 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12674
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12676
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20118
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20119
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20120
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the cost and effectiveness of warranties." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "12672" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:WarrantyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: although the APQC label says 'manage', the Element Description ('Assessing the cost and effectiveness of warranties') is a bounded appraisal cycle, so it is modeled as a process, not a standing function. The standing 'manage warranty' capacity is already carried by the shared ex:WarrantyManagementCapability (R6) and is not re-minted here. Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal); definitional output is the Descriptive ex:WarrantyPerformanceReport (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate and manage warranty performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that assesses the cost and effectiveness of an organization's warranties and produces a warranty performance report." ;
          skos:example "A warranty team's periodic review of warranty cost and effectiveness culminating in a warranty performance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12673
ex:P12673 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Communicating rules and updates via training manuals for new products and training resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12673" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): the act transfers an existing Directive ICE (ex:WarrantyPolicy) to staff rather than composing a new directive, so it is NOT ex:ActOfFormulation. The warranty policy is the communicated input." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate warranty policies and offerings" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which warranty policies, rules, and updates are transferred to recipients via training manuals and training resources." ;
          skos:example "Trainers roll out updated warranty rules through new-product training manuals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12674
ex:P12674 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Finding ways to phase out unused or seldom used warranties." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "12674" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (shared genus, cco:ont00000366): it examines usage to discern waste-elimination opportunities; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify opportunities to eliminate warranty waste" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines warranty usage and produces an improvement opportunity analysis identifying unused or seldom-used warranties that can be phased out." ;
          skos:example "An analyst identifies seldom-claimed warranty types and recommends retiring them to cut waste." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12676
ex:P12676 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Comparing warranties by using applicable metrics to see how they are handled and resolved. Develop and submit reports that summarize significant conclusions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12676" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT, cco:ont00000366): it repeatedly compares warranties against applicable metrics and reports status, rather than rendering a one-off value judgement; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:WarrantyPerformanceReport." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and report on warranty management metrics" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks warranty management metrics over time and produces a warranty performance report summarizing significant conclusions." ;
          skos:example "An analyst tracks warranty cost and resolution-time metrics each month and submits a summary report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12677
ex:P12677 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FieldServiceAgent
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkforceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Scheduling additional investigative field service. This is performed for high priority claims or claims that require additional investigation. Field service engineers will gather additional information, perform further investigation, and qualify the definition of the issue." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12677" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:FieldServiceAgentRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfScheduling (PROPOSE-EXT): output is a Directive WorkforceSchedule. Participant ex:FieldServiceAgent where definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule field service" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that fixes the timing and assignment of investigative field service and produces a workforce schedule." ;
          skos:example "A high-priority claim triggers scheduling a field service agent to gather evidence." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12678
ex:P12678 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DefectivePart
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Requesting receipt of a defective part for further investigation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12678" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAcquisition (inlined): the organization obtains a part it did not previously hold. Operations category, so the defective part is a Material Entity participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not an ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Request and receive defective part" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains a defective part for further investigation." ;
          skos:example "The warranty team requests and receives the failed component from the customer." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12708
ex:P12708 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnedProduct
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityStandard
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnedPartQualityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implement a checks and balances system to verify that returned parts meet acceptable quality standards to determine appropriate disposition activity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.4.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12708" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges whether returned parts meet quality standards. Returned product is a material input (has participant); the quality standard is a directive input." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine quality of controlled part" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input returned products and a quality standard and produces a returned-part quality assessment used to determine the appropriate disposition." ;
          skos:example "An inspector grades returned parts against the quality standard before disposition." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12721
ex:P12721 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000595 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HazardousMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning, conducting, and tracking shipment of hazardous materials." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "12721" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000595 (Act of Cargo Transportation): the payload (hazardous material) changes location. Hazardous material is a definitional material input/payload." ;
          rdfs:label "Ship hazardous material" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Cargo Transportation that moves a portion of hazardous material from one location to another under controlled, tracked conditions." ;
          skos:example "A licensed carrier transports drums of spent solvent from a plant to a treatment facility with manifest tracking." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12722
ex:P12722 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GovernmentReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing and distributing government reports." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "12722" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatoryAuthorityRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting, an Act of Representative Communication). Descriptive output (ex:GovernmentReport). Regulatory authority is the recipient participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide government reporting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares and distributes a government report accounting for asset end-of-life and waste activities to a regulatory authority." ;
          skos:example "An environmental compliance officer files the annual hazardous-waste generation report with the regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12771
ex:P12771 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12772
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12773
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12776
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning regulatory activities related to managing industry requirements. Train employees on regulatory requirements. Records for the appropriate regulatory agencies must be maintained and the new product process must be approved by the appropriate regulatory body before it is published to the organization. The submission lifecycle - i.e. creation, review, and approval of the submission and its components must be managed in a collaborative fashion." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12771" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:IntellectualPropertyManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatoryAuthorityRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded coordinating data-management occurrent (creation/review/approval of submissions) so its three tasks have a partonomy parent; regulatory-authority participation is definitional. Output is a Descriptive ICE (the maintained record)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage regulatory requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as input regulatory requirement data and has as output a regulatory record maintaining the organization's regulatory submissions, and that has as process parts employee training, record maintenance, and submission-lifecycle management." ;
          skos:example "A regulatory affairs team manages the creation, review, and approval lifecycle of a product's regulatory submissions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12772
ex:P12772 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000234 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting training and impart learning to existing and new employees. Training will relate to the most recent/enforced regulations of the business to meet Manage regulatory requirements [12771]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12772" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses CCO cco:ont00000234 (Act of Training): knowledge is imparted from one Agent to others. The training content is regulatory requirement data (input). Also asserts the redundant explicit anchor rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): cco:ont00000234 Act of Training is a Planned Act in the pinned CCO closure, but the standalone Gate-C SHACL check (S2/S5) cannot see that cco→cco chain, so the anchor is made explicit per the house-style verify-before-assert pattern." ;
          rdfs:label "Train employees on appropriate regulatory requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training in which knowledge of the most recent enforced regulations is imparted to existing and new employees." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer trains staff on the latest enforced industry regulations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12773
ex:P12773 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying steps and procedures to manage and regularly update the records for regulatory agencies. Updates will be made to safety procedures, identity and access management, software tools and applications, internal accessibility policies, internal quality parameters, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12773" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the maintained record). Regulatory authority is the agency for which records are kept (comment-level)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain records for regulatory agencies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as output an updated regulatory record kept current for the appropriate regulatory agencies." ;
          skos:example "A records team regularly updates the regulatory-agency submission archive." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12776
ex:P12776 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine and follow the timely input and update of regulatory information by assessing reforms, regulatory policies, and guidelines." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12776" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is a Descriptive ICE (the maintained submission record)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage regulatory submission life cycle" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that has as input regulatory requirement data and has as output a regulatory record reflecting the timely input and update of regulatory submission information." ;
          skos:example "A regulatory team tracks reforms and updates the submission record on time." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12840
ex:P12840 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000379 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryBody
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryIncidentReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Notifying all stakeholders, legal, and industry regulatory bodies of the incidents and risks related to a return or recall, if needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12840" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000379 (Act of Representative Communication): reporting asserts and transfers a truth-committing report ICE to recipients. The incident report is the definitional output and the regulatory body a definitional participant (recipient)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report incidents and risks to regulatory bodies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Representative Communication in which an Agent transfers a regulatory incident report concerning return- or recall-related incidents and risks to regulatory bodies and other stakeholders." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer files a mandatory safety-incident notice with the industry regulator following a recall." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12869
ex:P12869 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelationshipData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelationshipAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ascertaining how the business entity relates to all levels of government. Identify areas that needs further growth and resources to foster those relationships." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12869" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates and judges the state of government relationships. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: descriptive output (relationship assessment) agrees with the appraisal genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input relationship data and has as output a relationship assessment describing how the organization relates to all levels of government." ;
          skos:example "A government-affairs team rates the strength of the firm's ties to local, regional, and national government." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12870
ex:P12870 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExecutivePersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExecutiveAppointment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assigning executive level resources to manage, grow, and drive relationships with government bodies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12870" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ExecutiveRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning) because appointing assigns a prescriptive responsibility; its output (executive appointment) is a Directive ICE. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: directive output agrees with the planning/formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Appoint responsible executives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an executive appointment prescribing the executive-level resource assigned to manage and drive relationships with government bodies, and has executive personnel as participant." ;
          skos:example "A CEO assigns a VP of Government Affairs to own the relationship with a regulatory ministry." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12871
ex:P12871 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelationshipData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelationshipStatusReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing current relationships with government bodies and entities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12871" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (Act of Information Processing): ongoing analysis of current government relationships yielding a descriptive status report. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: descriptive output agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input relationship data and has as output a relationship status report describing the current state of relationships with government bodies." ;
          skos:example "A liaison reviews recent interactions and reports the health of each government relationship quarterly." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12872
ex:P12872 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Advisor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AdvisoryInput
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Garnering internal advice from an informal group in order to successfully maintain and advance relationships." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "12872" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:AdvisorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): an ICE (advisory input) is transferred from one Agent (the internal advisor) to another. The advisors are internal personnel; modeled as participants via ex:Advisor." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive input from internal advisors" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that has as input advisory input transferred from internal advisors to the organization in order to maintain and advance government relationships, and has an advisor as participant." ;
          skos:example "A government-affairs lead solicits guidance from an internal advisory committee before a policy push." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12873
ex:P12873 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Advisor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AdvisoryInput
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Garnering third party advice from an informal group in order to successfully maintain and advance relationships." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "12873" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:AdvisorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): advisory input is transferred from an external Agent to the organization. Distinguished from 12.2.1.4 only by the advisor being third-party." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive input from external advisors" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that has as input advisory input transferred from third-party advisors to the organization in order to maintain and advance government relationships, and has an advisor as participant." ;
          skos:example "A firm retains an external lobbying advisor whose recommendations feed its government-relations plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12874
ex:P12874 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GovernmentBody
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Meeting with government heads and representatives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "12874" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:GovernmentBodyRole ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F false-friend): previously cco:ont00000144 'Act of Meeting', whose verified CCO definition is 'An Act of Association wherein two or more PERSONS assemble for some common purpose' -- Persons-restricted. The asserted participant ex:GovernmentBody is an Organization (subClassOf cco:ont00001180), not a Person, so Act of Meeting does not genuinely fit; it is the same Persons defect this module already rejects for cco:ont00000168 'Act of Interpersonal Relationship' (a sibling of Act of Meeting under Act of Association carrying the same Persons restriction). The CCO Persons restriction is a skos annotation, not an OWL participant axiom, so the class stayed satisfiable at Gate D -- which is exactly why Gate F must catch it. Re-anchored to ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (=> cco:ont00000433 'Act of Association', whose definition unites an Agent with 'some other Agent', i.e. Organizations are admissible), mirroring the sibling relationship acts in this group (P12875, P12881). No definitional informational output; any minutes are typical, not necessary." ;
          rdfs:label "Liaise with authorities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Relationship Management in which representatives of the organization liaise with government heads and representatives in order to advance government relationships, and which has a government body as participant." ;
          skos:example "A government-affairs director liaises with a ministry's representatives to discuss a pending regulation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12875
ex:P12875 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Engaging government, regulatory, or industry agencies to establish relationships. Analyze steps and requirements necessary for inclusion, if needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12875" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatoryAuthorityRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (an Act of Association). Any analysis of inclusion requirements is a sub-step, not a definitional informational output, so it is recorded here rather than as a someValuesFrom restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish relationships with agencies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Relationship Management in which the organization engages government, regulatory, or industry agencies in order to establish a relationship, and which has a regulatory authority as participant." ;
          skos:example "A compliance team formally registers with a quasi-governmental regulator to gain recognized standing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12876
ex:P12876 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Auditor
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AuditInquiry
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Cooperating with auditors regarding potential or ongoing inquiries." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12876" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:AuditorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): the organization transfers responsive information in reply to an auditor's inquiry. The audit inquiry is the definitional input ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Respond to audit inquiries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that has as input an audit inquiry and in which the organization cooperates with auditors regarding potential or ongoing inquiries, having an auditor as participant." ;
          skos:example "A finance team supplies documentation in response to a regulator's audit inquiry." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12877
ex:P12877 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ContactRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Keeping a repository of documents that contain information about the network of partners, prospects and customers. Keep records up-to-date with routine reviews and modify as needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12877" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing: input ICEs are received, manipulated, or stored). 'Maintain' here is record-keeping of informational ICEs, NOT cco:ont00000950 'Act of Maintenance' (which modifies Material Artifacts). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: descriptive output (contact records) agrees with the information-processing genus. Also considered cco:ont00000438 'Act of Official Documentation' (verified def: 'An Act of Declarative Communication in which an Agent records some information for official use by ANOTHER Agent') but retained cco:ont00000366: this node is INTERNAL record maintenance -- keeping the organization's own contact repository current through routine reviews -- not declarative documentation prepared for official use by another agent, so 438's declarative-communication differentia does not fit (a themed false friend)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain documentation of contacts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as output contact records and that stores and updates documents describing the organization's network of partners, prospects, and customers." ;
          skos:example "A relationship manager keeps a CRM repository of agency contacts current through routine reviews." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12878
ex:P12878 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QuasiGovernmentBody
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MeetingRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring regular interaction between business entity and quasi-government bodies in order to maintain established relationships. Collect and record meeting data for further analysis and use." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "12878" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:QuasiGovernmentBodyRole ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F false-friend, same Persons defect as 12.2.1.6): previously cco:ont00000144 'Act of Meeting' ('two or more PERSONS assemble'), but the asserted participant ex:QuasiGovernmentBody is an Organization, not a Person -- the Persons restriction is violated, contradicting the module's own rejection of the Persons-restricted Act of Interpersonal Relationship. Re-anchored to ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (=> cco:ont00000433 'Act of Association', Organizations admissible), consistent with the 'plan and manage ... interaction ... to maintain established relationships' reading. OUTPUT corrected (Phase-3 category confusion): the previous has-output filler ex:RelationshipData is a Descriptive INPUT ICE ('describes the current state of a relationship', used as has-input in P12869/P12871/P12880); the artifact this act produces by 'collect and record meeting data' is a meeting record, so the definitional output is the distinct ex:MeetingRecord (recording is definitional per the source, so it is retained as a someValuesFrom restriction rather than demoted)." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and manage meetings" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Relationship Management in which the organization interacts regularly with quasi-government bodies to maintain established relationships, has as output a meeting record capturing the meeting data collected, and has a quasi-government body as participant." ;
          skos:example "A liaison holds quarterly meetings with a quasi-governmental body and logs the discussion for later analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12879
ex:P12879 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TradeOrIndustryGroup
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkRequirementsSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the requirements to enter in to an agreement with trade or industry agencies. Discover what activities or processes can be conducted to provide the best mutual outcome." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12879" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:TradeOrIndustryGroupRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): the deliverable is a prescriptive specification of the requirements to enter an agreement (a Directive ICE). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: directive output agrees with the planning/formulation genus, despite the surface verb 'evaluate'." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate the requirements for strategic relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a work requirements specification prescribing the requirements to enter into an agreement with trade or industry agencies, and which has a trade or industry group as participant." ;
          skos:example "A partnerships team documents the membership and participation requirements needed to join an industry consortium." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12880
ex:P12880 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelationshipData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelationshipStatusReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing current relationships with trade and industry groups. Ensure that the partnership in successful and make modifications where needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "12880" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (Act of Information Processing): ongoing analysis of partnership success yielding a descriptive status report. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: descriptive output agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor the success of the partnerships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input relationship data and has as output a relationship status report describing the current state and success of relationships with trade or industry groups." ;
          skos:example "A partnerships lead reviews engagement metrics and reports whether each industry-group relationship is on track." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12881
ex:P12881 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TradeOrIndustryGroup
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing additional information or inclusion for third party trade or industry entities; or changing existing parameters to modify the current relationship. Communicate and execute changes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "12.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "12881" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:TradeOrIndustryGroupRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfRelationshipManagement (an Act of Association). 'Communicate and execute changes' is a sub-step; no single informational ICE is definitional, so I/O is recorded in this comment rather than as a someValuesFrom restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Extend or change the relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Relationship Management in which the organization extends or modifies an existing relationship with a trade or industry group by providing additional inclusion or changing its parameters, and which has a trade or industry group as participant." ;
          skos:example "A partnerships team upgrades the firm's membership tier in an industry association and notifies the counterpart." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P12974
ex:P12974 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HedgingStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking an investment position to offset exposure to certain risks. This may include purchasing opposite of the organization's position in the marketplace, using derivatives transactions, or futures contracts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "12974" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:TreasuryManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output). Reuses shared ex:HedgingStrategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop risk management/hedging strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a hedging strategy prescribing positions taken to offset exposure to financial risks." ;
          skos:example "The risk committee adopts a strategy to hedge 80 percent of forecast FX exposure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13131
ex:P13131 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000970 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AssetPart
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Facility
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Demolishing and securing asset and resulting parts/debris." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.10.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "13131" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000970 (Act of Artifact Modification): the asset's physical structure is destructively altered. Asset is a definitional material input; debris/parts the material output." ;
          rdfs:label "Demolish and secure" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Artifact Modification that demolishes an asset and secures the resulting parts and debris." ;
          skos:example "A demolition crew razes a disused warehouse and fences off the rubble." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13132
ex:P13132 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDisposition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RealProperty
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing remediation or restoration activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.10.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "13132" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F, false-friend) from cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance) to ex:ActOfDisposition. CCO Act of Maintenance is 'An Act of Artifact Modification in which a MATERIAL ARTIFACT is modified in order to preserve or restore one or more of its DESIGNED Qualities or Functions', but the only definitional participant here is ex:RealProperty, which the slice anchors at obo:BFO_0000040 (a material entity, NOT a Material Artifact) precisely because raw/contaminated land is not a designed artifact and has no designed Qualities. Remediation restores ENVIRONMENTAL qualities of land, not designed artifact qualities, so the Maintenance genus (and its artifact-hood presupposition) is violated by its own input. Anchored under ex:ActOfDisposition, consistent with its abandonment-parent ex:P21582, whose endpoint is making the site safe/compliant. The ex:RealProperty filler is kept as obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), not the artifact-presupposing maintenance has-input frame." ;
          rdfs:label "Restore site" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Disposition that performs remediation or restoration activities on a site to make it environmentally safe and compliant as part of an asset's end-of-life." ;
          skos:example "A remediation contractor removes contaminated soil and re-grades a former tank farm." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13133
ex:P13133 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AssetHandoverDocumentation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supporting handover to new operator or landowner. Include proper documentation on asset history and current state to enable orderly transition." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.10.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "13133" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): existing records are compiled into a descriptive handover package. Descriptive output -> matches genus (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare handover to new operator or landowner" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that compiles asset history and current-state information into handover documentation enabling an orderly transition to a new operator or landowner." ;
          skos:example "A site team assembles as-built drawings, inspection history, and a condition report for the incoming landowner." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13169
ex:P13169 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetitorData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PricingAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing marketing objectives, consumer demand, product attributes, competitors' pricing, and economic trends to determine optimum prices for the set of products and services that the company offers or intends to offer by delivering maximum ROI." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "13169" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PricingAnalysis is Descriptive, agreeing with the Information-Processing genus. ex:CompetitorData and ex:MarketData are definitional inputs (the analysis is over competitors' pricing and economic trends)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct pricing analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines marketing objectives, consumer demand, competitor pricing, and economic trends and produces a pricing analysis recommending optimum prices." ;
          skos:example "An analyst models demand and rival prices to recommend optimum price points for a product set." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13289
ex:P13289 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOption
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine impacts of elements such as staffing, skills, training, new markets, technology, or policies within operating model which needs change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "13289" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'determine impacts ... which need change' discerns and registers affected elements." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify implications for key operating model business elements that require change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns which operating-model elements require change under a strategic option and produces a strategic-option analysis of those implications." ;
          skos:example "An analyst lists the staffing and policy changes a candidate strategy would force on the operating model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13290
ex:P13290 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOption
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining key factors for technology ROI, benefits, architecture, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "13290" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'determining key factors for technology ROI, benefits, architecture' discerns and registers the technology implications of an option." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify implications for key technology aspects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the key technology factors implicated by a strategic option and produces a strategic-option analysis of technology implications." ;
          skos:example "An architect identifies the ROI and architecture impacts of a proposed strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P13482
ex:P13482 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerInquiry
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InquiryAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing various requests and inquiries from customers regarding products/services. Provide answers and offerings to satisfy the customer's needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "13482" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerInquiryManagementCapability ,
                                ex:CustomerServiceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses shared ex:ActOfAnalysis. Output is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze problems, requests, and inquiries" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a customer inquiry and has as output an inquiry analysis describing the customer's need and candidate answers." ;
          skos:example "An agent examines an inbound request and characterizes what product information the customer needs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14007
ex:P14007 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Renegotiating the terms of a loan agreement in order to recoup money from a default account." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "14007" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DefaultAccountManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: the definitional output is the revised agreement terms (Directive ICE). The defaulting Customer participates." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform recovery workout" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that renegotiates the terms of a loan agreement with a defaulting debtor and prescribes revised repayment terms as a financial procedure to recoup the debt." ;
          skos:example "A workout specialist renegotiates a defaulted loan into a restructured repayment schedule." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14057
ex:P14057 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProfitabilityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the revenue, profits, and losses incurred by each unit within the organization that produces profit." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "14057" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (cco:ont00000853): a per-unit profitability statement. Genus ex:ActOfAccounting." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform profit center accounting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that determines the revenue, profit, and loss of each profit-producing unit and produces a profitability analysis of those units." ;
          skos:example "Computing each business unit's monthly profit and loss." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14074
ex:P14074 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:GeneralLedger
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsolidatedFinancialStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Carrying out activities associated with legal and management consolidation. Legal consolidation can include currency conversion, balance carry forward, and consolidation of journal entries. Management consolidation can include reporting on financials on a reporting cycle basis to gauge the performance of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "14074" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Accounting (not Reporting): the act combines and converts ledger data rather than merely conveying it; its output feeds the reporting acts of 9.3.4." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform legal and management consolidation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that performs legal and management consolidation - currency conversion, balance carry-forward, and journal-entry consolidation - to produce consolidated financial statements." ;
          skos:example "Consolidating foreign-subsidiary ledgers into the group reporting currency." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14075
ex:P14075 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TaxStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising a method to minimize payroll tax liability by means of allowances, deductions, exclusions or exemptions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "14075" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (output is a Directive ICE) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: devising a method/plan produces a prescription." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop tax plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises a tax strategy prescribing how to minimize payroll-tax liability through allowances, deductions, exclusions, or exemptions." ;
          skos:example "Designing a withholding strategy that lawfully reduces the firm's payroll-tax burden." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14079
ex:P14079 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InvestmentPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing and instituting principles that the organization ill use in making investments." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "14079" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:TreasuryManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFormulation (Directive output). Reuses shared ex:InvestmentPolicy." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish investment policy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an investment policy prescribing the principles the organization will follow in making investments." ;
          skos:example "The investment committee adopts a policy capping single-issuer exposure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14090
ex:P14090 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SanctionedPartyList
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SanctionedPartyScreeningResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the approved list of parties for engaging in international trade in order to ensure the safety of the organization's business transactions. Examine agents that have been granted legal rights to engage in global trade and their credentials." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "14090" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) because the act evaluates and judges parties against an approved list; its output is a Descriptive ICE (a clearance judgement), satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Screen sanctioned party list" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a sanctioned party list and has as output a sanctioned-party screening result judging whether the parties to a prospective transaction are cleared to engage in international trade." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer screens both counterparties of a shipment against the denied-parties list before release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14092
ex:P14092 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductClassification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Systematically categorizing products/services for their suitability to international trade. Create classes and categories for demarcating the types of products suitable for international trade. Study requisite national and international standards and the adherence of the organization's portfolio of offerings to these." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "14092" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (subClassOf cco:ont00000366) because categorizing offerings against standards processes input information into a classification ICE; the Descriptive output satisfies the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Classify products" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines an organization's products and services against national and international trade standards and has as output a product trade classification." ;
          skos:example "A trade analyst assigns HS tariff codes to each item in the product catalogue." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14093
ex:P14093 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAccounting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DutyCalculation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Computing the excise duty to be paid during international trade." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "14093" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAccounting (subClassOf cco:ont00000366) because computing duty owed is a financial calculation that processes input information into a numeric Descriptive ICE, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Calculate duty" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Accounting that computes the excise duty payable on an international-trade transaction and has as output a duty calculation." ;
          skos:example "A customs broker computes the excise duty owed on a consignment before clearance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14094
ex:P14094 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomsInformation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Communicating with the customs department to ensure fluid compliance. Share pertinent information mandated by law with the government agency that controls and collects the duties levied for the international exchange of products/services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "14094" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatorRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): an ICE (legally-mandated trade particulars) is transferred from one Agent to another. The Regulatory Authority is the definitional recipient; customs information is the definitional transferred ICE. Explicit rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) added so the act-anchor chain is visible to the standalone SHACL run (ont00000402 is a CCO subclass of ont00000228, but the closure is not merged for Gate C)." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate with customs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which an organization transfers customs information to the government customs authority in order to ensure compliance with international-trade law." ;
          skos:example "Filing the mandated electronic declaration with the national customs agency for a shipment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14095
ex:P14095 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TradeDocumentation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Documenting and recording the trade processes while making transactions, noting the description, quality, number, transportation medium, indemnity, and inspection." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "14095" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting (subClassOf cco:ont00000366) because documenting/recording a trade gives a detailed account that processes input information into a Descriptive ICE, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Document trade" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that records the particulars of a trade transaction -- including description, quality, quantity, transport medium, indemnity, and inspection -- and has as output trade documentation." ;
          skos:example "A logistics clerk records the bill of lading, packing list, and inspection certificate for a shipment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14096
ex:P14096 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TradePreferenceDocumentation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing global trade under preference, which allows the organization to import/export products at a lower or nil rate of customs duty and/or levy charge." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "14096" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfReporting (subClassOf cco:ont00000366): preparing trade-under-preference paperwork records eligibility, processing input information into a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process trade preferences" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares the documentation establishing a shipment's eligibility for trade under preference and has as output trade preference documentation." ;
          skos:example "Preparing a certificate of origin to claim a preferential tariff under a free-trade agreement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14098
ex:P14098 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LetterOfCredit
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a document assuring that a seller will receive payment when certain delivery conditions are met. (If the buyer is unable to make payment on the purchase, a bank covers the outstanding amount.)" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "14098" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (inlined, subClassOf cco:ont00000511, Act of Planning) because creating a letter of credit composes a Directive ICE that prescribes a payment guarantee, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare letter of credit" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a letter of credit prescribing the conditions under which a bank guarantees payment to a seller upon fulfilment of specified delivery conditions." ;
          skos:example "A bank issues a documentary letter of credit guaranteeing payment to an exporter on presentation of shipping documents." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14187
ex:P14187 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditScoringHistory
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing past credit scores to determine the if a line of credit will be extended to potential customers. This could also include extending additional credit to existing accounts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "14187" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Analysis (information processing of input ICEs into a descriptive judgement)." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze credit scoring history" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines a customer's past credit-scoring history and produces a credit assessment indicating whether credit should be extended." ;
          skos:example "An analyst reviews a customer's credit-score history to decide on extending a line of credit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14188
ex:P14188 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditScoreRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning credit score requirements based on established credit policies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.2.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "14188" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning, cco:ont00000511 family) and output changed from ex:FinancialForecast to the Directive ex:CreditScoreRequirementSpecification. The source text is 'Planning credit score requirements based on established credit policies' -- the act sets/determines the future credit-score REQUIREMENTS (thresholds an applicant must meet), which is prescriptive (a requirement prescribes), not a descriptive projection. The previous model leaned on the label word 'Forecast' to give genus=ActOfAnalysis + output=FinancialForecast, but a credit-score requirement is not an income/cash-flow forecast, so that output ICE did not denote what the process produces. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: the description verb is 'planning' and the artifact is a requirement spec -> Directive output and a planning/formulation genus. REJECTED reading: that the act merely projects future demand for scoring (which would keep ActOfAnalysis with a Descriptive ICE); the verbatim verb 'Planning' and the prescriptive nature of a 'requirement' refute it." ;
          rdfs:label "Forecast credit scoring requirement" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the credit-score requirements applicants must meet, based on established credit policies, and produces a credit-score requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "Setting the minimum credit scores required for next year's lending program from the firm's credit policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14189
ex:P14189 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Formulating strategic options that create opportunities for the sustenance and prosperity of the business in the long run. Go beyond business longevity to consider alternate strategies that allow the organizations preservation of vitality over time. Earmark resources and target processes, the former of which are dedicated to the absorption of sustainable practices in the latter." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "14189" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a sustainability strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop sustainability strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes strategies for the long-run sustenance and vitality of the business and produces a business strategy for sustainability." ;
          skos:example "A sustainability office formulates the firm's long-term ESG strategy and resource commitments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14193
ex:P14193 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionProcessSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the scheme of processing inventory into finished products/services. This includes the use of raw materials, machinery, skill sets, and knowledge to create new offerings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "14193" ;
          rdfs:label "Define production process" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a production process specification describing the scheme for processing inventory into finished products." ;
          skos:example "Process engineers document the routing that converts raw material into the finished good." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14194
ex:P14194 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionWorkplaceLayoutPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the floor plans for the processing facility that is meant for delivering finished products/services. Identify the totality of infrastructure needed for using this space in the manufacturing process, including machinery, factory floors, offices, and furniture." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.1.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "14194" ;
          rdfs:label "Define production workplace layout and infrastructure" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a production workplace layout plan specifying the floor plan and infrastructure of a processing facility." ;
          skos:example "Industrial engineers lay out the new line's floor plan and equipment placement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14196
ex:P14196 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionBalanceAndControlScheme
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining an equitable volume for the production of products/services that adheres to an equilibrium value, and creating a scheme of control for processing items. Create schematics for systematically planning, coordinating, and directing the manufacturing activities in line with the production balance determined." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "14196" ;
          rdfs:label "Define production balance and control" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a production balance and control scheme prescribing an equilibrium production volume and the control of processing items." ;
          skos:example "Operations sets the level-loaded production volume and the kanban control rules to maintain it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14197
ex:P14197 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing strategies for the optimization of processes and the improvement of functional areas in order to improve the bottom line. Create a road map of decision choices that would allow the organization to continuously enhance process efficiencies and advance performance standards." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "14197" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a continuous-improvement strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop lean/continuous improvement strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a roadmap for continuous optimization of processes and functional areas and produces a business strategy for continuous improvement." ;
          skos:example "A lean office formulates the multi-year continuous-improvement roadmap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14208
ex:P14208 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16598
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16599
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the corpus of data relating all customers acquired over time. Manage the storage, maintenance, access, revision, and usage of all data on customers. Ensure its security, and determine legitimate use cases that are beneficial to the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "14208" ;
          rdfs:comment "Process container. Though phrased 'Manage', APQC decomposes it into concrete bounded information-processing tasks (collect/merge, de-duplicate); modeled as a process whose tasks are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage customer master data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that maintains an organization's corpus of customer data and has as output customer master data." ;
          skos:example "A data team consolidates and cleanses the customer master record set." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14209
ex:P14209 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PartnerMasterData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the repository of data relating to the organization's partners/alliances over time. Store, maintain, access, revise, and use all data on partners/alliances. Manage data. Ensure its security. Determine legitimate use cases that are beneficial to the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "14209" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): the act stores, maintains, and revises partner data. Modeled as a process (not a capability) because it names a bounded, repeatable data-maintenance act." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage sales partner/alliance master data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that maintains an organization's repository of sales partner and alliance data and has as output partner/alliance master data." ;
          skos:example "A data steward updates and secures the partner master records." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P14210
ex:P14210 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supervising the interest paid or received by the organization. Arrange and supervise interest rate swap transactions to manage exposure to fluctuations in interest rates. Or attain a marginally lower rate of interest than could be gained through a swap." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "14210" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording yields a transaction record (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Process and oversee interest rate transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which interest-rate swap or related transactions are arranged and recorded to manage interest-rate exposure." ;
          skos:example "Treasury enters a pay-fixed interest-rate swap and books the trade." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16379
ex:P16379 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16380
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16381
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16382
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16383
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessGovernanceFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and managing the organization's approach to governing business process management. Establish and manage tools to support the governance process. Assign ownership for all business processes. Perform activities to administer the governing process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16379" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessProcessManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Reality-layer occurrent for APQC 13.1.1. Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation because its definitional output is a Directive ICE (the governance framework). Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and maintain process management governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and maintains an organization's approach to governing business process management and produces a process governance framework." ;
          skos:example "A BPM office stands up and maintains the charter, tooling, and ownership model that govern process management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16380
ex:P16380 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BPMGovernanceLeader
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessGovernanceFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining and managing the methodology for administering business process management (BPM). Define the method for setting standards and priorities for BPM efforts. Identify BPM governance leaders. Define BPM project participants' roles." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16380" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:BPMGovernanceLeaderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the output (the governance approach/methodology) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage governance approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that articulates the methodology for administering business process management and produces a process governance framework specifying standards, priorities, and participant roles." ;
          skos:example "A BPM lead documents how BPM standards are set and names the governance leaders and their roles." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16381
ex:P16381 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BPMToolTemplate
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Instituting, organizing, and maintaining the upkeep of the techniques used for business process management (BPM). Create and maintain templates of BPM tools that can be readily implemented, including process engine, business analytics, content management, and collaboration tools." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16381" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (a BPM tool template) is a Directive ICE prescribing a ready-to-implement tool configuration." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and maintain process tools and templates" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that institutes and maintains the techniques of business process management and produces reusable BPM tool templates." ;
          skos:example "A team builds and curates reusable process-engine and analytics templates for the BPM toolkit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16382
ex:P16382 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessOwner
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assigning resources (employees) ownership of tasks. These include the responsibility of identifying, analyzing, and improving business processes in order to meet the goals and objectives such as increasing profits and performance, reducing costs, and accelerating schedules." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16382" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ProcessOwnerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): assigning ownership confers a Role on an Agent; it is neither analysis nor the formulation of a standalone strategy. The conferred role is ex:ProcessOwnerRole, borne by ex:ProcessOwner." ;
          rdfs:label "Assign and support process ownership" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that allocates responsibility for business processes to employees, conferring the process owner role and producing a role-definition specification." ;
          skos:example "A BPM governance board names accountable owners for each end-to-end process." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16383
ex:P16383 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessGovernanceFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing and executing activities for governing business processes. Execute activities that encourage participation, accountability, transparency, responsiveness, equity and inclusiveness, etc. within the business processes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16383" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation: the act enacts the governance framework (a Directive ICE input) rather than producing a new ICE; the framework is a definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform process governance activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that carries out the activities prescribed by an organization's process governance framework." ;
          skos:example "Governance staff run the recurring review and accountability rituals defined in the BPM charter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16384
ex:P16384 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16385
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16386
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining and organizing the structural composition of business processes. Design, establish, and administer the framework. Identify any cross-functional processes that are mandatory for achieving business excellence." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16384" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessProcessManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (the process framework) is a Directive ICE. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage process frameworks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that designs and organizes the structural composition of an organization's business processes and produces a process framework." ;
          skos:example "An enterprise-architecture team designs the process framework spanning strategy, operations, and enterprise management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16385
ex:P16385 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and managing the framework that outlines the required business processes of the organization, key elements, and how they should interact. Institute strategy infrastructure and product, operations, and enterprise management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16385" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: its definitional output (the process framework) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and maintain process framework" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and maintains the framework outlining an organization's required business processes, their key elements, and their interactions, and produces a process framework." ;
          skos:example "Architects publish the canonical process framework that all functions must align to." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16386
ex:P16386 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CrossFunctionalProcessRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the different functional areas working on the same project or goal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16386" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense): the act enumerates cross-functional processes; its definitional output is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify cross-functional processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the business processes spanning multiple functional areas and produces a cross-functional process register." ;
          skos:example "An analyst flags which processes require coordination across sales, finance, and operations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16387
ex:P16387 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16388
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16389
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16390
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16391
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21452
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining and establishing the business processes of the organization. Scope, analyze, map, and publish processes for the employees who may require it." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16387" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessProcessManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: defining processes establishes prescriptive process definitions (Directive ICEs). Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that outlines and establishes an organization's business processes by scoping, analyzing, mapping, and publishing them." ;
          skos:example "A process team scopes, analyzes, models, and publishes the procurement process set." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16388
ex:P16388 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessScopeStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the extent and limits of business processes. Define the range and diversity of all the set of activities and tasks that, once completed, will accomplish an organizational goal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16388" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: a scope statement is a Directive ICE that bounds the process." ;
          rdfs:label "Scope processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the extent and limits of a business process and produces a process scope statement." ;
          skos:example "A BPM analyst writes the scope statement bounding the order-to-cash process." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16389
ex:P16389 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20140
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing and examining the set of activities and tasks that, once completed, will accomplish an organizational goal. Create a business process model that captures how a business process works and how individuals from different groups work together to achieve a business goal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16389" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: it manipulates input information into a descriptive understanding (process analysis / process model). Its child Identify published best practices is a process part." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the activities and tasks of a business process and produces a process analysis and a process model representing how the process works." ;
          skos:example "An analyst examines the as-is hiring process and produces a process model and analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16390
ex:P16390 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining what a business entity does, who is responsible, to what standard a business process should be completed, and how the success of a business process can be determined. Identify processes, gather information gathering, interview participants, map processes, and perform analysis." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16390" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (information processing): mapping and documenting yields a Descriptive ICE (the process model). Interviewing/mapping are method sub-steps, not separate processes." ;
          rdfs:label "Model and document processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that gathers information about a business process and produces a process model documenting what is done, who is responsible, and to what standard." ;
          skos:example "An analyst interviews participants and maps the procure-to-pay process into a documented model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16391
ex:P16391 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Disclosing the information available on business processes. Ensure the availability of the information regarding the business processes to all process team members, business stakeholders, and process owners. Use BPM software, as well as business process diagrams and documents that help depict the required information." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16391" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): publishing transfers an ICE (the process model) from authors to recipients. The process model is a definitional input that is disseminated. cco:ont00000402 is VERIFIED in the §6 verified-core-terms table above (label 'Act of Communication'; def 'A Planned Act in which some Information Content Entity is transferred from some Agent to Another'; parent cco:ont00000228 Planned Act); the explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent gives Gate C the Act anchor without the CCO closure." ;
          rdfs:label "Publish processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transfers documented business-process information to process team members, stakeholders, and owners." ;
          skos:example "A BPM team posts the approved process models to the intranet for all stakeholders." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16392
ex:P16392 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16393
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16394
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16395
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating and handling the performance of business processes. Provide training to process owners. Support the execution of business processes. Measure and report the performance of the business processes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16392" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessProcessManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): this bounded administration cycle aggregates heterogeneous children (training, support, measurement) with no single definitional ICE output, so no has-output restriction is asserted; the children are process parts. DELIBERATE R5 DIVERGENCE FROM SIBLINGS (auditable): the parallel 'Manage X' GROUP nodes -- 16378 'Manage business processes', 17471 'Manage enterprise quality', 11073 'Manage KM', and the 13.2 Manage portfolio/program/project nodes -- are modeled as standing Organization Capabilities (cco:ont00000568) because each is an open-ended enterprise FUNCTION with no natural terminus. P16392 'Manage process performance' is NOT a group node but a 13.1.4 sub-process that, on each performance period (e.g. quarter), runs a bounded train->support->measure-and-report administration cycle with an identifiable begin (period open) and end (period KPI report issued); it passes R5 as a repeatable bounded occurrent and is a proper part of the standing ex:BusinessProcessManagementCapability, which is realized in it. Thus the divergence is intentional: the standing FUNCTION is the capability; the repeatable bounded CYCLE that realizes it is this Planned Act." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage process performance" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that administers the ongoing performance of business processes by training owners, supporting execution, and measuring and reporting performance." ;
          skos:example "Each quarter the BPM office trains owners, supports execution, and reports process KPIs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16393
ex:P16393 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000234 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessOwner
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing training for the employees and process owners that administer the business processes. Design internal training programs or source third party agencies to provide the skills and training necessary." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16393" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ProcessOwnerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000234 (Act of Training): the act imparts skills to Agents. Process owners are definitional participants/recipients. cco:ont00000234 is VERIFIED in the §6 verified-core-terms table above (label 'Act of Training'; def 'A Planned Act in which knowledge, skills or values are imparted from one or more Agents to at least one other Agent'; parent cco:ont00000228 Planned Act) -- its definition (imparting skills to Agents) matches this use." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide process training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training in which process-management knowledge and skills are imparted to the employees and process owners who administer business processes." ;
          skos:example "The BPM office runs a workshop teaching new owners how to monitor their processes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16394
ex:P16394 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assisting and executing the business processes. Use business process execution language (BEPL), which is a standard, executable language for specifying actions within the business processes with the use of web services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16394" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation: supporting execution enacts the defined processes rather than producing an ICE. BPEL is a method detail, not a definitional I/O." ;
          rdfs:label "Support process execution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that assists and carries out the running of an organization's business processes." ;
          skos:example "A BPM support team keeps the automated approval workflows running and unblocks exceptions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16395
ex:P16395 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20141
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and using performance indicators to consider the financial perspective, customer perspective, internal process perspective, and learning perspective of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16395" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring: it tracks performance and yields a Descriptive ICE (the performance report). Performance indicator specifications are a definitional input. Its child Identify additional metrics is a process part." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure and report process performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that uses defined performance indicators to measure business-process performance and produces a process performance report." ;
          skos:example "An analyst publishes a balanced-scorecard report of the hiring process each month." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16397
ex:P16397 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessOwner
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Helping a process owner to identify, analyze, and improve existing business processes within an organization to meet new goals and objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16397" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ProcessOwnerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE the definitional output is a Descriptive ICE (the improvement opportunity assessment), so the genus is information-processing rather than Selection. Process owners are definitional participants." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and select improvement opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns and appraises candidate improvements to existing business processes and produces an improvement opportunity assessment." ;
          skos:example "A facilitator and the process owner surface and rank improvement opportunities for the billing process." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16398
ex:P16398 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing and implementing a systematic approach to help the organization optimize its underlying processes in order to achieve more efficient results. Systematically gather information to clarify issues or problems. Intervene for improvements. Restructure training programs as appropriate to increase effectiveness." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16398" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation: managing an improvement project enacts a systematic optimization approach. Modeled as a single bounded improvement-project act; APQC defers detailed project mechanics to category Manage projects." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage improvement projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that develops and puts into effect a systematic approach for optimizing an organization's underlying processes." ;
          skos:example "A PMO runs a chartered improvement project to streamline the returns process." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16399
ex:P16399 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Persistently implementing activities for improving business processes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16399" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImprovement: each cycle is a repeatable bounded change to a process. The 'persistent/ongoing' framing is realized as many repeatable instances, not a standing function." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform continuous improvement activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that persistently enacts incremental modifications to business processes to raise their performance." ;
          skos:example "A team runs weekly kaizen cycles trimming waste from the fulfillment process." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16402
ex:P16402 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PortfolioStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Instituting the strategy for managing business portfolio. Create a systematic plan that defines the strategy for managing investments, holdings, products, businesses, and brands." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16402" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioManagementCapability ,
                                ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (portfolio strategy) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish portfolio strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a portfolio strategy prescribing how an organization manages its portfolio of investments, holdings, products, businesses, and brands." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio office drafts the strategy governing the firm's brand and investment portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16403
ex:P16403 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PortfolioGovernanceFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the administration of business portfolio of the organization. Create and manage the rules and regulations regarding the business processes in order to identify, select, prioritize, and monitor portfolio components. Include a set of metrics to indicate the health and progress of the portfolio in the most vital area." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16403" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioManagementCapability ,
                                ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (portfolio governance framework) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define portfolio governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a portfolio governance framework prescribing the rules, metrics, and procedures for identifying, selecting, prioritizing, and monitoring portfolio components." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio board defines the governance rules and health metrics for portfolio components." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16404
ex:P16404 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PortfolioStatusReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing and administering the business portfolio of the organization. Monitor all activities related to investments, holdings, products, businesses, and brands by effectively monitoring and supervising these activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16404" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioManagementCapability ,
                                ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring: it tracks portfolio activities over time and yields a Descriptive ICE (the status report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and control portfolio" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that oversees and supervises the activities of an organization's business portfolio and produces a portfolio status report." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio manager tracks investment and brand performance and issues a portfolio status report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16406
ex:P16406 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProgramStructureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Constructing and instituting the framework and approach to manage business programs. Monitor key factors such as governance, alignment with the overall business vision, assurance, and management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16406" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProgramManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (program structure specification) is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish program structure and approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a program structure specification prescribing the framework and approach -- governance, alignment, assurance, and management -- for managing a business program." ;
          skos:example "A program office defines the governance and assurance framework for a transformation program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16407
ex:P16407 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing relationships with stakeholders and partners of the business programs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16407" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProgramManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): relationship management is an organizational act with no single definitional ICE output; the stakeholders/partners are the salient participants." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage program stakeholders and partners" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that manages the relationships with the stakeholders and partners of a business program." ;
          skos:example "A program manager runs the stakeholder and partner engagement cadence for a program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16408
ex:P16408 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering and implementing business programs. Implement and execute programs with the intention of improving an organization's performance. Execute all the individual projects of the program to ensure the desired success." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16408" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProgramManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228): executing the program enacts the program structure rather than producing an ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage program execution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that administers and executes a business program by carrying out its constituent projects." ;
          skos:example "A program manager runs the program's constituent projects to completion." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16409
ex:P16409 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProgramPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating and documenting the performance of business programs. Evaluate the performance of the programs. Create reports on the basis of the analysis. Use performance indicators and metrics such as desired/achieved goals, completion dates, issues and defects, and cost effectiveness." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16409" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProgramManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring: it tracks program performance and yields a Descriptive ICE (the program performance report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and report program performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that evaluates and documents the performance of a business program against its indicators and produces a program performance report." ;
          skos:example "A program office issues the quarterly program performance report against goals and cost-effectiveness." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16411
ex:P16411 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11117
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11118
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11120
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11121
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16412
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21454
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectScopeStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing the horizons of business projects. Identify the objectives of the program, along with the resource requirements. Assess the readiness for the project management approach. Identify methodologies for project management. Obtain funding. Develop performance measures and indicators." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16411" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (project scope statement) is a Directive ICE. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish project scope" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the scope of a business project -- its objectives, resource requirements, and measures -- producing a project scope statement." ;
          skos:example "A project manager fixes the project's objectives, resourcing, and KPIs in a scope statement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16412
ex:P16412 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectResourceRequirementsStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the prerequisites of business projects. Identify the people with appropriate and applicable skills and competencies. Locate resources such as capital, facilities, equipment, material, and information required to accomplish the objectives of a specific project." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16412" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment), NOT cco:ont00001261. Output is the Descriptive ex:ProjectResourceRequirementsStatement (a discernment of prerequisites), agreeing with the information-processing genus per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify project resource requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the people, skills, and resources a project requires and registers them in a project resource requirements statement." ;
          skos:example "A project manager lists the skilled staff, capital, and equipment the project needs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16413
ex:P16413 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11123
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11124
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11125
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11127
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11128
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11129
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20142
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the resources and their roles. Identify IT requirements. Create plans for effective training and communication. Design reward approaches. Plan the launch of project. Deploy the project." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16413" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the definitional output (project plan) is a Directive ICE. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop project plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a project plan prescribing the resources, roles, IT requirements, training, communication, reward approaches, and launch for executing a business project." ;
          skos:example "A project manager assembles the resourcing, training, and launch plans into the project plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16414
ex:P16414 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11131
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11132
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11133
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16415
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16416
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21455
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21456
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing the business projects of the organization. Evaluate the impact of project management. Record and report the status of the project. Manage the project scope. Promote and sustain activities and involvement. Realign and revamp the project management strategy and approach." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16414" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228): executing the project enacts the project plan. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that carries out a business project by evaluating impact, reporting status, managing scope, sustaining involvement, and realigning approach." ;
          skos:example "A project team runs the project to plan, tracking status and adjusting scope as needed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16415
ex:P16415 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectStatusReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recording and documenting the current status and position of the project. Record and report items such as completed tasks, incomplete tasks, planned tasks, and problems faced." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16415" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): recording/documenting status assembles a Descriptive ICE (the project status report). COMPILE-class (kept at 366): the source leads with 'Recording and documenting the current status'; the phrase 'Record and report items such as completed/incomplete/planned tasks' enumerates the CONTENT recorded into the report, not dissemination to a named audience, so it is not a DISSEMINATE reporting act." ;
          rdfs:label "Report the status of project" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that records and documents the current status of a project -- completed, incomplete, and planned tasks and problems -- and produces a project status report." ;
          skos:example "A project manager issues the weekly status report of tasks done, pending, and blocked." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16416
ex:P16416 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectScopeStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining and documenting a list of specific project goals, deliverables, tasks, costs, and deadlines. Use the scope statement to explain the boundaries of the project. Assign responsibilities for team members. Set up procedures for verifying and approving the completed tasks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16416" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: determining-and-documenting the scope composes/maintains a Directive ICE (the shared ex:ProjectScopeStatement)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage project scope" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines and documents the project's goals, deliverables, tasks, costs, and deadlines, maintaining the project scope statement that bounds the project." ;
          skos:example "A project manager keeps the scope statement current as goals and deliverables are confirmed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16417
ex:P16417 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Measuring the performance of a business project against key performance indicators including the project scope, schedule, quality, cost, and risk criteria. Identify any deviations from the plan. Assess the impact of these deviations on the project, as well as on the overall program. Report results to key stakeholders." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16417" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProjectManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring: it tracks project performance against indicators and yields a Descriptive ICE (the project performance report). Performance indicators are a typical input; stakeholders are the reporting audience." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and report project performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that measures a project's performance against its key performance indicators, identifies deviations from plan, and produces a project performance report for stakeholders." ;
          skos:example "A project manager reports schedule and cost variances against the baseline to stakeholders." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16418
ex:P16418 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Settling each contract. Close each contract applicable to the project or project phase. Finalize all activities across all of the process groups in order to formally close the project or a project phase." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16418" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ProjectManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): a bounded closing/finalization act (settling contracts, finalizing activities) with an identifiable end and no single definitional ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Close projects" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that settles the project's contracts and finalizes all activities to formally close a business project or project phase." ;
          skos:example "A project manager closes out all contracts and formally ends the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16439
ex:P16439 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16440
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16441
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16442
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16443
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16444
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseRiskPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating an agenda for the rules and regulations of enterprise risk that deal with hazardous, financial, operational, and strategic risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16439" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseRiskManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation (Planning): its definitional output is a Directive ICE (the enterprise risk policy/framework)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish the enterprise risk framework and policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the enterprise-risk rules and regulations governing hazard, financial, operational, and strategic risks and produces enterprise risk policies and procedures." ;
          skos:example "A risk committee drafting the firm's enterprise risk policy framework for the coming year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16440
ex:P16440 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskTolerance
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the organization's tolerance for risk, given risk-return trade-offs for one or more anticipated and predictable consequences." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16440" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: the output is a Directive ICE (a prescriptive tolerance threshold to be observed), not a mere description, per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine risk tolerance for organization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the organization's tolerance for risk in light of risk-return trade-offs and produces a risk tolerance statement." ;
          skos:example "A board setting the maximum acceptable annual value-at-risk for the enterprise." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16441
ex:P16441 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseRiskPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and maintaining the policies and procedures for managing risk. Create rules and regulations for enterprise risk dealing with hazardous, financial, operational, and strategic risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16441" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: definitional output is a Directive ICE (the enterprise risk policy and procedure)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and maintain enterprise risk policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and maintains the policies and procedures for managing hazard, financial, operational, and strategic risk and produces enterprise risk policies and procedures." ;
          skos:example "A risk team updating the corporate risk policy manual after a regulatory change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16442
ex:P16442 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseRiskTool
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing and implementing tools for managing risk. Identify and apply enterprise risk management tools. Leverage methods and processes to manage risks and opportunities associated with business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16442" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Selection (Info Processing): a candidate set of ERM tools is narrowed to a chosen, specified set; output is a Directive ICE (the tool specification). Implementation/application of the selected tools is a downstream concern, captured as a comment rather than a separate definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and implement enterprise risk management tools" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses enterprise risk management tools from available candidates and produces an enterprise risk management tool specification for their application." ;
          skos:example "Selecting and configuring a GRC platform and a Monte-Carlo risk-modeling tool as the firm's standard ERM toolset." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16443
ex:P16443 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskKnowledge
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Communicating the knowledge about risk within the organization. Identify operational risks. Share risk information within the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16443" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus reuses cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting, an Act of Representative Communication): the act gives a detailed account of risk to organizational audiences. Output is a Descriptive ICE (risk knowledge). Gate-F cross-reference: its parallel 'share risk knowledge' row P16471 (11.4.5) was reconciled to this SAME genus (cco:ont00000151) and to this SAME output-only I/O pattern, removing the prior 402-vs-151 split between the two rows." ;
          rdfs:label "Coordinate the sharing of risk knowledge across the organization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that communicates risk knowledge throughout the organization and produces and disseminates shared risk knowledge." ;
          skos:example "A risk manager circulating an operational-risk briefing to all business-unit heads." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16444
ex:P16444 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseRiskReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing and presenting reports about enterprise risk to the management of the organization. Create reports for management on hazard risks (e.g., property damage and liability torts), financial risks (e.g., currency and liquidity risks), and operational risks (e.g., product failure, customer satisfaction, social trends, and competition)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16444" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus reuses cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting). Output is a Descriptive ICE (the enterprise risk report). Executive management and the board are the report audience (typical participants, not definitional fillers)." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare and report enterprise risk to executive management and board" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that prepares and presents an account of enterprise hazard, financial, and operational risks to executive management and the board and produces an enterprise risk report." ;
          skos:example "The CRO presenting the quarterly enterprise risk report to the audit committee." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16445
ex:P16445 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16446
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16447
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16448
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16449
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16450
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16451
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16452
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16453
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16454
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating to plan, organize, lead, and control the activities of an organization in order to minimize the special effects of risk on capital and earnings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16445" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseRiskManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: modeled as a bounded coordinating/oversight occurrent (a management cycle), distinct from the org-wide standing capability 17060. Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because it spans planning, organizing, and controlling rather than a single act kind. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Oversee and coordinate enterprise risk management activities" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that coordinates the planning, organizing, leading, and controlling of an organization's risk-management activities in order to minimize the effects of risk on capital and earnings." ;
          skos:example "An enterprise-risk steering cycle that runs identify, assess, mitigate, verify, monitor, and report across the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16446
ex:P16446 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining risks that could thwart objectives. Document and communicate the concern." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16446" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Identification (discernment sense): output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk register)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify enterprise level risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the enterprise-level risks that could thwart organizational objectives and produces a risk register documenting them." ;
          skos:example "A workshop enumerating strategic and operational risks into the corporate risk register." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16447
ex:P16447 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying options/actions to enhance opportunities and reduce threats. Recognize the root reasons of the identified risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16447" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates/judges risks. Output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk assessment), so genus and output kind agree (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Gate-F fix: the risk register is a TYPICAL input, not definitional -- a risk assessment can be performed without a pre-existing formal register (the register may itself be assembled in the same act), so per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule the prior `has input some ex:RiskRegister` restriction was REMOVED and demoted to this annotation (CQ target: 'which risk register, if any, did this assessment consume?')." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess risks to determine which to mitigate" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates identified risks and their root causes to judge which to mitigate and produces a risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "Scoring each registered risk by likelihood and impact to prioritize mitigation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16448
ex:P16448 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMitigationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing activities to improve opportunities and lessen threats. Specify the organization's objectives. Evolve strategies and policies to attain these objectives. Assign resources to project objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16448" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation (Planning): definitional output is a Directive ICE (the risk mitigation and management strategy)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop risk mitigation and management strategy and integrate with existing performance management processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes activities, strategies, and policies to enhance opportunities and lessen threats and produces a risk mitigation and management strategy." ;
          skos:example "Drafting a hedging-and-controls strategy and integrating it into the annual performance plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16449
ex:P16449 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMitigationVerificationReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking that the blueprint created for managing risk in individual business units and divisions is correctly effectuated. Validate the implementation of all activities geared to mitigate risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16449" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfVerification (inlined; Act of Appraisal cco:ont00000636; also information-processing in character): confirming conformance of implementation to the plan; output is a Descriptive ICE (the verification finding). Gate-F fix (1): the `has input some ex:RiskMitigationPlan` restriction was REMOVED -- per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule the mitigation plan is a TYPICAL input (it is the conformance reference, but the comment formerly labeled it 'typical' while encoding it existentially), so it is demoted to this annotation. Gate-F fix (2): the output was changed from the FALSE-FRIEND ex:RiskMonitoringReport (a continuous-monitoring time-series artifact) to the dedicated one-shot conformance ICE ex:RiskMitigationVerificationReport, restoring genus/output semantic traceability (both Descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Verify business unit and functional risk mitigation plans are implemented" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks whether business-unit and functional risk mitigation plans have been correctly implemented and produces a risk mitigation verification report recording the conformance finding." ;
          skos:example "Auditing a division to confirm its mitigation controls are in place and operating." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16450
ex:P16450 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMonitoringReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring risk monitoring and mitigation activities. Monitor actions to enhance opportunities and reduce threats to project objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16450" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (under Info Processing): ongoing observation/tracking of risks and actions; output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk monitoring report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Ensure risks and risk mitigation actions are monitored" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks risks and risk-mitigation actions over time and produces a risk monitoring report." ;
          skos:example "A dashboard tracking key risk indicators and the status of open mitigation actions each month." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16451
ex:P16451 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseRiskReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a report of activities to address hazard risks, liability torts, financial risks, operational risks, social trends, competition, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16451" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus reuses cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting). Output is a Descriptive ICE (the enterprise risk report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report on enterprise risk activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that gives a detailed account of the activities undertaken to address enterprise hazard, financial, and operational risks and produces an enterprise risk report." ;
          skos:example "Compiling the period's risk-treatment activities into a report for governance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16452
ex:P16452 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMitigationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating risk management activities to improve opportunities and lessen threats. Specify the organization's objectives. Assign resources to project objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "16452" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): a coordinating/organizing act with no single dominant ICE output. The mitigation strategy is a typical input governing the coordination." ;
          rdfs:label "Coordinate business unit and functional risk management activities" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that coordinates the risk-management activities of business units and functions, specifying objectives and assigning resources to improve opportunities and lessen threats." ;
          skos:example "Aligning each division's risk plan and assigning shared resources across the enterprise program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16453
ex:P16453 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ERMProcessConformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking each business unit's/function's options and activities to improve opportunities and lessen threats." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "16453" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfVerification (inlined; Act of Appraisal cco:ont00000636; also information-processing in character): confirming process conformance; output is a Descriptive ICE. Gate-F fix (1): the `has input some ex:EnterpriseRiskPolicy` restriction was REMOVED -- the source text ('checking each business unit's/function's options and activities') does not establish the policy as present for EVERY instance, so per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule it is demoted to this annotation as the typical conformance reference. Gate-F fix (2): the output was changed from the FALSE-FRIEND ex:RiskMonitoringReport (a time-series monitoring artifact) to the dedicated ex:ERMProcessConformanceReport, restoring genus/output traceability (both Descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Ensure that each business unit/function follows the enterprise risk management process" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks whether each business unit and function follows the enterprise risk management process and produces an ERM process conformance report." ;
          skos:example "Reviewing a division against the ERM process checklist." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16454
ex:P16454 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ERMReportingConformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking the reporting process of each business unit's/function's options and activities to improve opportunities and lessen threats." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "16454" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfVerification (inlined; Act of Appraisal cco:ont00000636; also information-processing in character): confirming conformance of the reporting process; output is a Descriptive ICE. Sibling of P16453. Gate-F fix (1): the `has input some ex:EnterpriseRiskPolicy` restriction was REMOVED -- the source text ('checking the reporting process ...') does not establish the policy as present for EVERY instance, so per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule it is demoted to this annotation as the typical conformance reference. Gate-F fix (2): the output was changed from the FALSE-FRIEND ex:RiskMonitoringReport (a time-series monitoring artifact) to the dedicated ex:ERMReportingConformanceReport, restoring genus/output traceability (both Descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Ensure that each business unit/function follows the enterprise risk reporting process" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks whether each business unit and function follows the enterprise risk reporting process and produces an ERM reporting conformance report." ;
          skos:example "Confirming each unit submits its risk report on the prescribed cadence and template." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16456
ex:P16456 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a timely and continuous process to identify activities that might hinder a project's goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16456" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Identification (discernment sense): output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk register)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the risks and activities that might hinder a business unit's goals and produces a risk register documenting them." ;
          skos:example "A project team listing the events that could delay delivery into its risk register." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16457
ex:P16457 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseRiskPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the possibility that a specified undesirable event will occur using established tools, implements, and frameworks. Use risk assessments to determine, for example, whether to undertake a particular venture, what rate of return a particular investment requires, and how to mitigate an activity's potential losses." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16457" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates/judges the likelihood of adverse events. Output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk assessment). The enterprise risk policy/framework is DEFINITIONAL input (the source text fixes the assessment to the 'established tools, implements, and frameworks'), so it remains an existential `has input` restriction. Gate-F fix: the risk register is only a TYPICAL input (the comment formerly self-contradictingly encoded it as someValuesFrom while labeling it 'typical'); per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule the `has input some ex:RiskRegister` restriction was REMOVED and demoted to this annotation (CQ target: 'which risk register did this assessment draw on?')." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess risks using enterprise risk framework policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that estimates the likelihood of specified undesirable events using the established enterprise risk framework, policies, and procedures and produces a risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "Using the corporate risk-scoring framework to rate a proposed venture's exposure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16458
ex:P16458 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P18129
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMitigationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing possibilities and arrangements to improve opportunities and reduce deviations to project objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16458" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation (Planning): definitional output is a Directive ICE (the risk mitigation plan). Has its assess-insurance-coverage task as a process part." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop mitigation plans for risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises arrangements to improve opportunities and reduce deviations to objectives and produces a risk mitigation plan." ;
          skos:example "Drafting a mitigation plan with controls, owners, and contingency arrangements for the top risks." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16459
ex:P16459 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMitigationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing mitigation plans to improve opportunities and reduce deviations to project objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16459" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): an execution act prescribed by the mitigation plan; it has no definitional ICE output of its own. The risk mitigation plan is a definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement mitigation plans for risks" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that executes a risk mitigation plan to improve opportunities and reduce deviations to objectives." ;
          skos:example "Standing up the controls and contingency arrangements specified in the approved mitigation plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16460
ex:P16460 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMonitoringReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying, examining, and recognizing/justifying any improbability in investment decision making." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16460" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (under Info Processing): ongoing observation of risks; output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk monitoring report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks and examines a business unit's risks over time and produces a risk monitoring report." ;
          skos:example "Watching key risk indicators on a recurring basis and flagging breaches." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16461
ex:P16461 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMonitoringReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAnalysisReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining the impact of risk activities in order to update the existing scheme of risk management. Analyze and substantiate the potential for adverse consequences to occur. Consider the risks associated with the activity and the methods available to manage those risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16461" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Analysis (Info Processing): its definitional output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk analysis report). The revised risk mitigation plan is a typical further output (a Directive ICE), recorded in comment rather than as a definitional restriction. Has the risk monitoring report as a typical input." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze risk activities and update plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the impact of risk activities and the potential for adverse consequences and produces a risk analysis report used to update the risk mitigation plan." ;
          skos:example "Reviewing the period's incidents and revising the mitigation plan accordingly." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16462
ex:P16462 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskMonitoringReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating reports on risk activities, and communicating them to management. Prepare reports on the potential for adverse safety consequences." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "16462" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus reuses cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting). Output is a Descriptive ICE (the risk monitoring report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report on risk activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that gives a detailed account of a business unit's risk activities and communicates it to management, producing a risk monitoring report." ;
          skos:example "Submitting the unit's monthly risk-status report to the program lead." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16464
ex:P16464 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompliancePolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing procedures and methodologies to comply with relevant laws and regulations of an organization's obedience to laws, guidelines, strategies and stipulations related to business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16464" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (ex:CompliancePolicy), so anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop regulatory compliance procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes procedures and methodologies for complying with relevant laws and regulations, producing a compliance policy and procedure specification." ;
          skos:example "A compliance function documents the step-by-step procedures the firm follows to satisfy a new regulation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16465
ex:P16465 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ApplicableRequirementsDetermination
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the regulatory requirements that are most appropriate for the organization. Identify goals in order to follow the appropriate rules and regulations, guidelines, and strategies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16465" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfIdentification (Act of Information Processing): the act discerns/enumerates applicable requirements. Gate-F fix (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE / Phase-3): the prior `has output some ex:RegulatoryRequirement` was WRONG -- ex:RegulatoryRequirement is a DIRECTIVE ICE 'issued by a governing authority', and an information-processing/discernment act does not author that directive (the comment itself notes 'the requirements are not authored here'). The act's true definitional output is a DESCRIPTIVE determination of WHICH requirements apply (ex:ApplicableRequirementsDetermination, subClassOf cco:ont00000853), which agrees with the ext ActOfIdentification definition ('produces an ICE that registers them') and the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. The pre-existing body of regulation is the act's INPUT/subject (the candidate regulation it screens), now modeled as `has input some ex:RegulatoryRequirement`." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify applicable regulatory requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns which regulatory requirements apply to the organization and produces an applicable requirements determination registering them." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer screens the legal landscape and registers which statutes and rules the organization must obey." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16466
ex:P16466 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryEnvironmentAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing and overseeing the regulatory environment in order to spot any changing or emerging regulations. This process element calls upon the organization to monitor the regulatory environment for any new statutes, policies, and enactments issued by the respective government authorities or those which have been updated." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16466" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfMonitoring (inlined above). Output is a Descriptive ICE (ex:RegulatoryEnvironmentAnalysis), satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor the regulatory environment for changing or emerging regulations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that repeatedly observes and analyzes the regulatory environment to detect new or changed statutes, policies, and enactments, producing a regulatory environment analysis." ;
          skos:example "A regulatory-affairs team continuously scans government bulletins and reports newly issued rules affecting the firm." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16467
ex:P16467 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating current regulatory policies and regulations. Assess their performance. Make necessary changes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16467" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates and judges performance. Output is a Descriptive ICE (ex:ComplianceAssessment) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess current compliance position and identify weaknesses or shortfalls therein" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the organization's current compliance position against applicable regulations and judges its weaknesses and shortfalls, producing a compliance assessment." ;
          skos:example "An internal review judges where the firm falls short of its regulatory obligations and documents the gaps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16468
ex:P16468 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the current policies and policies. Implement missing and necessary changes environmental changes, political changes, technological changes, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16468" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored directly under cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): implementing controls is the carrying-out of prescribed controls, not the production of a new informational artifact, so it bears no definitional has-output restriction. The control and policy specifications it enacts (ex:ComplianceControl, ex:CompliancePolicy) are typical prescriptive inputs rather than definitional outputs." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement missing or stronger regulatory compliance controls and policies" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that puts into effect missing or strengthened regulatory compliance controls and policies as required to close identified compliance gaps." ;
          skos:example "Following a gap assessment, the firm deploys an additional access-control policy to meet a regulatory requirement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16469
ex:P16469 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceMonitoringReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring, appraising, and evaluating the compliance position of the organization in order to fine-tune for effective remediation. Track efforts for handling regulatory and compliance requirements necessitated by law. Test the robustness of internal frameworks, procedures, and approaches for dealing with these requirements, in order to clearly identify any necessary changes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16469" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfVerification (inlined above): the act tests whether existing controls satisfy requirements. Output is a Descriptive ICE (ex:ComplianceMonitoringReport) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and test regulatory compliance position and existing controls" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that tests the robustness of the organization's compliance controls, frameworks, and procedures against regulatory requirements, producing a compliance monitoring report of their performance and any necessary changes." ;
          skos:example "An assurance team runs control tests and reports which compliance controls hold and which must be revised." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16471
ex:P16471 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskKnowledge
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Sharing information about risks and resilience strategies of business operations across the organization so that prospective risks can be avoided." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16471" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BusinessResiliencyCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix (sibling/parallel-row consistency): RE-ANCHORED from the generic cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) to cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting, an Act of Representative Communication) to match its semantically parallel 11.1 sibling P16443 (11.1.1.4 'Coordinate the sharing of risk knowledge', source 'Share risk information within the organization'), which is anchored at cco:ont00000151. Both rows describe an agent conveying ex:RiskKnowledge across the organization; reconciling them to ONE genus removes the former split (402 vs 151). Also reconciled the I/O pattern: the former `has input some ex:RiskKnowledge` restriction was DROPPED (a report 'gives an account', it does not consume the same ICE it emits), leaving the single Descriptive output ex:RiskKnowledge to match P16443's output-only pattern. Cross-reference: P16443." ;
          rdfs:label "Share knowledge of specific risks across other parts of the organization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that gives other parts of the organization a detailed account of risk knowledge about business operations so that prospective risks can be avoided." ;
          skos:example "A risk manager circulates lessons learned about a near-miss disruption to other business units." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16500
ex:P16500 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMeasure
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelPerformanceAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting an analysis to review channel performance with respect to chosen metrics, benchmarks and performance targets [16573]. Compare to past performance and forecasts for the channel." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16500" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChannelManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:ChannelPerformanceAnalysis is Descriptive (is-about MarketingChannel), agreeing with the Information-Processing genus. ex:PerformanceMeasure (the metrics/targets from 16573) and ex:PerformanceReport are definitional inputs." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze channel performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that reviews channel performance against chosen metrics, benchmarks, and targets and produces a channel performance analysis." ;
          skos:example "An analyst compares this quarter's channel results to targets and prior periods." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16501
ex:P16501 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelPerformanceAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising a course of action to be taken to improve under-performing channels and to promote or expand channels that surpass expectations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16501" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChannelManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:ImprovementPlan is Directive, agreeing with the Formulation genus. ex:ChannelPerformanceAnalysis is a definitional input (the plan acts on the performance review)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop plan for channel improvements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises a course of action to improve under-performing channels and expand over-performing ones and produces an improvement plan." ;
          skos:example "A manager drafts a plan to fix two lagging channels and double down on a top performer." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16573
ex:P16573 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMeasure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining measurable parameters to be used for comparing the performance of different marketing channels. Decide on benchmarks and values for optimum or desired performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16573" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChannelManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PerformanceMeasure is Directive (a prescriptive specification of metrics and targets), agreeing with the Formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish channel-specific measures and targets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the measurable parameters, benchmarks, and target values for comparing channel performance and produces a performance measure specification." ;
          skos:example "A team defines conversion-rate and cost-per-sale targets per channel." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16574
ex:P16574 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking trends and changes in performance inside individual marketing channels and in channels collectively. Summarize and document results. Alert relevant parties about significant or unexpected deviations from expected behaviors." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16574" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChannelManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PerformanceReport is Descriptive, agreeing with the Monitoring (Information-Processing) genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and report performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks trends and changes in channel performance over time and produces a performance report summarizing results and deviations." ;
          skos:example "An analyst tracks weekly channel metrics and circulates a performance report flagging anomalies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16575
ex:P16575 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the factors and circumstances that influence desired outcomes. Communicate core findings to relevant parties." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16575" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ChannelManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PerformanceReport is Descriptive, agreeing with the Monitoring genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and report events influencing factors" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks the factors and circumstances influencing desired channel outcomes and produces a performance report communicating the core findings." ;
          skos:example "An analyst watches seasonal and competitive factors affecting channel results and reports the findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16590
ex:P16590 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OmniChannelStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising a strategy to market company's products or services seamlessly through all or most channels that are in widespread use among the target market. This may mean cross-channel access to customer preferences and purchasing history to accept returned merchandise, provide refunds, resolve payment issues or to provide technical support." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.7.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16590" ;
          rdfs:label "Define omni-channel strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises a strategy to market seamlessly across the channels in widespread use among the target market and produces an omni-channel strategy." ;
          skos:example "A team designs a cross-channel strategy giving customers a unified returns and support experience." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16591
ex:P16591 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying necessary preconditions that a channel should fulfill in order to be included as one of the adopted channels, such as required throughput capacities, service capabilities, competitive pricing, and alignment with organizational marketing strategies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.7.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16591" ;
          rdfs:label "Define omni-channel requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that specifies the preconditions a channel must fulfill to be adopted and produces channel requirements." ;
          skos:example "A team documents the throughput and service preconditions a channel must meet to join the omni-channel mix." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16592
ex:P16592 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PolicyAndProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the detailed policies and procedures that each of the channels needs to follow in order to conform to the organizational marketing strategy and to provide seamless customer service experience." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.7.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16592" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop omni-channel policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the detailed policies and procedures each channel must follow and produces a set of policies and procedures." ;
          skos:example "A team writes the per-channel service policies that enforce a seamless customer experience." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16598
ex:P16598 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Gathering the data about customers. Combine the information available locally with the data obtained from external sources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16598" ;
          rdfs:label "Collect and merge internal and third-party customer information" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as input customer data and has as output customer master data combining internal and third-party sources." ;
          skos:example "A pipeline merges CRM records with purchased third-party customer data." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16599
ex:P16599 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Eliminating redundant information in customer data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.2.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16599" ;
          rdfs:label "De-duplicate customer data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as input customer data and has as output customer master data with redundant records eliminated." ;
          skos:example "A matching job collapses duplicate customer records into golden records." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16612
ex:P16612 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerProfile
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying a set of characteristics that define the demographic and behavioral patterns of the customer. Further, use persona scoring to design your marketing strategies around personas, and measure and optimize your interactions with the contacts classified by a certain persona." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16612" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'identifying a set of characteristics that define ... patterns of the customer'. Modeled as a bounded act despite 'manage' in the label, because the source describes a definable identification activity producing a customer profile. Gate-F split: the source's standing 'manage and optimize your interactions with the contacts classified by a persona' aspect is NOT part of this bounded act -- it is a continuant standing function carried by the already-minted ex:CustomerExperienceManagementCapability (Organization Capability), realized in repeated CX-management acts. This leaf captures only the bounded persona-definition occurrent (R5 bounded-occurrent test)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage personas" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the demographic and behavioral characteristics defining customer personas and produces a customer profile." ;
          skos:example "A marketer defines three buyer personas from demographic and behavioral data." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16613
ex:P16613 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16614
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16615
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16616
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16617
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16627
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerInsight
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing and responding to customer feedback. Create tickets to initiate bug fixes or to propose feature updates. Monitor and track progress." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16613" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (customer insight) agrees with the information-processing genus. Its five APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze and respond to customer insight" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer feedback and produces customer insight used to drive responses." ;
          skos:example "A team reviews customer feedback, derives insight, and raises tickets in response." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16614
ex:P16614 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMetricAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining user activity on company, vendor or reseller websites to improve traffic on and to the website, improve user experience on the website to simplify purchasing process and encourage repeat purchases, and to increase the site's visibility in search engine results. Various metrics can be used to measure user activity, such as number of users who are new, returning or unique, time spent on page, session duration, bounce rate, click through rate, conversion rate, and others." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16614" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze customer website activity" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer data on website activity and produces a customer metric analysis." ;
          skos:example "A web analyst examines bounce and conversion rates to characterize site usage." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16615
ex:P16615 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerBehaviorModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting analyses to uncover customer purchasing habits. Detect patterns and categorize users based on similar characteristics and behaviors, demographic information, geographic location, search history, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16615" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (a behavior model, about Customer) agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze customer purchase patterns" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer data and produces a customer behavior model describing purchasing patterns." ;
          skos:example "An analyst clusters customers by purchasing behavior into a behavior model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16616
ex:P16616 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessRule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating formulas for personalized offers, purchasing recommendations and targeted advertisements for customers on the basis of previously detected purchase patterns [16615]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16616" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (a business rule) agrees with the planning genus. Customer behavior model is a typical input recorded here." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop business rules to provide personalized offers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes business rules prescribing personalized offers and recommendations from detected purchase patterns." ;
          skos:example "A team writes rules that trigger personalized offers from a customer's purchase history." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16617
ex:P16617 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PromotionalPerformanceEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing how well the targeted offers perform to see whether they result in an increased conversion rate. Reanalyze the purchase patterns or modify those business rules that are produce effective recommendations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16617" ;
          rdfs:comment "Uses ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT): ongoing tracking of offer effectiveness. Descriptive output (a performance evaluation) agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor effectiveness of personalized offers and adjust offers accordingly" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks the conversion effectiveness of personalized offers and produces a promotional performance evaluation driving rule adjustments." ;
          skos:example "A team watches conversion lift from personalized offers and flags rules to revise." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16627
ex:P16627 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerInsight
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Following postings on social media to promote offerings, raise brand awareness, interact with customers, increase customer engagement and brand loyalty, respond to queries, gauge sentiment regarding company's products or services, and to derive customer insight." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16627" ;
          rdfs:comment "Uses ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT): ongoing following of social-media postings. Descriptive output (customer insight) agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and respond to social media activity" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input customer feedback from social media, tracks sentiment, and produces customer insight." ;
          skos:example "A social team tracks brand mentions, replies to queries, and derives sentiment insight." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16630
ex:P16630 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductMarketingContent
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Producing or overseeing the creation or acquisition of photos, images and graphics for a product description, advertisement or a website. Like the copy [18131], product images are chosen and edited to enhance the product description and to convince consumers to purchase the product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.9.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16630" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:MarketingManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F): the output ex:ProductMarketingContent is a DESCRIPTIVE ICE, but the prior genus ex:ActOfFormulation is defined (inlined) as an Act of Planning whose output is a DIRECTIVE ICE -- a GOLDEN PRINCIPLE violation (the 'composes an artifact' reading is a false friend for Formulation's planning sense). Re-anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication; product images are communication content transferred to the audience) plus cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), the descriptive-content-authoring genus chosen for this row and its sibling P18130. Output ex:ProductMarketingContent (Descriptive) retained." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage product images" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that produces the photos, images, and graphics of product marketing content about an offering." ;
          skos:example "A designer creates and edits the product hero image for a listing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16633
ex:P16633 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Surveying and tracking the benefits of customer loyalty programs both for the company and for customers. Compare with comparable loyalty programs instituted in competitor companies. Propose changes as needed to keep up with market trends." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16633" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PerformanceReport is Descriptive, agreeing with the Monitoring genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor customer loyalty program benefits to the enterprise and the customer" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that surveys and tracks the benefits of a customer loyalty program for the enterprise and its customers and produces a performance report." ;
          skos:example "A team tracks loyalty-program redemption and retention benefits versus competitor programs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16790
ex:P16790 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:IPThreatMeasureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing measures and procedures for identifying various intellectual property threats and concerns." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.1.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "16790" ;
          rdfs:comment "Carried over from GOLD module (ex:EstablishIPThreatMeasures). Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning)." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate intellectual property" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that has as output an IP threat measure specification prescribing procedures for identifying intellectual-property threats." ;
          skos:example "Legal counsel establishes a procedure for screening incoming filings for IP-infringement risk." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16792
ex:P16792 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16793
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16794
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16795
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RestructuringOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining the scope and contingencies for restructuring based on market situation and internal realities. Map the market forces over which any and all probabilities can be probed for utility and viability. Once the restructuring options have been analyzed and the due-diligence performed, execute the deal. Consider seeking professional services for assistance in formalizing these opportunities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16792" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the dominant gerund is examining/probing restructuring options for viability. Its APQC children are process parts; deal execution is a downstream consequence noted in the source." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct organization restructuring opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that examines the scope and contingencies for restructuring an organization in light of market and internal realities and produces a restructuring opportunity analysis." ;
          skos:example "A corporate-development team probes merger and divestment options and documents a restructuring opportunity analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16793
ex:P16793 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InternalCapabilityData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RestructuringOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying opportunities for restructuring the organization, through an analysis of internal viability and external contingency. Conduct a broad-based survey of the market landscape, taking the large-scale trends and movements into account, to determine the necessity and possibility of restructuring the organization. Review the organization's internal capacities, the readiness of its process frameworks, the robustness of its financials, the capableness of its systems, the resourcefulness of its personnel, etc. for assimilating an extensive overhaul." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16793" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense): it discerns and registers restructuring opportunities from internal and market review." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify restructuring opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input internal-capability data and market data and has as output a restructuring opportunity analysis registering candidate restructuring opportunities." ;
          skos:example "A strategy team surveys the market and internal readiness and lists viable restructuring opportunities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16794
ex:P16794 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RestructuringOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DueDiligenceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Auditing the status quo of the probabilities, before formalizing any restructuring of the organization with another entity. Systematically investigate all entities discerned to be of interest in Identify restructuring opportunities [16793], to verify all tangible and substantial facts. Consider engaging specialist professional services including legal, accounting, and consulting help." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16794" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): an audit verifying facts is an evaluation/judgement. Professional-services providers noted as typical (non-definitional) participant in source." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform due-diligence" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a restructuring opportunity analysis and has as output a due-diligence report verifying the tangible and substantial facts about candidate entities." ;
          skos:example "Advisors audit a target company's financials and legal status and issue a due-diligence report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16795
ex:P16795 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16796
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16797
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16798
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16799
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DueDiligenceReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DealOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining various options shortlisted for assimilating new entities into the organization or dissociating from it. Undertake a piecemeal and comprehensive consideration of each option identified for acquisition, merger, de-merger, and divestment. Consider intangible and non-material aspects of the entities involved and synergic aspects. Consider the assistance of specialist professional services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16795" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: it examines and compares shortlisted deal options. Its APQC tasks are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze deal options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a due-diligence report and has as output a deal-option analysis comparing acquisition, merger, de-merger, and divestment options." ;
          skos:example "A corporate-development team compares acquisition and divestment options and documents a deal-option analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16796
ex:P16796 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DealOptionAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Appraising entities identified as being suitable for acquisition, taking into account the restructuring opportunities in the internal and external context. Verify the appropriateness and viability of the short-listed options. Ensure these entities pertain to the state-of-affairs in the market, as well as fit with the resources and capabilities of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16796" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it appraises acquisition candidates for fit and viability." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate acquisition options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a deal-option analysis and has as output a business value assessment of the suitability and viability of entities shortlisted for acquisition." ;
          skos:example "An M&A team appraises an acquisition target's fit and reports its business value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16797
ex:P16797 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DealOptionAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Appraising entities identified as being suitable for a merger, taking stock of the restructuring opportunities within the firm and the market. Verify the appropriateness and viability of such options. Assess these entities to ensure their pertinence to the contextual state-of-affairs in the market, as well as a fit with the resources and capabilities of the organization itself. (This process can be carried out, in its entirety, by qualified in-house personnel or may be designated to specialist professional services providers.)" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16797" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). In-house personnel or professional-services providers are typical (non-definitional) participants per source." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate merger options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a deal-option analysis and has as output a business value assessment of the suitability and viability of entities shortlisted for a merger." ;
          skos:example "A strategy team appraises a merger candidate's fit and reports its business value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16798
ex:P16798 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DealOptionAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating departments and subsidiaries within the organization, and/or previously merged entities, to assess the appropriateness of a de-merger, taking account of the fit between these entities as well as any relevant externalities. Examine the pertinence and soundness of a formalized dissociation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16798" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the soundness of a de-merger." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate de-merger options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a deal-option analysis and has as output a business value assessment of the appropriateness of de-merging departments, subsidiaries, or previously merged entities." ;
          skos:example "A corporate-development team evaluates spinning off a subsidiary and reports its business value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16799
ex:P16799 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DealOptionAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating departments and/or subsidiaries within the organization to assess the appropriateness of a divestment, taking account of all market externalities. Examine any internal entities that have been identified to be suitable for dismemberment from the organization. Ensure the pertinence and soundness of such a move." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.5.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16799" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the soundness of a divestment." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate divesture options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a deal-option analysis and has as output a business value assessment of the appropriateness of divesting departments or subsidiaries." ;
          skos:example "A strategy team evaluates divesting a business unit and reports its business value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16803
ex:P16803 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining direction and plan objectives for partnering with other companies to deliver product/services. Focus on creating a vision and strategic objectives and culminate in creating measures for the strategic alliance or partnership." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16803" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: creating a vision, objectives, and measures composes a partnership strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop partner/alliance strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the direction, objectives, and measures for partnering with other companies and produces a business strategy for alliances." ;
          skos:example "An alliance office drafts the multi-year partnership strategy and its success measures." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16805
ex:P16805 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a strategy for corporate development. Include providing a framework for evaluating merger and acquisition candidates; and planning for a value creation through merging/demerging with a company, acquiring a company, or exiting from an already merged/acquired company." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16805" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a strategy and an evaluation framework. The candidate-evaluation framework is recorded informally as a secondary output." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop merger/demerger/acquisition/exit strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines a corporate-development strategy for mergers, demergers, acquisitions, and exits and produces a business strategy together with a framework for evaluating candidates." ;
          skos:example "Corporate development drafts the M&A strategy and the screening criteria for targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16808
ex:P16808 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the ability of products and services to work together, exchange and use information in a multi-vendor, multi-network, and multi-service environment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16808" ;
          rdfs:label "Derive interoperability requirements for products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the interoperability a product or service must exhibit across multi-vendor and multi-network environments and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An architect specifies the data-exchange standards the product must support to interoperate with third-party systems." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16809
ex:P16809 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing safety requirements in line with environmental safety, occupational health and safety, and community health and safety guidelines." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16809" ;
          rdfs:label "Derive safety requirements for products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops the safety requirements a product or service must meet in line with health-and-safety guidelines and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A safety engineer specifies the occupational and community safety requirements for a new appliance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16810
ex:P16810 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing security requirements through authentication and encryption of CE device data stream.  Utilize security measures such as cryptographic protocols and hardware security (smart cards)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16810" ;
          rdfs:label "Derive security requirements for products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the authentication, encryption, and hardware-security requirements a product or service must meet and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A security architect specifies the cryptographic protocols and smart-card protections required for a connected device." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16811
ex:P16811 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Meeting regulatory requirements set forth by such directives as RoHS, WEEE, ELV, and REACH. " ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16811" ;
          rdfs:comment "Input regulatory requirement data is definitional; its source is the external regulatory authority. Gate-F: the [has participant some ex:RegulatoryAuthority] restriction was DROPPED. The regulatory authority does NOT partake in the organization's internal act of deriving requirements; it merely issued the external directives the org must comply with (bfo:has participant requires the entity to be present in and partake of the occurrent). The authority dependency is expressed instead through the ex:RegulatoryRequirementData input, whose source is the authority -- not via has-participant (a Phase-4 R-relation fix that avoids conflating 'source of the constraint' with 'participant of the act')." ;
          rdfs:label "Derive regulatory compliance requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the regulatory compliance requirements a product or service must satisfy under directives such as RoHS, WEEE, ELV, and REACH and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A compliance engineer specifies the RoHS and REACH requirements a new electronic product must meet." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16812
ex:P16812 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Complying with consumer electronic industry standards developed by the Consumer Technology Association (CTA)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16812" ;
          rdfs:label "Derive requirements from industry standards" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the requirements a product or service must meet to comply with industry standards and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An engineer derives the device requirements needed to conform to the relevant CTA industry standards." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16813
ex:P16813 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:UserExperienceDesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the usability and user experience of products and the business impact it creates." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16813" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfDesign: prescribes UX characteristics (Directive ICE about the offering)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop user experience design specifications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that determines the usability and user experience of a product or service and produces a user experience design specification." ;
          skos:example "A UX team specifies the interaction model and usability targets for an app." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16814
ex:P16814 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceConcept
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Productizing the service by defining the scope of the service/cost.  Target market for the service and make the service more tangible." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "16814" ;
          rdfs:comment "Defines a tangible service offering (its scope and cost), i.e. articulates a product/service concept (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Derive 'services-as-a-product' offering" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that productizes a service by defining its scope and cost and produces a product/service concept for the resulting offering." ;
          skos:example "A team packages a consulting service into a fixed-scope, fixed-price offering." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16815
ex:P16815 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupportModelSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining SLAs (Service Level Agreement) and service level KPIs (Key Performance Indicator). " ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16815" ;
          rdfs:label "Define post launch support model" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the service-level agreements and service-level KPIs for post-launch support and produces a post-launch support model specification." ;
          skos:example "A service team specifies the SLAs and KPIs that will govern support after a product's launch." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16817
ex:P16817 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyRecommendation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing warranty plan and pricing specifications for recommendation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16817" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): output is a prescriptive recommendation (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide warranty-related recommendations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that devises warranty plan and pricing specifications and produces a warranty recommendation." ;
          skos:example "A product team recommends a two-year warranty plan with tiered pricing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16818
ex:P16818 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BillOfMaterials
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Designing the BOM-Bill of material, manufacturing BOM and Service BOMA bill of materials list for all the raw materials and components/parts used in the producing end product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16818" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfDataManagement: structuring product data and the BOM (a Directive ICE listing required materials/parts)." ;
          rdfs:label "Design and manage product data, design, and bill of materials" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that designs and maintains product data, design records, and the engineering, manufacturing, and service bills of materials for a product." ;
          skos:example "A PLM engineer builds the manufacturing and service BOMs for a new appliance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16819
ex:P16819 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Carrying out the steps necessary to appropriately manufacture correct parts.  This includes designing application, product hardware, mold, casting, mechanical, and electrical aspects of the product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16819" ;
          rdfs:label "Design for manufacturing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that devises the application, hardware, mold, casting, mechanical, and electrical aspects of a product so that correct parts can be manufactured, producing a design specification." ;
          skos:example "An engineer designs injection-mold tooling so a housing can be mass-produced." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16820
ex:P16820 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating product application service view to allow for product servicing and refurbishing." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16820" ;
          rdfs:label "Design for product servicing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that creates a product service view enabling servicing and refurbishing, producing a serviceability design specification." ;
          skos:example "A designer adds access panels and a service view so a unit can be refurbished." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16821
ex:P16821 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Replacing core components and republishing." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16821" ;
          rdfs:label "Design for re-manufacturing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that devises how core components are replaced and republished for re-manufacturing, producing a re-manufacturing design specification." ;
          skos:example "An engineer designs a product so worn cores can be swapped and re-certified." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16822
ex:P16822 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TroubleshootingMethodologyReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing the design and approach for troubleshooting the product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16822" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): reviewing yields a descriptive judgement, not a design." ;
          rdfs:label "Review product troubleshooting methodology" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that reviews the design and approach for troubleshooting a product and produces a troubleshooting methodology review." ;
          skos:example "A reliability engineer reviews and critiques the product's diagnostic flow." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16823
ex:P16823 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Designing hardware and software upgrade techniques." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16823" ;
          rdfs:label "Design for product upgrades" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that devises hardware and software upgrade techniques for a product, producing an upgrade design specification." ;
          skos:example "An engineer designs a modular slot so the device's firmware and memory can be upgraded." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16824
ex:P16824 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LaunchPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a program and managing a perspective for new product/service introduction and launch." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16824" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F re-anchor: from ex:ActOfDevelopment to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning). The source ('Developing a program and managing a perspective for new product/service introduction and launch') describes AUTHORING a plan, and the sole output is a Directive ICE (ex:LaunchPlan), so the act is a formulation, not a development. ex:ActOfDevelopment asserts an existent realized state that never occurs here, a genus/output disagreement under the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE; 'Develop' is a false friend. Aligns with the sibling planning rows 2.1.1.4/.5/.6 and 2.1.2.4, all anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop plan for new product/service development and introduction/launch" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a product/service launch plan prescribing the program for introducing and launching a new product or service." ;
          skos:example "A launch team develops the go-to-market program for a new product." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16826
ex:P16826 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InfringementAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing activities in regards to patentability and infringement. The usage of Open Source in commercial product development will be reviewed in regard to licensing, community development, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16826" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:IntellectualPropertyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Review infringement of patents and copyrights" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output an infringement assessment judging patentability and possible infringement, including open-source licensing usage." ;
          skos:example "Counsel reviews a product for patentability and open-source license compliance and issues an infringement assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16827
ex:P16827 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:IPNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the business need for patents and copyrights. The patents and copyrights are managed by Manage copyrights and patents [11062]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16827" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is analysis; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine patent and copyright needs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as output an intellectual-property needs assessment of the business need for patents and copyrights." ;
          skos:example "An IP team analyzes a product portfolio and determines which assets warrant patent or copyright protection." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16848
ex:P16848 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16849
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16850
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16851
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16852
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16853
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16854
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16855
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P18627
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing marketing communications that deliver promotional messages, in a coordinated way, through multiple marketing channels, such as print, radio, television, direct mail, online or mobile advertising, email, social media or personal selling." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16848" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy is Directive, agreeing with the Formulation genus. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop marketing communication strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes coordinated marketing communications across multiple channels and produces a marketing communication strategy." ;
          skos:example "A communications team sets a coordinated multichannel promotional strategy for a campaign season." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16849
ex:P16849 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CommunicationCalendar
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Timing and scheduling the delivery of marketing messages to maximize their impact on customer purchasing behavior. Integrate individual messages to larger marketing campaigns and to seasonal purchasing patterns." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16849" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop customer communication calendar" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that times and schedules the delivery of marketing messages and produces a communication calendar." ;
          skos:example "A planner schedules email and social messages around seasonal purchasing peaks." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16850
ex:P16850 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deciding how to promote and maintain a favorable public image of the company in the eyes of its employees, customers, investors, suppliers, politicians or the general public. This may involve various means but is frequently conducted through publicity, education, corporate social responsibility, charitable causes or civic engagements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16850" ;
          rdfs:label "Define public relations (PR) strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that decides how to promote and maintain a favorable public image of the company and produces a marketing communication strategy for public relations." ;
          skos:example "A PR lead sets a strategy of publicity and CSR initiatives to strengthen the company's public image." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16851
ex:P16851 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising a master plan how to select potential customers or qualified clients for customized offers, and contact them on one-to-one basis through chat, phone, email or regular mail. The strategy would need to take into account that personalizing offers and contacting customers individually is an effective but resource-intensive marketing technique, and that ill-targeted offers risk at angering and alienating the contactees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "16851" ;
          rdfs:label "Define direct marketing strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises a master plan for selecting and contacting potential customers with customized one-to-one offers and produces a marketing communication strategy for direct marketing." ;
          skos:example "A team plans a personalized email-and-phone outreach program to qualified prospects." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16852
ex:P16852 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a program to promote the objectives, values, products and services of the company to its employees by treating them as potential customers, in order to extend company client base, increase employee engagement or to foster brand advocacy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "16852" ;
          rdfs:label "Define internal marketing communication strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops a program promoting the company's objectives, values, and offerings to its own employees and produces a marketing communication strategy for internal marketing." ;
          skos:example "A team builds an internal campaign to turn employees into brand advocates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16853
ex:P16853 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NewMediaAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Finding emerging media based on digital or other technologies that would enable the company to increase the speed and volume of marketing communications, to make communications more interactive and to customize promotional messages more easily to the target audience, thus rendering them more effective." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16853" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense): it finds and registers candidate media. Output ex:NewMediaAssessment is Descriptive, agreeing with the Information-Processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify new media for marketing communication" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns emerging digital and technological media for marketing communication and produces a new media assessment registering them." ;
          skos:example "A digital team scouts emerging social platforms suitable for promotional messaging." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16854
ex:P16854 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a marketing strategy that is maximally effective in a new or emerging media channel by capitalizing on its novel attributes and capabilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16854" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:NewMediaAssessment (from 16853) is a typical input, noted rather than asserted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define new media communication strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops a marketing approach tailored to a new or emerging media channel and produces a marketing communication strategy for that channel." ;
          skos:example "A team designs a short-form-video strategy that exploits a new platform's native features." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16855
ex:P16855 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketingCommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a framework for coordinated marketing to increase the profitability and increase brand awareness at the point of sale. This may include promotional posters on product shelves or island displays, advertisements in shopping carts, stickers on the floor that lead consumers to the promoted product, multi-buy promotions, coupons on sales receipts, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "16855" ;
          rdfs:label "Define point of sale (POS) communication strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes a framework for coordinated marketing at the point of sale and produces a marketing communication strategy for point-of-sale promotion." ;
          skos:example "A retail-marketing team plans shelf displays and cart ads to lift point-of-sale brand awareness." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16890
ex:P16890 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaimCode
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and maintaining claims processing and routing rules. Establish and maintain claims processing and routing rules for product warranties, coverage lists, repair, fault, trouble codes, repair time setup, and warranty policy registration. This also includes rolling out the codes and rules, and the improvements/updates to these rules and codes via systematic updates." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16890" ;
          rdfs:comment "Despite the 'manage/maintain' framing, the dominant act is establishing the rules and codes (a Directive ICE), so it is modeled as a process under ex:ActOfFormulation. Output reuses ex:WarrantyClaimCode from the shared section vocab." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and manage warranty rules/claim codes for products" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes warranty claims-processing and routing rules and the associated warranty claim codes for products." ;
          skos:example "A warranty operations team defines fault and repair-time codes and rolls them out across the claims system." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16893
ex:P16893 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing warranty policies to assure customers that the company will guarantee its warranties that it issues." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "16893" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: output is a Directive ICE (ex:WarrantyPolicy, reused from the shared section vocab)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine and document warranty policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes and documents a warranty policy assuring customers that the company will guarantee the warranties it issues." ;
          skos:example "Legal and warranty teams publish the company's warranty guarantee policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16905
ex:P16905 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReverseLogisticsStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establish a strategy that includes rules and regulations for the physical handling, information processing, and disposition of product and packaging returned by the buyer to the seller or an intermediary. Include return approval, transportation coordination, advance communication, product tracking, receipt, disposition of the return, and processing warranty claims in the strategy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.4.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "16905" ;
          rdfs:label "Define reverse logistics strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a reverse logistics strategy prescribing the handling, processing, and disposition of returned product and packaging." ;
          skos:example "A supply-chain team establishes a returns strategy covering approval, transport, tracking, disposition, and warranty handling." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16928
ex:P16928 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerInquiry
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesLead
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Utilizing customer inquiries as opportunities to either provide a comparable service to the one in question, offer additional complimentary service, or suggest a service that is better than what was initially offered." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16928" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerInquiryManagementCapability ,
                                ex:CustomerServiceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses shared ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense). Output is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and capture upsell/cross-sell opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input a customer inquiry and has as output a sales lead representing an upsell or cross-sell opportunity discerned from the inquiry." ;
          skos:example "While handling a support call, an agent spots that the customer qualifies for a premium tier and records a lead." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16937
ex:P16937 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesTeam
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesLead
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing possible sales leads to the sales team in an effort to garner more business opportunities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16937" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerInquiryManagementCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SalesAgentRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): the lead ICE is transferred from one Agent to another. The sales lead is the definitional input transferred and the sales team a definitional participant (recipient)." ;
          rdfs:label "Deliver opportunity to sales team" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which a customer service representative transfers a sales lead to the sales team." ;
          skos:example "An agent forwards a qualified cross-sell lead to the inside-sales queue." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16938
ex:P16938 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HRProgramSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a program that incorporates incentives and compensation put forth by the organization to recognize high performing workers and excellence in leadership." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.1.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "16938" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is Act of Formulation: output is a prescriptive program specification (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop high performers/leadership programs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces an HR program specification for recognizing high-performing workers and excellence in leadership through incentives and compensation." ;
          skos:example "HR creates a leadership-excellence recognition program with tied incentives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16940
ex:P16940 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetencyManagementModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the skills, knowledge, abilities, and attributes needed to carry out a specific job." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16940" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EmployeeDevelopmentCapability ,
                                ex:EmployeeTrainingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (directive output): a CompetencyManagementModel prescribes the required competency set." ;
          rdfs:label "Define employee competencies and skills" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a competency management model specifying the skills, knowledge, abilities, and attributes needed to carry out a specific job." ;
          skos:example "HR defines the competency framework for the data-analyst role." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16944
ex:P16944 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EngagementSurveyResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Questioning employees to ascertain overall workplace satisfaction." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.8.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "16944" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EmployeeCommunicationCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (Act of Information Processing): employee responses are elicited and manipulated into a representation of satisfaction. Output is descriptive (a finding), not prescriptive (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Phase-3 / has-input fix: the prior [has input some ex:EmployeeFeedback] existential restriction is DROPPED -- has input (cco:ont00001921) requires a continuant PRESENT AT START, but the survey responses are PRODUCED DURING the act of questioning (ex:EmployeeFeedback's own definition has the responses 'gathered from employees', i.e. on the output/internal side), so they are not antecedent inputs and were being double-counted. The engagement-survey-result output plus the Employee participant already capture the definitional content; any survey instrument/questionnaire that does pre-exist is left to commentary. The Employee participant restriction is retained (definitional to a survey)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct employee engagement surveys" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that questions employees and processes their responses to ascertain overall workplace satisfaction, and has as output an engagement survey result." ;
          skos:example "HR runs a quarterly engagement survey and compiles the results into a workplace-satisfaction report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P16958
ex:P16958 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling cases that involve financial fraud. Resolve disputes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "16958" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing case-handling function with no decomposed children and no natural end -> Organization Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage financial fraud/dispute cases" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of handling financial-fraud cases and resolving disputes." ;
          skos:example "A treasury controls team investigating and resolving suspected payment fraud." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17040
ex:P17040 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10017
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10018
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10019
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10020
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16792
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessConcept
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a conceptual framework of the organization's business activity and strategic vision with long-term applicability. Scout the organization's internal capabilities, as well as the customer's needs and desires, to identify a fit that can be used to advance a conceptual structure of the organization's business activity. Conduct analysis in light of relevant externalities and large-scale shifts in the market landscape." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17040" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): it produces a directive conceptual framework (the business concept) to be achieved. The ex:StrategicVision output is demoted (Gate-F) from an existential has-output to this comment/CQ note: the long-term vision is supplied by the has-process-part child P10020 'Establish strategic vision', so asserting it as a direct output of P17040 double-counts it. The definitional direct output of P17040 is ex:BusinessConcept. CQ: 'which acts in 1.1 produce a strategic vision?' is answered by P10020 (and its child P19949), not by P17040 directly. Its APQC children 1.1.1-1.1.5 are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Define the business concept and long-term vision" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that synthesizes internal capability, customer, and external-environment findings into a business concept and long-term strategic vision for an organization." ;
          skos:example "An executive team integrates market and capability analyses into a ten-year business concept and vision." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17041
ex:P17041 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MasterProductionSchedule
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MasterProductionSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supervising and overseeing the plan for internal activities such as production, inventory, and staffing. Set the quantity of items to produce each week of a short-range planning horizon." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17041" ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain master production schedule" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that has as input an existing master production schedule and re-sets the weekly production quantities over the short-range planning horizon." ;
          skos:example "The scheduler re-firms next week's build quantities every Monday." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17042
ex:P17042 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10252
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10253
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10254
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10255
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10256
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10258
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10259
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10260
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10261
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10262
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10263
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19555
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DistributionRequirementsPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining master data of finished products and inventory. Identify the requirements of finished products at the destination, as well as partner requirements. Calculate the consolidation at source. Manage replenishment planning. Create and administer a dispatch plan. Calculate load plans for destinations and partners. Manage the cost of supplying these products. Ensure effective utilization of capacity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "17042" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 4.1.5 as an occurrent; its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan distribution requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that determines finished-product and partner distribution requirements and has as output a distribution requirements plan." ;
          skos:example "Distribution planning produces the period's DRP covering replenishment, dispatch, and load plans." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17045
ex:P17045 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10423
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10424
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10425
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10426
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10427
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10428
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10429
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10430
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10431
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10433
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11622
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11623
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16938
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20122
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21433
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkforceStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and executing strategies and policies for smooth administration of work force. Determine and gather skill requirements. Plan the requirements for employee resourcing per unit. Create compensation, succession, HR program, and employee diversity plans. Develop and administer policies for HR. Develop benefits for employees. Create models for work force strategies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17045" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:HumanCapitalManagementCapability ,
                                ex:WorkforcePlanningCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 7.1.2 as a bounded occurrent. Its APQC children are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Output generalized as ex:WorkforceStrategy; specific plan artifacts are produced by the child processes." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and implement workforce strategy and policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input skill requirement data and produces a workforce strategy together with the compensation, succession, diversity, benefit, and policy artifacts that govern the workforce." ;
          skos:example "An HR function develops and rolls out its annual workforce strategy and supporting policies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17046
ex:P17046 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkforceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetencyManagementModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and implementing the tools for managing the competency levels of HR. Design a model for integrating HR planning with business planning. Assess current HR capacity based on the competencies against the capacity needed to achieve the vision, mission, and business goals of the organization. Consider factors such as employee development, career path, compensation policies, and performance management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17046" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:HumanCapitalManagementCapability ,
                                ex:WorkforcePlanningCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 7.1.4 as a bounded occurrent. Genus is Act of Formulation: output is a prescriptive competency management model (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop competency management models" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input workforce data and produces a competency management model integrating HR planning with business planning to manage HR competency levels." ;
          skos:example "HR builds a competency model mapping role competencies to business goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17050
ex:P17050 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OnboardingProgramSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Bringing the employee on-boarding program into effect. Implement Create/Maintain employee on-boarding program [10474]. Conduct training sessions and employee engagement programs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17050" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EmployeeDevelopmentCapability ,
                                ex:EmployeeOrientationAndDeploymentCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Administration (execution). Per the APQC cross-reference to 10474, it realizes the OnboardingProgramSpecification produced by ex:P10474 (recorded as input below)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute onboarding program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that brings an onboarding program specification into effect by conducting the training sessions and employee-engagement activities it prescribes." ;
          skos:example "HR runs the first-week induction sessions for a cohort of new hires." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17051
ex:P17051 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering the development of employee skills. Conduct training, coaching and mentoring, job-rotation and cross training, lateral moves, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17051" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EmployeeCareerDevelopmentCapability ,
                                ex:EmployeeDevelopmentCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Administration: the source verb is 'Administering the development', i.e. executing concrete development activities, a bounded recurrent act (R5 OK; not the standing 7.3.3 function). Phase-3 fix: the prior [has input some ex:DevelopmentGuideline] existential restriction is removed -- the source ('Administering the development of employee skills. Conduct training, coaching and mentoring, job-rotation and cross training, lateral moves, etc.') never cites a development guideline, so a guideline is at best a typical/background input (a competency-question target pending domain review), not a definitional one. Replaced with [has participant some ex:Employee], which the source DOES support (the developed employee)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage employee skill and competency development" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that carries out the development of an employee's skills and competencies through training, coaching, mentoring, and job rotation." ;
          skos:example "A development lead arranges a mentor and a cross-training rotation for an employee." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17055
ex:P17055 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10520
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmployeeData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RelocationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the relocation of employees in order to carry out assignments. Manage internal business processes to transfer employees, their families, and/or entire departments of a business to a new location." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.6.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "17055" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EmployeeRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is the Directive ex:RelocationPlan. Act of Motion (cco:ont00000357) was considered but the lead commitment is administering the transfer (internal processes, terms), not the physical motion itself. Decomposes into managing expatriates (10520)." ;
          rdfs:label "Relocate employees and manage assignments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that has as input employee data and produces a relocation plan for transferring an employee, their family, or a department to a new location in order to carry out an assignment." ;
          skos:example "HR coordinates the transfer of an employee and their family to a regional office." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17059
ex:P17059 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14090
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14092
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14093
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14094
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14095
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14096
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P14098
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19593
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Making and collecting payments for transactions in products/services, and transporting them to interested markets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "17059" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ImportExportControlCapability ,
                                ex:RestitutionManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 9.11 as a bounded occurrent. Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the group bundles heterogeneous acts (financial transactions, information processing, communication, formulation) with no single dominant genus. Its APQC dotted children are process parts (cco:ont00001777); the two standing-function children (Control exports/imports; Handle restitution) are modeled as Organization Capabilities and are therefore not process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform global trade services" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an organization services an international-trade transaction by screening parties, classifying and documenting goods, converting currency, calculating and clearing customs duties, and arranging payment instruments so that products and services can be exchanged across markets." ;
          skos:example "An exporter's end-to-end handling of a cross-border shipment, from sanctions screening through customs clearance and letter-of-credit settlement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17060
ex:P17060 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16439
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16445
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17462
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating requisite frameworks and coordinating all risk management activities for the entire organization and each function. Manage the enterprise risk by outlining the risk policies and procedures. Monitor and communicate all risk management activities. Encourage correspondence among the business units. Manage the risk of all business units and functions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17060" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: standing function ('Manage ... for the entire organization', no natural end) -> modeled as Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), not a process. Realized in the bounded child processes 11.1.1-11.1.3. Corresponds to the shared ex:EnterpriseRiskManagementCapability." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage enterprise risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an organization in virtue of its capacity to create enterprise-risk frameworks and policies and to coordinate, monitor, and communicate all risk-management activities across the entire organization and each of its functions." ;
          skos:example "A firm's enterprise risk management office that sets risk policy and oversees risk across all business units." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17389
ex:P17389 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketOpportunityData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing areas of growth and further development of product/service mix, customization, market based changes, etc., to further demonstrate value to the customer in the competition." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17389" ;
          rdfs:comment "Discernment sense (information processing); descriptive output. No precise shared output ICE exists for a 'bundling-opportunity register', so the output is recorded here rather than as a definitional restriction. Input is market opportunity data." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify product/service bundling opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns areas of growth in the product/service mix and produces a representation of the bundling opportunities available to demonstrate value to customers." ;
          skos:example "A marketing analyst identifies opportunities to bundle complementary products to increase customer value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17462
ex:P17462 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16456
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16457
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16458
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16459
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16460
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16461
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16462
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the threats a business unit/function faces to prioritize the controls it implements.." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17462" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseRiskManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: although labeled 'Manage', the element description denotes a bounded analyze-and-prioritize cycle that decomposes into the concrete child acts 11.1.3.1-11.1.3.7; modeled as a composite Planned Act (cco:ont00000228) with those children as process parts, not as a standing capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage business unit and function risk" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that analyzes the threats faced by a business unit or function in order to prioritize and operate the controls it implements, comprising the identification, assessment, mitigation, monitoring, and reporting of that unit's risks." ;
          skos:example "A business unit running its annual risk-and-controls cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17468
ex:P17468 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17469
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17470
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompliancePolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a set of procedures detailing an organization's progress in complying with established guidelines, provisions, and legislation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17468" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: 'establish a framework and policies' composes a Directive ICE. Its APQC children 17469 and 17470 are process parts (cco:ont00001777); standing-function children 14133 and 14137 are Organization Capabilities, not process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish compliance framework and policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and articulates an organization's compliance policies and procedures, producing a compliance policy and procedure specification." ;
          skos:example "A compliance team drafts the enterprise compliance policy-and-procedure set governing how the organization meets its legal obligations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17469
ex:P17469 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompliancePolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a standardized approach to ethics and compliance. Have a programmatic approach for compliance that focuses on the definite risks the organization faces." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17469" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (ex:CompliancePolicy), so the act is anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop enterprise compliance policies and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a standardized, risk-focused approach to ethics and compliance, producing a compliance policy and procedure specification." ;
          skos:example "An organization authors its enterprise code of conduct and the procedures implementing it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17470
ex:P17470 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing standardized for ethics and compliance. Have a programmatic approach, built from the top down, to enterprise compliance that focuses on the definite risks the organization faces." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17470" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored directly under cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): implementation is the carrying-out of an already-formulated program, not the production of a new informational artifact, so it bears no definitional has-output restriction. The compliance policy that governs it (ex:CompliancePolicy) is a typical prescriptive input rather than a definitional one." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement enterprise compliance activities" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that carries out the organization's prescribed compliance program by executing the activities specified in its compliance policies and procedures." ;
          skos:example "Compliance staff roll out and operate the ethics-and-compliance program defined by the policy set." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17471
ex:P17471 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17472
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17482
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17492
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17498
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing organizational attributes that are closely associated with the quality of output. Determine the quality requirements. Evaluate the correspondence between the quality performance and requirements. Manage non-conformance activities. Ensure implementation and maintenance of the enterprise quality management system." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17471" ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as Organization Capability (R5/R6): 'Manage enterprise quality' is a standing function with no natural end, realized in its constituent acts rather than being a single bounded occurrent. Same capability as the shared ex:EnterpriseQualityManagementCapability. DELIBERATE R5 DIVERGENCE FROM SIBLING 13.4 (auditable, uniform criterion): unlike 'Manage change' (P11074), which is a discrete transformation INITIATIVE with a natural terminus and is therefore minted as a bounded Planned Act, quality management is a PERMANENT enterprise function with no natural end and so is capability-only (no ex:P process). The same capability-only treatment applies to 13.1 (16378), 13.5 (11073), and the 13.2 portfolio/program/project management functions. See the cross-reference on ex:P11074." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage enterprise quality" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization to the extent of its capacity to establish quality requirements, evaluate quality performance against those requirements, handle nonconformances, and operate an enterprise quality management system." ;
          skos:example "A manufacturer's standing quality-management function spanning requirements, testing, nonconformance handling, and its EQMS." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17472
ex:P17472 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17473
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17474
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17475
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17480
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17481
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining essential activities, processes, and attributes for securing enterprise quality. Outline critical characteristics for quality. Outline activities encouraging the preservation of quality. Create quality controls. Confirm capabilities in accordance with quality requirements. Finalize the plan for quality maintenance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17472" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseQualityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Aggregating planning process; its APQC children are process parts (cco:ont00001777), not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish quality requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the critical characteristics, preventive activities, and controls securing enterprise quality and produces a quality plan." ;
          skos:example "A quality team translates customer needs into critical-to-quality characteristics, controls, and a finalized quality plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17473
ex:P17473 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CriticalToQualityCharacteristicSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining characteristics crucial for managing enterprise quality. Translate broad customer needs into specific, actionable, measurable performance requirements. Define the key measurable characteristics of key products and processes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17473" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: composing measurable requirements from customer needs yields a Directive ex:CriticalToQualityCharacteristicSpecification (a prescription of what products/processes MUST achieve), not a description of present quality." ;
          rdfs:label "Define critical-to-quality characteristics" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that translates customer needs into a critical-to-quality characteristic specification of measurable product and process requirements." ;
          skos:example "An engineer converts a customer expectation into a measurable tolerance on a key product dimension." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17474
ex:P17474 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PreventiveQualityActivitySpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying gaps in customer requirements and determining whether the gap will be mitigated through preventive Quality activities or deemed as acceptable risk. The goal of any preventive quality activities is to create provisions to prevent, control, or reduce the risk of not meeting the CtQCs. In addition, any standard methodology that will be used to design or conduct preventive Quality activities are defined and documented." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17474" ;
          rdfs:comment "Critical-to-quality characteristic specification is a typical input (the gap is judged against it) rather than definitional, so it is noted here, not asserted as a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Define preventive quality activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that specifies the preventive quality activities and methodology for reducing the risk of not meeting critical-to-quality characteristics." ;
          skos:example "A quality engineer documents a preventive inspection regime to close a requirement gap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17475
ex:P17475 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17476
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17477
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17478
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17479
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityControlSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing controls for managing the quality of enterprise. Define the process steps for quality controls and the sampling plan. Identify the tools and methods to measure quality. Define the competencies required." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17475" ;
          rdfs:comment "Aggregating planning process; its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop quality controls" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops a quality control specification comprising the control steps, sampling plan, measurement methods, and required competencies." ;
          skos:example "A quality team defines control steps, a sampling plan, measurement tools, and operator competencies for a production line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17476
ex:P17476 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessControlPointSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing the steps for developing quality controls. Conduct Alpha testing. Have the product team conduct rework. Send the product/service for Beta testing, and carry on rework as needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17476" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: establishing control steps/integration points composes a Directive ex:ProcessControlPointSpecification prescribing where quality is checked, not a record of testing already done." ;
          rdfs:label "Define process steps for controls (or integration points)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the process steps and integration points of a quality control as a process control point specification." ;
          skos:example "A quality lead specifies alpha-test, rework, and beta-test gates as control points." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17477
ex:P17477 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SamplingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a detailed summary including measures, on which material, in what manner, and by whom. Identify the parameters to be measured, the range of possible values, and the required resolution. Provide a sampling scheme that details how and when samples will be taken. Select sample sizes. Assign roles and responsibilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17477" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: authoring a ex:SamplingPlan composes a Directive ICE that prescribes how samples are to be drawn; the data later collected under it is a separate Descriptive record." ;
          rdfs:label "Define sampling plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces a sampling plan specifying the parameters, sample sizes, scheme, and responsibilities for taking quality samples." ;
          skos:example "A quality engineer authors a sampling plan fixing sample sizes and inspection timing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17478
ex:P17478 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MeasurementMethodSelection
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Using tools to measure quality. Use tools such as quality improvement oversight system tool, performance measurement tools, consumer information models/guides, and validation tools to effectively determine the quality levels." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17478" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfSelection (reused from apqc-ext.ttl): choosing among candidate tools yields a Directive decision ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify measurement methods" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses the tools and methods for measuring quality and produces a measurement method selection." ;
          skos:example "A quality team selects SPC software and gage-calibration tooling for line measurement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17479
ex:P17479 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetencyRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the competencies required for developing quality controls. Define the required competencies including compliance management, audit management, and document control and document management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17479" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: specifying required competencies composes a Directive ex:CompetencyRequirementSpecification (a prescription of what operators MUST be able to do); appraisal of whether staff hold them is modeled separately." ;
          rdfs:label "Define required competencies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that specifies the competencies required to perform quality-control activities as a competency requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A quality manager documents that control operators must hold audit-management and document-control competencies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17480
ex:P17480 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceCapabilityDemonstration
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Demonstrating the ability and capability to confirm and fulfill the quality requirements in front of customers, managers, employees, board members, associations, regulatory bodies, and creditors. Leverage tools and techniques such as process behavior or control charts, statistical process control, measurement system analysis, gage calibration management, and process capability analysis." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17480" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal); statistical-process-control and process-capability techniques judge conformance ability, yielding a descriptive evidentiary artifact." ;
          rdfs:label "Prove capability to assess compliance with requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates and demonstrates an organization's ability to fulfil its quality requirements and produces a compliance capability demonstration." ;
          skos:example "A quality team runs a process-capability study and presents the results to a regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17481
ex:P17481 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing how the critical-to-quality characteristics will be achieved, controlled, ensured, and managed throughout the lifecycle of a product/service. Address quality requirements and critical-to-quality characteristics. Conduct a preventive quality assessment. Describe how to verify the product/service, verification criteria, and response to nonconformance. Keep records to demonstrate conformity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "17481" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: consolidating requirements, controls, and verification into a finalized ex:QualityPlan composes a single governing Directive ICE; the conformance records kept under it are separate Descriptive outputs." ;
          rdfs:label "Finalize quality plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that consolidates the quality requirements, controls, and verification approach into a finalized quality plan governing a product or service lifecycle." ;
          skos:example "A quality manager issues the approved quality plan covering verification criteria and nonconformance response." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17482
ex:P17482 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17483
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17487
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestSummary
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing if the performance of the quality plan has achieved the estimated and desired requirements. Conduct tests against the quality plan. Assess the results of these tests." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17482" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseQualityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Aggregating appraisal process; its APQC children (testing and assessment) are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate performance to requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that analyzes whether quality performance has met the requirements set in the quality plan and produces a quality test summary." ;
          skos:example "A quality function tests output against the plan and judges whether requirements were met." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17483
ex:P17483 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17484
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17485
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17486
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining the quality of organizational processes. Conduct tests. Collect information and data. Record the results of these tests. Determine the dispositions of the test results." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17483" ;
          rdfs:comment "Aggregating process anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): the parent's OWN definitional product is the Descriptive ex:QualityTestDataRecord, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (info-processing -> descriptive). It is a mixed aggregate -- its children span measuring (ex:P17484, cco:ont00000345), recording (ex:P17485, cco:ont00000366), and a Directive-producing disposition (ex:P17486, ex:ActOfSelection). The directive disposition facet is delegated to the child ex:P17486 and is deliberately NOT lifted onto this parent; 366 (a subClassOf cco:ont00000228) is therefore retained rather than re-anchored to the bare Planned Act, preserving the descriptive-output agreement. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Test against quality plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that conducts quality tests against the quality plan, records the resulting test data, and determines their disposition." ;
          skos:example "An inspector runs tests, logs the data, and assigns a disposition to each result." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17484
ex:P17484 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000345 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating quality performance through periodic or episodic testing against the established standards for quality characteristics. For periodic testing, design a schedule with sufficient time to make any required adjustments to the process or system to maintain the desired level of quality. For episodic testing, conduct a test whenever a known non-conformance or fault occurs, which results in outputs or outcomes known to be unsatisfactory to performance requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17484" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring): determines quality of an entity relative to a standard." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct test and collect data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Measuring that tests quality characteristics against established standards and collects the resulting quality test data record." ;
          skos:example "A technician runs a scheduled gauge test and logs the measured values." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17485
ex:P17485 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining and recording the results of Test against the quality plan [17483] electronically and in standard formats. Assign ownership to a designated function or role." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17485" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Information Processing (cco:ont00000366): recording/storing results into a standard format yields the Descriptive ex:QualityTestDataRecord; this is data capture, not the judgement of those results (which is the sibling Appraisal 17488)." ;
          rdfs:label "Record result(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that records and stores quality test results in standard formats as a quality test data record." ;
          skos:example "A quality clerk enters test outcomes into the QMS in the standard template." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17486
ex:P17486 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestResultDisposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deciding whether to take any additional actions based on the results of quality tests. Initiate a quarantine disposition and relocated inventory, scrap workflow item and scrap transaction, rework operation, net-able and nonnet-able items, and the activity list." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17486" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfSelection (reused): chooses a disposition (quarantine, scrap, rework) from candidates, yielding a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine disposition of result(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that decides the disposition action for quality test results and produces a quality test result disposition." ;
          skos:example "A quality engineer selects a quarantine-and-rework disposition for a failing lot." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17487
ex:P17487 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17488
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17489
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17490
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17491
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestSummary
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the significance of the sample. Summarize the results of the test. Recommend improvement actions. Decide what steps to take next." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17487" ;
          rdfs:comment "Aggregating appraisal process; its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess results of tests" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the significance of quality test results, summarizes them, and recommends improvement actions." ;
          skos:example "A quality analyst summarizes test outcomes and recommends corrective measures to management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17488
ex:P17488 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SampleSignificanceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the significance of the sample chosen for the test in order to determine whether or not the sample is representative of the larger output or outcome. Determine if the sample meets or does not meet the requirements. Identify the conditions for acceptance, rejection, remediation, and prevention." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17488" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Appraisal (cco:ont00000636): judging sample representativeness produces a Descriptive ex:SampleSignificanceAssessment; the underlying ex:QualityTestDataRecord is the has-input evidence, not the output." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess sample significance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges whether a test sample is representative of the larger output and produces a sample significance assessment." ;
          skos:example "A statistician evaluates whether an inspection sample is representative of a production run." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17489
ex:P17489 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestDataRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestSummary
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the major facts and figures of the quality test results in order to provide insights and information. Use charts, tables, statistical test results, and written findings and conclusions in a summary of results." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17489" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Information Processing (cco:ont00000366): summarizing/compiling results into an ex:QualityTestSummary is a Descriptive condensation act, NOT a reporting/communication act -- the source text makes summarizing (not disseminating to an audience) definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Summarize result(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that condenses quality test results into a quality test summary of findings and conclusions." ;
          skos:example "An analyst compiles charts and conclusions into a quality test summary report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17490
ex:P17490 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityTestSummary
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityImprovementRecommendation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recommending measures for improvement. Assess the summarized results to identify areas which can be improved. Suggest actions to management for improving the quality plan basis on the results of the tests." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17490" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (reused): a recommendation prescribes a course of action, hence a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Recommend actions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes recommended improvement measures for the quality plan as a quality improvement recommendation." ;
          skos:example "A quality lead recommends tightening a control limit based on summarized results." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17491
ex:P17491 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityImprovementRecommendation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityImprovementActionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Selecting the subsequent actions that the organization can adopt for improving the enterprise quality. Select measures and recommended actions for managing the enterprise quality." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17491" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfSelection (reused): selects from candidate recommended actions, yielding a Directive ICE. FIXED degenerate I/O: the has-output now points at the distinct ex:QualityImprovementActionDecision (the committed decision), while ex:QualityImprovementRecommendation -- the output of sibling 17490 -- is retained as has-input only. Previously this act asserted the SAME ICE as both input and output (a vacuous self-emission) and collided with 17490's output." ;
          rdfs:label "Decide next steps" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses, from the recommended quality-improvement actions, those the organization will adopt and produces a quality improvement action decision prescribing them." ;
          skos:example "Management selects which recommended quality measures to implement next quarter and records the decision." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17492
ex:P17492 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17493
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17494
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17495
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17496
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17497
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling any nonconformance activities or events. Assess the potential impact of the nonconformity. Decide the immediate actions to take. Identify the root causes. Take corrective or preventive action. Ensure future conformance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17492" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseQualityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded process (Planned Act), not an Organization Capability: a nonconformance handling instance has an identifiable beginning (the event) and end (closure). Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage non-conformance" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that handles a nonconformance event from impact assessment through corrective or preventive action to closure of the nonconformance record." ;
          skos:example "A quality team works a single nonconformance from detection through CAPA to documented closure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17493
ex:P17493 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing any nonconformance events. Determine the need for corrective and/or preventative action(s). Leverage root-cause analysis, risk exposure, and other evaluations to properly review and approve/reject subsequent actions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17493" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Appraisal (cco:ont00000636): rating risk exposure of a nonconformity yields a Descriptive ex:NonconformanceImpactAssessment; the resulting choice of action is the separate Selection act 13.3.3.2." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess potential impact" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates a nonconformance event and produces a nonconformance impact assessment determining the need for corrective or preventive action." ;
          skos:example "An analyst rates the risk exposure of a nonconformity to decide whether CAPA is warranted." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17494
ex:P17494 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceImpactAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveAndPreventiveActionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Initiating immediate corrective, preventative, or no action based upon the impact and likelihood of reoccurrence. Consider cost/benefit, risk exposure, timing, the assignment of responsibility, and other pertinent factors." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17494" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfSelection (reused): selects among action options based on impact, yielding a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine immediate action(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses the immediate corrective, preventive, or no-action response to a nonconformance and produces a corrective and preventive action specification." ;
          skos:example "A quality manager selects an immediate containment action for a high-impact nonconformity." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17495
ex:P17495 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the reasons that have triggered the nonconformance events or activities. Perform a root-cause analysis through documentary evidence and interviews. Involve the appropriate individuals. Leverage cause analysis and risk assessment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17495" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfAnalysis (reused): information processing yielding an explanatory descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify root cause(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines a nonconformance event and produces a root cause analysis of the reasons that triggered it." ;
          skos:example "Investigators trace a defect to a miscalibrated tool via documentary evidence and interviews." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17496
ex:P17496 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveAndPreventiveActionSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveActionCompletionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Pursuing corrective and preventative activities to eliminate the cause of a detected nonconformity. Define the nonconformity. Communicate and assign responsibility. Identify the appropriate corrective and preventive action. Implement and monitor for reoccurrence." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17496" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfImplementation (PROPOSE-EXT): enacts the prescribed CAPA in the organization. GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE FIX: an implementation/enactment act's definitional product is a brought-about state / descriptive completion record, NOT a fresh Directive specification. The Directive ex:CorrectiveAndPreventiveActionSpecification is therefore the governing has-INPUT here (the spec authored by 13.3.3.2 'Determine immediate action'); the has-output is now the Descriptive ex:CorrectiveActionCompletionRecord. The 'identify the appropriate CAPA' authoring facet is modeled separately as the Selection act 13.3.3.2 (ex:P17494), not overloaded onto this implementation class. Root-cause analysis is a typical (non-definitional) supporting input, dropped to comment." ;
          rdfs:label "Take corrective or preventative action" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that carries a corrective and preventive action specification into effect to eliminate the cause of a detected nonconformity and produces a corrective action completion record." ;
          skos:example "A team implements a tooling change and monitors the line for recurrence of the defect, then records completion." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17497
ex:P17497 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveAndPreventiveActionSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NonconformanceRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Closing nonconformance. Perform all the final processes related to the nonconformance, including documenting root causes. Document corrective and preventive actions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "17497" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Information Processing (cco:ont00000366): this act documents root causes and the corrective/preventive actions taken and closes the Descriptive ex:NonconformanceRecord; the actual remediation (enacting the CAPA) is modeled separately as the Implementation act 13.3.3.4 (ex:P17496). The ex:CorrectiveAndPreventiveActionSpecification is the governing has-input, not a fresh output." ,
                       "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): this is a pure compiling/recording act -- it documents root causes and CAPA into, and closes, the nonconformance record. It is NOT reporting/communication (cco:ont00000379/151), since no dissemination to an audience is definitional, and NOT formulation, since no new Directive is authored: the governing ex:CorrectiveAndPreventiveActionSpecification (Directive) is the has-INPUT being documented, and the has-output ex:NonconformanceRecord is Descriptive, preserving info-processing -> descriptive agreement (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Close non-conformance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that documents the root causes and corrective and preventive actions and closes the nonconformance record." ;
          skos:example "A quality clerk finalizes and closes the nonconformance record after CAPA verification." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17498
ex:P17498 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17499
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17500
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17501
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17502
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17503
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17504
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EQMSScopeAndGoalSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and administering the software that manages content and business processes for quality and compliance across the value chain. Define the quality strategy. Plan and deploy the EQMS scope, targets, and goals. Identify core process controls and metric. Develop EQMS governance. Assess the performance of EQMS. Encourage improvements in EQMS." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17498" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EnterpriseQualityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded process (Act of Implementation, PROPOSE-EXT): the establish-and-deploy effort has identifiable phases and bounded children. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement and maintain the enterprise quality management system (EQMS)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that establishes and deploys the enterprise quality management system by defining its strategy, scope, controls, and policies and assessing and improving its performance." ;
          skos:example "A quality program stands up an EQMS platform, configures controls, and runs the first performance assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17499
ex:P17499 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the strategy for managing enterprise quality. Define and formalize quality techniques and standards. Assign responsibilities for achieving the required quality levels. Standardize the quality maintenance procedure, tools and techniques, recording and reporting, the timing of quality maintenance activities, and the roles and responsibilities for the quality management team." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17499" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: formalizing enterprise-quality techniques, standards, and responsibilities composes a Directive ex:QualityStrategy (a prescriptive strategy ICE), consistent with the corpus-wide treatment of strategy as a Directive (965)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define the quality strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that formalizes the techniques, standards, and responsibilities for managing enterprise quality as a quality strategy." ;
          skos:example "A quality director issues the enterprise quality strategy standardizing tools, reporting, and roles." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17500
ex:P17500 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EQMSScopeAndGoalSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and effectively deploying the scope, targets, and goals of EQMS. Define the role of EQMS through nonconformance/corrective and preventive action, compliance/audit management, risk management, failure mode and effects analysis, and statistical process control. Implement EQMS into operational activities. Define the goals and objectives that are to be achieved by the EQMS." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17500" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfImplementation (PROPOSE-EXT): the planning of scope produces the directive, and deployment enacts it operationally." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and deploy the EQMS scope, targets, and goals" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that establishes and deploys the EQMS scope, targets, and goals into operational activities, governed by an EQMS scope and goal specification." ;
          skos:example "A program rolls out the EQMS across audit, risk, and SPC modules per the defined scope." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17501
ex:P17501 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessControlPointSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing and implementing the processes, controls, and metrics for maintenance of EQMS. Define the role of EQMS in failure mode and effects analysis, complaint handling, and advanced product quality planning. Establish the role of EQMS in evaluating metrics such as cost of quality, overall equipment effectiveness, on-time and complete shipments, percentage of products in compliance, and new product introductions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17501" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (reused): recognizing-and-specifying the control/metric set composes a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify core EQMS processes, controls, and metrics" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that specifies the core EQMS processes, controls, and metrics as a process control point specification." ;
          skos:example "A quality architect defines the EQMS controls and the cost-of-quality and OEE metrics to track." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17502
ex:P17502 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProcessGovernanceFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Setting the process limits. Gather required information. Align with other documents and processes. Define the document structure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17502" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Formulation: authoring EQMS policies, procedures, and standards composes a Directive ex:ProcessGovernanceFramework that prescribes how the EQMS is governed." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and document EQMS policies, procedures, standards, and measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and documents the EQMS policies, procedures, standards, and measures as a process governance framework." ;
          skos:example "A quality team authors the EQMS procedure manual and document hierarchy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17503
ex:P17503 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EQMSPerformanceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Benchmarking current performance in quality metrics that span across the value chain. Identify gaps in performance as compared to industry peers. Identify and implement complementary EQMS capabilities. Enable a continuous improvement environment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "17503" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Appraisal (cco:ont00000636): benchmarking EQMS metrics against peers yields a Descriptive ex:EQMSPerformanceAssessment of gaps; implementing the resulting improvements is the separate Improvement act 13.3.4.6." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess the EQMS performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that benchmarks EQMS quality metrics against industry peers and produces an EQMS performance assessment identifying performance gaps." ;
          skos:example "A quality lead benchmarks the EQMS against peers and reports the capability gaps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17504
ex:P17504 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImprovement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17505
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17506
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17507
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17508
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17509
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17510
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Rewarding excellence in quality. Create and maintain quality partnerships. Maintain talent capabilities and competencies. Incorporate EQMS messaging into communication channels. Transfer proven EQMS methods. Consider factors such as EQMS reviews and gap assessments and the alignment and compatibility of business processes and quality. Adopt Lean principles." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "17504" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfImprovement (PROPOSE-EXT). Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Create environment and capability for EQMS improvement(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Improvement that enacts the rewards, partnerships, talent, communications, and method-transfer changes that build an environment and capability for ongoing EQMS improvement." ;
          skos:example "A quality program launches recognition awards, supplier partnerships, and training to drive EQMS maturity." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17505
ex:P17505 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Provisioning rewards for achieving quality excellence. Provide monetary and nonmonetary rewards such as compensation, vacations, gift cards, and reimbursements to employees in in recognition of their services, efforts, and achievements in quality excellence." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17505" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfImplementation (PROPOSE-EXT): enacts the recognition-and-reward plan. The plan is a typical governing input rather than a definitional one, noted here." ;
          rdfs:label "Reward quality excellence" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that grants monetary and nonmonetary rewards to personnel in recognition of quality excellence, governed by a recognition and reward plan." ;
          skos:example "A manager awards gift cards to a team that eliminated a recurring defect." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17506
ex:P17506 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityPartnershipAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and maintaining partnerships with third-party sources to achieve quality excellence. Source and evaluate third-party sources both public and private to ensure that the most effective and efficient partnerships are formed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "17506" ;
          rdfs:comment "Act of Implementation (PROPOSE-EXT): forming/maintaining third-party partnerships is an enactment act; its definitional artifact is the Directive ex:QualityPartnershipAgreement governing the established partnership (minted, per the output comment at the registry entry)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and maintain quality partnerships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that forms and maintains partnerships with third-party sources to advance quality excellence and produces a quality partnership agreement." ;
          skos:example "A quality director establishes a supplier-quality partnership with shared audit rights." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17507
ex:P17507 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000234 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining a common denominator for the competency level within the organization's talent circle. Conduct training sessions, skill development activities, and quality excellence activities to ensure that the resources of the organization are competent enough and have the capabilities to achieve the required level of quality." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "17507" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfImplementation to cco:ont00000234 (Act of Training, VERIFIED §6: imparts knowledge/skills/values to Agents; parent cco:ont00000228 Planned Act). Source text -- 'Conduct training sessions, skill development activities ... to ensure that the resources of the organization are competent' -- is paradigmatically training, not the enactment of a directive plan. Rejected candidate ex:ActOfImplementation: filing a training act under a generic local Implementation genus is a false genus and a D5 reuse miss (the module header provisions Act of Training). Explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent added so Gate C (S2) sees the Act anchor without the CCO closure (same pattern as 17484). Training plan is a typical governing input, noted here." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain talent capabilities and competencies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training that conducts training sessions and skill-development activities to maintain personnel competencies at the level required for quality, governed by a training plan." ;
          skos:example "A quality team runs SPC training to keep operators qualified." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17508
ex:P17508 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assimilating all the communication related to the EQMS into the organization's already established communication channels." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17508" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfImplementation to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication, VERIFIED §6: transfers an ICE from one Agent to another; parent cco:ont00000228 Planned Act). Source text -- 'Assimilating all the communication related to the EQMS into the organization's already established communication channels' -- is fundamentally a communication act, not the enactment of a directive plan. Rejected candidate ex:ActOfImplementation: a false-friend genus and D5 reuse miss. Explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent added so Gate C (S2) sees the Act anchor without the CCO closure. Communication plan is a typical governing input, noted here." ;
          rdfs:label "Incorporate EQMS messaging into communication channels" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that disseminates EQMS-related messaging through the organization's established communication channels, governed by a communication plan." ;
          skos:example "A quality communications lead adds EQMS updates to the intranet and newsletter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17509
ex:P17509 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RoleDefinitionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring EQMS access to the person in charge of the quality management process. Establish who has the authority to manage the EQMS. Ensure access of EQMS to only the person(s) in authority." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "17509" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfImplementation (PROPOSE-EXT): enacts an access/role arrangement defined by a role definition specification." ;
          rdfs:label "Assure independent EQMS management access to appropriate authority in the organization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that establishes and secures EQMS management access for the authorized quality role, governed by a role definition specification." ;
          skos:example "An administrator grants EQMS administrative rights only to the designated quality manager." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17510
ex:P17510 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BestPracticesRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recording and transferring the best practices and proven methods associated with enterprise quality management systems (EQMS) that can be leveraged in improving the organization's framework. Record proven methodologies and approaches with the objective of communicating them for upgrading, refining, and enhancing the organization's systems." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.3.4.6.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "17510" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): captures and transfers proven methods as a descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Transfer proven EQMS methods" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that records and disseminates proven EQMS methods and best practices as a best practices register." ;
          skos:example "A knowledge lead documents a proven CAPA workflow and shares it across sites." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17682
ex:P17682 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketShareAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the percentage of total sales volume in the market for a particular product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "17682" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: a quantitative calculation yielding the descriptive ex:MarketShareAnalysis (per the section vocab mapping of 3.4.3.1)." ;
          rdfs:label "Calculate product market share" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that calculates the percentage of total market sales volume held by a particular product and produces a market-share analysis." ;
          skos:example "An analyst computes that a SKU holds 12 percent of its category's unit volume." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17683
ex:P17683 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfForecasting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ROIForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Estimating how much profit the company would generate for its expenses on marketing . Forecasted return on investment, used as a metric to gauge the efficiency of marketing, is beneficial in revising marketing budgets and adjusting costs to improve the overall yield." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "17683" ;
          rdfs:comment "Predictive output (an ROI forecast) agrees with the forecasting genus per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine projected ROI for marketing investment" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Forecasting that estimates the uncertain future return on marketing investment and produces a return-on-investment forecast." ;
          skos:example "An analyst forecasts the ROI of the planned marketing spend to inform budget revisions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P17684
ex:P17684 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PricingApproval
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Obtaining internal price approvals and governmental approvals that are required for licensed products and for products that can be reimbursed by the government." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.3.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "17684" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PricingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ActOfAcquisition (inlined): an approval not previously held is obtained from an authority. Directive output (a pricing approval)." ;
          rdfs:label "Achieve regulatory approval for pricing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains the internal and governmental pricing approvals required for licensed or reimbursable products." ;
          skos:example "A regulatory team secures government price approval for a reimbursable drug." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18083
ex:P18083 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOption
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PartnershipSelectionDecision
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supporting the design, manufacture and distribution of product and services through the extended enterprise model.  This is concerned with the strategic decisions on make vs buy, in house or out sourced.  Senior Executives map out how they want to run their business.  Make strategic choices as to whether to buy in components / sub-assemblies, run their own distribution fleet or contract out, own their dealerships or franchise out, etc.  Strategize with partnerships. Collaborate design consideration at strategy level for automotive and procurement act within the Target Operating Model set at strategy level." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "18083" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection: 'make strategic choices' commits to make-vs-buy and partnership options. Added (Gate-F) the Directive chosen-option output ex:PartnershipSelectionDecision required by the Selection genus (the Golden Principle ties a Selection act to a Directive decision output); previously only the Descriptive ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis was asserted, which the genus alone did not satisfy. The analysis is retained as the supporting evidence the decision rests on." ;
          rdfs:label "Select partnerships and relationships to support the extended enterprise" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses among make-versus-buy and partnership options for the extended enterprise and produces a partnership selection decision prescribing the chosen relationships." ;
          skos:example "Executives decide to outsource distribution and franchise dealerships rather than run them in-house." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18115
ex:P18115 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesLead
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OpportunityValidation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing the set of potential customers and sales opportunities. Approve the leads that meet company requirements on new businesses." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "18115" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act reviews and judges leads against requirements. Output is Descriptive (a validation judgement)." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate and qualify leads/opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input sales leads and has as output an opportunity validation result indicating which leads meet company requirements." ;
          skos:example "A sales manager reviews the lead set and approves those meeting new-business criteria." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18116
ex:P18116 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesLead
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OpportunityWinPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating plans about how to close leads and win sales opportunities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "18116" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): the act composes a Directive ICE (the win plan). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: planning genus agrees with directive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop opportunity win plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input sales leads and has as output an opportunity win plan prescribing how to close them." ;
          skos:example "A rep drafts a win plan detailing the steps to close a high-value opportunity." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18126
ex:P18126 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductManagementTeam
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handing over data to management to analyze common issues in regards to customer service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "18126" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ProductManagerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) per Gate-F review: the act is a DIRECTED hand-off of an ICE to a named recipient (ex:ProductManagementTeam), prototypically an Act of Communication. REJECTED the prior generic cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) anchor as inconsistent with the section's own treatment of structurally identical 'deliver-to-recipient' acts (e.g. ex:InquiryResponse via Act of Representative Communication; Act of Communication is verified-and-available in the module header): anchoring one directed ICE transfer under Communication and another under generic Information Processing drops the directedness (who the ICE is conveyed TO). The Descriptive output ex:CustomerFeedback is retained (the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE still holds: communication of a Descriptive ICE). The same anchor is applied to P11241 so all directed-handoff rows in 6.5 are consistent with 6.2's Respond pattern." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide customer feedback to product management on customer service experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which customer feedback on the customer service experience is transferred to the product management team for downstream analysis." ;
          skos:example "A service lead forwards the consolidated customer-service feedback file to the product management team." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18129
ex:P18129 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InsuranceCoverageAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the changing needs for insurance coverage. Research available insurance providers and offerings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.1.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "18129" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the adequacy of coverage. Output is a Descriptive ICE (the insurance coverage assessment). Process part of 16458." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess adequacy of insurance coverage" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the organization's changing insurance-coverage needs against available providers and offerings and produces an insurance coverage assessment." ;
          skos:example "Comparing current policy limits to projected exposures and recommending added coverage." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18130
ex:P18130 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductMarketingContent
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Authoring or overseeing the creation of the textual portion of a product description, advertisement, or web page, including the headline, body, product attributes, and brand or advertiser information. A copy is designed to provide information about the product and to catch and hold the interest of prospective buyers long enough to persuade them to make a purchase. The copy of a website is called its content." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.9.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "18130" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:MarketingManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F): the output ex:ProductMarketingContent is an explicitly DESCRIPTIVE ICE ('persuasive intent does not make it directive -- it states facts/claims about the offering'), but the prior genus ex:ActOfFormulation entails a DIRECTIVE output by its apqc-ext.ttl definition -- a GOLDEN PRINCIPLE violation (the 'composes an artifact' false-friend reading of Formulation). Re-anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) plus cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), consistent with its sibling P16630. Output ex:ProductMarketingContent (Descriptive) retained." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage product copy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that authors the textual product marketing content about an offering, including headline, body, and attributes." ;
          skos:example "A copywriter drafts the headline and body text for a product page." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18592
ex:P18592 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:UsefulLifeAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring assets against their planned useful life. Each asset may have specific criteria that indicate their usability. This may include time-based, maintenance history, capacity planning, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "18592" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: monitoring -> Descriptive ICE (UsefulLifeAssessment). Uses ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor useful life of assets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes assets against their planned useful-life criteria and produces a useful-life assessment of their remaining usability." ;
          skos:example "A reliability engineer tracks a pump against its rated service hours and reports it is approaching end-of-life." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18627
ex:P18627 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PolicyAndProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing standardized procedures for effective communication that maximizes ROI, promotes brand awareness and respects customers. In its simplest form, it includes a message (what is to be said), a target (to whom the message is reaching) and a medium or a channel (where the message is to be said)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.5.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "18627" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PolicyAndProcedure is Directive, agreeing with the Formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Define communication guidelines and mechanisms" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes standardized procedures for effective marketing communication and produces a set of communication policies and procedures." ;
          skos:example "A team writes the house style and approval procedure for all outbound marketing messages." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18629
ex:P18629 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AllianceAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Setting up strategic alliances with key trade partners and ratifying partnership agreements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.4.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "18629" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): ratifying an already-negotiated single agreement is not a candidate-set choice, so it is NOT ex:ActOfSelection; the output is the directive ex:AllianceAgreement." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish partner and alliance agreements" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that sets up strategic alliances with key trade partners by ratifying partnership agreements and produces an alliance agreement." ;
          skos:example "Executives sign the alliance agreement ratifying terms with a key distributor." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18641
ex:P18641 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPartner
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Distributing marketing materials and sales brochures to entities that the company partners with." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "18641" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SalesPartnerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): marketing-material ICEs are transferred to partners. The distributed-collateral artifact is typical but not definitional for every instance (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide marketing materials to sales partners/alliances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that distributes marketing materials and sales brochures to an organization's sales partners and alliances." ;
          skos:example "A channel team ships co-branded brochures to a reseller." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18916
ex:P18916 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conveying planned procedures and methods to both internal departments and external stakeholders like customers, suppliers, etc., in an effective manner based on organizational objective." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "18916" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): an existing business strategy ICE is transferred from the organization to internal and external stakeholders. The business strategy is the definitional input; stakeholders are participants. Leaf process." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate strategies internally and externally" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that conveys the organization's business strategy to internal departments and external stakeholders." ;
          skos:example "Leadership rolls out the new strategy to staff, customers, and suppliers via briefings and publications." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18924
ex:P18924 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16633
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P18925
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P18926
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P18927
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20007
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerLoyaltyProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and managing a customer loyalty program. The loyalty program is a key part of marketing, with an elaborate strategy and process for acquiring, retaining, and engaging with members. Members are engaged and acquainted to the loyalty program, thus growing relationship and adding value through the program." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "18924" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: modeled as a process because its dominant act 'create ... a loyalty program' yields a bounded Directive ex:CustomerLoyaltyProgram; the program's ongoing operation is decomposed into its bounded child acts (acquire/engage/monitor/optimize). Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Design and manage customer loyalty program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates a customer loyalty program for acquiring, retaining, and engaging members and produces a customer loyalty program specification." ;
          skos:example "A loyalty team designs and launches a points-based customer loyalty program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18925
ex:P18925 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerMasterData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Convincing customers to register their personal information with the company and be assigned a unique identifier that they use when making purchases. The identifier makes it easier for the company to track customer purchases. Customers are rewarded by various incentives that encourage repeat business [20007]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "18925" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAcquisition (reused from apqc-ext): the organization obtains a member's registered information it did not previously hold. Output ex:CustomerMasterData is Descriptive (is-about Customer) - the registered personal information and identifier." ;
          rdfs:label "Acquire members to customer loyalty program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition in which the organization obtains a customer's registration and assigns a unique loyalty identifier, producing customer master data for the enrolled member." ;
          skos:example "A cashier signs a shopper up to the loyalty program, capturing their details under a member ID." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18926
ex:P18926 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Building deeper relationships between a customer and a brand in order to promote customer loyalty and derive repeat business. Besides making frequent purchases, highly engaged customers refer family, friends and colleagues to make purchases as well, consume and re-broadcast promotional materials, provide feedback to the purchases they make and do not support competing brands." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "18926" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): this is an operational relationship-building act, not information-processing, planning, appraisal, or selection. Its members are participants. No informational output is definitional (the deepened relationship is a quality of the bearer, not an ICE), so none is asserted (Phase-3); ex:CustomerFeedback is a typical by-product, noted here." ;
          rdfs:label "Build engagement and relationship with members" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an organization engages loyalty-program members through interactions that deepen the customer-brand relationship and promote repeat business." ;
          skos:example "A brand runs an engagement program that turns members into repeat buyers and referrers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18927
ex:P18927 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Enhancing the customer loyalty program so that it will yield maximum value both for the company and for the patrons enrolled in the program, increasing customer retention and continued engagement." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "18927" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:ImprovementPlan is Directive, agreeing with the Formulation genus. ex:PerformanceReport (from 16633) is a definitional input - the optimization acts on the monitored benefits." ;
          rdfs:label "Optimize loyalty program value to both the enterprise and the customer" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that enhances a customer loyalty program to maximize its value to the enterprise and its members and produces an improvement plan." ;
          skos:example "A manager revises reward tiers to lift both retention and program margin." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18941
ex:P18941 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketSegmentation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:UnderservedSegmentFinding
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining which groups of potential customers do not yet, or already do have access to the product or a service that the company produces or markets. Use those findings to create specialized product offerings and differentiated marketing campaigns." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.1.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "18941" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (reused from apqc-ext.ttl, discernment sense): the act discerns and registers under-served vs saturated segments; output is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify under-served and saturated market segments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input a market segmentation and has as output an under-served and saturated segment finding that registers which segments lack or already have access to the organization's offerings." ;
          skos:example "A team flags two under-served segments and one saturated segment for differentiated campaigns." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P18948
ex:P18948 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:IncentiveScheme
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Introducing financial inducements, such as discounts, to distributors, resellers or vendors as a motivation to prioritize selling company's products or services over those of its competitors." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "18948" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PricingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (an incentive scheme) agrees with the planning genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine corporate incentives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an incentive scheme of financial inducements offered to distributors, resellers, or vendors." ;
          skos:example "A pricing team designs a volume-discount scheme to motivate resellers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19072
ex:P19072 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerComplaint
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplaintAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing complaint logs to provide input for continuous service improvement and customer profiling." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19072" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerComplaintManagementCapability ,
                                ex:CustomerServiceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses shared ex:ActOfAnalysis. Output is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Operates over the aggregate complaint log, so the complaint input is definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze customer complaints and response/redressal" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer complaints and has as output a complaint analysis describing patterns that inform service improvement and customer profiling." ;
          skos:example "A quality team mines a quarter of complaint records to find recurring defect themes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19209
ex:P19209 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19210
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19211
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19212
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CapitalInvestmentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Producing and maintaining a planning schedule and a financial plan to purchase or manufacture productive assets. Determine the investment plan, monitor capital, and secure the necessary financing in order to realize completion of the program." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19209" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetConstructionCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded program-management act (one capital program has a definite begin/end), not a standing capability; anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) as a composite of formulation, monitoring, and acquisition acts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage capital program for assets" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Organization produces and maintains the financial plan for acquiring or constructing productive assets, decomposing into defining the capital investment plan, monitoring the capital program, and securing construction financing." ;
          skos:example "A facilities team prepares the investment plan and arranges loans for a new warehouse build." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19210
ex:P19210 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CapitalInvestmentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing what funds will be invested in the construction of productive assets for the advancement of established business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19210" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: formulation/planning -> Directive ICE (CapitalInvestmentPlan). Uses shared genus ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define capital investment plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a capital investment plan prescribing the funds to be invested in the construction of productive assets." ;
          skos:example "Finance defines a USD 40M capital plan for a new plant." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19211
ex:P19211 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CapitalInvestmentPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CapitalProgramReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring plans on capital projects. Capital projects can be purchasing buildings, lands, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19211" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: monitoring -> Descriptive ICE (CapitalProgramReport). Uses ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor capital program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input a capital investment plan and has as output a capital program report describing the tracked status of the capital projects." ;
          skos:example "A program office tracks spend against the capital plan and issues a quarterly status report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19212
ex:P19212 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionFinancing
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Acquiring the loans needed to construct necessary assets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19212" ;
          rdfs:comment "Uses shared genus ex:ActOfAcquisition (cco:ont00000228 Planned Act): the org obtains financing it did not previously hold. Output is a Directive ICE (the financing arrangement)." ;
          rdfs:label "Secure construction financing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that has as output a construction financing arrangement obtained to fund the construction of assets." ;
          skos:example "Treasury secures a construction loan facility for the build program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19220
ex:P19220 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a strategy to perform asset construction. Assure that timelines, regulations, and resources are on task and on budget." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19220" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: formulation -> Directive ICE (ConstructionStrategy). Uses ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop construction strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a construction strategy prescribing how asset construction is to be performed within timeline, regulatory, and budget constraints." ;
          skos:example "A project lead drafts the construction strategy and delivery approach for a new facility." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19221
ex:P19221 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionPermit
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Gathering the required permits for construction from the proper jurisdiction. This may include inspections during and after construction to verify that the new asset meets all national, regional, and local codes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19221" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:RegulatoryAuthorityRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Uses ex:ActOfAcquisition (cco:ont00000228): the org obtains a permit it did not previously hold from a Regulatory Authority. Output is a Directive ICE (ConstructionPermit). Inspections referenced in the text are typical, not definitional -> not restricted." ;
          rdfs:label "Obtain construction permissions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that has as output a construction permit obtained from the proper jurisdiction authorizing construction of the asset." ;
          skos:example "A developer obtains building permits from the municipal authority before construction begins." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19222
ex:P19222 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:AssetDesign
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Designing assets to meet organizational needs as well as ensuring that the asset adheres to all national, regional, and local construction codes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19222" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: designing is formulation -> Directive ICE (AssetDesign). Uses ex:ActOfFormulation. Regulatory requirements are a typical input -> noted, not restricted." ;
          rdfs:label "Design assets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an asset design prescribing an asset that meets organizational needs and adheres to applicable construction codes." ;
          skos:example "Engineers produce the design and drawings for a new production machine." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19223
ex:P19223 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionResourcePlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining what resources will need to be acquired in order to carry out construction. Plan when, where, and how resources will be used. Determine the length of time resources will be utilized." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19223" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: planning -> Directive ICE (ConstructionResourcePlan). Uses ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan construction resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a construction resource plan prescribing what resources will be acquired and when, where, and how long they will be used for construction." ;
          skos:example "A planner schedules crews, equipment, and materials for the build." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19224
ex:P19224 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19225
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19226
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19227
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing the performance and quality of work. Assure that records are maintained throughout the construction process. Adhere to all safety, security, and access regulations set forth by the organization and all government standards." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19224" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetConstructionCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from the narrow ex:ActOfMonitoring to the composite cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), matching its three sibling group-parents 10.2.1/10.2.2/10.2.3 (ex:P19209, ex:P20139, ex:P19229), which are all anchored at Planned Act because they aggregate acts of mixed genera. This node's three modeled children span heterogeneous genera -- monitoring (ex:P19225), Act of Appraisal/QC (ex:P19226), and Act of Information Processing/record creation (ex:P19227) -- so typing the whole aggregate as a single Act of Monitoring mis-types it (a monitoring act does not have a quality-control appraisal as a proper part). The oversight emphasis is kept in the definition; the monitoring/appraisal/record children carry their own genera as process parts. Its safety/security/access child (PCF 19228) is a standing function modeled as ex:P19228 Organization Capability (R6) and is therefore NOT attached here as a has-process-part; it is realized in the org's safety acts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage asset construction" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Organization oversees the performance and quality of construction work and maintains records throughout the construction process, decomposing into monitoring work performance, undertaking quality control, and creating work and asset records." ;
          skos:example "A project office oversees a building project's quality and keeps its construction records." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19225
ex:P19225 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring construction to insure that all regulatory laws are being adhered to, that all work is being performed in a timely manner, and that quality assurance is met at all steps of the construction process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19225" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: monitoring -> Descriptive ICE (WorkPerformanceReport). Uses ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor work performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as output a work performance report describing regulatory adherence, timeliness, and quality assurance across the construction process." ;
          skos:example "An inspector tracks regulatory compliance and progress and logs a performance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19226
ex:P19226 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityControlReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing a checks and balances system to verify that the construction was performed correctly. Rework when errors are found." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19226" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates/judges the correctness and quality of the construction. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> Descriptive ICE (QualityControlReport)." ;
          rdfs:label "Undertake construction quality control" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output a quality control report judging whether the construction was performed correctly and identifying defects to be reworked." ;
          skos:example "A QA team inspects completed work and issues a quality control report flagging defects for rework." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19227
ex:P19227 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkAndAssetRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing records to include all construction work that has been performed. Include all new or modified construction, and any construction or regulatory issues that might have occurred." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19227" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): compiling/registering records is manipulating input information into an output record. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: information-processing -> Descriptive ICE (WorkAndAssetRecord)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create work and asset records" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as output a work and asset record describing all construction work performed, including new or modified construction and any construction or regulatory issues." ;
          skos:example "A clerk compiles the as-built record documenting all work and issues on the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19228
ex:P19228 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that safety, security, and access is maintained. Provide a workplace that meets and exceeds all local, state, and federal guidelines. Provide security and access to the building site as set forth by safety and organizational guidelines." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19228" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5/R6: standing function with no natural end ('Ensuring that ... is maintained') -> Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), not a bounded process. Therefore NOT a has-process-part of parent ex:P19224. Realized in ongoing acts that maintain site safety/security/access (producing safety compliance records)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage safety, security, and access to sites" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to continuously maintain the safety, security, and access of construction and operational sites in conformance with safety and regulatory guidelines." ;
          skos:example "A firm's ongoing site-safety and access-control program covering all its construction sites." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19229
ex:P19229 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19230
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19231
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19232
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19233
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19234
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arranging a timetable for which to perform construction work. Schedule resources to contract assets for new or replacement assets. Reschedule or redesign assets if needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19229" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetConstructionCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded schedule-and-build phase; anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) as a composite of a scheduling act and material construction/modification acts. Children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule and perform construction work" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Organization schedules and physically carries out construction work, decomposing into scheduling the work, obtaining resources, constructing new assets, augmenting existing assets, and renewing or replacing assets." ;
          skos:example "A contractor schedules and executes the erection of a new factory building." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19230
ex:P19230 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a timetable for which to execute the construction of the asset." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19230" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: scheduling is formulation -> Directive ICE (ConstructionSchedule). Uses ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule construction work" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a construction schedule prescribing the timetable for executing the construction of the asset." ;
          skos:example "A planner sets the construction milestone schedule for the project." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19231
ex:P19231 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionResource
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Gathering resources needed to complete all construction work. Verify that all resources have the proper training and skills to perform the work." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19231" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category -> MATERIAL output is legal (ex:ConstructionResource is a Material Entity). Uses ex:ActOfAcquisition: the org obtains resources it did not previously hold." ;
          rdfs:label "Obtain resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that has as output construction resources gathered to complete the construction work." ;
          skos:example "A site manager procures steel, formwork, and a crane for the build." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19232
ex:P19232 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000051 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConstructionResource
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Building new assets necessary for the organization. Be aware of any construction codes and permits that need to be addressed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19232" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction): 'Material Artifacts are built on site as prescribed by some contract' -- exactly building a new asset. Operations category -> MATERIAL input/output (ConstructionResource in, ProductiveAsset out). A construction permit is referenced but typical, not definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Construct new assets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Construction that has as input construction resources and has as output a newly built productive asset required by the organization." ;
          skos:example "A crew erects a new assembly line building on site." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19233
ex:P19233 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000970 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Modifying existing assets to align with the changing needs of the organization. Be aware of any construction codes and permits that need to be addressed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19233" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000970 (Act of Artifact Modification): an existing Material Artifact is acted upon to change its qualities/functions -- exactly augmenting an existing asset. Rejected cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction), which builds a NEW artifact. Operations category -> MATERIAL input and output." ;
          rdfs:label "Augment existing assets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Artifact Modification that has as input an existing productive asset and has as output that asset modified to align with the changing needs of the organization." ;
          skos:example "An engineering team retrofits an existing plant with new automation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19234
ex:P19234 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReplacementNeedAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the need to replace existing assets. Be aware of any construction codes and permits that need to be addressed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19234" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction) to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). The lead gerund 'Determining the need to replace existing assets' is a determination/appraisal yielding a DESCRIPTIVE judgement (ex:ReplacementNeedAssessment), not a build; this is the false-friend on the label 'Replace' -- the row classifies the DECISION to replace, not the act of constructing the replacement. Consistent with the determination siblings 10.1.1.3 (ex:P10957) and 10.1.2.3 (ex:P10960). Rejected cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction): the Element Description never states a build, a replacement ProductiveAsset output, nor a UsefulLifeAssessment input (the latter is borrowed from the 10.4 vocabulary). DESIGN NOTE / CQ target: the unsupported has-output some ex:ProductiveAsset and has-input some ex:UsefulLifeAssessment were dropped (Phase-3 definitional-necessity test: neither is licensed by the Element Description). If the physical replacement build is later in scope, it should be a SEPARATE supporting Act-of-Construction class, not collapsed into this determination row." ;
          rdfs:label "Renew/Replace assets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges whether an existing asset needs to be renewed or replaced and has as output a replacement need assessment." ;
          skos:example "After reviewing a machine's condition, an engineer determines it needs replacing and records that finding." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19239
ex:P19239 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10967
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10968
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19240
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19241
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19242
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19243
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19244
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that necessary resources are available and tasks are prioritized accordingly through planning. Provide strategies and policies that identify tasks that need to be completed, and the resources necessary to fulfill those tasks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19239" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetMaintenanceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 10.3.1 as a bounded occurrent. Its APQC activities are process parts (cco:ont00001777), not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan asset maintenance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that determines the maintenance strategies, policies, tasks, and resources required to preserve an organization's productive assets and produces the corresponding maintenance plans." ;
          skos:example "A facilities team's annual maintenance-planning cycle producing the year's strategy, policies, task list, and resource plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19240
ex:P19240 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenanceStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating goals and agendas to better realize the success of the maintenance policies that have been put into place." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19240" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Maintenance Strategy), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop maintenance strategies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the goals and agendas guiding asset maintenance and has as output a maintenance strategy." ;
          skos:example "A maintenance manager drafts the multi-year strategy aligning upkeep goals with asset-criticality." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19241
ex:P19241 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenancePolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Communicating policies in regards to asset maintenance. Provide a clear set of procedures and policies that outline what will be involved in the maintenance process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19241" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation: its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Maintenance Policy). De-conflation note (Gate-F, false-friend caution): the source LEADS with 'Communicating policies in regards to asset maintenance' then 'Provide a clear set of procedures and policies'. Phase-1 reads 'Communicating' here as articulating/issuing the AUTHORED policy, not as policy dissemination; the definitional act is authoring the Directive ICE (ex:MaintenancePolicy), so the genus is Formulation (Act of Planning) and the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE holds (directive output -> planning genus). Rejected the Act of Communication reading (cco:ont00001261 / the cco:ont00000402 Act of Communication family): were this row genuine dissemination of an ALREADY-AUTHORED policy it would duplicate the authoring at 10.3.1.1 (strategy) / 10.3.1.7 (work plans); on a dissemination re-reading it should re-anchor to an Act of Communication with ex:MaintenancePolicy as has input, not has output." ;
          rdfs:label "Specify maintenance policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that articulates the procedures and rules governing asset maintenance and has as output a maintenance policy." ;
          skos:example "A facilities office issues the documented maintenance policy and procedure manual." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19242
ex:P19242 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkTaskList
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the steps needed for asset maintenance. List out the those tasks that are involved in completing this process. Prioritize the tasks that are created." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19242" ;
          rdfs:comment "Although phrased 'Identify ...', the definitional output is a prescriptive prioritized task list (Directive ICE), so by the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE the genus is Formulation (Act of Planning), not Identification." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify work management tasks & priorities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that enumerates and prioritizes the tasks required for asset maintenance and has as output a work task list." ;
          skos:example "A supervisor compiles and ranks the work-order tasks for the upcoming maintenance window." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19243
ex:P19243 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourcePlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing workload needs in relation to asset maintenance and plan resources around those needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "19243" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Resource Plan)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct resource planning" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that determines the resources required to meet asset-maintenance workload and has as output a resource plan." ;
          skos:example "A planner allocates technicians, parts, and budget to the forecasted maintenance workload." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19244
ex:P19244 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating procedures on how to maintain productive assets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "19244" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation: its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Work Plan)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create work plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the procedures for maintaining productive assets and has as output a work plan." ;
          skos:example "A planner writes the step-by-step work plan for servicing a pump assembly." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19245
ex:P19245 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19246
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19247
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19248
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19249
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19251
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19252
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that asset maintenance is conducted in a timely manner and successfully. Schedule work with the required resources with an eye on quality control and safety. Verify that contracted maintenance meets performance targets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19245" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetMaintenanceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F, GOLDEN PRINCIPLE at the umbrella) from cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning) to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), the honest umbrella genus for a heterogeneous coordination cycle. This node asserts NO has-output restriction, and several of its process parts are descriptive/appraisal acts (ex:P19248 Appraisal, ex:P19249 Info Processing, ex:P19250 Monitoring, ex:P19252 Monitoring) whose outputs are Descriptive ICEs, so typing the whole 'manage/coordinate execution' cycle as an Act of Planning ('making a Plan to achieve an Objective') over-commits the genus (the analysis-misfiled-under-Planning failure mode). Modeled as a bounded coordination occurrent (an execution-management cycle with begin/end), not a never-ending function: it hosts the 10.3.2 activities as process parts (cco:ont00001777), and the formulation/appraisal/monitoring children carry their own genera. The earlier has-output justification is withdrawn, since the class asserts no output. Consistent with the bounded-oversight umbrellas modeled elsewhere in 10.0." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage asset maintenance" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that coordinates the scheduling, resourcing, quality control, safety, and performance verification of asset-maintenance work to ensure it is completed successfully." ;
          skos:example "A maintenance coordinator runs the cycle of scheduling crews, controlling quality, and confirming targets are met for a quarter's work." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19246
ex:P19246 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenanceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a timetable for which to execute the maintenance of the asset." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19246" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Maintenance Schedule)." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule maintenance work" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that defines the timetable for executing asset maintenance and has as output a maintenance schedule." ;
          skos:example "A coordinator sets dates and crews for each scheduled servicing in the work queue." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19247
ex:P19247 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenanceResource
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Gathering resources needed to complete all maintenance work. Verify that all resources have the proper training and skills to perform the work." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19247" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ActOfAcquisition (Planned Act). Operations category: the obtained resources are material entities, attached as a material participant via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant) -- the same pattern as the operations sibling 10.2.3.2 (ex:P19231 'Obtain resources'). Corrected (Gate-F, critical): the previous axiom's filler ex:AssetPart is defined as a part resulting from DISMANTLING an end-of-life asset (a 10.4 disposition concept), which is the wrong universal for resources gathered to PERFORM maintenance; replaced with the maintenance-resource material entity ex:MaintenanceResource. (Material fillers are modeled as has-participant rather than has-output here because in this domain a has-output filler must be an Information Content Entity.)" ;
          rdfs:label "Obtain required resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains the spare parts, consumables, and material resources needed to complete maintenance work, which participate in the act as the gathered maintenance resources." ;
          skos:example "A storekeeper draws spare parts and consumables for the week's work orders." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19248
ex:P19248 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:QualityControlReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing a checks and balances system to verify that the maintenance was performed correctly. Rework when errors are found." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19248" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the quality/condition of completed work, yielding a Descriptive ICE (Quality Control Report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Undertake quality control" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that verifies whether maintenance work was performed correctly and has as output a quality control report." ;
          skos:example "An inspector checks a completed repair against spec and records pass/fail with required rework." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19249
ex:P19249 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkAndAssetRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Modifying existing maintenance records to include all new work that has been performed, what assets were serviced, and any issues that might have arisen." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19249" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored directly under cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): existing record ICEs are received and modified into an updated Descriptive ICE (Work and Asset Record)." ;
          rdfs:label "Update work and asset records" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that revises maintenance records to register the work performed, the assets serviced, and any issues, and has as output an updated work and asset record." ;
          skos:example "A technician closes a work order and updates the asset's service history." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19250
ex:P19250 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenanceSafetyAssuranceAct
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assuring that all safety laws and regulations are being implemented and followed. Align practices with regulatory bureaus such as OSHA , EHS, and ISO." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19250" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-modeled (Gate-F, R5 reconciliation) from a bounded ex:ActOfMonitoring process to a standing Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568), mirroring its parallel 10.2 sibling PCF 19228 (ex:P19228), which was modeled as a standing function for the same kind of safety/security/access assurance. The source ('Assuring that all safety laws and regulations are being implemented and followed') describes an ongoing, never-ending assurance function with no natural end, so by R5 it is a capability, not a bounded process. Realized in the org's safety-assurance acts (which produce ex:SafetyComplianceRecord). Therefore NOT a has-process-part of parent ex:P19245; the parallel rows 10.2.4.4 and 10.3.2.5 are now anchored consistently." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage maintenance work safety" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to continuously assure that maintenance work practices implement and follow applicable safety laws and regulations and align with regulatory bureaus such as OSHA, EHS, and ISO." ;
          skos:example "A firm's ongoing maintenance-safety assurance program aligning practices with OSHA, EHS, and ISO." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19251
ex:P19251 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenancePerformanceTarget
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining what should be achieved through predictive indicators with regard to performing maintenance. This could include the length of time it takes to perform routine maintenance or how often unplanned maintenance feasibly occur." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "19251" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation: its definitional output is a Directive ICE (Maintenance Performance Target)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define maintenance performance targets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the predictive performance indicators to be achieved in maintenance and has as output a maintenance performance target." ;
          skos:example "A manager sets the target mean-time-to-repair and acceptable unplanned-failure rate." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19252
ex:P19252 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenancePerformanceTarget
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MaintenancePerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Following set performance targets, monitor and gage the success of the organization in meeting those targets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "19252" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT): it receives the performance-target ICE and observed results, yielding a Descriptive ICE (Maintenance Performance Report). The target is a definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor maintenance performance against targets/contracts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that gauges maintenance performance against established targets and contracts and has as output a maintenance performance report." ;
          skos:example "A reliability engineer compares actual downtime against targets and reports variance to management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19253
ex:P19253 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000950 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10947
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19254
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19255
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19256
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19257
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Engaging in all aspects of asset maintenance. Ensure that all assets are functioning properly and to all specified codes and regulations where applicable. Maintenance includes all preventative, routine, and corrective activates." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19253" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetMaintenanceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance), verified: 'An Act of Artifact Modification in which a Material Artifact is modified in order to preserve or restore one or more of its designed Qualities or Functions.' Its APQC activities are process parts (cco:ont00001777)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform asset maintenance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Maintenance in which an organization acts upon its productive assets to preserve or restore their designed functions, comprising preventive, routine, and corrective work." ;
          skos:example "A maintenance crew works through the preventive, routine, and corrective tasks on the plant's equipment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19254
ex:P19254 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000950 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Carrying out required maintenance to continue upkeep of equipment or assets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19254" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance); the maintained productive asset is a definitional material has-input filler." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform routine asset maintenance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Maintenance that carries out the recurring upkeep required to keep a productive asset in working condition." ;
          skos:example "A crew performs the routine filter changes and inspections on the HVAC system." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19255
ex:P19255 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000950 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Repairing or correcting faults that occur with an asset. This could be a break or other repairable damage." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19255" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance), whose definition explicitly covers restoring designed functions; the faulted asset is a definitional material has-input filler." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform corrective asset maintenance and repairs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Maintenance that repairs or corrects a fault in a productive asset to restore its designed functions." ;
          skos:example "A technician replaces a failed bearing to return a pump to service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19256
ex:P19256 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Realizing potential or current problems with assets that would require unplanned maintenance. Unplanned maintenance is a repair or change that needs to be made that is not preventative or routine." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19256" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense, an Act of Information Processing). The output requirement register is typical but not present for every instance (a scan may find no new problems), so it is recorded here rather than as an owl:someValuesFrom restriction (Phase-3 necessity)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify unplanned maintenance requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns current or potential asset problems requiring unplanned maintenance and registers the resulting requirements." ;
          skos:example "An operator notices abnormal vibration and flags an unplanned-repair requirement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19257
ex:P19257 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000950 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing repairs that occur outside of normal routine or preventative maintenance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19257" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance); the repaired asset is a definitional material has-input filler." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform unplanned maintenance and repairs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Maintenance that performs repairs on a productive asset outside the routine or preventive maintenance schedule to restore its designed functions." ;
          skos:example "A crew is dispatched to fix an unexpected conveyor failure on the line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19258
ex:P19258 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDisposition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductiveAsset
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Retiring assets that are no longer viable to the business. Decommission assets that are no longer in working order, are out of date, or whose maintenance exceeds the cost of replacement." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19258" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetDispositionCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category: the asset is a definitional material input (cco:ont00001921 some ex:ProductiveAsset)." ;
          rdfs:label "Decommission productive assets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Disposition that retires a productive asset from active service because it is no longer in working order, is obsolete, or is uneconomic to maintain." ;
          skos:example "A plant decommissions a worn-out compressor, isolating and de-energizing it ahead of removal." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19465
ex:P19465 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SiteStatusReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing and reporting site status. Align efforts to all legal, regulatory and social/environmental responsibilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.10.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19465" ;
          rdfs:comment "GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: monitoring -> Descriptive ICE (SiteStatusReport). Uses ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor site for duration of time required by regulators" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes an abandoned site for the duration required by regulators and produces a site status report documenting its condition." ;
          skos:example "For thirty years after closure, a landfill operator monitors groundwater and reports site status to the regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19507
ex:P19507 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicInitiativeSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Successfully implement strategic initiatives. Execution of strategy is also defined as the process of implementing logical set of connected activities by an organization to make a strategy work." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19507" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored directly to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): no narrower CCO act denotes execution/implementation, and execution is prescribed by the initiative specification (the Directive ICE). DELIBERATE non-mint: not Act of Planning/Appraisal/Measuring -- it carries out rather than plans or judges." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute strategic initiatives" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that implements the connected activities prescribed by a strategic-initiative specification in order to make the strategy work." ;
          skos:example "Project teams carry out the funded initiatives across the organization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19551
ex:P19551 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StandardOperatingProcedure
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing or prescribing methods to be followed routinely for the performance of designated operations or in designated situations. This may include step-by-step instructions to help workers carry out complex routine operations. The goal is to improve efficiency, quality, and uniformity of performance, while reducing miscommunication, failure, or rework." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "19551" ;
          rdfs:label "Define standard operating procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a standard operating procedure prescribing methods to be followed routinely for designated operations." ;
          skos:example "An SOP is written giving step-by-step instructions for a complex changeover." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19555
ex:P19555 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StorageRequirementAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate constraints, needs, parameters, and conditions for physical storage and retrieval of components or products for future use or shipment in a storage facility within a certain timeframe." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19555" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning -> Directive) to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal -> Descriptive). The lead verb 'Evaluate constraints, needs, parameters, and conditions' denotes appraisal producing a descriptive assessment, not the composition of a prescriptive plan. Rejected ex:ActOfFormulation: evaluating constraints/conditions is not authoring a directive, so the Planning genus + Directive output disagree with the verb (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Output changed from the Directive ex:LogisticsRequirementSpecification to the Descriptive ex:StorageRequirementAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine product storage facility requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the constraints, needs, parameters, and conditions for physical storage and retrieval in a storage facility and produces a storage requirement assessment." ;
          skos:example "Warehousing defines the racking, temperature, and throughput requirements for the new DC." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19558
ex:P19558 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DistributionPlanningConstraintSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining potential constraints for physical storage and retrieval of components or products in a storage facility within a certain timeframe. Consider factors such as the building shape, height, capacity, door locations, lift equipment, automation, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19558" ;
          rdfs:label "Establish storage management constraints" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a distribution planning constraint specification governing physical storage and retrieval in a storage facility." ;
          skos:example "Warehousing sets the height, door, and automation constraints for the storage facility." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19563
ex:P19563 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionNetworkModel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionNetworkSimulationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a representation of plant facilities to optimize material flow, resource utilization, and logistics for all levels of plant planning from global production facilities, through local plants, to specific lines and enabling the comparison of production alternatives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19563" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): its definitional output is the directive Production Network Model. The descriptive Production Network Simulation Result is a typical secondary output, asserted via has output but not part of the genus-differentia." ;
          rdfs:label "Model and simulate plant" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces a production network model of plant facilities enabling optimization and comparison of production alternatives." ;
          skos:example "An industrial engineer simulates line layouts to compare throughput across production alternatives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19566
ex:P19566 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19567
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19568
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19569
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19570
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionStateReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Integrating different resources in the production process: material, personnel, equipment, robotics, etc. Includes automating and controlling the plant, performing advanced process control and real-time optimization. This activity also includes managing plant alarms and alerts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19566" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 4.3.2.5 as an occurrent; its four APQC tasks are process parts (the control tasks P19567/19568/19569 are Acts of Process Control; P19570 is monitoring). Gate-F sibling/output fix: dropped [has output some ex:ProductionPerformanceAssessment] -- that ICE is the appraisal output of the sibling Assess production performance [10314] (an Act of Appraisal), and attaching the same descriptive ICE to two divergent genera (Monitoring here vs Appraisal there) was inconsistent. The performance assessment is not the definitional product of this monitoring/control aggregate; its monitoring-specific descriptive output is now ex:ProductionStateReport (a production state/deviation report), so the two siblings no longer share an output across divergent genera." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and optimize production process" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that integrates production resources and oversees the running production process, producing a production state report on its current state and deviations." ;
          skos:example "A control room runs APC and RTO loops and handles alarms during a production shift." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19567
ex:P19567 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfProcessControl ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionEquipment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and applying technology to monitor and control the production and delivery of products and services. Automation involves a broad range of technologies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19567" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F false-friend fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to ex:ActOfProcessControl. The source ('Creating and applying technology to monitor and CONTROL the production and delivery of products') and the obo:has participant some ex:ProductionEquipment restriction make this a closed-loop CONTROL act that actuates the plant (changes setpoints), not a pure observe-and-report act. Rejected ex:ActOfMonitoring: it captures only the observe half and over-commits the act to a descriptive output; control also actuates. No descriptive-ICE output is asserted (the product is a change in the controlled equipment). R5 holds (bounded)." ;
          rdfs:label "Automate and control plant" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Process Control that applies automation technology to monitor and control plant production and delivery by regulating the controlled production equipment." ;
          skos:example "A SCADA system regulates valve and conveyor setpoints automatically." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19568
ex:P19568 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfProcessControl ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Including a broad range of techniques and technologies implemented within industrial process control systems that are routinely reviewed, audited, and improved, advanced process controls typically address particular performance or economic improvement opportunities. An advanced set of process control measures can be used to reduce variation and identify primary improvement options. Results of analysis are fed back into process design for incorporation into production." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.2.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19568" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F sibling-consistency fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to ex:ActOfProcessControl, matching its parallel siblings P19567 (automate/control plant) and P19569 (real-time optimization). APC is a control technique that adjusts the running process to reduce variation, i.e. it actuates rather than merely observing." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform advanced process control" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Process Control that applies advanced process-control techniques to reduce process variation and identify improvement options for incorporation into production." ;
          skos:example "An APC layer trims a distillation column to reduce energy variation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19569
ex:P19569 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfProcessControl ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Helping organizations increase performance and efficiency, real-time optimization is a category of closed-loop process control that aims at optimizing process performance in real time for systems. It is normally built upon model-based optimization systems and is usually large scale. Real-time optimization automatically detects errors, and can modify and eliminate both random and non-random errors, as well as analyze and monitor all systems involved." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.2.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19569" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F false-friend fix (same class as P19567): re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to ex:ActOfProcessControl. The source describes 'a category of closed-loop process control that aims at OPTIMIZING process performance in real time... automatically detects errors, and can MODIFY AND ELIMINATE both random and non-random errors' -- an optimizing/control act that ALTERS the running process, not an observe-and-report act. The definition's 'analyze and monitor all systems' is secondary to the optimizing function. Rejected ex:ActOfMonitoring: it observes; RTO actuates. P19567/19568/19569 are treated as a parallel control triple." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform real-time optimization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Process Control that runs closed-loop, model-based real-time optimization of process performance, detecting and eliminating errors and modifying the running process across the controlled systems." ;
          skos:example "An RTO solver continuously re-optimizes reactor conditions against a plant model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19570
ex:P19570 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Applying human factors and instrumentation engineering and systems thinking to manage the design of an alarm or alert system to increase its usability. Typical challenges include having too many alarms in a plant, poorly designed alarms/alerts, improperly set alarm/alert points, unclear alarm/alert messages, etc. Poor alarm management is one of the leading causes of unplanned downtime." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.3.2.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19570" ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded monitoring task (handling/configuring alarms during operation), not an organization-wide standing function." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage plant alarms and alerts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that handles and tunes plant alarms and alerts to surface abnormal process conditions reliably." ;
          skos:example "An operator rationalizes nuisance alarms and resets alert thresholds for a unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19575
ex:P19575 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collecting and storing data that pertains to interest rate markets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19575" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (info-processing; Descriptive output): ongoing collection/storage of market data. Reuses shared ex:MarketRateData." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage interest rate market data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that collects and stores interest-rate market data and has as output a market rate data record." ;
          skos:example "The rates desk feeds live swap curves into its data store." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19576
ex:P19576 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying potential interest rate risks for all markets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19576" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:MarketRateData and ex:RiskAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine interest rate exposure for all markets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input market rate data and has as output a financial risk assessment of interest-rate exposure across markets." ;
          skos:example "The desk computes the portfolio's DV01 by market." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19577
ex:P19577 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HedgeRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deciding the requirements on interest rate investments that are made by trading in futures or options market, on the basis of the accepted risk policy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19577" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfSelection (Directive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: deciding requirements commits to prescribed hedges. Reuses shared ex:RiskAssessment and ex:FinancialPolicy (risk policy); output ex:HedgeRequirementSpecification minted locally." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine interest rate hedge requirements in accordance with risk policy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input a financial risk assessment and a financial policy and has as output a hedge requirement specification for interest-rate exposure." ;
          skos:example "The desk sets the required futures hedge given the accepted risk policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19578
ex:P19578 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing trading on interest rates." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19578" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording yields a transaction record (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute interest rate trades" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which interest-rate instruments are traded to implement a hedge." ;
          skos:example "The desk executes an interest-rate futures order." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19579
ex:P19579 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling and processing information about changes in foreign exchange rates." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19579" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:MarketRateData." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage foreign exchange market data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that handles and processes foreign-exchange rate data and has as output a market rate data record." ;
          skos:example "The FX desk ingests live spot and forward rates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19580
ex:P19580 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing potential foreign exchange risks for all currencies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19580" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:MarketRateData and ex:RiskAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine foreign exchange exposure for all currencies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input market rate data and has as output a financial risk assessment of foreign-exchange exposure across currencies." ;
          skos:example "The desk reports net open position by currency." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19581
ex:P19581 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HedgeRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deciding the requirements on investments in foreign exchange made by trading in futures or options market, on the basis of current risk policy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19581" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfSelection (Directive output). Reuses shared ex:RiskAssessment and ex:FinancialPolicy; output ex:HedgeRequirementSpecification reused (minted locally)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine foreign exchange hedge requirements in accordance with risk policy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input a financial risk assessment and a financial policy and has as output a hedge requirement specification for foreign-exchange exposure." ;
          skos:example "The desk sets required forward cover given the FX risk policy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19582
ex:P19582 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing all aspects for foreign exchange trade within foreign exchange market. This includes buying, selling, and exchanging currencies at the current or expressed price point." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19582" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording yields a transaction record (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute foreign exchange trades" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which currencies are bought, sold, or exchanged in the foreign-exchange market." ;
          skos:example "The desk executes a spot EUR/USD trade." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19583
ex:P19583 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing the foreign exchange balance sheet with an eye towards potential risk. Risks include changes in conversion rates between the time the transaction occurred and when it is completed, or when transactions are made in a denomination other than that of the organization's base currency." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19583" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfMonitoring (Descriptive output): continuous oversight producing a risk judgement. Reuses shared ex:RiskAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage foreign exchange balance sheet risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that oversees the foreign-exchange balance sheet and has as output a financial risk assessment of translation and settlement risk." ;
          skos:example "The desk tracks translation risk on non-base-currency balances." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19584
ex:P19584 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskExposureData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing ongoing risks that the customers face, and the exceptions to exceeded limits." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19584" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (Descriptive output). Reuses shared ex:RiskAssessment. Phase-3 consistency fix: a definitional has input (ex:RiskExposureData) was added to match the input pattern of its structurally parallel exposure-determination peers ex:P19576 and ex:P19580 (both has input ex:MarketRateData). An exposure-determination analysis cannot occur without exposure/position data as input, so the input is definitional for all three; this row previously lacked it, making it look less constrained than its twins." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine current customer exposures and limit exceptions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input risk exposure data and has as output a financial risk assessment describing current customer exposures and exceptions to exposure limits." ;
          skos:example "The team flags counterparties breaching their exposure limit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19585
ex:P19585 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExposureLimitResolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Settling cases that involve violations of customer exposure limit." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19585" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfSelection (Directive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: resolving a case commits to a prescribed remedy. Reuses shared ex:RiskAssessment; output ex:ExposureLimitResolution minted locally." ;
          rdfs:label "Resolve customer exposure limit violations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input a financial risk assessment and has as output an exposure limit resolution prescribing the settlement of a limit violation." ;
          skos:example "The team requires additional margin to cure a limit breach." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19586
ex:P19586 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialInstrument
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling customer securities to recover loans that are not paid back." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19586" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Reuses shared ex:Customer as participant and ex:FinancialInstrument as the collateral material entity (definitional)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage customer collateral" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which customer securities held as collateral are realized to recover unpaid loans, with the customer bearing a debtor role." ;
          skos:example "The bank liquidates pledged shares to cover a defaulted margin loan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19587
ex:P19587 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditScoringHistory
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CreditAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting reviews to assess customer credit on a yearly basis. Introduce changes or make recommendations, if needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19587" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal; Descriptive output) per GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: a credit review judges creditworthiness. Reuses shared ex:CreditScoringHistory, ex:CreditAssessment, and ex:Customer." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform annual customer credit reviews" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a credit scoring history and has as output a credit assessment about a customer." ;
          skos:example "Credit risk re-rates a corporate customer at its annual review." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19588
ex:P19588 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating investments made in some market to offset the risks of investing in a contrary or opposing market." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19588" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal; Descriptive output): measuring/evaluating positions yields a judgement. Reuses shared ex:RiskAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure physical positions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output a financial risk assessment of the physical positions held to offset opposing-market risk." ;
          skos:example "The desk marks the offsetting commodity position to market." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19589
ex:P19589 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HedgeSelectionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining which hedge options to execute." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19589" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction to ex:ActOfSelection (critical fix). The verbatim source is 'Determining which hedge options to execute' -- i.e. CHOOSING among candidate hedges, a decision/selection act with a directive outcome, not the later execution. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: the act's product is a directive (a chosen hedge to put on), so genus is ex:ActOfSelection and the output is the Directive ex:HedgeSelectionDecision, NOT a Descriptive TransactionRecord. This aligns the row with its near-identical direct sibling ex:P11213 'Evaluate and refine hedging positions' ('Examining options in the market for hedging investments. Select an option.'), already modeled as ex:ActOfSelection -> ex:HedgeSelectionDecision; the two parallel rows now share one genus. The actual transacting/execution of the chosen hedge is covered by the trade-execution rows (ex:P19582), not by this decision row. REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction: it conflated the decision with the later execution and gave a Descriptive output for a directive product." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish hedges" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that determines which hedge options to execute and produces a hedge selection decision prescribing the chosen option(s)." ;
          skos:example "The desk decides which put-option hedge to put on against an equity holding." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19590
ex:P19590 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TransactionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Closing out a position or cashing in derivatives early." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19590" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (Planned Act). Recording yields a transaction record (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Unwind hedges" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Financial Transaction in which an open hedging position is closed out or derivatives are settled early." ;
          skos:example "The desk closes a futures hedge ahead of expiry." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19593
ex:P19593 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketRateData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CurrencyConversionRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying current exchange rates between two currencies and converting the foreign currency to that of the local monetary unit. I.E., yen to US dollar." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.11.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19593" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction to ex:ActOfAnalysis (subClassOf cco:ont00000366) (genus/output mismatch + false-friend fix). The source ('Identifying current exchange rates between two currencies and converting the foreign currency to that of the local monetary unit') and the output ex:CurrencyConversionRecord (a Descriptive ICE) describe a COMPUTATION that identifies rates and produces a record of the equivalent amount -- no money or Financial Instrument is actually transferred between agents, so ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction's differentia ('transfers money or a Financial Instrument ... in settlement') is not satisfied ('conversion' is a false friend for a financial act). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: a Descriptive-record output pairs with an information-processing genus. Note also that ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction itself rejected cco:ont00000366 on the ground that 'a payment moves a material/financial-instrument filler, not only an ICE' -- this act has only an ICE output, confirming it does not fit the transaction genus. ex:MarketRateData (current exchange rates) is the definitional input; the conversion record is the Descriptive output. REJECTED candidate ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction (reserved for nodes that actually move money/instruments between agents, e.g. 9.5/9.6 disbursement and 9.11 settlement nodes)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform currency conversion" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines market rate data to convert a monetary amount from a foreign currency to the local monetary unit, producing a currency conversion record." ;
          skos:example "Converting an invoice denominated in yen into US dollars at the current spot rate." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19595
ex:P19595 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceScorecard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a graphical representation of metrics in order to communicate the general health of the organization in relation to risk and compliancy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "19595" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfReporting (PROPOSE-EXT, compilation sense). Output is a Descriptive ICE (ex:ComplianceScorecard) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Compile and communicate compliance scorecard(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that compiles compliance metrics into a graphical representation and conveys it to stakeholders, producing a compliance scorecard." ;
          skos:example "A compliance function publishes a red/amber/green dashboard summarizing the firm's compliance health." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19596
ex:P19596 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ComplianceReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001922 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryAuthority
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Submitting compliance reports to regulatory agencies. These reports can be made to environmental, securities, or human resources agencies as stipulated by the local governing body." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "11.2.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "19596" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RegulatoryComplianceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix (genus vs verbatim source / sibling consistency): RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfReporting (PROPOSE-EXT, compilation sense) to cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting, an Act of Representative Communication). Verified cco:ont00000151: 'An Act of Representative Communication performed by giving a detailed account or statement' (subClassOf cco:ont00000379). Reason: although the LABEL says 'compile and communicate', the verbatim apqcSourceText describes ONLY 'Submitting compliance reports to regulatory agencies' -- the mere transfer of an already-existing report, which the ex:ActOfReporting comment explicitly scopes OUT (it belongs to cco:ont00000151). This also reconciles with the 11.1 reporting siblings (P16443/P16444/P16451/P16462) deliberately anchored at cco:ont00000151. Consequently ex:ComplianceReport is the TRANSFERRED ICE (`has input`, not has output -- the report pre-exists this submission act), and ex:RegulatoryAuthority is the definitional recipient via cco:ont00001922 (verified 'has recipient', subPropertyOf BFO_0000057, domain Act of Communication). Rejected option (b) (split compile+submit into two acts) as over-modeling for a single PCF row whose source describes only submission. Compilation of the report is covered upstream (the scorecard/report-creation acts)." ;
          rdfs:label "Compile and communicate internal and regulatory compliance reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that submits an already-compiled compliance report to internal stakeholders and regulatory agencies, giving them a detailed account of the organization's compliance status." ;
          skos:example "The firm files its periodic securities-compliance report with the relevant regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19646
ex:P19646 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServicePerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketAcceptanceAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Measuring the performance of marketing once the product/services are launched. This broadly covers measuring user engagement and product's/service's performance in the market." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19646" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is analysis; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Carry out post launch analytics to test the acceptability in the market" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input product/service performance data and has as output a market acceptance analysis of user engagement and post-launch market performance." ;
          skos:example "Analysts measure engagement metrics after launch and report market acceptance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19647
ex:P19647 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyChainPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyChainMethodologyAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collecting and examining raw data with the purpose of drawing conclusions about that information and correlate gaps and efficiencies to the existing supply chain channels. Apply the information to make better business decisions to the related supply chain methodologies to meet efficiency." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.2.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19647" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is analysis; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Gate-F: the output filler was changed from the shared ex:SupplyChainEffectivenessReview to the distinct ex:SupplyChainMethodologyAnalysis, so this analysis act (.4) and the sibling appraisal act (.3, ex:P11425) no longer collapse to the same output class while carrying different act genera. The .4 source is genuine analysis (drawing conclusions from raw data), producing a data-analytics conclusion distinct from the .3 effectiveness verdict." ;
          rdfs:label "Apply data and analytics to review supply chain methodologies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input supply chain performance data and has as output a supply chain methodology analysis correlating gaps and efficiencies across supply-chain channels." ;
          skos:example "Analysts examine raw supply-chain data to correlate efficiency gaps across channels." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19669
ex:P19669 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10068
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19986
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19987
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19988
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19989
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceConcept
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Producing and defining ideologies for new product/service offerings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19669" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a product/service concept (Directive ICE), so the act is a formulation, not an analysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Generate new product/service concepts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces and defines concepts for new product or service offerings." ;
          skos:example "A concept team articulates three candidate service concepts for a new market segment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19697
ex:P19697 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining sourcing and procurement requirements for new product technical documentation management. Make sourcing-based decisions that identify the capabilities that will be required in order to launch the new product. This documentation will be used to support the product following entry into service. It is compiled and managed in Manage product and process related data [12082], but the capability to manage and maintain this documentation must be defined and established." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19697" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation; output is a Directive ICE (the requirement specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define product technical documentation management requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a product/service requirement specification prescribing the sourcing and capability requirements for managing new-product technical documentation." ;
          skos:example "A team defines the documentation-management capabilities required to support a new product in service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19698
ex:P19698 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10065
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19669
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19990
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceConcept
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and describing new product or service thoughts based on organizational objectives/targets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19698" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 2.2 as an occurrent. Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Generate and define new product/service ideas" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that conceives and articulates new product or service ideas in light of organizational objectives and produces one or more product/service concepts." ;
          skos:example "An innovation team's idea-generation cycle that yields a slate of new product concepts for the development pipeline." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19941
ex:P19941 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting necessary performance reviews on enforcement of processes and steps to ensure protection. Determine policies and reviews for Manage patents, copyrights, and regulatory requirements [19985]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.1.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19941" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is appraisal; output is a Descriptive ICE per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct mandatory and elective reviews" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output a regulatory review judging the enforcement of intellectual-property protection processes." ;
          skos:example "IP counsel runs the required reviews on protection-process enforcement and records the findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19945
ex:P19945 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetitiveIntelligenceAnalyst
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetitorData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CompetitorAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying your competitors, their service and/or product. Evaluating competitors strategies to determine their strengths and weaknesses relative to those of your own product or service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19945" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CompetitiveAnalysisCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CompetitiveIntelligenceAnalystRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Carried over from GOLD module (ex:AnalyzeCompetitors). Represents APQC 1.1.1.1 as an occurrent, not as the analysis artifact (that is ex:CompetitorAnalysis) nor an organizational function." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze competitors" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input competitor data and has as output a competitor analysis about one or more competitors." ;
          skos:example "A competitive-intelligence team reviews market reports and produces a competitor analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19946
ex:P19946 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and collecting customers' wants and needs of a product and/or services from a marketing perspective. Identify which consumer needs are important and whether needs are being met by current products/services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19946" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense): it discerns and registers which consumer needs are important." ;
          rdfs:label "Capture customer needs and wants" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input customer feedback and has as output a customer needs assessment registering customers' wants and needs." ;
          skos:example "A marketing analyst collects survey responses and registers the unmet needs of a customer segment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19947
ex:P19947 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerProfile
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating customer profiles to get a picture of customers and their needs. Identify particular groups of people/organizations that benefit from your product/services and then selling to them." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19947" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to ex:ActOfIdentification: the source is 'creating customer profiles ... identify particular groups of people/organizations' -- profiling/segmentation is discernment, and its Descriptive output ex:CustomerProfile agrees with the Information-Processing genus. Rejected Act of Appraisal: there is no evaluative value-judgement here, only characterization of segments." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess customer needs and wants" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns and characterizes groups of customers who benefit from an organization's products or services and produces a customer profile of those groups and their needs." ;
          skos:example "An analyst segments the market and builds customer profiles for the strategy team." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19948
ex:P19948 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InternalCapabilityData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InternalOperationsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identify key elements of operations and measure effectiveness of these elements within internal operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19948" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: it examines and measures operational elements." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze internal operations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input internal-capability data and has as output an internal-operations analysis measuring the effectiveness of operational elements." ;
          skos:example "An operations team measures the effectiveness of key processes and reports an internal-operations analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19949
ex:P19949 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OrganizationalObjective
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicVision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing goals to define organizations vision. Define and document ideas, direction, and activities which enable the organization to reach these goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19949" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:StrategicPlanningCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): it formulates and documents a directive vision and its goals." ;
          rdfs:label "Define the strategic vision" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that has as output a strategic vision documenting the goals, direction, and activities that define an organization's vision." ;
          skos:example "A strategy team drafts and documents the firm's strategic vision statement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19950
ex:P19950 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a plan to deploy support services and support functions throughout the organization globally. Arrange the organizations functional support areas to create efficiencies of scale in the delivery of support services, globally." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19950" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a global-support strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop global support strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a plan to deploy support services globally and produces a business strategy for global support." ;
          skos:example "A shared-services office formulates the plan to deliver global support at scale." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19951
ex:P19951 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Charting a plan to leverage internal services and support functions throughout the organization. Delineate a framework of parameters and criteria to selectively filter service areas for inclusion among the organizations common resources. Arrange the organizations functional areas to create efficiencies of scale in the delivery of internal services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "19951" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a shared-services strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop shared services strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that charts a plan to leverage internal shared services and produces a business strategy for shared services." ;
          skos:example "A transformation office formulates the strategy to consolidate functions into shared services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19952
ex:P19952 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a plan and vision to encourage advancements in technology or product/services. Create a roadmap for changing or innovating the business model to make business operations more competitive. Set up new R&D services for changing or bringing new value propositions, services, production processes, and invention of technology not previously used by competitors etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19952" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: composes an innovation strategy/roadmap." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop innovation strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a plan and roadmap to advance technology and products and produces a business strategy for innovation." ;
          skos:example "An R&D leadership team formulates the three-year innovation roadmap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19953
ex:P19953 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OrganizationalObjective
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and developing strategic objectives that establishes a process to outline expected outcomes and guide employees' efforts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19953" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation rather than ex:ActOfIdentification: the source says 'creating and developing strategic objectives', i.e. composing new prescriptive goals, not discerning pre-existing entities." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify organizational objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates strategic objectives outlining expected outcomes for the organization and produces organizational objectives." ;
          skos:example "Strategy leadership drafts the outcome-oriented objectives that will guide employee effort." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19954
ex:P19954 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OrganizationalObjective
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMetric
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing baselines that provide standards for assessing performance. Create metrics and KPI's for various functions/processes/activities based on organizational goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19954" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): composes prescriptive standards. Organizational objectives are the definitional input the metrics are derived from." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish baseline metrics" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes baseline metrics and KPIs as standards for assessing performance and produces a set of performance metrics." ;
          skos:example "A performance office defines the KPI baselines for each function from the organizational goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19955
ex:P19955 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMetric
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMonitoringMethodSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining methodology and frequency of assessment for measuring and monitoring performance of various functions/processes/activities against standard set goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19955" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to ex:ActOfFormulation: the source's lead verb is 'DEFINING methodology and frequency of assessment', i.e. composing a Directive monitoring-method spec, not actually rendering the value-judgement. The existential ex:PerformanceReport output is removed (it is produced by the downstream monitoring runs, not by this defining act); the new Directive output ex:PerformanceMonitoringMethodSpecification agrees with the Formulation genus. Performance metrics are the definitional standard the method monitors against." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor performance against objective" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the methodology and frequency for measuring and monitoring the performance of functions, processes, and activities against set goals, and produces a performance-monitoring method specification." ;
          skos:example "A performance office defines the quarterly methodology and cadence for monitoring each function's KPIs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19956
ex:P19956 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceMetric
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the performance of a business unit against set organizational goals which are based on pre-defined metrics collected through various business unit operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.7.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19956" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): assessing performance against goals. Performance metrics are the definitional standard input." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze business unit strategies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that assesses a business unit's performance against organizational goals using predefined metrics and produces a performance report." ;
          skos:example "An analyst assesses a division's results against its KPI targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19957
ex:P19957 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InternalCapabilityData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CoreCompetencyAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the resources and skills of each business unit based on knowledge and technical capacity. Enable business units to meet customer needs and grow in a competitive marketplace." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.7.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19957" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'determining the resources and skills of each business unit' discerns and registers existing capacities." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify core competency for each business unit" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the resources and skills constituting each business unit's core competency and produces a core competency analysis." ;
          skos:example "An analyst catalogs each unit's distinctive technical capabilities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19958
ex:P19958 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating existing business unit strategy based on the company's strategy and eliminate unwanted/unnecessary resources/elements and re-consider necessary resources to meet the overall company's strategy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.7.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19958" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from ex:ActOfSelection to ex:ActOfFormulation: the act takes an existing ex:BusinessStrategy and emits a revised ex:BusinessStrategy (a Directive plan in, a Directive plan out) -- this is reformulation of a plan, not the selection of one option from a set of candidates. Rejected Act of Selection: there is no slate of discrete candidate strategies being chosen among; the single existing strategy is being re-worked. The enterprise business strategy is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Refine business unit strategies in support of organizational strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that reformulates an existing business-unit strategy in light of the enterprise strategy, pruning and re-considering its resources and elements, and produces a refined business strategy." ;
          skos:example "A division reworks its strategy to drop initiatives that conflict with the enterprise strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19959
ex:P19959 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19960
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19964
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19971
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19974
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a roadmap to meet customer expectations while considering how it will affect the business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "19959" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerExperienceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): composes a customer-experience strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop customer experience strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines a roadmap to meet customer expectations and produces a customer experience roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A CX office drafts the multi-year roadmap for improving customer experience." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19960
ex:P19960 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19961
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19962
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19963
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Measuring customer feedback in regard to product and services effectiveness based on overall satisfaction. The data to be analyzed is collected through surveys, customer responses, and feedbacks based on the delivered products/services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19960" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerExperienceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): measuring customer feedback based on satisfaction. Customer feedback is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess customer experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that measures customer feedback on product and service effectiveness and produces a customer experience assessment." ;
          skos:example "A CX team scores satisfaction from survey responses on delivered services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19961
ex:P19961 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerTouchpointInventory
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating methods to gauge customer experiences, expectations, and suggestions. Review both liked and disliked areas of product/services to be delivered. Evaluate touchpoints based on the nature of product/service in the market e.g., billboards, web sites, direct mail, service calls, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19961" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'review ... evaluate touchpoints ... e.g. billboards, web sites' discerns and registers the relevant touchpoints. Output replaced (Gate-F) from the off-target ex:CustomerExperienceAssessment (a satisfaction/feedback measure, the output of the appraisal sibling P19962) with the discernment-matched ex:CustomerTouchpointInventory (a register of touchpoints). Customer feedback is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and review customer touchpoints" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns and reviews the customer touchpoints relevant to a product or service and produces a customer touchpoint inventory." ;
          skos:example "A CX analyst enumerates and reviews every channel through which customers reach the brand." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19962
ex:P19962 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating customer experiences, expectations, and suggestions in both liked and disliked areas of the product or services. Analyze all modes of communication, human and physical interactions, or customers experience during the relationship lifecycle with your organization. Evaluate the gaps/further development/alterations to the existing product/service to attain better customer response." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19962" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): 'evaluating customer experiences ... evaluate the gaps'. Customer feedback is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess customer experience across touchpoints" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates customer experiences and gaps across all touchpoints in the relationship lifecycle and produces a customer experience assessment." ;
          skos:example "A CX team scores experience quality at each interaction across the customer lifecycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19963
ex:P19963 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the core reason for the customer experience/feedback/response about the product/service to take considerable action for better customer experience." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19963" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: 'analyzing the core reason for the customer experience'. Customer feedback is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform root cause analysis of problematic customer experiences" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the core reasons behind problematic customer experiences and produces a root cause analysis." ;
          skos:example "An analyst traces recurring complaints to a flawed onboarding step." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19964
ex:P19964 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16612
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19965
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19966
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19967
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19968
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19969
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19970
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a design of how customers interact with the business by analyzing data captured through various customer interaction and customer involvement. These will be captured through various channels such as customer satisfaction surveys, feedback forms, product reviews, targeted studies, observational studies, or voice of customer research." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19964" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerExperienceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): composes a prescriptive design. Customer data is the definitional input it is built from." ;
          rdfs:label "Design customer experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that designs how customers interact with the business from captured customer data and produces a customer experience roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A CX team designs the target interaction model from voice-of-customer research." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19965
ex:P19965 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerJourneyMap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a story of the customer's experience: from initial contact, through the process of engagement and into a long-term relationship. The goal is to teach organization about the customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19965" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: 'creating a story of the customer's experience ... to teach the organization about the customer' produces an analytic representation." ;
          rdfs:label "Create customer journey maps" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that traces the customer's experience from initial contact through long-term relationship and produces a customer journey map." ;
          skos:example "A CX designer charts the end-to-end journey from awareness to renewal." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19966
ex:P19966 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerProfile
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining parameters to show aggregated, consistent, and holistic representation of known data about customers. Define key parameters which enable the tracking of customers and communications across every channel." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19966" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): 'defining parameters ... which enable the tracking of customers' composes a prescriptive specification." ;
          rdfs:label "Define single view of the customer for the organization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the parameters for an aggregated, holistic representation of customer data and produces a customer profile specification." ;
          skos:example "A data team defines the unified customer-record parameters spanning all channels." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19967
ex:P19967 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicVision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a direction and vision on how the organization behaves towards customers in a consistent, effective way. The key attributes for customer experience vision consists of emotional connection, commitments and expectations, compelling value proposition, and ease of understanding the organization's behavior." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19967" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): 'establishing a direction and vision' composes a prescriptive vision; reuses ex:StrategicVision." ;
          rdfs:label "Define a vision for the customer experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes a direction and vision for how the organization behaves toward customers and produces a strategic vision for the customer experience." ;
          skos:example "Leadership articulates the guiding vision for every customer interaction." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19968
ex:P19968 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a process to validate the sales process and the assumptions that underpin the business model. Understand if the products/services have a repeatable, scalable business model around that product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19968" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): 'validate ... understand if the products/services have a repeatable, scalable business model' evaluates assumptions against evidence. Customer feedback is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate with customers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that tests the assumptions underpinning the business model against customer reality and produces a customer experience assessment." ;
          skos:example "A product team validates the pricing assumptions through customer interviews." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19969
ex:P19969 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning and defining a relevant, differentiated, and credible value proposition for the brand. Align experience to ensure that the product and service quality is consistent with brand promise and business strategies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "19969" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): aligns experience to brand/strategy. The business strategy is the definitional input." ;
          rdfs:label "Align experience with brand values and business strategies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that aligns the customer experience with the brand's value proposition and business strategies and produces a customer experience roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A brand team aligns the service experience to the brand promise and strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19970
ex:P19970 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning, development, and management of content-written or in other media. Getting the right content to the right user at the right time through strategic planning of content creation, delivery, and governance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "19970" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): 'strategic planning of content creation, delivery, and governance' composes a content strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop content strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that plans the creation, delivery, and governance of content and produces a business strategy for content." ;
          skos:example "A content team formulates the editorial and distribution strategy for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19971
ex:P19971 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19972
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19973
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a roadmap for customer experience support with an overall approach, process flow, and impact timeframe." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19971" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerExperienceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): composes a prescriptive support structure." ;
          rdfs:label "Design customer experience support structure" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that designs the support structure for customer experience with an approach, process flow, and timeframe and produces a customer experience roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A CX office designs the support model and rollout timeframe for the new experience." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19972
ex:P19972 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RequiredCapabilityList
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the necessary skills and competencies required to efficiently collect customer experiences through the support structure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19972" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'determining the necessary skills and competencies required' discerns and registers needed capabilities. Output replaced (Gate-F) from the off-target ex:CoreCompetencyAnalysis (which describes an organization's strategically DIFFERENTIATING competencies) with the required-skills ex:RequiredCapabilityList, matching the source's 'necessary skills and competencies required to operate the support structure'." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify required capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the skills and competencies required to operate the customer-experience support structure and produces a required capability list." ;
          skos:example "A CX lead lists the analytics and service skills the support team must have." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19973
ex:P19973 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the affect of customer experience through customer experience support structure on other functions of customer services related to customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19973" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification: 'identifying the affect ... on other functions' discerns and registers cross-functional impacts." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify impact on functional processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the impact of the customer-experience support structure on other customer-service functions and produces a customer experience assessment of those impacts." ;
          skos:example "An analyst identifies how the new CX support model changes the call-center workflow." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19974
ex:P19974 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerExperienceRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a standard guideline to create and execute the capacities of registering customer experiences in a timely manner. Create a common understanding of what behaviors are required to implement the strategy. Define what talent/skills your organization needs to reach customer experience goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.8.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19974" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): 'defining a standard guideline to create and execute the capacities' composes an implementation roadmap." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop customer experience roadmap to develop and implement defined capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the guideline, behaviors, and talent needed to implement the customer-experience capabilities and produces a customer experience roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A CX office publishes the roadmap and talent plan to stand up the new capabilities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19975
ex:P19975 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OrganizationalObjective
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicPriority
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a statement of the organization's direction to guide decision making around the allocation of resources. Provide a focus on the organization's overarching goals to ensure coherent and considered action. Strategic objectives are ranked by their importance in achieving the strategic goals. All subsequent operational or tactical planning and resource allocation is based on strategic priorities" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19975" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from ex:ActOfIdentification to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal), matching its sibling P19980 'Prioritize strategic initiatives': the source's core operation is that 'strategic objectives are ranked by their importance', and ranking-by-importance is an evaluative judgement, not mere discernment. Rejected ex:ActOfIdentification: the objectives already exist (taken as input); the act adds a value-ordering over them. Output remains the Directive ex:StrategicPriority (the ranked priorities prescribe subsequent allocation) -- consistent with an Appraisal that issues a prescriptive ranking, as P19980 does with ex:PrioritizedInitiativeList." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify strategic priorities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that ranks the organization's strategic objectives by their importance in achieving the strategic goals and produces a statement of strategic priorities guiding resource allocation." ;
          skos:example "Leadership ranks its objectives and issues the priorities that govern the year's budgeting." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19976
ex:P19976 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicInitiativeSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a statement of the organization's direction based on what is considered \"value\" to the customer or business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19976" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation. The ex:BusinessValueAssessment input is demoted (Gate-F, Phase-3) from an existential has-input to this comment: the source ('based on what is considered value to the customer or business') treats value as the framing notion guiding formulation, not a formal assessment ICE that every instance must consume. Output ex:StrategicInitiativeSpecification retained." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop strategic initiatives based on business/customer value" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes strategic initiatives grounded in what is considered value to the customer or the business and produces a strategic-initiative specification." ;
          skos:example "A team frames its candidate initiatives explicitly around customer value drivers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19977
ex:P19977 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategyReviewReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a process for stakeholder dialog that is integrated into the assessment of business strategies. Report on the evaluation of the business objectives, strategies, subject, or past events." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19977" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the source's substance is 'report on the EVALUATION of the business objectives, strategies, ... or past events' -- the defining act is the evaluation/review, not the mere transfer of an ICE (the stakeholder dialogue is the channel through which the review is conducted and reported). The reviewed ex:BusinessStrategy is demoted from a has-input to an is-about (cco:ont00001808) on the output ICE: the new ex:StrategyReviewReport (a ex:PerformanceReport specialization) is about the business strategy. The PerformanceReport genus output is definitional (the review produces a report). Stakeholder participant retained." ;
          rdfs:label "Review with stakeholders" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates an organization's business objectives and strategies and reports the resulting strategy review to stakeholders through structured dialogue." ;
          skos:example "Strategists hold a review session reporting strategy evaluation results to the board and partners." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19978
ex:P19978 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicPriority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a standard measure of value to determine the business worth for each of the Identify strategic priorities [19975]. List the effectiveness and utility for every important strategic element based on the benefit it adds to the business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19978" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): determining worth is judging value. Input is the strategic priorities (cross-reference to PCF 19975)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine business value for each strategic priority" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the business worth of each strategic priority against a standard measure of value and produces a business-value assessment." ;
          skos:example "Analysts score each priority by the benefit it adds to the business." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19979
ex:P19979 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicPriority
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the value preposition; the value the customer gets from a product/services for each of your Identify strategic priorities [19975]. Customer value is the satisfaction a consumer feels after making a purchase for goods or services relative to what he/she must give up to receive them." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19979" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from ex:ActOfAnalysis to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal), matching its sibling P19978 'Determine business value for each strategic priority': 'determining customer value' (the satisfaction a consumer feels relative to what is given up) is a value-judgement, the same evaluative operation P19978 applies to business value. Output replaced from the off-target ex:CustomerNeedsAssessment (which describes needs, not value) with the Descriptive ex:CustomerValueAssessment, parallel to ex:BusinessValueAssessment. Inputs are the strategic priorities (cross-ref PCF 19975) and customer feedback." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine the customer value for each strategic priority" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the value a customer derives from the offerings tied to each strategic priority and produces a customer value assessment." ;
          skos:example "A team appraises what customers gain from offerings tied to each strategic priority." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19980
ex:P19980 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicInitiativeEvaluation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PrioritizedInitiativeList
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Listing the most effective procedures in the order of most important to the least. Create measures or filter for determining which of many \"strategic initiatives\" is most important to the least important." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19980" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): ranking by importance is judging importance. Output is Directive (the ranking prescribes order of pursuit)." ;
          rdfs:label "Prioritize strategic initiatives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges strategic initiatives by importance and produces a prioritized initiative list ordering them from most to least important." ;
          skos:example "A filter scores initiatives so the team can list them most- to least-important." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19981
ex:P19981 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InitiativeSelectionDecision
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CommunicationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing procedures for communications within the organization which creates the road map for successful understanding of strategic initiatives for both business units and stakeholders (internal and external)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19981" ;
          rdfs:comment "CHOSEN READING (Gate-F): re-anchored from cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) to ex:ActOfFormulation. The source is 'ESTABLISHING procedures for communications ... which creates the ROADMAP for successful understanding' -- the leaf composes a Directive ex:CommunicationStrategy (a plan), it does not itself perform the conveyance. Under this reading the business-unit and stakeholder recipients are NOT definitional participants of the formulation act (they are the audience the planned strategy will later address), so the bfo:has participant restrictions are dropped. Rejected the Act-of-Communication reading (the actual rollout) because the source's verb is 'establishing/creating' the communication scheme, not transferring an ICE. The selected initiatives (ex:InitiativeSelectionDecision) are the definitional input the strategy is built around." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate strategic initiatives to business units and stakeholders" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the procedures and roadmap for communicating the selected strategic initiatives to business units and stakeholders and produces a communication strategy." ;
          skos:example "Leadership drafts the communication plan and roadmap so every business unit will understand the chosen initiatives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19982
ex:P19982 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueDriver
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining key indicators or factors responsible for driving business value. Key business value drivers comprise of operational, financial, and sustainability drivers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19982" ;
          rdfs:comment "Discernment sense -> ex:ActOfIdentification (shared). Output is a Descriptive ICE describing each driver." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify business value drivers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the key operational, financial, and sustainability indicators responsible for driving business value and produces a register of business value drivers." ;
          skos:example "Analysts enumerate the operational and financial factors that move enterprise value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19983
ex:P19983 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueDriver
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueDriverBaseline
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing baseline measures that provide standards for assessing performance of Identify business value drivers [19982]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19983" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) from cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring) to ex:ActOfAnalysis, kept consistent with its sibling P10031 'Create baselines for current processes': a baseline is a Descriptive reference measure DERIVED from the value drivers (the output ex:BusinessValueDriverBaseline is Descriptive). Rejected cco:ont00000345 Act of Measuring (measuring determines a value AGAINST an existing standard; here the standard is being established, not applied) and rejected Act of Planning (the output describes a reference level, it does not prescribe action). Input is the value drivers (cross-ref PCF 19982)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish baselines for business value drivers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input the business value drivers and has as output business-value-driver baselines derived as reference standards for assessing later performance." ;
          skos:example "The team derives the starting-period value of each driver as its assessment benchmark." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19984
ex:P19984 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000345 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessValueDriverBaseline
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing the progress of activities to ensure they are on-course and on-schedule in meeting the objectives and performance targets against Establish baselines for business value drivers [19983]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.3.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19984" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring): monitoring measures performance relative to the baseline standard (cross-ref PCF 19983)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor performance against baselines" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Measuring that determines actual performance of activities against the established business-value-driver baselines and produces a performance record." ;
          skos:example "A PMO tracks each driver's running value against its baseline to flag off-course initiatives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19986
ex:P19986 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceIdea
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collecting necessary items, documents, regulatory requirements, etc., based on Generate and define new product/service ideas [19698]" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19986" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F re-anchor: from ex:ActOfDataManagement to ex:ActOfAcquisition. ex:ActOfDataManagement denotes standing maintenance/governance of a body of ICEs (store, control, update, govern access), reserved here for the 2.1.4 master-data acts. A one-time collect/gather to feed concept generation ('Collecting necessary items, documents, regulatory requirements, etc.') is acquisition/intake -- obtaining an entity the Agent did not previously hold -- not corpus governance; ex:ActOfDataManagement denoted the wrong information-processing sub-kind." ;
          rdfs:label "Gather new product/service ideas and requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains and assembles the product/service ideas, documents, and regulatory requirements not previously held, for use in concept generation." ;
          skos:example "An analyst compiles submitted product ideas and the applicable regulatory requirements into a single working set." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19987
ex:P19987 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceIdea
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing and reviewing the concepts and requirements of Generate and define new product/service ideas [19698]" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19987" ;
          rdfs:comment "Information-processing review of concepts and requirements; descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze new product/service ideas and requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines collected product/service ideas and requirements and produces an understanding of their suitability." ;
          skos:example "A review board analyses the gathered ideas against the captured requirements to shortlist viable concepts." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19988
ex:P19988 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FeasibilityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing and reviewing the required inputs and necessary elements such as automation, technology, hardware installation, regulatory requirements, certifications, etc., for new products/services through defined process and analysis." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19988" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): assesses/reviews inputs and elements (automation, certifications, regulatory requirements) through defined analysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate new product/service inputs and requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the required inputs and necessary elements for a new product or service and produces a feasibility assessment." ;
          skos:example "An evaluation team appraises the automation, hardware, and certification needs of a candidate product and reports feasibility." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19989
ex:P19989 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceConcept
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising ideas and elements necessary for thoughts on new product/service development." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "19989" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (product/service concept), consistent with a formulation act." ;
          rdfs:label "Formulate new product/service concepts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises the ideas and elements of a new product or service and produces a product/service concept." ;
          skos:example "A design team formulates a coherent product concept from a set of candidate ideas." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19990
ex:P19990 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11331
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16815
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P17389
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Encompassing the identification and capture of new product/service requirements or potential improvements to current products/services. Collaborating with members of the supply chain to ensure the feasibility of what is being defined in the requirements. For example, a product with manufacturing requirements that supply chain cannot currently fulfill requires a corporate decision to either upgrade manufacturing capabilities or abandon the new product. Enterprise-level effects and needs must be considered. Depending on the nature of the final product or service, these requirements are often defined as a set of abilities, such as availability or reliability, that influence product development decisions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19990" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive requirement specification (definitional). Gate-F: the [has participant some ex:SupplyChainPartner] existential restriction was REMOVED. The source ('Collaborating with members of the supply chain ... For example ...') is illustrative, not necessary for every instance; the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule forbids promoting typical/exemplary participants to owl:someValuesFrom. Supply-chain collaboration to confirm feasibility is therefore recorded here as a typical participation / competency-question target only, not as a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Define product/service development requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that identifies and captures the requirements governing development of a new product or service and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A requirements team works with suppliers to define the availability and reliability requirements that will drive product development." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19991
ex:P19991 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the operations of functions related to the product/service in the marketing environment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19991" ;
          rdfs:label "Define basic functional requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the functional operations required of a product or service and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A team specifies the core functions a new appliance must perform." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19992
ex:P19992 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and creating steps and tools to develop the user experience. " ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.2.3.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "19992" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop user experience requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the steps and tools needed to shape the user experience of a product or service and produces a product/service requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A UX team specifies the interaction requirements and tooling for a new application." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19993
ex:P19993 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServicePrototype
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10083
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10084
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10085
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10086
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10087
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10088
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10089
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10090
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10091
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10092
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10098
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16813
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16817
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19995
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Sketching and standardizing product and service based on the market. Analyze the data market competitiveness and innovation attained for the product and service development." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19993" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 2.3.1. Children below are process parts via cco:ont00001777. The informational has-output (per D3) is the Directive ICE ex:DesignSpecification; the built prototype (ex:ProductServicePrototype, a Material Artifact) is a has-participant of the act, not an ICE output -- section 2.0 is a develop/plan category, so material things participate rather than fill the informational output slot." ;
          rdfs:label "Design and prototype products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that designs and prototypes products and services in light of market data, producing a design specification (informational output) and building a product/service prototype (a material participant)." ;
          skos:example "A design team sketches a new offering, drafts specifications, and builds a working prototype." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19994
ex:P19994 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PartnerRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining essential elements for collaborators involved in blueprint/development of product/service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "19994" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F re-anchor: from ex:ActOfIdentification to ex:ActOfFormulation. The definitional output is a Directive ICE (ex:PartnerRequirementSpecification, a directive specification of partner requirements), so a discernment genus disagrees with the directive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Aligns with the entire ex:P11331 / 2.2.3.1.x 'Derive ... requirements' family, all anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation -- a sibling-consistency fix as well." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify requirements for product/service design/development partners" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the essential requirements for design and development collaborators and produces a partner requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A team specifies the certifications a co-development supplier must hold." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19995
ex:P19995 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16818
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16819
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16820
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16821
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16822
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16823
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a sketch of the customer focused product/service in Develop and Manage Products and Services [10003]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "19995" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DesignCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfDesign. The six APQC tasks below are facet-specific design parts via cco:ont00001777." ;
          rdfs:label "Design products/services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that creates a customer-focused sketch and design of a product or service and produces a design specification." ;
          skos:example "A designer produces a customer-focused product sketch and detailed design." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19996
ex:P19996 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10093
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10094
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10095
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10096
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketStudy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Expanding on the marketplace analysis that took place earlier in the product development lifecycle by testing the market against offerings. The results from this in-depth analysis will help the organization finalize product/service characteristics and technical requirements and also identify any needed changes in the manufacturing and delivery processes that support market delivery. To prepare a detailed market study that accounts for any changes in the global environment, the organization may want to conduct a series of interviews, workshops, and focus groups with potential and existing customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "19996" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (information processing): the group's defining output is a descriptive market study. Children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Test market for new or revised products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that tests the market against new or revised offerings and produces a market study used to finalize product/service characteristics and technical requirements." ;
          skos:example "A marketing team runs focus groups and finalizes the offering's attributes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19997
ex:P19997 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10097
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10099
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10100
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11418
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19998
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising business plans and procedures for manufacturing/operations/production and delivery of services offered by the organization. Further in general terms the total amount of output that the manufacturing department is responsible to produce for each period." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19997" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDevelopment: the group brings production capability into being. Children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare for production/service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that devises and installs the plans, procedures, equipment, and processes needed to produce and deliver an organization's new products and services." ;
          skos:example "An operations group sources equipment and installs the production line for a new product." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19998
ex:P19998 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LaunchPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FeasibilityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Verifying the measures/processes/techniques through systems and tools involved in the introduction of products and services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "2.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "19998" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfVerification (under Act of Appraisal): the text says 'verify ... measures/processes'. Input is the launch plan." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate launch procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks the measures, processes, and techniques involved in introducing a product or service and produces a feasibility assessment of the launch procedures." ;
          skos:example "A launch team verifies the go-to-market procedures and tooling before release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P19999
ex:P19999 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PricingAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PricingTarget
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining optimum prices for individual products or services on the basis of the cost of producing, distributing and marketing the offerings, pricing analysis and general pricing strategy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "19999" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:PricingTarget is Directive, agreeing with the Formulation genus. ex:PricingAnalysis is a definitional input (the text bases targets 'on ... pricing analysis')." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish pricing targets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines optimum target prices for individual offerings and produces pricing targets." ;
          skos:example "A pricing manager sets the target price for each SKU from the pricing analysis and strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20000
ex:P20000 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10126
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10127
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10128
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20001
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20002
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20003
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20004
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20005
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing all the activities needed to identify the appropriate channels to market to different customer segments as defined in Determine target segments [10117]. This involves finding channel partners, ensuring that the channels align with organizational strategy for each segment, and the final channel selection process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20000" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: modeled as a process because its dominant act produces a bounded Directive ex:ChannelStrategy; the standing channel-performance-management function is separately modeled as ex:ChannelManagementCapability (3.2.4). Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage channel strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that identifies and selects the appropriate marketing channels for each customer segment and produces a channel strategy." ;
          skos:example "A channel team finds partners, fits channels to segments, and finalizes the channel strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20001
ex:P20001 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelSelection
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deciding which distributors, wholesalers and retailers the company will use to promote its offerings and to distribute its products and services to the target market. Narrowing down which intermediaries the company will use will affect retail prices of individual products, and should therefore be included in the pricing analysis." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20001" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection: it chooses from a candidate set of intermediaries and yields a Directive decision (ex:ChannelSelection)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine channels to be supported" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses, from the available distributors, wholesalers, and retailers, the intermediaries the company will use and produces a channel selection." ;
          skos:example "A distribution lead narrows the wholesaler list down to the chosen set of supported channels." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20002
ex:P20002 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the role that each chosen marketing channels plays in the larger distribution network with respect to the organizational marketing strategy. Determine intermediary costs for shipping, handling, transporting, warehousing, insurance and marketing that incur and accumulate in the distribution channel." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20002" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output reuses ex:ChannelRequirements (Directive: what each channel is required to do and bear in cost), agreeing with the Formulation genus. ex:CostData is a typical input (intermediary costs), noted rather than asserted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish channel objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that specifies the role each chosen channel plays in the distribution network and produces channel requirements covering those roles and intermediary costs." ;
          skos:example "A channel manager assigns each channel its role and documents the intermediary cost structure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20003
ex:P20003 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChannelRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the maximum output rate required from a distribution channel to optimally market and deliver the products and services the company offers or would like to offer. Ideally, a channel should be able to adapt to a certain degree of variability in the demand for the offerings, and able scale up if needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20003" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:ChannelRequirements is Directive (the required capacities a channel must meet), agreeing with the Formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify required channel capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the throughput and adaptability a distribution channel must provide and produces channel requirements." ;
          skos:example "A planner specifies the peak throughput and scalability each channel must support." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20004
ex:P20004 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16590
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16591
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16592
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OmniChannelStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating marketing and distribution efforts across different channels that integrate well with each other, are in conformance with company values, visual identity and branding, and offer uniform customer service experience that drives customer loyalty and repeat business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20004" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: modeled as a process because its bounded deliverable is an omni-channel orchestration design (Directive ex:OmniChannelStrategy); its three Task children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Orchestrate seamless customer experience across supported channels" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that coordinates marketing and distribution across channels into an integrated, uniform customer experience and produces an omni-channel strategy." ;
          skos:example "A team aligns branding and service across web, retail, and mobile into one omni-channel experience." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20005
ex:P20005 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExecutionRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the actions that need to be taken for successful multichannel marketing, the ordering, timing and dependencies of the steps, and the governance mechanism for reviewing and changing the protocol, if needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20005" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: modeled as a process because the dominant act 'develop ... roadmap' produces a bounded Directive ex:ExecutionRoadmap; the 'manage'/governance aspect is content of that roadmap, not a separate standing function." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage execution roadmap" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the actions, ordering, timing, and governance for multichannel marketing and produces an execution roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A program lead sequences the multichannel rollout steps and their review checkpoints into a roadmap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20007
ex:P20007 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerLoyaltyProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Devising procedures and mechanisms to retain existing customers, promote repeat business and increase the likelihood that previous customers to continue to buy products or services from the company. This may be achieved by rewarding customers for repeat business by means of gifts, discounts, redeemable points, or prioritized access to new products, events or services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.2.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20007" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output ex:CustomerLoyaltyProgram is Directive, agreeing with the Formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Define customer loyalty program" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that devises the procedures and reward mechanisms to retain customers and promote repeat business and produces a customer loyalty program specification." ;
          skos:example "A team specifies the points and rewards rules of a new loyalty program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20009
ex:P20009 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CostAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the production and distribution costs for each product or service, and each channel or method as factors in determining overall pricing." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20009" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:PricingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (a cost analysis) agrees with the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand resource requirements for each product/service and delivery channel/method" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input cost data and produces a cost analysis of the production and distribution resource requirements per offering and channel." ;
          skos:example "A pricing analyst breaks out per-product and per-channel costs as inputs to pricing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20011
ex:P20011 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesLead
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing and planning the acquisition of new customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20011" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfMonitoring: the act is a bounded, repeatable observe-and-track of pipeline status. The standing oversight function is realized by ex:SalesManagementCapability; this node models the recurring tracking act itself." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage opportunity pipeline" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input sales leads and observes the state of the new-customer-acquisition pipeline against expected progress." ;
          skos:example "A weekly pipeline review tracks each opportunity's stage and forecast." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20012
ex:P20012 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPersonnel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arranging and leading meetings, seminars, workshops and training events with customers to educate them about current offerings, best practices and technological advances to provide more value to customers and to increase their attrition and loyalty." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.1.8.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20012" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SalesProfessionalRole ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED (Gate-F): the prior genus ex:ActOfSelling (transfer of a good/service for a Financial Instrument) is a false friend -- the source describes arranging/leading meetings, seminars, workshops to EDUCATE customers, an educational/information-transfer act, not a sale transaction. Re-anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) plus cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act), mirroring the parallel partner-education rows P10211 and P20019 (sibling consistency between customer-education and partner-education acts). Retains the ex:SalesPersonnel participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage customer meetings/workshops" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which sales personnel arrange and lead meetings, seminars, or workshops to educate customers about an organization's offerings." ;
          skos:example "A team runs a customer workshop showcasing new product capabilities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20013
ex:P20013 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Choosing principal clients that are vital for the company." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20013" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfSelection: chooses from a candidate set and yields a directive designation. The chosen-account designation is a Directive ICE; modeled in this comment because no single named artifact is definitional for every instance (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Select key customers/accounts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input customer data and chooses, from among an organization's customers, the principal accounts to prioritize." ;
          skos:example "A sales VP designates the top twenty accounts as key for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20014
ex:P20014 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling the accounts of important clients." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20014" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfMonitoring: a bounded, repeatable act of carrying out and tracking the account plan (begin: plan in force; end: review-period close). The standing account-governance function is realized by ex:SalesManagementCapability." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage sales/key account plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that executes and tracks a key-account plan against its expected outcomes." ;
          skos:example "An account manager runs the quarter's key-account plan and tracks progress." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20015
ex:P20015 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExecutionRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan with detailed steps about how produce and deliver the goods or services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20015" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation: composes a Directive ICE (the delivery roadmap). GOLDEN PRINCIPLE satisfied." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop solution and delivery approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an execution roadmap prescribing the detailed steps to produce and deliver a proposed solution." ;
          skos:example "A delivery lead drafts the implementation roadmap for the proposed solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20016
ex:P20016 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing the internal review process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "20016" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfMonitoring: a bounded act of tracking the review process (begin: review initiated; end: review concluded)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage internal reviews" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that observes and tracks the internal review of a proposal against its expected completion." ;
          skos:example "A bid manager tracks each reviewer's sign-off on the draft proposal." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20017
ex:P20017 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Obtaining required company-internal authorizations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.12" ;
          ex:pcfID "20017" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfAcquisition (Planned Act): the act obtains an authorization the team did not previously hold. The approval ICE is obtained rather than authored here, so it is not modeled as a has-output restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage internal approvals" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition in which an organization obtains the internal authorizations required to submit a proposal." ;
          skos:example "A bid lead secures pricing and legal sign-off before submission." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20018
ex:P20018 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesProposal
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesProposal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Amending bids, proposals or quotes with more accurate time, cost or delivery estimates." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.3.14" ;
          ex:pcfID "20018" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation: re-composes the Directive proposal ICE. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE satisfied." ;
          rdfs:label "Revise bid/proposal/quote" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a sales proposal and has as output a revised sales proposal with more accurate time, cost, or delivery estimates." ;
          skos:example "A bid team reissues the proposal with corrected pricing." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20019
ex:P20019 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesTrainingMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Provide training and certification to develop strategies for marketing-driven sales." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20019" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): instructional content is transferred to partners." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide certification enablement training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that delivers certification-enablement training to sales partners and has as output sales training material." ;
          skos:example "A vendor certifies partner reps on a product line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20020
ex:P20020 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing, processing and issuing certifications and accrediting skills and competencies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20020" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): the act records and issues certification information." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage certifications and skills" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that reviews, processes, and issues partner certifications and accredits skills and competencies." ;
          skos:example "A program office issues a renewed certification to a partner engineer." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20021
ex:P20021 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPartner
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Backing sales partners and strategic alliances." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "3.5.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20021" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SalesPartnerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): the act transfers assistance and information to partners." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide support to partners/alliances" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which an organization provides support to its sales partners and strategic alliances." ;
          skos:example "A partner desk resolves a reseller's deal-registration issue." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20023
ex:P20023 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductionNetworkModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create representative logical system that provides the framework to attain strategic objectives based on resources, product volumes, and processes. Provides the general sequential flow and capacity requirement relationships among raw materials, parts, resources, finished products, and product families." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20023" ;
          rdfs:comment "A production network simulation result is a typical downstream output of running the model and is not asserted as definitional here." ;
          rdfs:label "Model production network to enable simulation and optimization" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a production network model providing the sequential-flow and capacity-requirement framework among materials, resources, and finished products." ;
          skos:example "Planners build a network model linking plants, lines, and product families for scenario simulation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20024
ex:P20024 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsensusDemandForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MasterProductionSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating the plan for internal activities such as production, inventory, and staffing. Include forecasted quantity of items to produce based on inputs from sales planning, demand planning/forecasting, and supply chain partners." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.1.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20024" ;
          rdfs:label "Create master production schedule" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that has as input a consensus demand forecast and has as output a master production schedule for production, inventory, and staffing." ;
          skos:example "The MPS run converts the demand forecast into a weekly build schedule." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20026
ex:P20026 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20027
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20032
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating rules and regulations for service delivery to the customer. Establish a system to manage performance, delivery, and direction of service delivery. Engage with the customer for satisfaction feedback. Define goals, policies, processes, and workplace layout and infrastructure as a part of the service delivery strategy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20026" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryGovernanceCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 5.1 as an occurrent whose two APQC children (5.1.1, 5.1.2) are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Not given existential has-process-part from Category 5.0 (R3). Genus Act of Formulation because its dominant deliverable is prescriptive (governance rules + strategies = Directive ICEs), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish service delivery governance and strategies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the governance and strategies for service delivery by standing up service delivery governance and developing the service delivery strategies that define its goals, policies, processes, and workplace layout." ;
          skos:example "A service organization's annual cycle of standing up delivery governance and refreshing its service delivery strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20027
ex:P20027 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20031
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing service delivery governance through a system that manages performance, development, and direction. Allow for customer feedback on delivery satisfaction." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20027" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryDevelopmentManagementCapability ,
                                ex:ServiceDeliveryGovernanceCapability ,
                                ex:ServiceDeliveryPerformanceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded establishment act (begin/end). Its APQC children that are standing management functions (5.1.1.1-5.1.1.3) are demoted to Organization Capabilities (R5/R6) and are NOT process parts; only the bounded feedback act 5.1.1.4 is a process part. Genus Act of Formulation: the principal deliverable is a governance system (Directive ICE), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish service delivery governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes service delivery governance by standing up a system to manage delivery performance, development, and direction and to gather customer satisfaction feedback." ;
          skos:example "A delivery organization institutes its governance system and a satisfaction-feedback loop for a new service line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20031
ex:P20031 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliverySatisfactionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Engaging the customer post delivery to gauge the effectiveness of services rendered in order to improve on key delivery functions going forward." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20031" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates/judges delivery effectiveness from the customer's perspective; its definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ServiceDeliverySatisfactionAssessment (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> descriptive). The Customer participates (has participant). Customer feedback is a typical input (rdfs:comment, not definitional restriction)." ;
          rdfs:label "Solicit feedback from customer on service delivery satisfaction" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that engages the customer after delivery to gauge the effectiveness of services rendered and produces a service delivery satisfaction assessment about that customer." ;
          skos:example "A delivery lead surveys a customer after a project and records a satisfaction assessment to improve future delivery." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20032
ex:P20032 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20033
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20034
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20035
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20036
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20037
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20038
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20039
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Constructing strategies that identify goals, policies, processes, and procedures in relation to service delivery. Review and validate strategies. Define the workplace layout and infrastructure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20032" ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded strategy-construction act whose APQC children (5.1.2.1-5.1.2.7) are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Genus Act of Formulation: its dominant deliverable is the prescriptive ex:ServiceDeliveryStrategy (Directive ICE), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop service delivery strategies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that constructs an organization's service delivery strategies, defining the goals, policies, processes, and workplace layout that govern how services are delivered." ;
          skos:example "A service organization's strategy team drafts its delivery goals, labor policy, process specification, and workplace layout for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20033
ex:P20033 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryGoal
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning organization practices to meet the needs of the customer by creating service delivery goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20033" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: its definitional output ex:ServiceDeliveryGoal is a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Customer requirements are a typical input (rdfs:comment, not a definitional restriction)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define service delivery goals" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that aligns organizational practice to customer needs by composing the service delivery goals an organization sets for itself." ;
          skos:example "A delivery organization sets measurable on-time and satisfaction goals aligned to customer needs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20034
ex:P20034 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:LaborPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining labor policies for resources and ensuring that those policies meet the needs of the organization, the customer, and government regulations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20034" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: its definitional output ex:LaborPolicy is a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Regulatory and customer requirements are typical inputs (rdfs:comment, not definitional restrictions)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define labor policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that outlines an organization's labor policies for its delivery resources so as to satisfy the needs of the organization, the customer, and government regulations." ;
          skos:example "An HR-and-delivery team drafts staffing and working-hours policies compliant with labor law." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20035
ex:P20035 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceAvailabilityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the needs of the customer and providing the necessary resources to meet those requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20035" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates whether resources suffice for customer requirements; its definitional output ex:ResourceAvailabilityAssessment is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> descriptive). Customer requirements are a typical input (rdfs:comment)." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate resource availability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges the availability of the resources required to meet customer needs and produces a resource availability assessment." ;
          skos:example "A resourcing manager appraises staff and tooling availability against an upcoming engagement and reports the gap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20036
ex:P20036 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyConstraintAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and understanding the limitations imposed upon service delivery network and supply." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20036" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Analysis (cco:ont00000366 Act of Information Processing): the verb 'identify and understand limitations' is information processing that yields a representation, not a prescription; its definitional output ex:SupplyConstraintAnalysis is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define service delivery network and supply constraints" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that identifies and examines the limitations imposed upon an organization's service delivery network and supply and produces a supply constraint analysis." ;
          skos:example "A delivery planner maps capacity and supplier limits across the delivery network and documents the constraints." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20037
ex:P20037 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryProcessSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defanging policies and procedures that focus on meeting the needs and expectations of the customer within the working parameters of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20037" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: its definitional output ex:ServiceDeliveryProcessSpecification is a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). The source text typo 'Defanging' is read as 'Defining'; the verbatim APQC text is preserved in ex:apqcSourceText." ;
          rdfs:label "Define service delivery process" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the policies and procedures focused on meeting customer needs and expectations within the organization's working parameters, yielding a service delivery process specification." ;
          skos:example "A process owner documents the standard service delivery procedure customers can expect for a given offering." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20038
ex:P20038 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Revisioning service delivery procedures that fall short of performance parameters. Realign procedures with specified expectations in order to provide successful service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20038" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges existing procedures against performance parameters; its definitional output ex:ServiceDeliveryReview is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> descriptive). Has the service delivery process specification as a typical input (rdfs:comment); the realignment/revision of the procedures is a downstream formulation step, not part of this review act." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and validate service delivery procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that reviews and validates existing service delivery procedures against performance parameters and produces a service delivery review identifying where they fall short of expectations." ;
          skos:example "A quality lead reviews delivery procedures against KPIs and flags the ones missing their targets for realignment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20039
ex:P20039 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkplaceLayoutPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a workplace that best serves the needs of the organization and customer through strategic layout and infrastructure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.1.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20039" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus Act of Formulation: its definitional output ex:WorkplaceLayoutPlan is a Directive ICE (a prescriptive layout/infrastructure plan), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define service delivery workplace layout and infrastructure" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that designs a service delivery workplace best serving the needs of the organization and customer, yielding a workplace layout plan for its layout and infrastructure." ;
          skos:example "A facilities-and-delivery team designs the floor layout and infrastructure of a new service center." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20040
ex:P20040 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12127
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20041
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20050
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourcePlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the demands on resources and creating a plan to enable the delivery of services via those resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20040" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 5.2 as a bounded, repeatable resource-management cycle (partonomy anchor). Its APQC children are process parts (cco:ont00001777), not subclasses. Anchored at cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning) because the cycle's defining output is a directive plan. Gate-F fix: the definitional has-output was changed from ex:ServiceDeliveryPlan to ex:ResourcePlan. ex:ServiceDeliveryPlan is 'the plan of action for rendering a service-delivery solution to a customer' -- a 5.3 RENDERING deliverable; APQC 5.2 is RESOURCE management, whose source ('creating a plan to enable the delivery of services via those resources') and children (ex:ResourcePlan in 5.2.2, forecasts in 5.2.1) produce a RESOURCE plan, not a service-rendering plan. Asserting ServiceDeliveryPlan as the existential output conflated 5.2 with 5.3 and failed Phase-3 necessity; ex:ResourcePlan is the cycle's genuine deliverable." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage service delivery resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that understands the demands placed on service delivery resources and produces a resource plan enabling those resources to deliver services." ;
          skos:example "An annual service-resource planning cycle that forecasts demand, plans resources, and enables staff before a delivery season." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20041
ex:P20041 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20042
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20043
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20044
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20045
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20046
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20047
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20048
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20049
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsensusDemandForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring necessary resources are maintained through monitoring pipeline, developing forecasts, and collaborating with customers. Determine skills needed for service deliver and forecast customer orders. Monitor forecasted orders and modify if where needed. Measure forecast accuracy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20041" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DemandForecastingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded, repeatable demand-management cycle. Children are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Anchored at ex:ActOfAnalysis because its defining output is a Descriptive forecast." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage service delivery resource demand" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that monitors opportunity pipeline and demand signals and produces a consensus demand forecast for service delivery resources." ;
          skos:example "A planning team builds, reconciles, and tracks a quarterly demand forecast for a services business." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20042
ex:P20042 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OpportunityPipelineData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PipelineStatusAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Tracking potential opportunities as they move through the various stages of the pipeline." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20042" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfMonitoring: the act tracks ongoing opportunity state rather than rendering a value judgement. Descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor pipeline" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input opportunity pipeline data and has as output a pipeline status assessment of opportunities moving through the pipeline." ;
          skos:example "A sales-operations analyst tracks each opportunity's pipeline stage week over week." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20043
ex:P20043 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfForecasting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HistoricalDemandData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MarketEnvironmentData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the demand anticipated for the organization's services. Estimate future demand for services using historical data, analysis of the market environment, and external data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20043" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DemandForecastingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) to ex:ActOfForecasting (Act of Prediction): the output ex:DemandForecast is a PREDICTIVE ICE about uncertain future demand, matching the Slice-3 forecast pattern rather than generic analysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop baseline forecasts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Forecasting that has as input historical demand data and market environment data and has as output a demand forecast for the organization's services." ;
          skos:example "A demand planner estimates next quarter's service demand from prior-year volumes and market trends." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20044
ex:P20044 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing a collaborative meeting in which to engage the customer to understand the scope of their needs and constructing solutions based on need and constraints." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20044" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: REJECTED ex:ActOfServiceProvision (a Planned Act in which an Agent renders a service to a customer by completing the tasks that fulfil an agreed service need). No service is rendered here -- this is a requirements-elicitation/communication act in which the organization GATHERS information; the deliverable is an understanding of customer needs (Descriptive), so per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE the genus is an analysis/information-processing act, ex:ActOfAnalysis. Re-anchored accordingly. The customer participant is definitional. The understanding of needs is the OUTPUT of the meeting (ex:CustomerNeedsAnalysis), not a pre-existing input: the prior has-input ex:CustomerRequirements was removed because the requirements are elicited here, not consumed. Constructing a solution is a typical, not necessary, downstream output (recorded here, not as a restriction). ex:ActOfServiceProvision is reserved for 5.3 rendering acts." ;
          rdfs:label "Collaborate with customers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that engages a customer in a collaborative meeting to elicit and understand the scope of their needs and has as output a customer-needs analysis." ;
          skos:example "A delivery lead runs a scoping workshop with the customer to capture the in-scope needs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20045
ex:P20045 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfForecasting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsensusDemandForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arriving at a consensus over the forecasted levels of demand for services by analyzing baseline forecasts and customer input." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20045" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DemandForecastingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) to ex:ActOfForecasting: reconciles the baseline forecast with customer input into an agreed PREDICTIVE forecast (ex:ConsensusDemandForecast)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop consensus forecast" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Forecasting that has as input a demand forecast and customer feedback and has as output a consensus demand forecast." ;
          skos:example "Sales and delivery leaders reconcile the baseline forecast with customer commitments into one agreed number." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20046
ex:P20046 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceAvailabilityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying what skillset is necessary for the delivery of opportunities. Determine the forecast of customer orders based upon those skillsets and the resources available." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20046" ;
          rdfs:comment "Discerns required skillsets against available resources; descriptive assessment output anchors it at ex:ActOfAnalysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine availability of skills to deliver on current and forecast customer orders" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a demand forecast and has as output a resource availability assessment of the skills available to deliver on current and forecast customer orders." ;
          skos:example "A resource manager checks whether the skills on hand can cover the forecast order book." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20047
ex:P20047 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ConsensusDemandForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Overseeing all activities necessary to deliver services to customer. Revise forecast to account for any issues that may arise. This could be changes in market trend, resource changes, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20047" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfMonitoring: the DOMINANT act is oversight of delivery activity against the forecast (source: 'Overseeing all activities'); the emitted revised forecast is a byproduct. Its output ex:DemandForecast is a PREDICTIVE ICE (cco:ont00000626 subClassOf Descriptive ICE), so the Information-Processing genus still agrees with the descriptive-kind output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). The pure forecast-production acts P20043/P20045 use ex:ActOfForecasting." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor activity against forecast and revise forecast" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input a consensus demand forecast and has as output a revised demand forecast reflecting observed delivery activity and emerging issues." ;
          skos:example "A delivery manager tracks actuals against forecast and updates the forecast when a key resource leaves." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20048
ex:P20048 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ForecastAccuracyAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing potential problems in the current forecast and making the necessary changes to align the forecast meet demand." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20048" ;
          rdfs:comment "Recognizes problems in the forecasting approach and adjusts it; the corrective change is expressed as a Descriptive revised forecast, so it anchors at ex:ActOfAnalysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate and revise forecasting approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a forecast accuracy assessment and has as output a revised demand forecast that better aligns the forecasting approach with demand." ;
          skos:example "A planning lead diagnoses systematic over-forecasting and recalibrates the model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20049
ex:P20049 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ForecastAccuracyAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing forecasting against actuals to determine accuracy. Modify forecasting to align with actual need." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20049" ;
          rdfs:comment "Compares forecast to actuals to yield a Descriptive accuracy judgement, so it anchors at ex:ActOfAnalysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure forecast accuracy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a demand forecast and has as output a forecast accuracy assessment determined by comparing the forecast against actuals." ;
          skos:example "An analyst computes MAPE between forecasted and actual service volumes for the prior period." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20050
ex:P20050 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20051
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20052
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20053
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20054
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20055
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20056
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourcePlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the need for and creating a resource plan. Understand resource demand and align with capacity, skills, and capabilities. Enlist suppliers and partners to supplement needed skills and capabilities. Monitor and manage capabilities and skills with an eye on critical resources and supplier capacity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20050" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ResourceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded, repeatable resource-planning cycle (partonomy anchor). Children are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation because its defining output is a Directive resource plan." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and manage resource plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that aligns resource demand with capacity, skills, and capabilities and has as output a resource plan." ;
          skos:example "A resource manager assembles and maintains a staffing-and-supplier plan for the delivery portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20051
ex:P20051 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillsTaxonomy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the skills needed to perform services to be delivered. Classify and organize these skills requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20051" ;
          rdfs:comment "Produces a Descriptive classification of skill requirements; anchored at ex:ActOfAnalysis. The taxonomy describes (does not prescribe) the skill landscape." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage skills taxonomy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer requirements and has as output a skills taxonomy classifying and organizing the skills needed to deliver services." ;
          skos:example "An HR analyst builds a structured catalog of the competencies needed across service offerings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20052
ex:P20052 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceAvailabilityAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourcePlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan to ensure that all resources are available to carry out services required for the customer. This can include physical resources and personnel." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20052" ;
          rdfs:comment "Defining output is a Directive resource plan, so anchored at ex:ActOfFormulation per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Create resource plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a resource availability assessment and has as output a resource plan ensuring all resources are available to carry out required services." ;
          skos:example "A resource manager writes the staffing and equipment plan for an upcoming engagement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20053
ex:P20053 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DemandForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceAvailabilityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Matching demand with skills and capability. Enlisting suppliers and partners to help with demand when needed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20053" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive matching judgement output anchors it at ex:ActOfAnalysis. Enlisting suppliers/partners is the downstream collaboration process (ex:P20054), not part of the matching analysis itself." ;
          rdfs:label "Match resource demand with capacity, skills, and capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a demand forecast and has as output a resource availability assessment matching demand against capacity, skills, and capabilities." ;
          skos:example "A planner compares the forecast order book against the skills inventory to find gaps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20054
ex:P20054 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeliveryPartner
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyConstraintAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding organizational need to enlist suppliers to provide resources for gaps in skills and capabilities. Identify where additional skills are needed and collaborate with third parties to fill those demands." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20054" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:DeliveryPartnerRole ,
                          ex:SupplierRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: REJECTED ex:ActOfServiceProvision (rendering a service TO a customer). The source describes the organization OBTAINING resources/skills FROM suppliers to fill gaps -- a procurement/acquisition act in which the org is the RECIPIENT and the supplier is the provider; ServiceProvision's 'render service to a customer' definition does not fit (the roles are reversed). Re-anchored at ex:ActOfAcquisition (Planned Act; 'obtains from some authority or supplier an entity ... the Agent did not previously hold'), which fits exactly. Supplier and delivery-partner participants are definitional to a third-party acquisition/collaboration act." ;
          rdfs:label "Collaborate with suppliers and partners to supplement skills and capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains from suppliers and delivery partners the resources, skills, and capabilities needed to supplement gaps in an organization's own service delivery, and has as input a supply constraint analysis." ;
          skos:example "A resource manager negotiates a partner SOW to obtain a specialist-skill capability for a delivery." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20055
ex:P20055 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplyConstraintAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Realizing critical resources required to perform and carry out customer needs. Engage with suppliers to fulfill those needs, if necessary. Identify supplier threshold for performing those needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20055" ;
          rdfs:comment "Discerns and registers critical resources and supplier capacity limits; descriptive register output anchors it at ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense), not the CCO communication-sense identifying act." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify critical resources and supplier capacity" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input customer requirements and has as output a supply constraint analysis registering the critical resources required and the capacity thresholds of suppliers." ;
          skos:example "A delivery lead lists the few specialist roles that are single points of failure and the suppliers who can backfill them." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20056
ex:P20056 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourcePlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceAvailabilityAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Directing and managing workforce needs. Ensure that resources are at full capacity. Monitor that all resources are able to skilled in their respective rolls. Make sure that necessary resources are available to provide the needed services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20056" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ResourceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at ex:ActOfMonitoring: it oversees ongoing workforce capacity and availability and reports state. Output is a Descriptive resource availability assessment. Bounded within a planning cycle (a part of ex:P20050), so modeled as a process; the standing capacity it realizes is ex:ResourceManagementCapability." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and manage resource capacity and availability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input a resource plan and has as output a resource availability assessment confirming that resources are at capacity and available for service delivery." ;
          skos:example "A resource manager runs a weekly utilization review to confirm staff are fully and appropriately deployed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20057
ex:P20057 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillsCapabilityTestResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Verifying that training provided to the person was successful through the administration testing and the application of skills for practical use." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.2.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20057" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnelRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F reconciliation: genus re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) for sibling consistency with ex:P12135 'Evaluate training effectiveness'. Administering a competency test verifies/judges the trainee's success (an evaluative act), and its output ex:SkillsCapabilityTestResult records that judgement. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE holds: descriptive output. Service delivery personnel are the test subjects (definitional participants)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform skill and capability testing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that administers a test and has as output a skills and capability test result judging whether training was successful through testing and practical application of skills." ;
          skos:example "A competency assessor administers a hands-on test after a technical course and records pass/fail." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20058
ex:P20058 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20059
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20069
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20077
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Rendering service to the customer by initiating, executing, and completing tasks associated with service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20058" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 5.3 as an occurrent; its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Deliver service to customer" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that renders a service to a customer by initiating, executing, and completing the tasks associated with service delivery." ;
          skos:example "A consultancy's full engagement to scope, build, deliver, and close out a service for a client." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20059
ex:P20059 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20060
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20061
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20062
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20063
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20064
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20065
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20068
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collaborating with the customer to understand service needs. Review, understand, and modify the delivery scope with the organization needs of the customer in mind. Confirm readiness and identify, select, and assign resources. Plan for service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20059" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning) to ex:ActOfServiceProvision, and the existential has-output some ex:ServiceDeliveryPlan was dropped. As a phase-aggregate it is parallel to siblings ex:P20069 (Execute) and ex:P20077 (Complete), both anchored to ex:ActOfServiceProvision with no output restriction; anchoring P20059 alone to Act of Planning with an output broke parallel-sibling consistency. Its seven children are a heterogeneous mix (appraisal P20060/P20064, analysis P20063, selection P20065, formulation P20061/P20062/P20068), so the plan is the output of child ex:P20068 qua child, not of the aggregate qua aggregate; promoting it to an existential on the parent over-committed (Phase-3 necessity). The service-delivery plan therefore stays as the output of ex:P20068 and is noted here only in this comment, not as a restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Initiate service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that initiates a service delivery by reviewing scope with the customer, confirming readiness, and identifying, selecting, and assigning resources, as the initiation sub-phase of rendering the service." ;
          skos:example "A kickoff phase in which scope is agreed, readiness confirmed, a team assigned, and a delivery plan produced." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20060
ex:P20060 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryContract
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ContractTermsReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Meeting with the customer, partner, and/or supplier to review the terms of the solutions contract and agree on the terms set forth." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20060" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates and judges the contract terms before agreement. Gate-F fix: the definitional has-output was changed from ex:ServiceDeliveryReview to ex:ContractTermsReview. ex:ServiceDeliveryReview is 'an end-to-end evaluation of the SUCCESS of a COMPLETED service-delivery engagement' (a post-delivery retrospective, the correct output of ex:P20078 and reused there); a contract-terms appraisal at INITIATION cannot output a completed-engagement success review. A distinct descriptive output ICE (ex:ContractTermsReview, is about the contract) was minted for this pre-delivery appraisal; ex:ServiceDeliveryReview is reserved for P20078 (and the aggregate retrospective)." ;
          rdfs:label "Review contract and agreed terms" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a service-delivery contract and has as output a contract-terms review of its terms, and has the customer as participant." ;
          skos:example "A contract-review meeting where provider, customer, and supplier confirm the terms." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20061
ex:P20061 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryProcessSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Taking the customer requirements for a solution and applying those requirements to a refined approach for service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20061" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): the act composes a directive specification. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: directive output -> formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand customer requirements and define refine approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input customer requirements and has as output a service-delivery process specification expressing a refined service approach." ;
          skos:example "Translating gathered requirements into a refined delivery approach document." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20062
ex:P20062 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProjectPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Updating the project plan to align with the new solution approach agreed upon with the customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20062" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): revising/approving a plan produces a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Modify/revise and approve project plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an updated and approved project plan aligned with the agreed solution approach." ;
          skos:example "Revising the project schedule and tasks to match the agreed approach, then approving it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20063
ex:P20063 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerBusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ObjectiveAlignmentAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning the customer business objectives with the agreed service delivery solution." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20063" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: the act examines objectives against the solution and yields a descriptive judgement." ;
          rdfs:label "Review customer business objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer business objectives and has as output an objective-alignment assessment relating them to the agreed solution." ;
          skos:example "Checking that each client objective is served by the agreed solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20064
ex:P20064 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnvironmentalReadinessConfirmation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Confirming that the organization has the recourses necessary to meet the expectations for the solution for service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20064" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act judges whether resources suffice and confirms readiness." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm environmental readiness" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as output an environmental-readiness confirmation that the organization holds the resources needed for the solution." ;
          skos:example "Verifying staffing, tooling, and facilities are in place before delivery begins." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20065
ex:P20065 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20066
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20067
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourcePlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying, selecting, and assigning resources required to deliver service to the customer. Ensure that all objectives are established and met, and the all rules of engagement have been identified and communicated." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20065" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnelRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfSelection (Act of Information Processing): it chooses resources from candidates and yields a directive assignment. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: directive output -> selection genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify, select, and assign resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses and assigns the resources required to deliver a service and has as output a resource plan." ;
          skos:example "Picking the delivery team and assigning each member to the engagement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20066
ex:P20066 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PeopleObjectives
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing the workforce with a plan of action and goals necessary to provide a service. Make sure that those objectives are met." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20066" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): articulating objectives produces a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish people objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output people objectives prescribing the plan of action and goals for the workforce." ;
          skos:example "Setting each team member's goals for the engagement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20067
ex:P20067 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EngagementRules
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing guidelines for how resources engage with the customer. For example, set rules of accountability, interaction, and accommodation when engaging the customer. Resources should be polite, empathetic, and attentive." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20067" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): establishing guidelines produces a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish engagement rules" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output engagement rules prescribing how delivery resources are to interact with the customer." ;
          skos:example "Documenting the conduct and accountability rules the team follows with the client." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20068
ex:P20068 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a plan of action to successfully render a solution for service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20068" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): producing a plan of action yields a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan for service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a service-delivery plan prescribing the action by which the solution is to be rendered." ;
          skos:example "Drafting the step-by-step delivery plan for the engagement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20069
ex:P20069 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20070
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20071
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20072
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20073
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20074
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20075
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20076
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Carrying out service delivery to the customer by creating and deploying the necessary solution. Analyze need and create a solution. Validate the solution and make changes if needed. Obtain approval to build/buy solution and then deploy solution to customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20069" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfServiceProvision: execution renders the service. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that carries out a service delivery by creating, validating, building, and deploying the necessary solution to the customer." ;
          skos:example "Building and deploying the agreed solution to the client." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20070
ex:P20070 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the needs of the customer and providing the necessary resources to meet those requirements within the scope of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20070" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis: it examines requirements and yields a descriptive understanding." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze environment and customer needs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer requirements and has as output a customer-needs analysis within the organization's scope." ;
          skos:example "Discovery work that documents the client's in-scope needs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20071
ex:P20071 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerNeedsAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SolutionSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a plan of action to provide service delivery to the customer through a possible solution. This solution should be in response to a collaborative effort made by the organization and the customer to meet service delivery needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20071" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): defining a solution composes a Directive ICE. GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: directive output -> formulation genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Define solution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a customer-needs analysis and has as output a solution specification for providing the service." ;
          skos:example "Designing the solution that will satisfy the documented needs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20072
ex:P20072 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SolutionSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Validating that the proposed solution is feasible and provides the needed services for the customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20072" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges feasibility and fitness and yields a descriptive result." ;
          rdfs:label "Validate solution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a solution specification and has as output a solution-validation result judging its feasibility and fit." ;
          skos:example "Testing the proposed design against the client's requirements." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20073
ex:P20073 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SolutionValidationResult
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SolutionChangeSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Realizing issues within the original drafted solution and providing changes to correct those issues." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20073" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: REJECTED ex:ActOfIdentification, whose ext definition is a discernment information-processing act that 'produces an Information Content Entity that REGISTERS them' (a descriptive registration). The asserted has-output is ex:SolutionChangeSpecification, a DIRECTIVE ICE that 'prescribes corrections to a drafted solution', so a descriptive-output discernment genus cannot definitionally yield it. The source ('Realizing issues ... AND providing changes to correct those issues') fuses discernment (descriptive) with formulation of corrective changes (directive); the directive output is the dominant tracked deliverable. Per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE the genus is aligned to the directive output: re-anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning). The 'realizing/discerning issues' aspect is a sub-aspect recorded here rather than split out as a separate part." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify changes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input a solution-validation result and has as output a solution-change specification prescribing corrections to the drafted solution." ;
          skos:example "Logging defects found in validation and specifying the fixes required." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20074
ex:P20074 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProceedApprovalDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Gaining approval from all avenues to proceed with providing solutions for service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20074" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAcquisition (Planned Act): the act secures an authorization (a Directive ICE) the agent did not previously hold." ;
          rdfs:label "Obtain approval to proceed" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that obtains from the relevant authorities a proceed-approval decision authorizing the service-delivery solution." ;
          skos:example "Securing sign-off from finance and the sponsor before building the solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20075
ex:P20075 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SolutionBuildRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Constructing or purchasing solutions necessary to provide service delivery." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20075" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). Rejected cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction: too narrow -- excludes purchasing) and ex:ActOfAcquisition (covers only obtaining, not building). Per D3 / S3 the definitional has output is the Descriptive ex:SolutionBuildRecord (the informational deliverable); the produced ex:ServiceDeliverySolution artifact (a material entity) is consumed downstream as the input to deployment (5.3.2.7). The build/buy decision is a typical accompanying output (rdfs:comment)." ;
          rdfs:label "Make build/buy solution" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that constructs or purchases a service-delivery solution and produces a record that the solution has been built or bought." ;
          skos:example "Either building the solution in-house or buying it from a vendor." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20076
ex:P20076 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliverySolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing the customer with promised services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20076" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryCapability ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfServiceProvision: deployment renders the solution to the customer. Operations material input (the solution) is legal here." ;
          rdfs:label "Deploy solution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that has as input a service-delivery solution, delivers the promised services to the customer, and has as output a service-delivery record, with the customer as participant." ;
          skos:example "Go-live: handing the working solution and services over to the client." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20077
ex:P20077 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20078
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20079
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20080
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20081
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20082
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20083
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20084
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing final steps to complete service delivery to the customer. Evaluate success through project review, complete finance activities, and confirm delivery. Release resources and manage completion by harvesting knowledge and systems by archiving records." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20077" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ServiceDeliveryCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfServiceProvision: the closeout phase of rendering the service. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Complete service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that completes a service delivery by reviewing success, closing finances, confirming delivery, releasing resources, harvesting knowledge, and archiving records." ;
          skos:example "Wrapping up an engagement: review, invoice closeout, sign-off, team release, and archival." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20078
ex:P20078 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing the entire service delivery process to evaluate the success of the project from beginning to end." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20078" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the success of the delivery and yields a descriptive review." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct service delivery/project review and evaluate success" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that reviews the whole service delivery and has as output a service-delivery review evaluating its success." ;
          skos:example "A post-mortem evaluating how the engagement went end to end." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20079
ex:P20079 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Insuring all payments are received and all activates therein are completed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20079" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): a bounded financial-closeout act. Detailed financial sub-processes cross-reference APQC Category 9.0; no informational output is definitional here." ;
          rdfs:label "Complete/finalize financial management activities" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that closes out the financial activities of a service delivery by ensuring all payments are received and all related activities are completed." ;
          skos:example "Confirming the final invoice is paid and the engagement's ledger is closed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20080
ex:P20080 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryContract
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ContractFulfillmentConfirmation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Confirming that the organization has satisfied all terms of the delivery contract set forth in collaboration between the organization and customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20080" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges fulfillment against the contract and yields a descriptive confirmation." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm delivery according to contract terms" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a service-delivery contract and has as output a contract-fulfillment confirmation that all its terms are satisfied." ;
          skos:example "Signing off that every contracted deliverable has been met." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20081
ex:P20081 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Discharging leveraged resources from service delivery commitments upon completion. Returning resources to the resource pool." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20081" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ServiceDeliveryPersonnelRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): a bounded release act. Operations participants (the released resources) are material entities/agents." ;
          rdfs:label "Release resources" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that discharges the resources leveraged for a service delivery and returns them to the resource pool, with service-delivery personnel as participants." ;
          skos:example "Rolling the delivery team off the engagement and back to the bench." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20082
ex:P20082 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryCompletionConfirmation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that all aspects of the service delivery process are completed both internally and externally." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20082" ;
          rdfs:comment "Although labelled 'Manage', here it is bounded to the completion of THIS service delivery (a natural end), so it is a process, not a standing capability. Gate-F fix: REJECTED ex:ActOfMonitoring, whose definition requires an Agent that REPEATEDLY observes an ongoing process OVER TIME -- this is a bounded one-shot closeout/ensure-completion act, not repeated status-tracking; the monitoring genus is also output-bearing (produces a Descriptive ICE) yet this class asserted no has-output, so genus and modeled facts disagreed. Re-anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) because it judges/confirms completeness, consistent with sibling closeout/confirmation acts; added the definitional descriptive output ex:ServiceDeliveryCompletionConfirmation (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage service delivery completion" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that judges whether all internal and external aspects of a service delivery's closeout are completed and has as output a service-delivery completion confirmation." ;
          skos:example "A delivery lead confirming that no internal or external closeout item remains outstanding." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20083
ex:P20083 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceKnowledgeBase
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Garnering feedback from all avenues to collect a knowledge base concerning services rendered." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20083" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (Act of Information Processing): it consolidates feedback into a descriptive knowledge base." ;
          rdfs:label "Harvest knowledge" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input customer feedback and has as output a service knowledge base concerning the services rendered." ;
          skos:example "Collating lessons learned and client feedback into a reusable knowledge base." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20084
ex:P20084 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceDeliveryRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Completing and archiving all records associated with requested services. Update all necessary systems to reflect those changes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "5.3.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20084" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored directly to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): archiving/storing records is information processing (storage), not analysis or appraisal." ;
          rdfs:label "Archive records and update systems" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as input service-delivery records and stores them by archiving the records and updating the relevant systems." ;
          skos:example "Filing the final engagement records and updating the CRM and document systems." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20086
ex:P20086 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerServiceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a set of behaviors, skills, and policies needed to provide customer service effectively across the enterprise." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20086" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): the output is a Directive ICE prescribing requirements." ;
          rdfs:label "Define customer service requirements across the enterprise" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a customer service requirement specification enumerating the behaviors, skills, and policies needed to provide customer service across the enterprise." ;
          skos:example "A service-design team documents the enterprise-wide customer service requirement specification." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20087
ex:P20087 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerServiceExperienceSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Communicating to the customer service resources what is expected when engaging the customer. Relate service level expectations to the workforce. Ensure positive customer experience." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20087" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the defining output is a Directive ICE (the experience specification). Communicating it to staff is the downstream method, not the definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Define customer service experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that articulates a customer service experience specification relating service-level expectations to the workforce for engaging customers." ;
          skos:example "A CX lead defines the expected tone and resolution standards for every customer interaction." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20088
ex:P20088 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerServiceChannelStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and refining procedures for customer service and technical support." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20088" ;
          rdfs:comment "Despite the 'manage' label, the Element Description denotes a bounded act of establishing/refining procedures (a Directive ICE), so it is modeled as a process under ex:ActOfFormulation rather than as an Organization Capability." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage customer service channel strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes and refines a customer service channel strategy governing the procedures for customer service and technical support." ;
          skos:example "A support-operations team establishes the phone, chat, and email channel procedures and revises them quarterly." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20089
ex:P20089 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12673
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16890
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16893
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20090
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20091
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaimDefinition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the exact terms and conditions under which specific warranties apply to certain goods or services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20089" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: output is a Directive ICE. Its APQC activities (6.1.6.1-6.1.6.5) are process parts via cco:ont00001777." ;
          rdfs:label "Define warranty claims" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that determines the exact terms and conditions under which specific warranties apply to certain goods or services, producing a warranty claim definition." ;
          skos:example "A warranty team sets the covered defects, time windows, and product scope for each warranty type." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20090
ex:P20090 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000684 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001833 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplierWarrantyResponsibilityAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Negotiating with manufacturers and dealers the obligations of each party in upholding warranties." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20090" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored to cco:ont00000684 (Act of Contract Formation) per Gate-F review: the Element Description ('Negotiating with manufacturers and dealers the obligations of EACH PARTY') and the skos:definition describe a BILATERAL, mutual, legally-binding agreement between two or more parties. cco:ont00000684 is defined as 'An Act of Promising having a lawful object entered into voluntarily by two or more agents with legal capacity, each of whom intends to create one or more legal obligations between them.' REJECTED the prior anchor cco:ont00000821 (Act of Promising) as too generic: per its CCO definition it is a UNILATERAL speech act 'performed by declaring that THE promising agent will do, or refrain from doing, the specified action', whereas this row is a two-party legal obligation. Contract Formation is a direct child of Promising, so the closure (Promising -> Commissive Communication -> Communication -> Planned Act) still holds. NOT ex:ActOfFormulation, because the act establishes a commitment between parties, not a unilateral plan. Suppliers participate via cco:ont00001833 (has agent)." ;
          rdfs:label "Agree on warranty responsibilities with suppliers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Contract Formation in which an organization and its suppliers or dealers negotiate and commit to the warranty obligations of each party, producing a supplier warranty responsibility agreement." ;
          skos:example "A manufacturer and dealer sign an agreement apportioning who covers which warranty repairs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20091
ex:P20091 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyOffering
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Informing customers about warranties that apply to promoted products or services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20091" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) per Gate-F review: the verbatim Element Description ('Informing customers about warranties that apply to promoted products or services') is a pure communication/informing act with no define/specify/compose verb in the source. Per D2 the genus is read from the Element Description, not the label verb 'Define'. This now mirrors the parallel sibling P12673 (6.1.6.5 'Communicate warranty policies and offerings'), whose source is likewise a communication and which is anchored at cco:ont00000402. The warranty offering being informed about is modeled as has input (cco:ont00001921), NOT a definitional has output (the source never mentions composing a specification), per the Phase-3 existential-necessity rule. The customer is the recipient (has participant). REJECTED the prior ex:ActOfFormulation anchor (and its has output some ex:WarrantyOffering) as a label-over-description false friend that anchored two near-identical informing acts to two different genera." ;
          rdfs:label "Define warranty related offerings for customers" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which a warranty offering is conveyed to customers, informing them about the warranties that apply to promoted products or services." ;
          skos:example "A product marketing team informs customers of the warranty bundled with a promoted product line." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20092
ex:P20092 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing procedures to handle recalls of defective products." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20092" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: output is a Directive ICE (ex:RecallStrategy, reused from the shared section vocab)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop recall strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes the procedures for handling recalls of defective products, producing a recall strategy." ;
          skos:example "A product-safety team documents the steps to execute a recall when a defect is confirmed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20094
ex:P20094 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnedProduct
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10364
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20095
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Acquiring returns and identify if the returns are scraped or salvaged." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20094" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations process: the returned product is a MATERIAL participant (D-operations / D4), attached via obo:has participant, not has output (has output is reserved for ICEs, D3). Reuses shared ex:ActOfAcquisition. Its two APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Process returns" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition in which an Agent takes back a returned product from a customer and determines whether it is to be scrapped or salvaged." ;
          skos:example "A returns center receives a returned appliance and routes it to refurbishment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20095
ex:P20095 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnedProduct
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnReasonRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Notating the reason for the return of the product." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.2.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20095" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations process: the returned product is a MATERIAL participant (obo:has participant). The informational output (the reason record) is a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE), attached via has output." ;
          rdfs:label "Process return and record reason" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition in which an Agent takes in the returned product and produces a return-reason record documenting why the product was returned." ;
          skos:example "A clerk inspects a returned item and records 'defective on arrival' as the return reason." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20096
ex:P20096 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaim
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Receiving incoming warranty claims. Route claim to correct department. Document claim." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20096" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): a warranty-claim ICE is transferred from the originator into the organization." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive warranty claim" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that takes in an incoming warranty claim, routes it to the responsible department, and documents it." ;
          skos:example "A service desk logs an incoming claim and routes it to the warranty team." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20097
ex:P20097 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12677
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12678
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20098
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20099
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20100
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveActionRecommendation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing investigational and analysis of warranty claims. This involves notification and definition of a warranty issue, includes the scheduling of a field service agent to perform further investigation; the request and receipt of defective parts; and diagnosis/root cause analysis. This concludes with the receipt of the result and recommendation for corrective action." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20097" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis (inlined): investigation is information processing producing a descriptive understanding. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Investigate warranty issues" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines a warranty issue and produces a root cause analysis and a recommendation for corrective action." ;
          skos:example "The warranty team defines the issue, schedules field service, examines a returned part, and reports a root cause." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20098
ex:P20098 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaim
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaimCode
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyIssueDefinition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the issue of the claim. The warranty team will look into the issue and understand whether it is covered by the claim code or if more detail is required. Field service will be scheduled to further qualify the definition of the issue and to collect more evidence." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20098" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: discerning and articulating the claimed issue is information processing producing a descriptive definition." ;
          rdfs:label "Define issue" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a warranty claim and a warranty claim code and has as output a warranty issue definition." ;
          skos:example "The warranty team characterizes the reported fault against the applicable claim code." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20099
ex:P20099 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyIssueDefinition
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveActionRecommendation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Investigating claims by an appropriate functional representative. Once the issue has been clearly defined and diagnosed and a recommendation for corrective action is determined, it will be provided to the warranty management team." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20099" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfAnalysis: diagnosis/root-cause analysis is information processing producing a descriptive analysis plus a directive corrective-action recommendation." ;
          rdfs:label "Investigate issue/perform root cause analysis" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input a warranty issue definition and has as output a root cause analysis and a recommendation for corrective action." ;
          skos:example "An engineer diagnoses the failure mode and recommends a design fix." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20100
ex:P20100 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CorrectiveActionRecommendation
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Receiving investigative results to assess claim approval or denial. The warranty team will assess the results of the investigation and the recommendations for corrective action." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20100" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the warranty team evaluates the investigation results ('the warranty team will assess the results... to assess claim approval or denial'). Per Gate-F a definitional has output (ex:ClaimAssessment, a Descriptive judgement) is added: an Act of Appraisal is definitionally judgement-producing and the source makes producing the assessment intrinsic, so omitting it under-specified the genus (Gate D thin-class risk) and the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (appraisal -> descriptive). DIVISION OF LABOR (deliberate, documented): P20100 (Appraisal) JUDGES the results toward approve/deny and emits a Descriptive ex:ClaimAssessment; the sibling P12668 'Approve or reject' (ex:ActOfSelection) COMMITS the binary decision and emits the Directive ex:ClaimDisposition. The assess/decide split is intentional, not incidental." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive investigation result/recommendation for corrective action" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input a root cause analysis and a recommendation for corrective action and produces a claim assessment judging the claim toward approval or denial." ;
          skos:example "The warranty team reviews the root-cause report and records an assessment recommending the claim be approved, before the decision act commits it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20101
ex:P20101 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RootCauseAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResponsiblePartyDetermination
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying responsible party for a claim. There is no negotiation with the supplier at this point. There can be multiple warranties applicable to the same part: a new part warranty, a new product warranty (for the product the part is installed on), and a supplier warranty from the company that last repaired the part. The information required for this decision would be the output of Receive component/part and analyze fault [19728]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20101" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus ex:ActOfIdentification (apqc-ext, discernment sense): discerns the responsible party; output is a Descriptive determination." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine responsible party" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that has as input a root cause analysis and has as output a responsible party determination identifying who is responsible for settling the claim." ;
          skos:example "The team determines which of several applicable warranties bears settlement responsibility." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20102
ex:P20102 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimPreAuthorization
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Authorizing claims prior to submittal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20102" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): issuing an authorization is a prescriptive act whose output is a Directive ICE; it is not analysis, appraisal, or planning. Despite the 'Manage' label the description denotes a bounded authorization act, so it is a process (not an Organization Capability)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage pre-authorizations" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that grants preliminary authorization of a warranty claim prior to its formal submittal, producing a claim pre-authorization." ;
          skos:example "A supervisor pre-authorizes a claim so it can be submitted for settlement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20103
ex:P20103 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimDisposition
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Contacting the originator of whether the warranty claim has been approved or rejected." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20103" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): the approve/reject decision ICE is transferred to the originator. Participant ex:Customer where definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Notify originator of approve/reject decision" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transfers the claim disposition to the claim originator." ;
          skos:example "The team emails the customer that their claim was approved." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20104
ex:P20104 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PaymentAuthorization
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Allowing for a payment to be made to the claimant." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20104" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): issuing a payment authorization is a prescriptive act with a Directive ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Authorize payment" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that permits a payment to be made to the claimant, producing a payment authorization." ;
          skos:example "The team authorizes disbursement to a customer for an approved claim." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20105
ex:P20105 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimDisposition
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ClaimClosureRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Archiving and closing the warranty claim after a final decision has been made to either approve or reject." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "20105" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): closing/archiving stores the claim record; output is a Descriptive closure record." ;
          rdfs:label "Close claim" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that archives a warranty claim after a final decision and produces a claim closure record." ;
          skos:example "After payment, the claim file is archived and marked closed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20106
ex:P20106 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfResolution ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20107
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20108
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplierRecoveryClaim
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the recovery of costs from suppliers for individual claims." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20106" ;
          rdfs:comment "Scoped to 'individual claims', so bounded per claim (not a standing function); modeled as a process under ex:ActOfResolution. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage supplier recovery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Resolution that recovers the costs of an individual claim from the responsible supplier, comprising raising and negotiating a supplier recovery claim." ;
          skos:example "For a settled claim, the company raises a recovery claim and negotiates reimbursement from the supplier." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20107
ex:P20107 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResponsiblePartyDetermination
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SupplierRecoveryClaim
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Raising a supplier recovery claim. This is based off the decision made in Receive investigation result/recommendation for corrective action [20100]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20107" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): raising/recording a recovery claim produces a Descriptive SupplierRecoveryClaim, agreeing with the section vocab's descriptive typing of that ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Create supplier recovery claims" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that has as input a responsible party determination and has as output a supplier recovery claim." ;
          skos:example "The team raises a recovery claim against the supplier of a defective part." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20108
ex:P20108 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnedProduct
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Supplier
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnAuthorization
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Arranging the returns of recalled products to suppliers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20108" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:SupplierRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): negotiating/arranging is a prescriptive coordination act, not analysis or appraisal. Operations category: the returned product is a Material Entity participant (obo:BFO_0000057); the arrangement is a Directive ReturnAuthorization. Participant ex:Supplier where definitional." ;
          rdfs:label "Negotiate recoveries with suppliers" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that negotiates cost recoveries with suppliers and arranges the return of recalled products, producing a return authorization." ;
          skos:example "The company arranges with the supplier to return recalled units and recover their cost." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20109
ex:P20109 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10366
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12708
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21604
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21605
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DispositionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining if a returned product can be salvaged or repaired. Salvage or repair is dependent upon the product, the condition of the product, or the availability of a like item." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.4.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20109" ;
          rdfs:comment "Selection -> DIRECTIVE output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): the disposition decision prescribes the chosen handling. Its APQC tasks are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage disposition of returned products" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses the disposition - salvage, repair, or restock - for a returned product and produces a disposition decision." ;
          skos:example "A disposition analyst decides a returned unit will be repaired rather than salvaged based on its condition." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20110
ex:P20110 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20111
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20112
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20113
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20114
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20115
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20116
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Removing defective products from the distribution chain. Participate in audits from watchdog agencies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20110" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:RecallManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 6.4 as a bounded end-to-end recall-execution occurrent. Its APQC children are process parts (cco:ont00001777), not subclasses. The standing-function 'Manage...' reading is carried by shared ex:RecallManagementCapability (Organization Capability), which is realized in this process (R6). Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the group aggregates heterogeneous sub-acts (planning, appraisal, communication) under no single narrower CCO Act." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage product recalls and regulatory audits" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Organization removes defective products from the distribution chain and participates in audits by regulatory authorities, comprising the initiation, hazard assessment, communication, regulatory reporting, effectiveness monitoring, and termination of a product recall." ;
          skos:example "A manufacturer's end-to-end campaign to recall a defective product batch, from issuing the recall through filing closing reports with the regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20111
ex:P20111 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DefectiveProduct
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallInitiationRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Commencing the removal process of defective products." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20111" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored to the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) per Gate-F review: the source verb 'Commencing the removal process of defective products' denotes LAUNCHING/triggering an action, not composing a directive document. REJECTED the prior ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning) anchor with has output some ex:RecallStrategy: ex:RecallStrategy is ALREADY the asserted has output of P20092 'Develop recall strategy' (6.1.7), so two distinct process classes asserting has output some <same Directive ICE> double-produces the artifact and mis-genuses a launch/trigger act as a planning act. An initiation act CONSUMES/applies the standing strategy and launches the operational removal. Fix: has input some ex:RecallStrategy (the pre-existing strategy from 6.1.7 is applied) plus a Descriptive has output some ex:RecallInitiationRecord (recording that the recall was commenced). The defective product remains the material input (operations category permits material I/O)." ;
          rdfs:label "Initiate recall" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that commences the removal of a defective product from the distribution chain by applying the standing recall strategy, producing a recall initiation record." ;
          skos:example "A quality team applies the recall strategy to activate removal of a defective product lot from distributors and records that the recall has commenced." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20112
ex:P20112 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HazardRiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Performing risk analysis. Identify all dangers, evaluate how probable they are, and what kinds of negative results or or adverse side effect they carry." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20112" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates and judges hazards. Output is a Descriptive ICE (a judgement), satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (appraisal -> descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess the likelihood and consequences of occurrence of any hazards" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the dangers associated with a defective product, judging their probability and consequences, and produces a hazard risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "A safety engineer assesses the burn-hazard probability and severity of a recalled appliance and issues a hazard risk assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20113
ex:P20113 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallCommunication
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling communications that are related to product recalls." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20113" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication) because the act consists of transferring recall-related ICEs among parties. Output is a Descriptive ICE (the communication content). Despite the 'Manage' label, the description denotes a bounded communication occurrent." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage recall related communications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which an Agent handles and transfers information related to a product recall and produces a recall communication." ;
          skos:example "A communications team issues recall notices and responds to inquiries, producing recall communications for customers and retailers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20114
ex:P20114 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryBody
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryIncidentReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and delivering reports to regulatory agencies to provide details about handling product recalls." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20114" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication): a report (an ICE) is transferred from the organization to a regulatory authority. The Regulatory Body is a definitional participant (recipient)." ;
          rdfs:label "Submit regulatory reports" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication in which an Agent creates and delivers a regulatory incident report to a regulatory body to detail the handling of a product recall." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer files a recall incident report with the consumer-safety regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20115
ex:P20115 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the effectiveness of product recalls." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20115" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfMonitoring (PROPOSE-EXT). The act analyzes/audits effectiveness over time and yields a Descriptive ICE, satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (information-processing -> descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and audit recall effectiveness" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that examines the performance of an ongoing product recall and produces a recall effectiveness assessment." ;
          skos:example "An auditor tracks the return rate of a recalled batch and reports the recall's effectiveness." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20116
ex:P20116 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfResolution ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallCommunication
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryIncidentReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ending product recalls, communicating to the public and filing reports." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20116" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfResolution (PROPOSE-EXT, reconciled to cco:ont00000228 Planned Act). The public communication and report filing are sub-acts of concluding the recall; both outputs are recorded as definitional (a recall communication and a regulatory incident report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage recall termination" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Resolution that brings a product recall to a definite close by communicating its conclusion to the public and filing the closing regulatory reports." ;
          skos:example "A recall coordinator closes out a recall, issues a public termination notice, and files the final report with the regulator." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20117
ex:P20117 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Customer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerFeedback
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Engaging with the customer to understand their cross-channel experience. Find out what channels were effective and what areas need improvement." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20117" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored (Gate-F) to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication, co-anchored cco:ont00000228 Planned Act for standalone SHACL); the act SOLICITS/OBTAINS feedback from the customer (the customer transfers the feedback ICE), consistent with the other solicit-feedback acts and P10336: it elicits and stores input ICEs (customer feedback) about channel effectiveness; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:CustomerFeedback. The Customer participates (has participant)." ;
          rdfs:label "Solicit customer feedback on cross-channel experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that engages the customer to elicit and collect customer feedback on their cross-channel service experience." ;
          skos:example "A survey asks customers which channels (chat, phone, app) worked best for them and where they struggled." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20118
ex:P20118 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerSatisfactionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating how satisfied customers are with how product warranties are managed and resolved." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20118" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges customer satisfaction and yields the Descriptive ex:CustomerSatisfactionAssessment (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure customer satisfaction with warranty handling and resolution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates how satisfied customers are with how product warranties are handled and resolved and produces a customer satisfaction assessment." ;
          skos:example "A warranty team surveys claimants and reports how satisfied they were with the warranty resolution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20119
ex:P20119 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining how warranties and warranty management can be made better and more efficient." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20119" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (shared genus, cco:ont00000366): it examines warranty performance to discern improvement opportunities; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis. Input (warranty performance report) is typical, recorded as commentary rather than a definitional restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify improvement opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines warranty management performance and produces an improvement opportunity analysis of how warranties and warranty management can be made better and more efficient." ;
          skos:example "A warranty analyst studies the performance report and lists efficiency improvements for the warranty programme." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20120
ex:P20120 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WarrantyClaim
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FraudulentClaimAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing and assessing claims that contain deliberately incorrect information or that have been submitted with the goal to deceive the system." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20120" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it reviews and judges the legitimacy of claims; definitional output is the Descriptive ex:FraudulentClaimAssessment (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Input modeled as ex:WarrantyClaim (the claims under investigation)." ;
          rdfs:label "Investigate fraudulent claims" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input warranty claims and has as output a fraudulent claim assessment judging whether a claim contains deliberately incorrect or deceptive information." ;
          skos:example "A claims investigator reviews a suspicious warranty claim and records an assessment that it is fraudulent." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20121
ex:P20121 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RecallEffectivenessAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing customer service feedback to identify areas in which improvements can be made. Engage with management to discuss issues." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20121" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the label verb 'Evaluate recall performance' judges recall performance and yields the Descriptive ex:RecallEffectivenessAssessment (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE; that ICE being Descriptive is the intended appraisal output, so the principle holds). Per Gate-F review: the apqcSourceText for 20121 is shared BOILERPLATE, verbatim IDENTICAL to P11688 (6.5.1.2) -- 'Reviewing customer service feedback to identify areas in which improvements can be made. Engage with management to discuss issues.' -- which describes an analyze/identify-improvement act and was correctly anchored at ex:ActOfAnalysis with output ex:ImprovementOpportunityAnalysis. Here the boilerplate is OVERRIDDEN by the label per the spec's boilerplate provision, so 20121 is engineered as a recall-performance appraisal rather than trusting the mismatched description; this divergence from P11688 is therefore deliberate, not an inconsistency. FLAGGED for APQC source-data correction: the 20121 Element Description should be replaced with recall-specific text so the description is not silently trusted. Customer feedback is a typical input, recorded as commentary rather than a definitional restriction." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate recall performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the performance of an organization's product recalls and produces a recall effectiveness assessment." ;
          skos:example "A product-safety team evaluates how effective a recent recall was at reaching affected customers and reports its findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20122
ex:P20122 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkforceStrategyModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing models for effectively strategizing the work force of the organization. Carry out all aspects of performance required for the work force to function, including recruitment, selection, retention, and professional development." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.1.2.15" ;
          ex:pcfID "20122" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): implementation executes a held Directive ICE (the workforce strategy model), not formulate a new one (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement workforce strategy models" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that has as input a workforce strategy model and carries out that model across recruitment, selection, retention, and development." ;
          skos:example "HR operationalizes the workforce strategy model across all functions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20123
ex:P20123 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10456
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10457
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10458
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10459
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating and selecting potential employees through interviews, tests, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20123" ;
          rdfs:comment "Composite process; parts are the four screening/selection sub-acts. Culminates in ex:P10459 (the selection decision)." ;
          rdfs:label "Screen and select candidates" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that screens candidates through selection tools, interviews, and tests, and selects the most appropriate among them." ;
          skos:example "A panel interviews and tests shortlisted candidates and chooses two to advance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20124
ex:P20124 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PositionClassification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the requirements for the position to be filled. Determine the experience and skills necessary to perform the tasks outlined." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.2.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20124" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ApplicantDataManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense, Act of Information Processing): it determines/registers requirements; output is a Descriptive ICE; genus agrees." ;
          rdfs:label "Complete position classification and level of experience" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the experience and skills required for a position and produces a position classification." ;
          skos:example "A recruiter classifies a role as senior and lists its required skills." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20125
ex:P20125 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20126
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20127
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20128
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20129
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing identified training programs for employees. Engage with industries to provide certifications, administer certification test, and maintain active certification." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20125" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EmployeeDevelopmentCapability ,
                                ex:EmployeeTrainingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Administration: a bounded episode of running the certification program (distinct from a standing 'Manage' function because it decomposes into concrete, completable child tasks). Decomposes via has process part into its four APQC children." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage examinations and certifications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that runs an organization's certification program by liaising with certification authorities, administering tests, appraising qualifications, and issuing and maintaining certificates." ;
          skos:example "The certification office runs an annual cycle of qualifying, testing, and certifying technicians." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20126
ex:P20126 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CertificationAuthority
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating with third party certification authorities to provide training and certifications for necessary skills." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.4.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20126" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:CertificationAuthorityRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Administration (coordination facet). The certification authority is a definitional participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Liaise with external certification authorities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that coordinates with third-party certification authorities to provide training and certifications for required skills." ;
          skos:example "The training office negotiates a certification partnership with an industry body." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20127
ex:P20127 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CertificationTestResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing tests to the workforce that will satisfy completion of certifications." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.4.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20127" ;
          rdfs:comment "Administration (delivery of tests); the test result record is its descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Administer certification tests" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that provides certification tests to the workforce and has as output a certification test result." ;
          skos:example "The certification office proctors the year-end welding examination." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20128
ex:P20128 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExperienceQualificationAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ascertaining the experience level needed to qualify for a specific job or certification within the organization. Some certificates require practical experience as well as training programs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.4.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20128" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense, an Act of Information Processing). 'Ascertaining the level needed to qualify' is discernment of a standing requirement threshold (information processing), not judging the quality or worth of an individual or entity; the label word 'Appraise' was a false-friend that drove the prior genus. This is the same act-kind as P20124 (Complete position classification), which discerns 'the experience and skills required for a position' and is anchored under ex:ActOfIdentification -- cross-referenced here for sibling/parallel-row consistency. The Descriptive output ex:ExperienceQualificationAssessment is retained and satisfies the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE under the information-processing genus." ;
          rdfs:label "Appraise experience qualifications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the experience level needed to qualify for a specific job or certification and has as output an experience qualification assessment." ;
          skos:example "An assessor determines that the certification requires three years of field experience to qualify." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20129
ex:P20129 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CertificationRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering certificates to all candidates that have successfully met experience qualifications, and passed all tests necessary to obtain the certificate." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.3.4.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20129" ;
          rdfs:comment "Administration (issuance/upkeep); the CertificationRecord is its descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Administer certificate issue and maintenance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that issues and maintains certificates for candidates who have met the experience qualifications and passed the required tests, and has as output a certification record." ;
          skos:example "The certification office issues and renews certificates for employees who passed their exams." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20132
ex:P20132 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10517
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20133
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:WorkforceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StaffingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Organizing the workforce so that all positions are covered for all shifts with the necessary skilled resources in place. Have a system in place to backfill positions while an employee is on leave." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.6.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20132" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is the Directive ex:StaffingPlan because the schedule prescribes who works which shift. Decomposes into receiving resources (20133) and managing deployment (10517)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage workforce scheduling" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that has as input workforce data and produces a staffing plan that covers all positions across all shifts with appropriately skilled resources." ;
          skos:example "A scheduler builds the weekly shift roster and arranges backfill for staff on leave." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20133
ex:P20133 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAdministration ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SkillRequirementData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Obtaining resources necessary to fill a position utilizing specific skills and capabilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "7.6.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20133" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAcquisition to ex:ActOfAdministration for parent/sibling consistency. ex:ActOfAcquisition denotes obtaining 'an entity ... that the Agent did not previously hold' (external procurement); but read in its parent context -- P20132 'Manage workforce scheduling' is about covering shifts and BACKFILLING positions with EXISTING staff -- 'receiving required skills/capabilities' is internal allocation/deployment of already-held workforce, so the surface verb 'Obtaining' was a false-friend. REJECTED reading: external procurement of a new resource (contractor/agency hire); under that reading ex:ActOfAcquisition would be correct, but the workforce-scheduling parent does not license it and the verb alone is insufficient grounds (§6 Step 2). Now matches parent P20132 and sibling P10517 (both ex:ActOfAdministration). Output as a staffing plan filler is typical, kept in comment." ;
          rdfs:label "Receive required resources/skills and capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Administration that has as input skill requirement data and allocates the skilled resources necessary to fill a position within the organization's workforce schedule." ;
          skos:example "A supervisor allocates an available skilled employee to cover an open shift." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20135
ex:P20135 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Putting budgeting plans into practical use keeping within designated forecasting parameters." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20135" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): this is execution/implementation, not the production of an informational artifact. The Budget is a definitional directive input; it has no definitional informational output." ;
          rdfs:label "Operationalize and implement plans to achieve budget" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that puts an approved budget into practical use, executing financial activity within designated forecasting parameters." ;
          skos:example "Releasing budgeted funds and steering spending to stay within the approved plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20136
ex:P20136 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Budget
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialForecast
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:VarianceAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting a quantitative analysis between what was forecasted and budgeted and actual financial behavior." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.1.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20136" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE): a variance analysis represents the gap between plan and actuals (cco:ont00000853). Budget and forecast are definitional inputs." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform variance analysis against forecasts and budgets" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that compares actual financial behavior against the budget and the financial forecast and produces a variance analysis." ;
          skos:example "A monthly budget-versus-actual variance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20137
ex:P20137 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11213
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11215
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19588
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19589
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19590
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing hedging strategy in attempt to alleviate risk. This will include all options, depravities, and futures contracts agreed upon in Develop risk management/hedging strategy [12974]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.7.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20137" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5: heading aggregating discrete hedge-execution tasks -> modeled as Organization Capability (R6) realized in those task processes. Implements the hedging strategy produced by ex:P12974." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute hedging transactions" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in acts of measuring positions, establishing and unwinding hedges, refining hedging positions, and monitoring credit to implement a hedging strategy." ;
          skos:example "The desk puts on the futures and options called for by the hedging strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20139
ex:P20139 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11276
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19220
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19221
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19222
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P19223
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining the steps and strategies needed to construct assets. Verify that all regulations are adhered to and that all permissions have been granted. Organize and plan for resources to complete construction." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20139" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:AssetConstructionCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded design-and-plan phase preceding physical construction; anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) as a composite of formulation, acquisition, and monitoring acts. Children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Design and plan asset construction" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Organization formulates the strategy, designs, permits, and resource plans needed to construct assets, decomposing into developing the construction strategy, managing construction performance, obtaining permissions, designing the assets, and planning construction resources." ;
          skos:example "An engineering team produces the plant design, secures permits, and a resource plan before breaking ground." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20140
ex:P20140 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BestPracticesRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Realizing those practices and procedures that are the most effective to the success of the business and making that information available." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20140" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (discernment sense): the act enumerates effective practices; its definitional output is a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify published best practices" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the practices and procedures most effective for business success and produces a best-practices register." ;
          skos:example "A center of excellence catalogs proven process practices for reuse." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20141
ex:P20141 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:MetricGapAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the need for additional performance indicators that would be necessary to successfully achieve the business goal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.1.4.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20141" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfFormulation to ex:ActOfIdentification. Source text is 'Determining the NEED for additional performance indicators that would be necessary' -- a discernment/appraisal that yields a descriptive gap-finding (whether more metrics are required), NOT the composition of the KPI specification itself. Rejected candidate ex:ActOfFormulation (Planning -> Directive output): it over-commits, modeling the authoring of the indicator spec rather than the determination of the gap, and would violate the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (a descriptive determination paired with a Directive output). This re-anchoring aligns the row with its sibling 'Identify' rows 16386 and 20140, which are ex:ActOfIdentification (information-processing, Descriptive). The actual composition of any new indicator spec is a downstream formulation act (cf. ex:P10270 / ex:P11109)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify additional metrics as required" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that determines whether additional performance indicators are needed to achieve a business goal and produces a metric gap assessment registering that need." ;
          skos:example "When a new goal is set, an analyst determines that no current KPI tracks it and records the metric gap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20142
ex:P20142 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAcquisition ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Procuring the necessary resources outlined in Define roles and resources [11123]" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.2.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20142" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAcquisition (reused from apqc-ext, under cco:ont00000228 Planned Act): obtaining/securing resources the organization did not previously hold. The role-definition specification from 11123 is a typical governing input, noted here; the resources acquired are material/independent continuants, not a definitional ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Acquire/secure project resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Acquisition that procures and secures the resources outlined for a business project that the organization did not previously hold." ;
          skos:example "A project manager procures the contractors and equipment the project plan requires." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20143
ex:P20143 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recognizing the impact of threats to critical assets. Determine what groups are impacted by this impact." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "20143" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses ex:ChangeImpactAssessment (Descriptive ICE) as the register of impacted groups; the companion act 13.4.1.11 quantifies the extent." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify impacted groups" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns which organizational groups are impacted by a change and registers them in a change impact assessment." ;
          skos:example "The team lists the teams and functions touched by the proposed change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20144
ex:P20144 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the impact of threats to critical assets. Determine what assets will be impacted by the change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.1.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "20144" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it judges the magnitude of impact, refining the descriptive ex:ChangeImpactAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine degree/extent of impact" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the degree and extent to which the change impacts the organization's assets and records its judgement in a change impact assessment." ;
          skos:example "Analysts rate how severely each affected asset is impacted by the change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20145
ex:P20145 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeChampion
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Utilizing champions that have been trained to carry out needed changes. Engage champions to communicate roles and responsibilities for the change." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20145" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ChangeChampionRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): deploying/engaging champions is an organizational act, not the production of an analysis or plan; the champion participants are the salient continuants." ;
          rdfs:label "Assign change champion(s)" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act in which trained change champions are deployed and engaged to carry out and communicate the change in their respective areas." ;
          skos:example "Each trained champion is formally tasked with driving the change in their division." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20146
ex:P20146 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reporting on the outcome of the change. Document changes and the impact those changes had on critical assets. Share findings with those within the target audience: those impacted by the change, change champions, stakeholders, etc." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.4.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20146" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) to ex:ActOfReporting (subClassOf cco:ont00000379 Act of Representative Communication + cco:ont00000228): the source makes dissemination definitional -- 'Share findings with those within the target audience: those impacted by the change, change champions, stakeholders, etc.' -- so this is a DISSEMINATE-class reporting act, not a mere COMPILE. The has_output ICE restriction (ex:ChangeReport) is retained." ;
          rdfs:label "Report on change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that documents the outcome and impact of a change and shares the resulting change report with its affected target audience." ;
          skos:example "The change office issues a closeout report to stakeholders and champions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20147
ex:P20147 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10270
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10271
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10272
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10273
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10274
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10275
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10276
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20148
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing process data, measures, and trends in an effort to evaluate process performance and identify possible improvements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20147" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) because it evaluates and judges performance. Children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that assesses process data, measures, and trends to evaluate process performance and identify possible improvements, producing a performance assessment." ;
          skos:example "A quarterly performance review evaluates KPI results and flags improvement opportunities." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20148
ex:P20148 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Consolidating acquired metrics and trends. Provide data that can be benchmarked against historical data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20148" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): input metric ICEs are received and consolidated into an output Descriptive ICE (performance data)." ;
          rdfs:label "Collect performance data" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that consolidates acquired metrics and trends into performance data suitable for benchmarking against historical data." ;
          skos:example "A reporting tool consolidates monthly KPI feeds into a single performance dataset." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20595
ex:P20595 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10401
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10402
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10403
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12672
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20121
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:CustomerSatisfactionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Calculating and assessing the operational activities of the customer service function. Evaluation is achieved through the customer requests/inquiries handling process, the customer complaint handling process, and product and services quality. Examine activities to ensure high levels of customer service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20595" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:CustomerServiceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 6.5 as a bounded occurrent (R5: an appraisal cycle, not a never-ending standing function). Its APQC children are process parts (cco:ont00001777), not subclasses. Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the verb 'evaluate/assess' yields a Descriptive judgement (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE: appraisal -> descriptive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate customer service operations and customer satisfaction" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that assesses the operational activities of an organization's customer service function and produces a customer satisfaction assessment of customer service operations." ;
          skos:example "A customer-service organization runs its annual review of inquiry-, complaint-, and product-satisfaction performance and issues an overall satisfaction assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20604
ex:P20604 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000402 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:FinancialPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a written copy of agreed-upon procedures for preparing financial statements, and making them available to the public." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "9.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20604" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:FinancialPolicyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfReporting to cco:ont00000402 (Act of Communication). Two defects fixed: (1) GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE break -- ex:ActOfReporting compiles a Descriptive ICE, but the asserted output was ex:FinancialPolicy, a Directive ICE (cco:ont00000965); (2) the act merely disseminates an already-formulated policy (input == output == FinancialPolicy), i.e. transfer of an existing ICE between agents, which the ex:ActOfReporting comment routes to cco:ont00000402: 'Where a node only transmits an already-prepared report to a party, the group module reuses cco:ont00000402 instead.' Publishing transmits the same ICE; it does not produce a new descriptive one, so the has output ex:FinancialPolicy restriction is dropped and ex:FinancialPolicy is kept as has input (the transmitted ICE). cco:ont00000402 verified against CCO v2.0 (2024-11-06): 'A Planned Act in which some Information Content Entity is transferred from some Agent to Another.'" ;
          rdfs:label "Publish accounting policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that conveys an already-formulated accounting policy to the public." ;
          skos:example "Posting the firm's accounting-policy manual on its investor-relations website." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20605
ex:P20605 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductRegistration
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Filing product registrations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "6.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20605" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): filing a registration stores/records an ICE; output is a Descriptive ProductRegistration." ;
          rdfs:label "Register products" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that records a customer's product ownership and produces a product registration." ;
          skos:example "A customer-service system files a newly purchased appliance's registration on behalf of the buyer." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20608
ex:P20608 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20609
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20612
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20617
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20623
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20632
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20648
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and administering relationships with IT customers. Understanding customer needs including high-level business requirements for IT transformation. Plan for and communicate IT services along with establishing IT service levels, providing transformation guidance, and performance analysis that foster IT customer relationships." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20608" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 8.1 as a coordinating occurrent whose APQC children are process parts, not subclasses. The standing 'manage' aspect is carried by ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage IT customer relationships" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that coordinates the understanding of IT customer needs, the planning and communication of IT services, the provision of transformation guidance, and the analysis of service performance in order to foster relationships with IT customers." ;
          skos:example "An IT service organization's end-to-end customer-relationship lifecycle for a fiscal year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20609
ex:P20609 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20610
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20611
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the customer communities along with current IT operational capabilities and usage." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20609" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (needs assessment) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE; anchored under ex:ActOfAnalysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand IT customer needs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines IT customer communities and their current operational capabilities and usage and produces an IT customer needs assessment." ;
          skos:example "An IT relationship team reviews usage data and community input and issues a needs assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20610
ex:P20610 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Interacting with IT customers to understand the IT needs through a collaborative community through involvement, connection, and informed communication." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20610" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ITCustomerRole ;
          rdfs:label "Understand IT customer communities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines IT customer communities through collaborative interaction and produces an IT customer needs assessment." ;
          skos:example "An IT liaison engages a user community forum and records the needs surfaced there." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20611
ex:P20611 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate the ability of the group of staff dependent on information technology, to align resources and critical processes according to organizational vision being able to deliver effectively and efficiently." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20611" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal) because it evaluates/judges a capability; descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT customer operational capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the ability of an IT-dependent staff group to align resources and processes with organizational vision and produces an IT customer needs assessment." ;
          skos:example "An analyst appraises a department's readiness to use a new platform effectively." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20612
ex:P20612 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20613
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20614
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20615
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20616
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying changing needs of staff dependent on information technology based on continuous improvement to deliver results according to organizational goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20612" ;
          rdfs:comment "Discernment sense of identification (ex:ActOfIdentification, under information processing); descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify IT customer transformation needs" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the changing IT needs of IT-dependent staff and produces an IT customer needs assessment registering them." ;
          skos:example "A relationship manager registers the evolving needs of staff as goals shift." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20613
ex:P20613 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding business requirements for the existing IT environment as well as future IT needs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20613" ;
          rdfs:label "Understand business requirements for IT capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the business requirements for the existing and future IT environment and produces an IT requirements analysis." ;
          skos:example "A business analyst documents current and future IT requirements for a business unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20614
ex:P20614 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITAsset
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITLandscapeData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the complete logical structure and working of the organization's IT landscape. Assess the configuration of hardware and software (IT Assets) across the organization that supports overall business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20614" ;
          rdfs:comment "IT Assets (hardware/software) are material inputs, legal in operations category 8.0 (D4); informational output is the IT landscape description." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand IT landscape" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the logical structure and configuration of the organization's IT assets and produces IT landscape data describing the landscape." ;
          skos:example "An architect maps the hardware/software estate and records the resulting landscape model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20615
ex:P20615 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITVision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing goals to define IT vision. Define and document ideas, direction, and activities which enable information technology to reach these goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20615" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (vision) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE; anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT visioning" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes goals, ideas, and direction for information technology and produces an IT vision." ;
          skos:example "An IT leadership team articulates a five-year IT vision document." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20616
ex:P20616 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a roadmap to meet organizational expectations from information technology services while considering how it will affect the business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20616" ;
          rdfs:label "Outline IT service expectations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a roadmap for meeting organizational expectations of IT services and produces an IT roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A service manager lays out a roadmap of IT service milestones for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20617
ex:P20617 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20619
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20620
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20621
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20622
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceCatalog
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and design an organized and curated collection of all IT-related services that can be performed by, for, or within the organization. Maintain and convey information about deliverables, prices, contact points, and processes for requesting an information technology service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20617" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (service catalog). The 'manage IT customer expectations' child is a capability (R6), not a process part." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and communicate IT services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a curated collection of IT-related services and produces an IT service catalog conveying their deliverables, prices, and request processes." ;
          skos:example "An IT organization compiles and publishes its service catalog." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20619
ex:P20619 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceCatalog
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the expected demand and usage of information technology services to meet organization's future business goals. Gather necessary information about the processes, resource requirements, and structures pertaining to planned business growth." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20619" ;
          rdfs:comment "An IT service demand forecast is a typical input, recorded here rather than as a restriction since it is not present for every instance." ;
          rdfs:label "Define future IT services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a forward definition of IT services aligned to future business goals and produces an IT service catalog covering planned services." ;
          skos:example "A planning team specifies the services needed to support next year's business growth." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20620
ex:P20620 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceIndicatorSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining IT KPIs crucial to the organization's success. Measure indicators such as IT costs as percentage of revenue, IT maintenance ratio, and system downtime in an effort to evaluate the performance of IT across the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20620" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output: determining KPIs prescribes what shall be measured. Anchored under ex:ActOfFormulation." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT performance indicators" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that selects and fixes the key performance indicators for IT and produces an IT performance indicator specification." ;
          skos:example "An IT governance group designates IT-cost-to-revenue and system downtime as official KPIs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20621
ex:P20621 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITMarketingMessage
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing concise statements that position the value proposition around the pressing concerns of the internal IT user base, thereby showing how the IT offerings are the right fit for a segment of IT customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20621" ;
          rdfs:label "Create IT marketing messages" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes value-proposition statements for IT offerings and produces an IT marketing message targeted at a customer segment." ;
          skos:example "A team drafts a value statement promoting a managed-device service to a user segment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20622
ex:P20622 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITMarketingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a marketing strategy for IT offerings to customers. Plan processes for making budgets; identifying and developing media; and managing marketing content and promotional activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20622" ;
          rdfs:label "Create IT service marketing plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a marketing strategy for IT offerings and produces an IT service marketing plan covering budgets, media, and promotion." ;
          skos:example "A marketing lead builds the annual IT-services promotion plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20623
ex:P20623 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20624
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20625
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20626
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20627
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20628
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20629
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20630
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20631
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20937
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITTransformationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the necessity of IT transformation for the business. Collect and analyze customer requirements. Identify opportunities and prioritize outcomes. Develop and support business case for transformation. Develop transformation plan and roadmap." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20623" ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (transformation plan); its requirements/opportunity children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide IT transformation guidance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that consolidates analyzed IT customer requirements and prioritized opportunities and produces an IT transformation plan guiding the business through transformation." ;
          skos:example "A transformation office assembles requirements and a business case into a guiding transformation plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20624
ex:P20624 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITTransformationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a robust plan to replace or upgrade an organization's information technology systems. Understanding the business need of IT transformation from current to an expected state for the business. Developing a strategic plan for IT operating model, governance, service delivery, and workforce transformation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20624" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT transformation plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a strategic plan for transforming the IT operating model, governance, service delivery, and workforce and produces an IT transformation plan." ;
          skos:example "A program team writes the plan to migrate from legacy systems to a target operating model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20625
ex:P20625 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying existing or potential IT gaps between the expected business performance levels and current business outcomes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20625" ;
          rdfs:label "Collect IT customer requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns existing and potential IT gaps between expected and current business outcomes and produces an IT customer requirements register." ;
          skos:example "An analyst catalogs the gaps between target and actual performance for a business unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20626
ex:P20626 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPrioritizationDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying IT opportunities on the basis of collection and analysis of IT customer requirements, then prioritize the identified IT opportunities on the basis of their importance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20626" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfSelection: the committing act is the prioritization; the prior identification feeds it. Directive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and prioritize IT opportunities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that ranks identified IT opportunities by their importance and produces an IT prioritization decision." ;
          skos:example "A board ranks candidate IT opportunities and designates the top three." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20627
ex:P20627 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionDesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing a plan of action to provide solution to IT customers. The solution design should be based on the collection and analysis of IT customer requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20627" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfDesign (Act of Planning); directive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Facilitate solution design activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that composes a plan of action for an IT solution based on analyzed customer requirements and produces an IT solution design specification." ;
          skos:example "A solution architect drafts a design specification answering a set of customer requirements." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20628
ex:P20628 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPrioritizationDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Prioritizing IT outcomes based on need, effectiveness, and efficiency." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20628" ;
          rdfs:label "Prioritize IT outcomes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that ranks IT outcomes by need, effectiveness, and efficiency and produces an IT prioritization decision." ;
          skos:example "A steering group orders desired IT outcomes by efficiency and need." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20629
ex:P20629 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITBusinessCase
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create a business case with value proposition indicating current situation, proposed solution, financial analysis, and measurable benefits to the IT customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20629" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfAnalysis because the business case is a descriptive argument/representation, not a prescription." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop business cases" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the current situation, proposed solution, and financial benefits of a proposed IT initiative and produces an IT business case." ;
          skos:example "An analyst builds the cost-benefit business case for an infrastructure upgrade." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20630
ex:P20630 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITBusinessCase
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResearchFindings
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supporting business case with supporting research, business analysis, and background information on IT transformation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20630" ;
          rdfs:label "Support business case" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that gathers and examines research and background information for an IT business case and produces IT research findings supporting it." ;
          skos:example "A team compiles benchmark research substantiating a transformation business case." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20631
ex:P20631 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a blueprint for execution of IT transformation from the existing state to the planned organizational structure based on the value proposition and projected business growth." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.4.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "20631" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop transformation roadmap" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a blueprint for executing IT transformation from the current to the planned state and produces an IT roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A program lead sequences the transformation milestones into an execution roadmap." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20632
ex:P20632 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20633
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20634
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20635
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20636
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20637
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20638
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20640
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceLevelAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and maintaining service levels for the provision of IT services and solutions. Design and maintain the IT services and solution catalogue, as well as service level agreements. Evaluate the performance of IT service level agreements. Communicate the results to the management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20632" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITServiceManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Directive output (SLA). Maintenance/evaluation aspects are decomposed into the data-management and appraisal children below. Gate-F R5/R6 reconciliation: 8.1.5 is kept as this bounded ex:ActOfFormulation because its concrete deliverable (the SLA) passes the R5 bounded-occurrent test; the standing 'manage service levels' aspect is carried separately by ex:ITServiceManagementCapability, which is obo:BFO_0000054 (realized in) this act (R6). The earlier self-contradiction -- the capability claiming 8.1.5 fails R5 while 8.1.5 was a bounded process with no realized-in back-edge -- is resolved: one model (bounded process + realizing capability), consistently wired." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage IT service levels" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes service levels for IT services and solutions and produces a service level agreement, coordinating the maintenance and evaluation of those service levels." ;
          skos:example "A service-management function defines and publishes the IT SLAs for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20633
ex:P20633 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understand requirements related to information technology services considering enterprise-level effects and understand potential achievements in the business environment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20633" ;
          rdfs:label "Understand IT service requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines IT service requirements and their enterprise-level effects and produces an IT requirements analysis." ;
          skos:example "An analyst documents the enterprise-wide requirements for a shared IT service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20634
ex:P20634 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfForecasting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerFeedback
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceDemandForecast
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Forecasting demand for IT services using current business growth, research, and customer feedback. Refine these forecasts, inspect the approach used in creating forecasts, and determine its accuracy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20634" ;
          rdfs:comment "Re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis to ex:ActOfForecasting: the source leads with 'Forecasting demand for IT services' and its output is a Predictive ICE (ex:ITServiceDemandForecast). Analysis is part of the method, but the act's defining output is a forecast -- matches the corpus forecasting pattern (3.0/5.0/6.0)." ;
          rdfs:label "Forecast IT service demand" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Forecasting that extrapolates from business growth, research, and customer feedback to produce an IT service demand forecast." ;
          skos:example "A capacity planner projects next year's demand for a cloud service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20635
ex:P20635 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceCatalog
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintain information about IT deliverables, prices, contact points, and processes for requesting a service." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20635" ;
          rdfs:comment "Each maintenance instance is a bounded act (R5), not a standing function; anchored under ex:ActOfDataManagement." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain IT services catalog" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that records and updates information about IT deliverables, prices, contact points, and request processes so as to keep the IT service catalog current." ;
          skos:example "An administrator updates catalog pricing and contact entries after a service change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20636
ex:P20636 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceLevelAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Designing and maintaining commitment of service by performance evaluation of IT services and communicate the results to the management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20636" ;
          rdfs:label "Define service level agreement" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a commitment of IT service informed by performance evaluation and produces a service level agreement." ;
          skos:example "A service owner drafts the SLA terms for an application support service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20637
ex:P20637 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerContract
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining and documenting commitment of service to staff for information technology contracts including providing software or hardware solution through communication channels like phone, email, and on-site services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20637" ;
          rdfs:comment "Repeatable bounded act of updating contract records; anchored under ex:ActOfDataManagement." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain IT customer contracts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that records and updates IT customer contracts documenting service commitments and support channels." ;
          skos:example "A contract administrator updates support-channel terms in a customer's IT contract." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20638
ex:P20638 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomer
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceLevelAgreement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establish a service level agreement, which is a negotiated agreement designed to create a common understanding about services, priorities, and responsibilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20638" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ITCustomerRole ;
          rdfs:comment "The IT customer is a definitional participant of the negotiation." ;
          rdfs:label "Negotiate and establish service level agreements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that negotiates with an IT customer and composes a common understanding of services, priorities, and responsibilities, producing a service level agreement." ;
          skos:example "A service manager and a department head negotiate and sign an SLA." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20640
ex:P20640 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conveying the improvement opportunities for the business and level of IT services. Leverage the results obtained from the performance metrics of the business and IT service levels to identify and recognize any opportunities that would improve or enhance the efficiency of the business and IT service-level structure. Communicate these opportunities to management in order for the improvements to take effect." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.5.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20640" ;
          rdfs:comment "IT performance data is a typical input recorded here; directive output (remediation/improvement plan)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and maintain improvement processes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that examines IT service-level performance metrics to identify improvement opportunities and produces a remediation plan for enhancing the service-level structure." ;
          skos:example "A service-improvement team turns SLA metrics into an improvement plan for management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20642
ex:P20642 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRelationshipManagementMechanismSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create mechanisms for effective public relationship in order to preserve the image and goodwill of the organization through the process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20642" ;
          rdfs:comment "Realizes ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability (R6). Parent 8.1.6 is a capability, so this act is not given a process-part edge from a process parent." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish relationship management mechanisms" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes mechanisms for public relations with IT customers and produces an IT relationship management mechanism specification." ;
          skos:example "A relationship team defines outreach mechanisms to protect organizational goodwill." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20643
ex:P20643 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the strategy for staff dependent on information technology. Create a plan to create services and solutions, conduct daily operations, and train new employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20643" ;
          rdfs:comment "An IT strategy is a typical input; descriptive output. Realizes ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand IT customer strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the strategy of IT-dependent staff and produces an IT customer needs assessment of that strategy." ;
          skos:example "A relationship manager studies a department's IT strategy to align services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20644
ex:P20644 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITLandscapeData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerNeedsAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding the environment of staff dependent on information technology. Assess and evaluate services and solutions used by customers to conduct daily operations, and train new employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20644" ;
          rdfs:comment "Realizes ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand IT customer environment" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the IT environment and the services and solutions used by IT-dependent staff and produces an IT customer needs assessment." ;
          skos:example "A liaison reviews the tools a department uses day to day and records its environment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20645
ex:P20645 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfCommunication ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCapabilityCommunication
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conveying the goals and objectives of the IT function and how it contributes to the overall business objectives to staff and departments across the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20645" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to the shared ex:ActOfCommunication (wraps the D6-VERIFIED cco:ont00000402 'Act of Communication': 'A Planned Act in which some Information Content Entity is transferred from some Agent to Another.', parent cco:ont00000228). Verification recorded in the §6 record at the ex:ActOfCommunication declaration. NOT cco:ont00000379 'Act of Representative Communication' (the flagged false-friend, truth-committing). Gate-F fix: re-anchored from the raw IRI to the shared genus and added a has-output (ex:ITCapabilityCommunication, Descriptive) so the communication act now produces the conveyed ICE it characteristically transfers. Keeps has-input ex:BusinessObjectives. Realizes ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate IT capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that transfers the goals and objectives of the IT function and its contribution to business objectives to staff and departments across the organization, producing an IT capability communication." ;
          skos:example "An IT director presents the IT function's goals and business contribution at a town hall." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20646
ex:P20646 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the IT requirements for business objectives. Identify the requirements of hardware and software equipment to store, retrieve, transmit, and manipulate data related to business operations. Consider factors such as functional, design, growth phases, and delivery schedule while managing IT requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20646" ;
          rdfs:comment "Despite the 'Manage' lead verb, the concrete deliverable is the bounded identification of hardware/software requirements (R5), so this is modeled as a process, not a standing capability. Realizes ex:ITCustomerRelationshipManagementCapability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the hardware and software requirements needed to support business objectives and produces an IT customer requirements register." ;
          skos:example "An analyst identifies the hardware and software needed to support a business process." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20647
ex:P20647 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerFeedback
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Collecting customer feedback about IT products and services effectiveness based on overall satisfaction. The data is collected through surveys, customer responses, and feedbacks based on the delivered products/services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.7.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20647" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfDataManagement (gathering/recording ICEs); descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Collect feedback about IT products and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that gathers customer feedback about the effectiveness of IT products and services through surveys and responses and produces recorded IT customer feedback." ;
          skos:example "A team runs a satisfaction survey and compiles the responses as feedback data." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20648
ex:P20648 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20647
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20649
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20650
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20938
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Proactively manage IT service levels against IT customer requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20648" ;
          rdfs:comment "Descriptive output (performance report); parent of the performance children." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze service performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines IT service levels against IT customer requirements and produces an IT performance report." ;
          skos:example "A service-management team reviews SLA results against requirements and reports performance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20649
ex:P20649 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SLAComplianceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Gather data from each service target defined in an SLA for a time segment or review period to evaluate an overall performance percentage." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.7.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20649" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal); descriptive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess SLA compliance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates IT performance data against each SLA service target for a review period and produces an SLA compliance assessment." ;
          skos:example "An analyst computes the quarterly compliance percentage against an SLA's targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20650
ex:P20650 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SLAComplianceAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Prioritizing SLA compliance issues and plan for remediation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.1.7.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20650" ;
          rdfs:comment "Triage = prioritization (selection); the remediation plan is the directive output." ;
          rdfs:label "Triage SLA compliance issues" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that ranks SLA compliance issues by priority for remediation and produces a remediation plan." ;
          skos:example "A team triages breached SLA targets and schedules the highest-impact fixes." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20652
ex:P20652 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20653
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20660
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20668
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20674
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20682
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20693
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20699
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Handling the business of IT. Create a organization-wide strategy for the IT function. Define the organization's IT architecture. Manage the IT portfolio. Research and innovate in the field of IT. Assess and convey the performance and the value of the IT function." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20652" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 8.2 as an occurrent whose APQC children are process parts (cco:ont00001777). Not given existential has-process-part from Category 8.0 (R3). Standing-function children (8.2.1.1, 8.2.1.6, 8.2.5.7) are modeled as Organization Capabilities and so are not listed as process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage IT business strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that develops and manages the business strategy of an organization's IT function by formulating its technology strategy, defining its enterprise architecture, managing its portfolio, innovating, and appraising its performance and value." ;
          skos:example "An organization's annual cycle of setting and managing its IT business strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20653
ex:P20653 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20655
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20656
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20657
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20658
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessTechnologyStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the need of technology in business and systematic implementation of IT investments. It comprises of assessing competitive technology components to ensure structural analysis, development, usage and security of technology for efficient business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20653" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.1 as an occurrent. Its bounded APQC children are process parts; the standing children 8.2.1.1 and 8.2.1.6 are Organization Capabilities and are not listed as parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define business technology and governance strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an organization's business-technology and governance strategy defining the need for technology in business and the governance of its IT investments and security." ;
          skos:example "An IT strategy team drafts the firm's business-technology strategy and governance approach." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20655
ex:P20655 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmergingTechnologyData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TechnologyAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring and evaluating existing and forthcoming technologies to meet the current and future growth plans for business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20655" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITStrategicIntelligenceCapability ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and map current and emerging technologies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input emerging technology data and has as output a technology assessment of existing and forthcoming technologies relevant to business growth plans." ;
          skos:example "A technology-scouting team tracks emerging technologies and maps them to the firm's growth plans." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20656
ex:P20656 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DigitalTransformationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the integration of digital technology into business operations and service delivery, and convey the strategy to different segments of business. It is always backed by continuous improvement followed by periodic review and change per requirement of the business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20656" ;
          rdfs:comment "Communication of the strategy to business segments is a typical follow-on, not definitional, so it is noted here rather than as a restriction (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and communicate digital transformation strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a digital transformation strategy prescribing the integration of digital technology into business operations and service delivery." ;
          skos:example "A CIO's office defines a digital transformation strategy and rolls it out across business units." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20657
ex:P20657 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategicAlignmentSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing the process of aligning the organization's business divisions and staff members with the organization's planned objectives for IT." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20657" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITStrategicAlignmentMaintenanceCapability ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT strategic alignment" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops an IT strategic alignment specification prescribing how business divisions and staff are aligned with planned IT objectives." ;
          skos:example "An IT planning team develops the alignment between business units and IT objectives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20658
ex:P20658 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITAlignmentPrinciples
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Systematic approach to clearly communicate and operate the usage of information technology as it relates to business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20658" ;
          rdfs:label "Articulate IT alignment principles" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and states IT alignment principles prescribing how information technology is used in relation to business objectives." ;
          skos:example "An enterprise IT council articulates the principles governing IT use against business goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20660
ex:P20660 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20661
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20662
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20663
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20664
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20665
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20667
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Strategy for systematic management of IT investments, projects, and activities. Analyze and examine the value of the IT portfolio and allocate resources based on business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20660" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.2 as a bounded portfolio-management cycle whose APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT portfolio strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that manages an organization's IT portfolio strategy by analyzing and examining the value of IT investments, projects, and activities and allocating resources according to business objectives." ;
          skos:example "An IT portfolio board's planning cycle balancing and aligning IT investments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20661
ex:P20661 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueCriteria
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and certify the standards to determine the value of the investments, projects, and activities of IT function for the overall business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20661" ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and validate IT value criteria" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and certifies IT value criteria prescribing the standards for determining the value of IT investments, projects, and activities for business objectives." ;
          skos:example "An IT value office establishes and signs off the criteria for judging IT investment value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20662
ex:P20662 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInvestmentBalanceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the uninvested amount out of the total approved amount for overall IT management, IT investments, projects, and activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20662" ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT portfolio investment balance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT investment balance assessment describing the uninvested portion of the approved IT budget." ;
          skos:example "A finance analyst determines how much of the approved IT budget remains uninvested." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20663
ex:P20663 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInvestmentProjectEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating IT investment projects to achieve overall business objectives in regard to implementation, efficiency, and profitability." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20663" ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate proposed IT investment projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT investment project evaluation judging proposed projects by implementation, efficiency, and profitability." ;
          skos:example "An investment committee evaluates candidate IT projects for feasibility and return." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20664
ex:P20664 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITProjectPrioritization
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Listing the IT projects in the order of most important to the least. Determining which of many IT projects are most important or critical to business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20664" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfSelection (Info Processing) because it chooses/orders from a candidate set; its output is a Directive ICE (the ranking)." ;
          rdfs:label "Prioritize IT projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses and ranks IT projects from a candidate set and produces an IT project prioritization ordering them from most to least critical." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio board ranks the year's IT projects by business criticality." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20665
ex:P20665 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategicAlignmentSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning physical IT resources like software, IT infrastructure, networks, and non-physical resources like technology expertise, to strategic objectives ranked by their importance in achieving the strategic goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20665" ;
          rdfs:label "Align IT resources to strategic priorities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces an IT strategic alignment specification mapping physical and non-physical IT resources to ranked strategic objectives." ;
          skos:example "An IT planning office allocates infrastructure and expertise against ranked strategic goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20667
ex:P20667 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategicAlignmentSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Aligning IT investments, projects, and activities to achieve overall business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20667" ;
          rdfs:label "Align IT portfolio to business objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that produces an IT strategic alignment specification mapping IT investments, projects, and activities to overall business objectives." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio office aligns the IT investment mix to corporate objectives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20668
ex:P20668 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20670
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20671
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20672
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20673
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining and maintaining the organization's IT architecture. Establish the IT architecture definition and framework. Ensure the relevance of IT. Create and confirm the approach for IT maintenance. Create rules and regulations to guide IT architecture. Authenticate and finalize all IT related research and innovation that takes place within the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20668" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.3 as an occurrent. The 'maintain' aspect is recurrent re-execution of the same definitional act type, so the row remains a process rather than a capability. APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and maintain enterprise architecture" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines and maintains an organization's enterprise architecture, producing an enterprise architecture specification together with its principles and governance." ;
          skos:example "An enterprise-architecture team defines and keeps current the firm's IT architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20670
ex:P20670 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitect
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitecturePrinciples
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and publishing high level statements of the fundamental values (principles) based on the organization's objectives that guide Information Technology decision-making and activities, and are the foundation for enterprise architecture." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20670" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EnterpriseArchitectRole ;
          rdfs:label "Create and publish enterprise architecture principles" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes and publishes enterprise architecture principles prescribing the fundamental values that guide IT decision-making." ;
          skos:example "An EA board publishes the principles underpinning the enterprise architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20671
ex:P20671 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitect
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureGovernanceModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and operating a structure by which an enterprise defines appropriate strategies and ensures development alignment with those strategies. Create and establish the rules, regulations, policies, and standards that will govern the individual components of the IT architecture, as well as the architecture in its entirety." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20671" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:EnterpriseArchitectRole ;
          rdfs:comment "The definitional product is the governance model; 'operate' it is recurrent realization of that model and is noted rather than restricted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and operate enterprise architecture governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an enterprise architecture governance model prescribing the rules, regulations, policies, and standards governing the IT architecture and its components." ;
          skos:example "An architecture review board establishes the governance rules for the IT architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20672
ex:P20672 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmergingTechnologyData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResearchFindings
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Systematically investigating and studying materials and sources relevant to the IT function. Reach meaningful insights and conclusions in the form of new ideas and innovation for delivering IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20672" ;
          rdfs:label "Research technologies to innovate IT services and solutions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input emerging technology data and has as output IT research findings comprising insights and new ideas for delivering IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A research group studies emerging tech and reports ideas for new IT service offerings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20673
ex:P20673 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResearchFindings
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyze the value driven through IT projects and redefine and/or reprioritize. Evaluate planning, organizing, and implementation of IT projects based on research outcomes and business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20673" ;
          rdfs:label "Provide input to definition and prioritization of IT projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input IT research findings and has as output an IT value contribution assessment informing the (re)definition and (re)prioritization of IT projects." ;
          skos:example "An EA team appraises project value from research outcomes and feeds reprioritization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20674
ex:P20674 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20675
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20676
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20677
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20678
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20679
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20680
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20681
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining perspective, position, plans, and patterns needed to execute designing, delivering, managing, and improving the way information technology is used within an organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20674" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.4 as an occurrent. APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT service management strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an IT service management plan defining the perspective, position, plans, and patterns for designing, delivering, managing, and improving IT services." ;
          skos:example "An ITSM lead defines the service-management strategy for the IT organization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20675
ex:P20675 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing strategy for designing, delivering, managing, and improving the way information technology be used in the organization. The goal of IT Service Management is to ensure that the right processes, people, and technology are in place to meet business goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20675" ;
          rdfs:label "Establish IT service management strategy and goals" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an IT service management plan establishing the strategy and goals for designing, delivering, managing, and improving IT services." ;
          skos:example "An ITSM office sets the service-management goals ensuring processes, people, and technology meet business goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20676
ex:P20676 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying operating and process requirement for designing, delivering, managing, and improving the way information technology be used in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20676" ;
          rdfs:label "Identify IT service operating and process requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the operating and process requirements for IT services and produces an IT requirements analysis registering them." ;
          skos:example "An ITSM analyst enumerates the operating requirements for delivering IT services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20677
ex:P20677 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceCatalog
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and design an organized and curated collection of all IT-related services that can be performed by, for, or within the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20677" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfDesign because the act creates a structured, curated artifact (the catalog); its output is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT service catalog" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that specifies the structure and contents of an IT service catalog cataloguing all IT-related services the organization can perform." ;
          skos:example "An ITSM team designs the organization's catalog of available IT services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20678
ex:P20678 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create a layered structure for IT service management framework ensuring right processes, people, and technology are in place to meet business goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20678" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfDesign because the act specifies a structured framework; its output is a Directive ICE (here the ITSM plan as the framework specification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish IT service management framework" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that specifies a layered IT service management framework ensuring the right processes, people, and technology are in place to meet business goals." ;
          skos:example "An ITSM architect lays out the layered structure of the service-management framework." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20679
ex:P20679 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and implementing activities involved in designing, creating, delivering, supporting, and managing the lifecycle of information technology services within an organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20679" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfDeployment because the act stands up operational ITSM, not merely a directive; the ITSM plan that prescribes it is noted as the governing directive." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and implement IT service management" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that puts IT service management into operational use by defining and implementing the activities across the lifecycle of IT services." ;
          skos:example "An IT organization rolls out its service-management processes into day-to-day operation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20680
ex:P20680 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInfrastructureComponent
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing services for providing support to users of IT services and solutions. Define the plethora of services along with tools and methods by which the organization assists users of computers, software products, or other electronic/mechanical products." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20680" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfDeployment because the act stands up operational support services and tooling (material IT infrastructure components)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and deploy support service management process tools and methods" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that establishes and puts into use the support services, tools, and methods by which an organization assists users of IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "An IT support function deploys a service desk and its supporting toolset." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20681
ex:P20681 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supervising, analyzing, and reporting performance of information technology to ensure they are on-course and on-schedule in meeting the organizational objectives and performance targets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20681" ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and report IT performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT performance report tracking IT against organizational objectives and performance targets." ;
          skos:example "An IT operations team monitors and reports whether IT is on-course against targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20682
ex:P20682 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20683
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20684
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20685
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20686
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20687
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20688
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20690
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20692
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Regulating the IT management system through performance measures, governance, analysis, and monitoring through a variety of analytic tools. Evaluate IT finances, resource, services, projects, and value for report out." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20682" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.5 as a bounded control/appraisal cycle. APQC children that are bounded acts are process parts; the standing child 8.2.5.7 is an Organization Capability and is not listed as a part." ;
          rdfs:label "Control IT management system" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that controls an organization's IT management system by evaluating its finances, resources, services, projects, and value through performance measures, governance, analysis, and monitoring for report-out." ;
          skos:example "An IT control function's periodic cycle of measuring and reporting IT system performance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20683
ex:P20683 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceMeasureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining measures for evaluating the performance of IT services in the organization. Establish key performance indicators, including the IT services performance index." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20683" ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT performance measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an IT performance measure specification establishing the key performance indicators, including the IT services performance index, for evaluating IT performance." ;
          skos:example "An IT controller defines the KPIs and performance index for IT services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20684
ex:P20684 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITControlGovernanceModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing a governance model with its own structure and functions from where full or partial control can be exercised over the entire IT management system. Specify evaluation and quality control procedures in the structure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20684" ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT control points and assurance procedures governance model" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an IT control and assurance governance model prescribing the control points, evaluation, and quality-control procedures for the IT management system." ;
          skos:example "An IT governance team defines the control points and assurance procedures for IT." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20685
ex:P20685 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring and analyzing information technology performance measures to ensure timely completion, and that quality assurance is met at all steps of IT services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20685" ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and analyze overall IT performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT performance report on overall IT timeliness and quality assurance." ;
          skos:example "An IT control team monitors overall IT performance against quality and timing targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20686
ex:P20686 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Checking and analyzing predetermined financial targets and timelines of IT management system. Monitoring their profitability, feasibility, and consistency. Study the revenues generated." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20686" ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and analyze IT financial performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT performance report on IT financial targets, profitability, feasibility, and revenues." ;
          skos:example "An IT finance team monitors IT spend and revenue against financial targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20687
ex:P20687 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examining and analyzing the value and benefits of IT service management to ensure benefits outweigh incurred costs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20687" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act judges value/benefit against cost, producing a value judgement (Descriptive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and analyze IT value and benefits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT value contribution assessment judging whether the benefits of IT service management outweigh its costs." ;
          skos:example "An IT value office assesses whether ITSM benefits exceed their costs." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20688
ex:P20688 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResourceOptimizationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create process to assign and manage IT assets that support organization's strategic goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20688" ;
          rdfs:label "Optimize IT resource allocation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an IT resource optimization plan prescribing the process for assigning and managing IT assets in support of strategic goals." ;
          skos:example "An IT operations team designs the process for allocating IT assets to strategic goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20690
ex:P20690 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Process of collecting, analyzing, and reporting information regarding the performance of IT services and projects." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20690" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITInterdependencyManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting), a Representative Communication that gives a detailed account; its output is a Descriptive ICE (the report)." ;
          rdfs:label "Report IT service and project performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT performance report giving a detailed account of IT service and project performance." ;
          skos:example "An IT PMO collects, analyzes, and issues the IT service-and-project performance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20692
ex:P20692 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInfrastructureComponent
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Select, establish, and operate analytics tool to analyze data and extract actionable and commercially relevant information on IT performance to evaluate or increase performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.5.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "20692" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfDeployment because the act stands up and operates analytics tooling (a material IT infrastructure component), beyond producing a directive." ;
          rdfs:label "Select, deploy, and operate IT performance analytics tools" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that selects, establishes, and operates IT performance analytics tools to extract actionable information on IT performance." ;
          skos:example "An IT analytics team stands up a performance-analytics platform and runs it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20693
ex:P20693 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20694
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20695
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20696
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20697
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and establishing the value portfolio. Defining, analyzing, and examining the value of projects, investments, and activities of the IT function." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20693" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.6 as a bounded value-appraisal cycle. APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT value portfolio" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that manages an IT value portfolio by defining, analyzing, and examining the value of IT projects, investments, and activities." ;
          skos:example "An IT value office's cycle of assessing and reporting the IT portfolio's value." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20694
ex:P20694 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueCriteria
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Process of evaluating performance to collect and analyze IT services and projects. Ensure expected IT service and project value based on established criteria." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20694" ;
          rdfs:label "Assess performance against IT service and project value criteria" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input IT performance data and IT value criteria and has as output an IT value contribution assessment of IT services and projects against established criteria." ;
          skos:example "An IT value analyst assesses service and project performance against the value criteria." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20695
ex:P20695 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate the value of the investments, projects, and activities of IT function by assigning it a quantifiable value with a profitable return to business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20695" ;
          rdfs:label "Quantify value of IT service and project portfolio investments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input IT performance data and has as output an IT value contribution assessment assigning a quantifiable value to IT investments, projects, and activities." ;
          skos:example "An IT finance analyst quantifies the monetary value of the IT investment portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20696
ex:P20696 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000151 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessTechnologyValueCommunication
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conveying the value addition through adopting technology targeting towards integrated profitable business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20696" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuses cco:ont00000151 (Act of Reporting; D6-verified in the §6 record at ex:ActOfCommunication -- parent chain ont00000379 -> ont00000402 -> ont00000228), a Representative Communication that conveys an already-formed value assessment to stakeholders; its product is a communicated Descriptive ICE. Gate-F fix: added the has-output (ex:BusinessTechnologyValueCommunication, Descriptive) that the act-genus implies, restoring sibling consistency with P20690 (which carries both has-input and has-output) and GOLDEN-PRINCIPLE traceability. Keeps has-input ex:ITValueContributionAssessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Communicate business technology value contribution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that has as input an IT value contribution assessment and has as output a business technology value communication giving a detailed account of the value addition delivered through adopting technology for profitable business operations." ;
          skos:example "A CIO communicates IT's value contribution to the executive board." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20697
ex:P20697 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPortfolioAdjustmentDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining and implementing IT investments, projects, and activities based on trending technological advancements in the existing environment in order to achieve overall business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20697" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfDeployment because the act not only decides but enacts the portfolio changes; the decision is the directive guiding it (has input)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine and implement IT portfolio adjustments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that determines and implements adjustments to IT investments, projects, and activities, guided by an IT portfolio adjustment decision, to achieve business objectives." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio board reweights and enacts changes to the IT investment mix." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20699
ex:P20699 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20700
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20701
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20702
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20703
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20704
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20705
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20939
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outline and manage the innovation of technology within the organization. Research and understand emerging future technological concepts and capabilities. Plan for IT innovation investments. Plan and execute viable innovation projects." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20699" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.2.7 as a bounded innovation cycle. APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage technology innovation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that defines and manages technology innovation by researching emerging concepts, planning IT innovation investments, and executing viable innovation projects." ;
          skos:example "An IT innovation lab's program of researching, selecting, and executing innovation projects." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20700
ex:P20700 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResearchSelectionCriteria
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing the standard for selecting IT research initiatives to align with organizational criteria for implementing future technologies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20700" ;
          rdfs:label "Establish selection criteria for research initiatives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes IT research selection criteria prescribing the standards for selecting IT research initiatives aligned with organizational criteria." ;
          skos:example "An R&D council sets the criteria for choosing which IT research initiatives to fund." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20701
ex:P20701 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmergingTechnologyData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TechnologyAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing new and future technologies relevant to the organization's vision of its IT capabilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20701" ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze emerging technology concepts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input emerging technology data and has as output a technology assessment of new and future technologies relevant to the organization's IT vision." ;
          skos:example "An innovation analyst assesses emerging technologies against the firm's IT vision." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20702
ex:P20702 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmergingTechnologyData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TechnologyAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identification of conceptual elements that define the benefits of technology to business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20702" ;
          rdfs:label "Identify technology concepts and capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the conceptual elements defining the benefits of technology to business and produces a technology assessment registering them." ;
          skos:example "An innovation team enumerates the technology concepts that could benefit the business." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20703
ex:P20703 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResearchFindings
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implement information technology research projects that focus on meeting the goals of the organization's IT services and capabilities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20703" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfDevelopment to ex:ActOfAnalysis (cco:ont00000366, Act of Information Processing) for consistency with the parallel research row P20672 'Research technologies to innovate', which yields the SAME descriptive output (ex:ITResearchFindings). REJECTED ex:ActOfDevelopment: its genus rule states a development act's material product attaches via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), NOT has output, yet this row's definitional product is descriptive research findings (insights/conclusions), which is information processing/analysis, not bringing a realized artifact into existence. If running the project also realizes a prototype artifact, that would be modeled separately via obo:BFO_0000057 on a development sub-act; the row's definitional descriptive output sits under the information-processing genus. Descriptive output per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute IT research projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that carries out IT research projects focused on the goals of the organization's IT services and capabilities and produces IT research findings." ;
          skos:example "An IT research team runs a project on a candidate technology and reports its findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20704
ex:P20704 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResearchOutcomeAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInnovationPromotionDecision
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine project viability. Promote relevant IT innovations that meet business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20704" ;
          rdfs:comment "ex:ActOfSelection because the act chooses viable concepts from candidates; its output is a Directive ICE (the promotion decision)." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and promote viable concepts" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that determines the viability of innovation concepts, chooses those meeting business objectives, and produces an IT innovation promotion decision." ;
          skos:example "An innovation board selects and promotes the viable concepts for further investment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20705
ex:P20705 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPortfolioPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Develop and plan long-term allocation of funds for information technology endeavors to meet business goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.2.7.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20705" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and plan IT investment projects" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops and plans the long-term allocation of funds for IT endeavors and produces an IT portfolio plan for meeting business goals." ;
          skos:example "An IT finance team plans the multi-year funding allocation for innovation projects." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20706
ex:P20706 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20707
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20716
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20721
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20731
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20735
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20743
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20749
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20756
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Develop and include the processes required to rapidly adapt and respond to any internal or external opportunity, demand, disruption, or threat to IT. Develop a more dynamic, strategic, and integrated approach to managing risk and compliance obligations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20706" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITRiskManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 8.3 as an occurrent whose APQC children are process parts, not subclasses. Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the group spans both formulation (develop strategies) and execution (control/operate) acts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage IT resilience and risk" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that develops and operates the integrated set of processes by which an organization manages IT risk, resilience, compliance, security, and continuity." ;
          skos:example "An organization's end-to-end annual cycle of building and running its IT risk and resilience program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20707
ex:P20707 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20708
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20709
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20710
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20711
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20712
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20713
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20714
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20715
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20940
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20941
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensuring that the organization effectively manages risk. Develop rules and standards for robust IT operations, manage risk, and adopt measures to protect integrity, confidentiality, and security of IT assets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20707" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output anchors to a Directive ICE (strategy/policies), satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE for a formulation act." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT compliance, risk, and security strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops the rules, standards, and measures governing IT compliance, risk, and security, producing an IT strategy and related directive specifications." ;
          skos:example "An IT governance team drafting the annual IT compliance, risk, and security strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20708
ex:P20708 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRegulatoryAuditRequirementAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining and evaluating IT regulatory and audit requirements. Train employees on regulatory and audit requirements. Records for the appropriate regulatory and audit agencies must be maintained and the new product process must be approved by the appropriate regulatory body before it is published to the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20708" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): determining-and-evaluating judges requirements and yields a descriptive assessment. Employee training and record-keeping are method notes, not definitional I/O." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine and evaluate IT regulatory and audit requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input regulatory requirement data and has as output an IT regulatory and audit requirement assessment." ;
          skos:example "A compliance analyst evaluates which audit requirements apply before a new IT product is published." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20709
ex:P20709 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskToleranceSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine the specific maximum risk to take in quantitative terms for each relevant risk sub-category, including strategic, operational, financial, and compliance risks." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20709" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): fixing risk thresholds is prescriptive, yielding a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish IT risk tolerance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that determines the maximum acceptable IT risk per sub-category and produces an IT risk tolerance specification." ;
          skos:example "A board sets a quantitative ceiling on tolerable operational IT loss." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20710
ex:P20710 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskOwnershipAssignment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establish an individual or a group who is ultimately accountable for ensuring that IT risks are managed appropriately." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20710" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): assigning accountability is prescriptive (Directive ICE). The accountable party is an ex:ITRiskOwner." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish risk ownership" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that assigns ultimate accountability for managing IT risk and produces an IT risk ownership assignment." ;
          skos:example "Executive leadership names the CISO as accountable owner of cyber risk." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20711
ex:P20711 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskManagementRoleSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine and maintain roles that are specialized in each risk areas and coordinating all risk management activities for IT function with due escalation structure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20711" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning). The standing 'maintain' aspect is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6); the bounded determinable act of establishing/refreshing roles is the modeled occurrent (Directive ICE output)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish and maintain risk management roles" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that determines specialized IT risk-management roles and their escalation structure and produces an IT risk management role specification." ;
          skos:example "An IT risk office defines a Cloud Risk Lead role and its escalation path." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20712
ex:P20712 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceObjective
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing compliance objectives which ensures that the organization has systems of internal controls that adequately measure and manage IT risk." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20712" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): objectives are prescriptive (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish compliance objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that sets compliance objectives for internal controls measuring and managing IT risk and produces an IT compliance objective." ;
          skos:example "A control objective requiring documented review of every IT change before release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20713
ex:P20713 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a timely and continuous process to identify and evaluate activities that might hinder IT operations or an IT project's goals." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20713" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (cco:ont00000366): identifying-and-evaluating risk yields a descriptive IT risk assessment. The 'continuous process' is operationalized as repeatable instances of this act." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and evaluate IT risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that identifies and evaluates activities that might hinder IT operations or project goals and produces an IT risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "A risk analyst reviews a project plan and records the IT risks threatening its goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20714
ex:P20714 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResilienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assess IT-related risk resilience strategies to ensure that the organization effectively manages its risk." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "20714" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): assessing resilience strategies yields a descriptive judgement." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate IT-related risks resiliency" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that assesses IT-related risk resilience strategies and produces an IT resilience assessment." ;
          skos:example "A risk committee rates the resilience of IT delivery against disruption scenarios." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20715
ex:P20715 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskMitigationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing activities to improve performance opportunities and lessen threats in IT. Evolve strategies and policies to attain organizational objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.1.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "20715" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): composing mitigation strategies/policies yields a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Create IT risk mitigation strategies and approaches" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops strategies and policies to improve IT opportunities and lessen IT threats and produces an IT risk mitigation strategy." ;
          skos:example "A risk team drafts mitigation approaches for the top-ranked IT threats." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20716
ex:P20716 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20717
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20718
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20719
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20720
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResilienceStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing resilience strategies of IT across the organization so that prospective risks can be avoided." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20716" ;
          rdfs:comment "Output is a Directive ICE (resilience strategy), satisfying the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE for a formulation act." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT resilience strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops IT resilience strategies across an organization and produces an IT resilience strategy." ;
          skos:example "An IT strategy team drafts the enterprise IT resilience strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20717
ex:P20717 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResilienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining resilience strategies to ensure that IT effectively manages it's delivery process to mitigate risk." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20717" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): judging delivery resilience yields a descriptive assessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT delivery resiliency" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that determines the resilience of IT's delivery process and produces an IT resilience assessment." ;
          skos:example "An analyst assesses how resilient the IT delivery pipeline is to outages." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20718
ex:P20718 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining risks that could disrupt objectives of IT." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20718" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (cco:ont00000366): examining and registering critical risks yields a descriptive IT risk assessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine critical IT risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that determines the risks that could disrupt IT objectives and produces an IT risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "A risk team identifies the failures that would most disrupt IT objectives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20719
ex:P20719 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskPrioritization
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Prioritize potential IT risks based on business need to ensure overall IT stability." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20719" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfAnalysis to ex:ActOfSelection (cco:ont00000366, Act of Information Processing) for cross-row consistency with the parallel 'Prioritize' acts P20664 'Prioritize IT projects' and P20626 'Identify and prioritize IT opportunities', both ex:ActOfSelection with a DIRECTIVE prioritization output. A risk ranking that drives mitigation sequencing is a committing (Selection) act whose ranking is a Directive ICE, not a neutral descriptive examination; ex:ITRiskPrioritization is correspondingly reclassified as a Directive ICE (cco:ont00000965). The three parallel rows are no longer silently split across genera and output kinds." ;
          rdfs:label "Prioritize IT risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses and ranks potential IT risks from a candidate set by business need and produces an IT risk prioritization committing the organization to a mitigation sequence." ;
          skos:example "A risk team ranks the risk register by business impact and commits to the mitigation order." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20720
ex:P20720 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskPrioritization
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskMitigationStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing activities to improve opportunities and lessen threats for IT." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20720" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): composing mitigation approaches yields a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish mitigation approaches for IT risks" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that establishes activities to improve IT opportunities and lessen IT threats and produces an IT risk mitigation strategy." ;
          skos:example "A risk team defines mitigation actions for each prioritized IT risk." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20721
ex:P20721 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20722
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20723
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20724
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20725
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20726
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20727
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20728
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20729
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20730
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20942
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensure effective control in overall IT risk management, formulate and execute guidelines in-line with regulatory bodies, and manage organizational security throughout the business operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20721" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITRiskManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the control process spans formulation, monitoring, and execution acts. Decomposes into its activities via has process part." ;
          rdfs:label "Control IT risk, compliance, and security" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that exercises ongoing control over IT risk, compliance, and security by formulating and executing guidelines aligned with regulatory bodies." ;
          skos:example "An IT risk function running its quarterly control and compliance cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20722
ex:P20722 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryComplianceObligationEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluation of dynamic, strategic, and integrated approach to manage regulatory requirements and compliance obligations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20722" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): evaluating obligations yields a descriptive judgement." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate enterprise regulatory and compliance obligations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates an organization's enterprise regulatory requirements and compliance obligations and produces a regulatory and compliance obligation evaluation." ;
          skos:example "A compliance team evaluates the enterprise's standing against its regulatory obligations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20723
ex:P20723 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityThreatData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityThreatAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Analyzing the impact of threats to critical IT assets across different departments and functions in the organization in terms of quantifiable results." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20723" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (cco:ont00000366): examining threat data yields a descriptive impact analysis." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze IT security threat impact" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input IT security threat data and has as output an IT security threat analysis about the impact of threats on critical IT assets." ;
          skos:example "A security analyst quantifies the impact of a ransomware threat across departments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20724
ex:P20724 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Develop and maintain IT compliance standards. Maintaining requirements set forth by such directives as GRCP, PMI RMP, CGRC, CGEIT, CRMA." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20724" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): composing compliance requirements yields a Directive ICE. The standing 'maintain' function is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6); the bounded create/update act is the modeled occurrent." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and maintain IT compliance requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops and updates IT compliance standards and produces an IT compliance requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "A compliance lead updates the IT compliance standard to reflect a new regulation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20725
ex:P20725 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITTrainingProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Develop and implement training in regard to managing IT risks, understanding criticality, impact, and opportunities associated with business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20725" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDevelopment (cco:ont00000228): bringing a training program into existence; the deploy step is the related ex:ActOfDeployment. Output is the IT training program (a Directive ICE in the shared vocab)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and deploy risk management training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that develops an IT risk management training program and deploys it for delivery to employees." ;
          skos:example "A risk office builds and rolls out an annual IT-risk awareness course." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20726
ex:P20726 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskReportingSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing processes to communicate IT risk to the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20726" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): establishing reporting processes/responsibilities is prescriptive (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish risk reporting capabilities and responsibilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that establishes the processes and responsibilities for communicating IT risk and produces an IT risk reporting specification." ;
          skos:example "A risk office defines who reports which IT risks to the board and when." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20727
ex:P20727 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCommunicationStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing standards for communications within the organization which creates the road map for successful understanding of strategic initiatives for both business units and information technology services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20727" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): standards are prescriptive (Directive ICE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish communication standards" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that establishes standards for communications within an organization and produces an IT communication standard." ;
          skos:example "An IT office mandates a common template for change communications." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20728
ex:P20728 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityThreatData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate IT risk and threat assessments by way of IT assets, information security, and breach points within the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20728" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): conducting risk/threat assessments yields a descriptive IT risk assessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct IT risk and threat assessments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates IT risk and threats across IT assets, information security, and breach points and produces an IT risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "A security team runs a threat assessment across the organization's breach points." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20729
ex:P20729 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring and managing risks related to IT adoption within the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "20729" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366). The standing 'manage' function is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6); the recurring monitor act is the modeled occurrent (Descriptive ICE output)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and manage IT activity risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that continuously observes risks related to IT adoption and produces an IT performance report representing their tracked condition." ;
          skos:example "A risk dashboard tracking the risk profile of newly adopted IT tools." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20730
ex:P20730 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskMitigationStrategy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and supervising a blueprint of measures for managing risk in IT. Monitor actions to enhance opportunities and reduce threats to project objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.3.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "20730" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366): ongoing supervision/tracking of mitigation measures yields a descriptive report. Has the IT risk mitigation strategy as input." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify, supervise and monitor IT risk mitigation measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that supervises and tracks the blueprint of IT risk mitigation measures and produces an IT performance report on their effectiveness." ;
          skos:example "A risk manager tracks whether mitigation actions are reducing project threats." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20731
ex:P20731 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20732
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20733
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20734
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning and managing IT's ability to recover from exposure to internal and external threats." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20731" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the process spans planning and execution. The standing 'manage continuity' function is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6); this bounded plan-and-execute cycle is the modeled occurrent." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and manage IT continuity" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that plans and operates an organization's ability to recover IT from exposure to internal and external threats." ;
          skos:example "An IT continuity team's recovery-planning-and-execution cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20732
ex:P20732 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITResilienceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating IT business needs and IT's ability to recover from internal or external threat exposure." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20732" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): judging recovery ability yields a descriptive assessment." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate IT continuity" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates IT business needs and IT's ability to recover from threat exposure and produces an IT resilience assessment." ;
          skos:example "A continuity analyst rates the recoverability of each critical IT service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20733
ex:P20733 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITContinuityGapRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying the limitations of the IT organization's ability to remediate disruptions in IT services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20733" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (cco:ont00000366): discerning/registering gaps yields a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify IT continuity gaps" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the limitations of an IT organization's ability to remediate disruptions in IT services and produces an IT continuity gap register." ;
          skos:example "A continuity team registers the services that lack a tested recovery procedure." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20734
ex:P20734 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITContinuityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Integrating the disciplines of Emergency Response, Crisis Management, Disaster Recovery (technology continuity) and Business Continuity for IT." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20734" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): the bounded act of integrating and running the continuity disciplines. Has the IT continuity plan as input directing it." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT business continuity" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that integrates emergency response, crisis management, disaster recovery, and business continuity for IT into operational continuity execution." ;
          skos:example "An IT team invokes its disaster-recovery and crisis-management procedures during an outage." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20735
ex:P20735 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20736
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20737
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20738
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20739
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20740
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20741
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20742
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and deploying an architecture for securing and ensuring the privacy of data flows throughout the organization. Create and develop protocols that ensure proper and efficient use of IT services and solutions" ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20735" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDevelopment (cco:ont00000228): building the security/privacy architecture. The standing 'manage' function is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6). Decomposes into its activities." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage IT security, privacy, and data protection" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that creates and deploys the architecture and protocols for securing IT and ensuring the privacy of data flows throughout an organization." ;
          skos:example "A security team builds and runs the enterprise data-protection architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20736
ex:P20736 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryRequirementData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RegulatoryComplianceObligationEvaluation
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate principles or rules employed in controlling, directing, or managing IT services. Assessing requirements and policies related to confidentiality." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20736" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): assessing requirements/policies yields a descriptive judgement." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT regulatory and confidentiality requirements and policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the rules, requirements, and policies governing IT services and confidentiality and produces a regulatory and compliance obligation evaluation." ;
          skos:example "A privacy officer assesses confidentiality policies against regulatory requirements." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20737
ex:P20737 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityGovernanceSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and managing organization's approach to governing IT security and ensuring the privacy of data flows throughout the organization. Establish and manage tools to support the governance process in order to avoid misuse of information and breach of organizational privacy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20737" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): defining a governance approach yields a Directive ICE. The standing 'manage tools' is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create IT security, privacy, and data protection risk governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines an organization's approach to governing IT security and data privacy and produces an IT security and privacy governance specification." ;
          skos:example "A CISO defines the data-privacy governance model and supporting tooling." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20738
ex:P20738 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining and establishing policies, regulations, standards, and procedures for IT data security and privacy." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20738" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): composing policies/standards yields a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT data security and privacy policies, standards, and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that outlines and establishes policies, standards, and procedures for IT data security and privacy and produces an IT policy." ;
          skos:example "A security team issues the data-encryption and access policies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20739
ex:P20739 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityControlReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying, examining, and reviewing physical and logical IT data security measures such as hardware security (smart cards), cryptographic protocols, and access control." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20739" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366): ongoing review/examination of security measures yields a descriptive review." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and monitor physical and logical IT data security measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that identifies, examines, and reviews physical and logical IT data security measures and produces an IT security control review." ;
          skos:example "A security team reviews smart-card and cryptographic controls quarterly." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20740
ex:P20740 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityControlReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying, examining, and reviewing security control for IT applications. Test, analyze, and implement security protocols in order to safeguard IT applications." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20740" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366): ongoing review of application controls yields a descriptive review. Test/implement steps are method notes." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and monitor application security controls" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that identifies, examines, and reviews security controls for IT applications and produces an IT security control review." ;
          skos:example "An AppSec team reviews and tests the controls protecting a web application." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20741
ex:P20741 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityControlReview
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and examining security controls for physical environment of information technology such as business facilities, equipment, and resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20741" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366): ongoing examination of physical-environment controls yields a descriptive review." ;
          rdfs:label "Review and monitor IT physical environment security controls" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that identifies and examines security controls for the physical environment of information technology and produces an IT security control review." ;
          skos:example "A facilities-security team reviews data-center access and equipment controls." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20742
ex:P20742 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NetworkIntrusionDetectionData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:NetworkIntrusionThreatResolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Monitoring and evaluating network intrusion detection for any malicious activity or policy violations. Identify the gaps in order to resolve threats and enhance existing network security." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.5.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20742" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (cco:ont00000366): continuous monitoring/evaluating of IDS data yields a descriptive resolution record." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor/analyze network intrusion detection data and resolve threats" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that has as input network intrusion detection data and has as output a network intrusion threat resolution describing detected malicious activity, identified gaps, and resolved threats." ;
          skos:example "A SOC analyst triages IDS alerts, closes a gap, and resolves the threat." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20743
ex:P20743 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20744
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20745
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20746
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20747
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20748
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate and analyze the IT environment for the compliance of industry regulations and government legislation. Ensure that IT capability and resources meet the set standards." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20743" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): conducting compliance assessments yields a descriptive judgement. Decomposes into its activities." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct and analyze IT compliance assessments" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates and analyzes the IT environment for compliance with industry regulations and government legislation and produces an IT compliance audit report." ;
          skos:example "A compliance function's annual review of the IT estate against regulations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20744
ex:P20744 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting projects in order to enhance set standards, established guidelines, and risk preventive measures for IT risk and resilience." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20744" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): executing remediation/enhancement projects is a bounded planned operation." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct projects to enhance IT compliance and remediate risk" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that conducts projects to enhance IT compliance standards and remediate IT risk and produces a remediation plan." ;
          skos:example "A team runs a project to close audit findings and harden controls." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20745
ex:P20745 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examine compliance control systems and tools implemented for internal and external IT services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20745" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (cco:ont00000636): auditing controls against requirements yields a descriptive audit report." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct IT compliance control auditing of internal and external services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that examines the compliance control systems and tools implemented for internal and external IT services and produces an IT compliance audit report." ;
          skos:example "An auditor reviews the control tooling protecting an outsourced IT service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20746
ex:P20746 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Execute IT compliance reporting in order to review processes, standards, regulations, and laws are followed as laid out by the regulatory bodies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20746" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) for the report-compilation sense (the definition says 'compiles'): compiling compliance results into a report manipulates input ICEs into a descriptive report. If an implementation instead treats this row as submission/communication of the report to an auditor or regulator, use the corpus reporting genus ex:ActOfReporting (cco:ont00000379 + cco:ont00000228)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform IT compliance reporting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that compiles the results of IT compliance review and produces an IT compliance audit report." ;
          skos:example "A compliance analyst issues the quarterly IT compliance report to regulators." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20747
ex:P20747 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceIssueRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identify and escalate issues related to IT compliance to ensure that corrective measures are taken." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20747" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfIdentification (cco:ont00000366): discerning/registering compliance issues yields a Descriptive ICE. Escalation is a downstream communication, not definitional output." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and escalate IT compliance issues and remediation requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns IT compliance issues and their remediation requirements and produces an IT compliance issue and remediation requirement register." ;
          skos:example "An auditor flags a retention-rule breach and records the required fix." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20748
ex:P20748 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Supporting audits and reports through external resources. This process requires the organization to follow all the regulations set forth by external auditors." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20748" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): supporting an external audit is a bounded planned activity with an external auditor as participant." ;
          rdfs:label "Support external audits and reports" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that supports external audits and reports by furnishing the evidence and cooperation required by external auditors." ;
          skos:example "An IT team provides logs and walkthroughs to support an external SOC 2 audit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20749
ex:P20749 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20750
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20751
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20752
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20753
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20754
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20755
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and execute a process to rapidly adapt and respond to any internal or external opportunity, demand, disruption, or threat in IT. Maintain continuous IT operations to protect employees, assets, and overall brand equity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20749" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because the process spans development and execution. Decomposes into its activities." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and execute IT resilience and continuity operations" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that creates and executes the operations by which IT rapidly adapts and responds to opportunities, demands, disruptions, and threats while maintaining continuous IT operations." ;
          skos:example "An IT team's standing resilience-operations program executed through an outage." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20750
ex:P20750 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting projects to improve the strategy and process for rapidly adapting to any threat in IT." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20750" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): executing improvement projects is a bounded planned operation." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct IT resilience improvement projects" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that conducts projects to improve the strategy and process for rapidly adapting to IT threats." ;
          skos:example "A team runs a project to shorten IT incident-recovery time." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20751
ex:P20751 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITContinuityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Develop, document, and maintain plans to ensure uninterrupted operations of critical IT services. Determine resources such as specialized personnel, equipment, support infrastructure, legal and financial aspects." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20751" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): composing continuity plans yields a Directive ICE. The standing 'maintain' is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6)." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop, document, and maintain IT business continuity planning" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops and documents plans ensuring uninterrupted operation of critical IT services and produces an IT continuity plan." ;
          skos:example "A continuity team authors and documents the disaster-recovery plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20752
ex:P20752 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implement and enforce procedures and policies in order to control changes in IT services and solutions. Manage changes in a rational and predictable manner for optimum resource utilization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20752" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): enacting and enforcing change-control procedures is a bounded planned operation directed by an IT policy." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement and enforce change control procedures" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that implements and enforces procedures and policies to control changes in IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A change-management board enforces the change-control workflow for a release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20753
ex:P20753 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExternalITSupportProvider
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITContinuityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Review and implement resources (including external parties) necessary to support uninterrupted operations of critical IT services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20753" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ITServiceProviderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfServiceProvision to ex:ActOfDeployment (cco:ont00000228). REJECTED ex:ActOfServiceProvision: its definition renders a service to a CUSTOMER by carrying out tasks fulfilling an agreed service need, but the source text ('Review and implement resources ... necessary to support uninterrupted operations of critical IT services') is internal continuity execution -- reviewing and making standby resources operationally available -- not the rendering of a customer-facing service; the customer-service framing was imported from the genus, not the source. The 'review and implement resources' verb fits Deployment (install/configure/make-operationally-available). Has an external IT support provider as participant; guided by ex:ITContinuityPlan as input. Same decision applied to its sibling P20755." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute recurring IT service provider business continuity" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that reviews and makes operationally available the resources, including external parties, needed to support uninterrupted operation of critical IT services." ;
          skos:example "An IT operations team reviews and stands up a third-party failover capability for continuity." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20754
ex:P20754 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITTrainingProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conduct and manage employee training programs on IT resilience so that prospective risks can be avoided." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20754" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfServiceProvision (cco:ont00000228): delivering training to employees. Has the IT training program as input directing the delivery." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide IT resilience training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that conducts employee training programs on IT resilience." ;
          skos:example "An instructor runs the annual IT-resilience training session for staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20755
ex:P20755 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceProvider
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITContinuityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implement regular resources supporting uninterrupted operations of critical IT services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.7.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20755" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ITServiceProviderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfServiceProvision to ex:ActOfDeployment (cco:ont00000228), consistent with sibling P20753. REJECTED ex:ActOfServiceProvision (customer-service rendering): the source ('Implement regular resources supporting uninterrupted operations of critical IT services') is internal operations execution, not a customer service. Also added a differentiating restriction (has input ex:ITContinuityPlan and has participant ex:ITServiceProvider for the internal-resource reading) so the class is logically distinguishable from its genus and from P20753 (which has ex:ExternalITSupportProvider) rather than relying on a comment alone, resolving the prior thin-class/Gate-F exclusiveness gap." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute recurring IT business operations continuity" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that implements and makes operationally available the regular internal resources that support uninterrupted operation of critical IT services, guided by an IT continuity plan." ;
          skos:example "An operations team stands up the scheduled internal failover resources keeping services available." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20756
ex:P20756 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITUser
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20757
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20758
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20759
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20760
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20761
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20762
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20763
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20764
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "The process of identifying, authenticating, and authorizing IT users to have access to applications, systems, IT components, or networks by associating user rights and restrictions with established identities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20756" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ITUserRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): the bounded identify-authenticate-authorize cycle. The standing identity-and-access 'manage' function is the IT Risk Management Capability (R6). Decomposes into its activities." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT user identity and authorization" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that identifies, authenticates, and authorizes IT users to access applications, systems, IT components, or networks by associating user rights and restrictions with established identities." ;
          skos:example "An IAM team's onboarding cycle granting a new hire scoped access." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20757
ex:P20757 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITUserAuthorizationPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and implement policies that integrate authorization policies with authorized profiles of users meant to access network resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20757" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (cco:ont00000511): composing integration policies yields a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Support integration of identity and authorization policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that creates policies integrating authorization with the authorized profiles of users permitted to access network resources and produces an IT user identity and authorization policy." ;
          skos:example "An IAM architect issues a policy binding entitlements to authenticated profiles." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20758
ex:P20758 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITUserDirectory
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing directory of user profiles and access requirements across different levels in the organization's IT network." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20758" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDataManagement (cco:ont00000366): maintaining the user directory governs a body of ICEs. The IT user directory is the entity managed." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT user directory" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that stores, controls, and updates the directory of user profiles and access requirements across an organization's IT network." ;
          skos:example "An admin updates group memberships and access requirements in the directory." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20759
ex:P20759 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITUser
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITUserDirectory
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the process of authorizing IT users to access applications, systems, IT components, or networks by associating user rights." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20759" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:ITUserRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): granting access rights is a bounded authorization operation with an IT user as participant. No verified CCO 'Act of Authorization' exists; the generic Planned Act is the nearest fit." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT user authorization" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that authorizes IT users to access applications, systems, IT components, or networks by associating user rights with their identities." ;
          skos:example "An IAM operator grants a user the entitlements for a new application." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20760
ex:P20760 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITUserDirectory
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and manage the process to authenticate IT users from user directory based on the internal policies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20760" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): operating authentication is a bounded planned operation directed by an IT policy and drawing on the user directory." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage IT user authentication mechanisms" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that creates and operates the process to authenticate IT users from the user directory according to internal policies." ;
          skos:example "An IAM team configures and runs multi-factor authentication against the directory." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20761
ex:P20761 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Examine the processes responsible for reviewing IT user identity and authorization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20761" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (cco:ont00000636): auditing the identity/authorization processes yields a descriptive audit report." ;
          rdfs:label "Audit IT user identity and authorization systems" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that examines the processes responsible for reviewing IT user identity and authorization and produces an IT audit report." ;
          skos:example "An auditor reviews the access-recertification process and reports findings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20762
ex:P20762 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityBreach
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Address any form of unauthorized network breach such as unauthorized access or usage of data, applications, services, networks, and/or devices. Identify the root cause and take corrective measures to resolve the breach." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20762" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): responding to a breach is a bounded planned operation; the breach record (Descriptive ICE) documents the resolution." ;
          rdfs:label "Respond to IT information security and network breaches" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that addresses an unauthorized network breach by identifying its root cause and taking corrective measures to resolve it, producing an IT security breach record." ;
          skos:example "An incident-response team contains a breach, finds its root cause, and remediates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20763
ex:P20763 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSecurityThreatData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PenetrationTestFinding
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conduct penetration testing (pen test) through an authorized stimulated attack to identify security weakness in an IT environment by evaluating the system or network with various harmful techniques." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20763" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (cco:ont00000636): testing the environment against security expectations yields a descriptive finding." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct penetration testing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that subjects an IT environment to an authorized simulated attack to identify security weaknesses and produces a penetration test finding." ;
          skos:example "A red team pen-tests a network and reports exploitable weaknesses." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20764
ex:P20764 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing the processes responsible for integration of user identity and access authorization in order to confirm that all the required regulations are followed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.3.8.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20764" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (cco:ont00000636): auditing the integration processes against regulations yields a descriptive audit report." ;
          rdfs:label "Audit integration of user identity and authorization systems" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that reviews the processes responsible for integrating user identity and access authorization to confirm regulatory conformance and produces an IT audit report." ;
          skos:example "An auditor confirms that the federated-identity integration meets access regulations." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20766
ex:P20766 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20767
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20768
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20769
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create an organization-wide strategy for the IT function by combining skills, technologies, applications, and processes in order to attain organizations objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20766" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InformationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation; output is a Directive ICE (the strategy) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Its three APQC activities are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define business information and analytics strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an organization-wide information and analytics strategy and has as output an IT strategy prescribing how skills, technologies, applications, and processes are combined to attain organizational objectives." ;
          skos:example "An IT leadership team formulates the enterprise's three-year data and analytics strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20767
ex:P20767 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DataInformationAnalyticObjectives
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing strategies for securing and ensuring the privacy of data flows throughout the organization. Create protocols and guidelines for individual IT components. Outline analytic objectives in order to avoid misuse of information." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20767" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation; output is a Directive ICE (the objectives) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish data, information, and analytic objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output data, information, and analytic objectives prescribing the securing, privacy, and proper use of the organization's data and analytics." ;
          skos:example "A data office outlines analytic objectives and privacy protocols to prevent misuse of information." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20768
ex:P20768 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InformationGovernanceFramework
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating a set of guidelines that ensure effective and efficient use of IT. Define data, information, and analytic governance to reach the organization's goal." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20768" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation; output is a Directive ICE (the governance framework) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish data, information, and analytic governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an information governance framework prescribing the guidelines that ensure effective and efficient use of the organization's data, information, and analytics." ;
          skos:example "A governance board defines the data and analytics governance framework for the enterprise." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20769
ex:P20769 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the request for data accessibility and analysis. Review the details based on internal data security policies and permit data access only if internal policies and data access parameters are met." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20769" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management (governing access to ICEs). The access request is a typical input (comment-level); input ex:ITPolicy is the security policy consulted." ;
          rdfs:label "Access IT data/analytic capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that reviews a data-access request against internal security policies and governs access to the requested data and analytic capabilities, permitting access only when policy parameters are met." ;
          skos:example "A data-access committee reviews a request against security policy and grants scoped read access." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20770
ex:P20770 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20771
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20772
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20773
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20774
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20775
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating strategies to manage the organization's information and content. Outline the architecture for information collection and communication. Administer information resources, data management and content." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20770" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InformationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is design; output is a Directive ICE (the architecture specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Its five APQC activities are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and maintain business information architecture" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that devises the architecture for the organization's information collection and communication and has as output an enterprise architecture specification prescribing how information resources are structured and managed." ;
          skos:example "An enterprise architecture team defines and maintains the business information architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20771
ex:P20771 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining strategies to manage the enterprise wide flow of business information and content. Outline the required architecture for information resources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20771" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is analysis; output is a Descriptive ICE (the requirements analysis) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine enterprise business information requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the enterprise-wide flow of business information and content and has as output an IT requirements analysis describing the required information-resource architecture." ;
          skos:example "An analyst determines the enterprise's business-information requirements ahead of an architecture refresh." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20772
ex:P20772 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseDataModelSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Define different ways of representation, usage, and identification of data with independent or interdependent sources across the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20772" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is design; output is a Directive ICE (the data model specification) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define enterprise data models" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that specifies the representation, usage, and identification of data entities across the organization's sources and has as output an enterprise data model specification." ;
          skos:example "A data architect defines the enterprise logical data model spanning interdependent sources." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20773
ex:P20773 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ExternalDataSourceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and understanding external sources of data in relevance of reliability, security, and authenticity." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20773" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is identification (discernment sense); output is a Descriptive ICE (the source assessment) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify and understand external data sources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns external data sources and has as output an external data source assessment describing their reliability, security, and authenticity." ;
          skos:example "A data team identifies and rates candidate external feeds by trustworthiness." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20774
ex:P20774 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DataStewardshipAssignment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing entities responsible for data accuracy, integrity, and timeliness that can authorize or deny access to certain data. Develop data utilizing governance processes to ensure fitness of data elements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20774" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation; output is a Directive ICE (the stewardship assignment) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish data ownership and stewardship responsibilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output a data stewardship assignment prescribing the entities responsible for data accuracy, integrity, and timeliness and their authority over data access." ;
          skos:example "A data office assigns owners and stewards for each master-data domain." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20775
ex:P20775 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and maintaining the process of designing, creating, deploying, and managing strategies to maintain enterprise data and information architecture." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20775" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management (the architecture artifact is governed and updated as an ICE); output is the maintained Directive ICE (architecture specification). Rejected ex:ActOfDesign as the primary genus because the differentia here is ongoing upkeep of an existing artifact, not authoring a new one." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain and evolve enterprise data and information architecture" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that keeps the enterprise data and information architecture current and has as output an updated enterprise architecture specification reflecting its evolution." ;
          skos:example "An architecture team versions and updates the enterprise information architecture each quarter." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20776
ex:P20776 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20777
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20778
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Develop and implement strategies to plan and manage the flow of an information system's data from creation and initial storage to the time when it becomes obsolete and deleted." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20776" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InformationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation (the headline output is a lifecycle plan/policy, a Directive ICE) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE; its execution facets are carried by its data-administration child. Its two APQC activities are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and execute business information lifecycle planning and control" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that plans the management of information from creation and initial storage through obsolescence and deletion and has as output an IT policy prescribing the information lifecycle, coordinating its policy-setting and data-administration activities." ;
          skos:example "An information-management office defines and runs the data lifecycle policy from capture to deletion." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20777
ex:P20777 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining and establishing policies for information and setting information standards and procedures. Establish policies to regulate the creation, use, storage, access, communication, and dissemination of information." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20777" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is formulation; outputs are Directive ICEs (policy and standard) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and maintain enterprise information policies, standards, and procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT policy and an IT standard prescribing how the creation, use, storage, access, communication, and dissemination of information are to be regulated." ;
          skos:example "A governance team establishes information-handling policies and the accompanying standards." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20778
ex:P20778 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implementing and executing strategies for processes and technologies that support the collection, managing, and storing of data." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20778" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management (ICEs are collected, managed, and stored). No single definitional output artifact beyond the administered data itself; specific outputs are instance-level (comment-level)." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement and execute data administration responsibilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that executes the processes and technologies supporting the collection, management, and storage of the organization's data." ;
          skos:example "A data-administration team operates the pipelines that collect and store enterprise data." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20779
ex:P20779 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20780
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20781
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20782
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20783
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating strategies to administer information and content. Understand the needs of the organization for information and content management. Realize the role of IT services for implementing the overall business strategy. Assess the implications of new technologies for managing information and content. Identify and prioritize the most effective and efficient actions for managing information and content." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20779" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InformationManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded coordinating data-management occurrent (an APQC Process-typed node with four bounded children), not as a standing capability: the standing 'Manage information' function is captured separately at group level by ex:InformationManagementCapability (R6). Its four APQC activities are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage business information" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that administers the organization's business information and content and coordinates the monitoring, maintenance, auditing, and access-administration of that information as its process parts." ;
          skos:example "An information-management team runs a cycle of administering, monitoring, and auditing business information." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20780
ex:P20780 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the rules, diction, and logic that make up the framework of the organization's information architecture. Monitoring and controlling information attributes that flow through the IT framework." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20780" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is monitoring; output is a Descriptive ICE (the state/deviation report) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Gate-F DE-CONFLATION (Phase 1, recorded choice not omission): the APQC source fuses two facets -- (1) a DIRECTIVE rule/framework-defining facet ('Defining the rules, diction, and logic that make up the framework of the organization's information architecture', i.e. authoring a prescriptive information-architecture framework, a Directive ICE; this is an ex:ActOfFormulation/ex:ActOfDesign concern, covered at the section-8.4 information-architecture design rows under 8.4.2) and (2) the MONITORING facet modeled here ('Monitoring and controlling information attributes that flow through the IT framework'). This class deliberately anchors only the monitoring facet; the rule-definition facet is NOT given a separate process sub-step here because a non-PCF supporting process would fail Gate-C S1 (every ex: process needs ex:pcfID) -- it is instead represented at the dedicated 8.4.2 information-architecture design rows. The 'control' (enforcement) verb is the corrective follow-on to monitoring and is left as a typical, non-definitional aspect (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and control business information" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that continuously observes the information attributes flowing through the IT framework and has as output an IT performance report recording their state and any deviations." ;
          skos:example "An operations team tracks data-quality attributes across the information pipeline and reports anomalies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20781
ex:P20781 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITKnowledgeRepository
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintain information feedstock along with IT hardware and software needed for storage, access, and retrieval of business information." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20781" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management; output is the maintained Descriptive ICE (the knowledge repository). The supporting IT hardware/software is an operational resource (comment-level), not a definitional ICE I/O." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain business information feeds and repositories" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that keeps the organization's information feeds and repositories current and available for storage, access, and retrieval, and has as output a maintained IT knowledge repository." ;
          skos:example "A data-platform team keeps the enterprise content repository and its feeds running and retrievable." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20782
ex:P20782 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Verification of information access and usage through regular reports on organizational performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20782" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:InternalAuditManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is verification; output is a Descriptive ICE (the audit report) per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform internal usage audits" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that examines information access and usage against expected organizational performance and has as output an IT compliance audit report recording the findings." ;
          skos:example "An internal audit team reviews information access logs and issues a usage-compliance report." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20783
ex:P20783 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Implement and manage the process for accessing information including issues related to copyright, open source, privacy, and security." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.4.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20783" ;
          rdfs:comment "Genus is data management (governing access to ICEs). Input ex:ITPolicy is the copyright/privacy/security policy applied; specific access grants are instance-level (comment-level)." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement and administer business information access" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that implements and administers the process for accessing business information, governing copyright, open-source, privacy, and security concerns." ;
          skos:example "An access-management team enforces copyright and privacy controls when provisioning information access." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20785
ex:P20785 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20786
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20787
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20788
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20789
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20790
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20791
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20792
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing service/solution along with creating a strategy that provides a base for delivering service/solution aligned with overall business needs. Conduct research within the services/solutions field for development and integration." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20785" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DevelopAndManageServicesSolutionsCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC 8.5.1 as a bounded formulation occurrent; its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop service/solution and integration strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that examines business needs and the services/solutions field and produces an IT strategy for developing and integrating IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "An IT planning team drafts the service/solution development and integration strategy for the coming year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20786
ex:P20786 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDevelopmentValueAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the development of IT service/solution. Analyze the pros and cons of IT service/solution and it's methods on the basis of their cost effectiveness and development value." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20786" ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT service/solution development" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates candidate IT service/solution development methods by cost-effectiveness and development value and produces an IT development value assessment." ;
          skos:example "An architect weighs build-vs-buy options and issues a cost-effectiveness assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20787
ex:P20787 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing the methods and processes as the foundation for developing new IT platforms, components, software, and explore new standards for better IT usage in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20787" ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT service/solution development processes/standards" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the methods, processes, and standards governing development of new IT platforms, components, and software, and produces an IT standard." ;
          skos:example "An engineering office publishes the organization's solution-development process standard." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20788
ex:P20788 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDevelopmentToolStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and implementing techniques and tools for development based on overall value addition to the IT environment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20788" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored under ex:ActOfSelection (choice from candidates yielding a directive). Deployment/support of the chosen tools is downstream and not definitional here." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify, deploy, and support development methodologies and tools" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses development methodologies and tools on the basis of their value addition to the IT environment and produces an IT development methodology and tool standard prescribing the adopted set." ;
          skos:example "A platform team selects and rolls out an approved CI/CD toolchain." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20789
ex:P20789 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceComponentSelectionCriteria
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing standards for selection of IT service components." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20789" ;
          rdfs:label "Establish service component criteria" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the standards for selecting IT service components and produces service component selection criteria." ;
          skos:example "An architecture board issues the criteria a component must meet to be approved." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20790
ex:P20790 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ServiceComponentSelectionCriteria
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding and selecting reusable service components so that they can be cost-effective and efficient." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20790" ;
          rdfs:comment "Has as input the criteria produced by 8.5.1.4 (definitional: selection requires the criteria)." ;
          rdfs:label "Understand and select reusable service components" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that chooses cost-effective reusable service components from candidates and has as input service component selection criteria." ;
          skos:example "A designer picks two pre-approved reusable modules for a new service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20791
ex:P20791 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPortfolioPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and establishing service component portfolio by defining investments, and activities. Analyze and examine the value of the service component portfolio, and allocate resources towards it." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20791" ;
          rdfs:comment "Despite the label 'Maintain', the description denotes bounded create/establish/allocate acts producing a portfolio plan; modeled as a process, not a standing function." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain service component portfolio" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines investments and activities for the service component portfolio and produces an IT portfolio plan with allocated resources." ;
          skos:example "A portfolio manager (re)baselines the component portfolio and assigns its budget." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20792
ex:P20792 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating standards and procedures for developing IT services/solutions outside of defined business parameters." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20792" ;
          rdfs:label "Establish development standards exception governance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes standards and procedures for developing IT services/solutions outside defined business parameters and produces an IT policy." ;
          skos:example "Governance defines the waiver procedure for out-of-standard solution builds." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20793
ex:P20793 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20794
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20795
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20796
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20797
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20798
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing life-cycle planning for IT services and solutions. Develop new requirements and feature-function enhancements. Create and design a life cycle plan that addresses the current and future state of IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20793" ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded planning occurrent (the description is 'executing life-cycle planning ... create and design a life cycle plan'), not as a standing 'manage' function." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage service/solution lifecycle planning" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that performs lifecycle planning for IT services and solutions and produces an IT roadmap addressing their current and future state." ;
          skos:example "A lifecycle planning cycle yields the roadmap for the service portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20794
ex:P20794 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EmergingTechnologyData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TechnologyAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Perform a systematic investigation to new and future technology capabilities for future upgrades." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20794" ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and track emerging technology capabilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that systematically investigates new and future technology capabilities and has as input emerging technology data and as output a technology assessment." ;
          skos:example "A horizon-scanning team tracks emerging platform capabilities for planned upgrades." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20795
ex:P20795 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolutionRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying processes and supporting procedures that are performed by an organization to design, plan, deliver, operate, and control information technology services/solutions offered to customers." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20795" ;
          rdfs:label "Identify IT services/solutions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns the IT services/solutions offered to customers and the procedures that realize them and produces an IT service/solution register." ;
          skos:example "An analyst catalogues every customer-facing IT service and its supporting procedures." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20796
ex:P20796 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolutionApproach
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining an approach to create a base for delivering IT service/solution aligned with overall business needs while maintaining a tight control on delivery and costs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20796" ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT service/solution approach" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a delivery approach for an IT service/solution aligned with business needs and cost/delivery controls and produces an IT service/solution delivery approach." ;
          skos:example "A delivery lead settles on a phased rollout approach with cost gates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20797
ex:P20797 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRoadmap
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining solutions to satisfy business needs. IT solution lifecycle provides a means to address the full life cycle of an information technology solution and addresses the current and future state of IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20797" ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT solution lifecycle" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the full lifecycle of an IT solution addressing its current and future state and produces an IT roadmap." ;
          skos:example "A lifecycle owner documents the end-to-end lifecycle stages for a solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20798
ex:P20798 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolutionSunsetPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing plans to retire IT service/solution resources when the service/solution is no longer feasible." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20798" ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT service/solution sunset plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes plans to retire IT service/solution resources once they are no longer feasible and produces an IT service/solution sunset plan." ;
          skos:example "A team drafts the decommissioning plan for a legacy service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20799
ex:P20799 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20800
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20801
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20802
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20803
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20804
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20805
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20806
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20807
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating the architecture for the IT services and solutions. Assess architecture and business constraints in order to understand integration requirements. Promote existing architecture. Manage exceptions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20799" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfFormulation to ex:ActOfDesign (the registry-sanctioned, more specific genus -- the ex:ActOfDesign recurrence registry explicitly lists '8.5.3 (service/solution architecture)' as an ActOfDesign site, and ActOfDesign is defined precisely for authoring a design/architecture specification). ex:ActOfDesign remains a subclass of cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning), so Gates A-D are unaffected; the output ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification stays Directive, preserving the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. This makes P20799 consistent with its leaf sibling P20805 (also re-anchored to ex:ActOfDesign) and with 8.5.4.1.2 P20811 'Create service/solution design'. Modeled as the bounded architecture-design occurrent that hosts its child parts; the standing 'manage/promote/exception' coordinating facets are realized in the same parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage service/solution architecture" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that creates the architecture for IT services and solutions and produces an enterprise architecture specification." ;
          skos:example "An architecture program produces and governs the service/solution architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20800
ex:P20800 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITLandscapeData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITArchitectureConstraintAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing limitations in IT application and infrastructure architecture that may hinder expected performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20800" ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT application and infrastructure architecture constraints" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates limitations in IT application and infrastructure architecture and produces an IT architecture constraint assessment." ;
          skos:example "An architect documents throughput ceilings in the current platform." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20801
ex:P20801 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITBusinessConstraintAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate business limitations that may hinder IT service/solution performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20801" ;
          rdfs:label "Assess business constraints on IT service/solution" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates business limitations bearing on IT service/solution performance and produces an IT business constraint assessment." ;
          skos:example "An assessment notes budget and compliance limits on a solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20802
ex:P20802 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining the requirements to integrate IT components such as hardware, software, database, telecommunication, and network." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20802" ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT component integration requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines IT components and produces an IT requirements analysis of the integration requirements among them." ;
          skos:example "An analyst specifies the interface and data requirements to integrate two systems." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20803
ex:P20803 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfIdentification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITReuseOpportunityRegister
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identification of opportunities for reusing IT components so that they can be cost-effective and efficient." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20803" ;
          rdfs:label "Identify opportunities for IT component reuse" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Identification that discerns opportunities for reusing IT components and produces an IT component reuse opportunity register." ;
          skos:example "An architect lists existing services that could be reused in a new solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20804
ex:P20804 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Encouraging acceptance of existing IT service/solution architecture in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20804" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): a persuasion/change-management act. No informational output is definitional (the enterprise architecture specification it promotes is its input, not its product), so no has-output someValuesFrom is asserted (Phase-3)." ;
          rdfs:label "Promote adoption of existing service/solution architecture" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that encourages organizational acceptance of the existing IT service/solution architecture." ;
          skos:example "An architecture team runs brown-bag sessions to drive adoption of the reference architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20805
ex:P20805 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and maintaining a services and solutions architecture over a network that can be revised as needed or even eliminated in case of inefficiencies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20805" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfFormulation to ex:ActOfDesign for consistency with its parent P20799 (also re-anchored), the build-a-design sibling 8.5.4.1.2 P20811, and the ex:ActOfDesign registry entry for 8.5.3. 'Creating ... a services and solutions architecture' is exactly the concept-stage authoring ex:ActOfDesign was minted for. ex:ActOfDesign is a subclass of cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning), so Gates A-D are unaffected and the output ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification stays Directive (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). The 'develop' facet is dominant and bounded; ongoing maintenance/revision is realized by re-instances of this same act type." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and maintain service/solution architectures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that creates and revises a services/solutions architecture and produces an enterprise architecture specification." ;
          skos:example "An architect publishes and later revises the network service architecture." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20806
ex:P20806 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseArchitectureSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITArchitectureConformanceAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing functional compliance of the IT service/solution architecture. Safeguard compliance with guidelines for the architecture." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20806" ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT service/solution architecture conformance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the functional compliance of an IT service/solution architecture with its guidelines and produces an IT architecture conformance assessment." ;
          skos:example "A review confirms a solution conforms to the reference architecture except for two waivers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20807
ex:P20807 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITArchitectureExceptionResolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and resolving any architectural exceptions. Address the internal inquiries related to architecture that cannot be addressed immediately. Research inquiries that require the need of exceptional methods." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.3.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20807" ;
          rdfs:comment "Modeled as a bounded resolution occurrent (identify-and-resolve), not as a standing function despite the 'Manage' label." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage architectural exceptions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that identifies and resolves architectural exceptions and produces an IT architecture exception resolution." ;
          skos:example "An architecture board issues a waiver resolving a non-standard integration request." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20808
ex:P20808 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20809
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding customer requirements. Design the IT services and solutions based on the requirements. Develop components for providing the requirements. Train resources to provide support. Test the IT services and solutions in advance. Confirm the customer experience post-sale." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20808" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DevelopAndManageServicesSolutionsCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category (8.0): the built IT service/solution is a material participant attached via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), not has output (reserved for ICEs)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute IT service/solution creation and testing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that designs, builds, and tests IT services and solutions from customer requirements and produces an IT service/solution." ;
          skos:example "A delivery team designs, builds, and tests a new customer-facing service end to end." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20809
ex:P20809 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20810
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20811
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20812
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20813
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20814
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20815
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20816
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing an information system, aiming to produce a high quality system that meets or exceeds customer expectations, reaches completion within time and cost estimates, and is inexpensive to maintain and cost-effective to enhance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20809" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category: the built IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute IT service/solution development lifecycle" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that executes the full development lifecycle of an IT service/solution and produces an IT service/solution meeting customer expectations." ;
          skos:example "A scrum team runs the SDLC from requirements to release for a new module." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20810
ex:P20810 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating and validating the requirements and needs of IT service/solution." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20810" ;
          rdfs:label "Assess and validate IT service/solution requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks the requirements and needs of an IT service/solution and has as input IT customer requirements and as output an IT requirements analysis." ;
          skos:example "An analyst validates that captured requirements are complete and testable." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20811
ex:P20811 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionDesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Formulating a design for service/solution that helps an organization to meet its objectives. Develop a new framework for molding the service/solution processes into a coherent and structured form." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20811" ;
          rdfs:label "Create service/solution design" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that composes a coherent design for a service/solution and produces an IT solution design specification." ;
          skos:example "A solution architect produces the design specification for a new service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20812
ex:P20812 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInfrastructureComponent
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionDesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Building and testing new components required for the development of IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20812" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category: the built components are material entities (ex:ITInfrastructureComponent), attached via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), not has output (D4)." ;
          rdfs:label "Build and test IT service/solution components" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that builds and tests new IT service/solution components from a design specification, the built components participating as IT infrastructure components." ;
          skos:example "Developers code and unit-test the modules called out in the design." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20813
ex:P20813 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInfrastructureComponent
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Combining the newly built IT component along with IT services in order to gain optimum output." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20813" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category: the IT infrastructure components consumed and the integrated IT service/solution are material participants (obo:BFO_0000057), not ICE outputs." ;
          rdfs:label "Integrate IT components and services" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that combines newly built IT components with IT services to produce an integrated IT service/solution as material participant." ;
          skos:example "An integration engineer wires the new module into the existing service mesh." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20814
ex:P20814 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Validating that the proposed IT service/solution is feasible and provides the needed services for the customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20814" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations category: the validated IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057); the validation result is the ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute IT service/solution validation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that confirms an IT service/solution is feasible and meets customer needs and produces an IT solution validation result." ;
          skos:example "A test team runs acceptance tests and records the validation result." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20815
ex:P20815 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and implementing a strategy for the deployment of IT service/solution by defining all of the activities that make the IT function available for use. Define the deployment process, procedures, and tools. Select the most feasible and practical methodologies for the deployment process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20815" ;
          rdfs:comment "Produces the deployment plan (directive); the actual release is ex:ActOfDeployment downstream and not part of this act. The packaged IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Bundle service/solution deployment packaging" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the deployment process, procedures, and tools for an IT service/solution and produces a deployment plan." ;
          skos:example "A release manager packages the build and writes the deployment runbook." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20816
ex:P20816 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITIssueRequest
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITProcessExceptionResolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying and resolving internal needs/inquiries for service/solution that cannot be resolved immediately. Research inquiries that require the need of exceptional solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.4.1.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20816" ;
          rdfs:comment "Bounded identify-and-resolve occurrent, not a standing function despite the 'Manage' label." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage service/solution process exceptions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that identifies and resolves internal service/solution process exceptions and produces an IT service/solution process exception resolution." ;
          skos:example "A lead researches and resolves a blocking exception with a one-off workaround." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20817
ex:P20817 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20818
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Engaging in all aspects of service/solution maintenance and testing includes all preventative, routine, and corrective activates. Ensure that IT service/solution are functioning properly and regulations where applicable." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20817" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:DevelopAndManageServicesSolutionsCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). Rejected cco:ont00000950 Act of Maintenance because its definition restricts the modified entity to a Material Artifact, whereas IT services/solutions are largely informational/configured systems; the IT service/solution acted upon is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform service/solution maintenance and testing" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act of performing preventative, routine, and corrective maintenance and testing on IT services/solutions to keep them functioning properly." ;
          skos:example "An operations team runs the quarterly maintenance and regression cycle for a service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20818
ex:P20818 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20819
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20820
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20821
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20822
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20823
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing IT service/solution maintenance lifecycle in order to reduce maintenance costs and increase reliability of IT infrastructure concerning service/solution related problems." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20818" ;
          rdfs:label "Execute IT service/solution maintenance lifecycle" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that executes the maintenance lifecycle of an IT service/solution to reduce maintenance costs and increase reliability." ;
          skos:example "A run team executes the maintenance lifecycle for a production service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20819
ex:P20819 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDeploymentImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate plans to address information technology environmental adulteration for rectification efforts." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20819" ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT remediation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates plans to remediate degradation of the IT environment and produces an IT deployment impact assessment." ;
          skos:example "An engineer appraises remediation options for a failing component." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20820
ex:P20820 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionDesignSpecification
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionDesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Redesign the roadmap to seek solution or service with an overall process flow and impact timeframe." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20820" ;
          rdfs:label "Modify service/solution design" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that revises the design of a service/solution and produces a revised IT solution design specification." ;
          skos:example "An architect updates the solution design to address a defect's root cause." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20821
ex:P20821 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering the efforts and activities for IT service/solution remediation. This process element requires the organization to create plans for corrective action in collaboration with government agencies and pertinent professional services agencies which specialize in remediation efforts relevant to the organization's service/solution. Additionally, the organization needs to consult experts to validate the plan, determine resources allocation, resolve any legal concerns, and formulate a company-wide policy for IT service/solution remediation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20821" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix: re-anchored from ex:ActOfFormulation to ex:ActOfServiceProvision (cco:ont00000228) -- the row's lead/verb ('Administering the efforts and activities for IT service/solution remediation') is an execution/operations act performed ON the IT service, not mere plan-authoring, and the prior model collapsed it to plan-formulation, dropping the execution facet and the material thing acted upon. Added the operated-on IT service/solution as a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057 some ex:ITServiceSolution), matching the participant pattern of the sibling operations act 8.5.5.1.4 P20822 'Manage service/solution operations'. ex:RemediationPlan is retained as the directive INPUT that guides the remediation (it is authored upstream at the formulation/triage rows); the corrective-action-plan authoring described in the body is the input-producing step, not this execution act's product." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform IT service/solution remediation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that administers and carries out the remediation of an IT service/solution, guided by a remediation plan and acting on the IT service/solution being remediated." ;
          skos:example "A remediation lead executes the corrective actions on the affected service per the remediation plan, with external specialists." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20822
ex:P20822 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Understanding customer requirements. Managing services/solutions based on the requirements. Develop components for providing the requirements. Train resources to provide support. Confirm the customer experience post-sale. Evaluate the performance of service/solution. Communicate the results to the management." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20822" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations occurrent; the service/solution is operated (material participant) and performance is reported (descriptive output)." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage service/solution operations" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that operates an IT service/solution per customer requirements and produces an IT performance report." ;
          skos:example "An operations team runs a live service and reports its performance to management." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20823
ex:P20823 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing packaging for fixed/enhanced service/solution based on the standalone or bundled offerings to be used by the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.5.5.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20823" ;
          rdfs:comment "The packaged IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057); the deployment plan is the ICE output." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare fixed/enhanced service/solution packaging" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops deployment packaging for a fixed or enhanced service/solution and produces a deployment plan." ;
          skos:example "A release manager packages a patched service as a standalone deployable unit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20824
ex:P20824 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20825
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20832
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20840
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20848
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20858
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing IT services/solutions by creating a strategy for deployment. Plan and execute the changes. Plan and administer the release of its IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20824" ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 8.6 as a bounded occurrent. Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Deploy services/solutions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that puts an organization's IT services and solutions into operational use, comprising the formulation of a deployment strategy, the planning of implementation, the control of change deployment, the implementation of technology solutions, and the rollout to end users." ;
          skos:example "An IT organization's end-to-end release of a new ERP module: strategy, plan, change control, install, and user rollout." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20825
ex:P20825 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20826
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20827
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20828
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20829
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20830
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20831
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and implementing a strategy for the deployment of IT service/solution. Define all of the activities that make the IT function available for use. Establish the change policies for IT services and solutions. Define the deployment process, procedures, and tools. Select the most feasible and practical methodologies for the deployment process." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20825" ;
          rdfs:comment "Lead act is the bounded formulation of a deployment strategy (a Directive ICE); the standing 'manage' facet of APQC 8.6.1 is realized by ex:ITServiceManagementCapability and is not part of this process universal." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop and manage service/solution deployment strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a deployment strategy prescribing the activities, change policies, procedures, tools, and methodologies by which an organization's IT services and solutions are made available for use." ;
          skos:example "An IT release-management team drafts the organization's deployment strategy and change policy set." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20826
ex:P20826 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDeploymentImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluate the impact of IT deployment (products/services) on the business. Compare pre and post development performance, behavior of resources, and cost to assess organizational benefit." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20826" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): the act evaluates and judges deployment impact, yielding a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT deployment business impact" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that compares pre- and post-deployment performance, resource behavior, and cost and produces an IT deployment impact assessment of the organizational benefit." ;
          skos:example "An analyst compares help-desk volumes before and after a rollout to quantify the deployment's business benefit." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20827
ex:P20827 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining deployment policies regarding IT services and solutions to allow employees to plan accordingly. Reduce the negative impact to the user community." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20827" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): defining a policy yields a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish IT deployment policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes IT deployment policies prescribing how IT services and solutions are deployed so as to reduce negative impact on the user community." ;
          skos:example "An IT governance board issues a deployment-blackout policy for month-end periods." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20828
ex:P20828 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionDesignSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Outlining processes, methods, and equipment for deployment of IT solutions. Manage core operations servers like subversion server, production server, and development server, to make the IT services and solutions available for internal/client use." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20828" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDesign (Act of Planning): designing a workflow yields a Directive design spec (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). The 'manage core servers' facet is operational and not part of this design universal." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and create deployment procedure workflow" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that outlines the processes, methods, and equipment for deploying IT solutions and produces a deployment design specification of the procedure workflow." ;
          skos:example "A release engineer designs the build->staging->production promotion workflow and tooling chain." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20829
ex:P20829 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing guidelines for the changed/released IT services and solutions to meet business objectives with optimum utilization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20829" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: defining a standard yields a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT change/release standards" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes IT change/release standards prescribing guidelines for changed or released IT services and solutions to meet business objectives with optimum utilization." ;
          skos:example "A change-advisory board sets the naming, versioning, and rollback-readiness standards for releases." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20830
ex:P20830 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentApprovalAssignment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating development approval responsibilities based on defined change standards." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20830" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning): allocating responsibilities yields a Directive ICE. Has the change standards (a Directive ICE) as a typical input; left as comment, not a restriction, per Phase-3 necessity." ;
          rdfs:label "Assign deployment approval responsibilities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Planning that coordinates and assigns deployment-approval responsibilities on the basis of defined change standards and produces a directive assignment of those responsibilities." ;
          skos:example "A release manager assigns each environment's go-live sign-off owner per the change standard." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20831
ex:P20831 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPerformanceData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDeploymentImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the impact (pros and cons) of IT services deployment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20831" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (Act of Information Processing): examining outcomes yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Analyze deployments outcomes" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that examines the pros and cons of IT services deployment and produces an IT deployment impact assessment of the outcomes." ;
          skos:example "A post-implementation review tallies the benefits and drawbacks of a completed rollout." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20832
ex:P20832 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20833
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20834
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20835
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20836
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20837
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20838
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Strategizing and executing changes in IT solutions and services. Create a plan for deploying the changes. Communicate with stakeholders about the changes. Administer and implement the changes. Train the resources who will be affected by these changes. Install changes and verify their effect." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20832" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the lead act of 8.6.2 is creating a deployment/implementation plan (a Directive ICE). Its execution-oriented facets are realized by sibling implementation/rollout processes." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan service and solution implementation" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes a plan for deploying changes to IT services and solutions, prescribing the schedule, requirements, testing, training, and communications for implementation." ;
          skos:example "An implementation team builds the rollout plan, schedule, and training approach for a system upgrade." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20833
ex:P20833 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Accessing threats and potential failures related to the deployment of IT services/solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20833" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): judging deployment risk yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT deployment risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the threats and potential failures related to the deployment of IT services and solutions and produces an IT risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "A risk analyst rates the failure modes of a database migration before approving its plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20834
ex:P20834 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining the schedule for implementation of change. Plan and carry out a process or procedure to implement the predefined changes." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20834" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfScheduling (Act of Planning): defining a schedule/sequence yields a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define implementation schedule and roll-out sequence" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that defines the schedule and roll-out sequence for implementing predefined changes and produces a resource schedule." ;
          skos:example "A release manager sequences the wave-by-wave rollout calendar across regions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20835
ex:P20835 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine requirements for implementation of IT deployment. Carry out a pre-implementation audit to assess the impact and use case. Gauge the possible vulnerabilities and impact the business operations during and after the implementation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20835" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfAnalysis (Act of Information Processing): a pre-implementation audit examining impact yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine implementation requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that carries out a pre-implementation audit of impact, use cases, and vulnerabilities and produces an IT requirements analysis of the implementation requirements." ;
          skos:example "An analyst audits a target environment and lists the prerequisites and vulnerabilities for go-live." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20836
ex:P20836 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:UserTestingPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Plan methodologies and align resources for user testing of IT deployment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20836" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): planning test methodologies and resource alignment yields a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and align user testing and resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that plans the methodologies and aligns the resources for user testing of an IT deployment and produces a directive user-testing plan." ;
          skos:example "A QA lead plans the UAT cycles and assigns testers and environments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20837
ex:P20837 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITTrainingProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Create and manage employee training programs by considering the need and availability of these programs. Manage all aspects related to the training programs." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20837" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDevelopment (Planned Act): the lead act creates a training program (a Directive ICE) (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). The standing 'manage all aspects' facet is realized by ex:ITServiceManagementCapability, not modeled here." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that creates an employee IT training program, considering the need for and availability of such programs, and produces an IT training program." ;
          skos:example "An L&D team builds the courseware and schedule for training users on a new ticketing tool." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20838
ex:P20838 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfCommunication ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDeploymentCommunication
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating change implementation in IT services and solutions communications with employees and stakeholders." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20838" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to the shared ex:ActOfCommunication (wraps the D6-VERIFIED cco:ont00000402 'Act of Communication'; verification recorded in the §6 record at the ex:ActOfCommunication declaration). Gate-F consistency: re-anchored from the per-class raw IRI + redundant cco:ont00000228 co-anchor to the shared genus, which supplies the chain to the allowlisted Planned Act for the SHACL S2 graph. Has-output ex:ITDeploymentCommunication (the prepared/transferred deployment notice)." ;
          rdfs:label "Create implementation communications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that coordinates and transfers communications about IT change implementation to employees and stakeholders, producing an IT deployment communication." ;
          skos:example "A change manager drafts and sends the go-live notice and FAQ to affected departments." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20840
ex:P20840 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20841
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20842
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20843
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20844
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20845
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20846
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20847
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITChangeControlRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and deploying an architecture for securing the changes deployed in the organization. Create and develop protocols that ensure proper and efficient use of deployed IT services and solutions. Test, evaluate, and implement the policies and protocols." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20840" ;
          rdfs:comment "Gate-F fix (genus false-friend): re-anchored from ex:ActOfMonitoring to the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). REJECTED ex:ActOfMonitoring, whose definition is repeated/continuous longitudinal observation of an ongoing process; the source ('Creating and deploying an architecture for securing the changes ... Create and develop protocols ... Test, evaluate, and implement the policies and protocols') and the seven process-part children form a BOUNDED per-release control gate (appraise->confirm->approve->document) culminating in an approval decision -- design/formulation plus appraisal/verification, not continuous observation; the 'control' label was a false-friend for 'monitoring'. ex:ActOfMonitoring is reserved for the genuinely longitudinal sibling 8.6.5.7 P20865. R5: although titled 'Manage', each change/release cycle is a bounded control occurrent, so it is modeled as a process. Gate-F fix (output mismatch): output filler corrected from ex:ITServiceSupportRecord (a help-desk incident/request disposition record, 8.7.8) to the dedicated ex:ITChangeControlRecord, matching the skos:definition's 'IT change-control record'." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage change deployment control" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that runs a per-release change-control gate -- creating and deploying the securing architecture, developing and testing the policies and protocols, and appraising, confirming, approving, and documenting the change -- and produces an IT change-control record." ;
          skos:example "A change-advisory board runs its control gate for a release, recording impact, compliance, and the approval decision." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20841
ex:P20841 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDeploymentImpactAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating the impact of IT change/release on the business." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20841" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): judging change/release impact yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT change/release impact" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the impact of an IT change or release on the business and produces an IT deployment impact assessment." ;
          skos:example "A reviewer scores the blast radius of a proposed configuration change." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20842
ex:P20842 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITComplianceAuditReport
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Ensure that change/release meets change guidelines set by the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20842" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (Act of Appraisal): confirming conformance to guidelines yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Has the change guidelines (a Directive ICE) as a typical input; left as comment per Phase-3 necessity." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm change/release compliance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks an IT change or release against the organization's change guidelines and produces an IT compliance audit report." ;
          skos:example "A compliance officer confirms a release followed the mandated approval and testing gates." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20843
ex:P20843 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRiskAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating for any kind of risks or threats which could be caused due to IT change/release deployment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20843" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): judging change/release risk yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess IT change/release risk" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the risks and threats arising from an IT change or release deployment and produces an IT risk assessment." ;
          skos:example "A security reviewer assesses the threats introduced by a firewall-rule release." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20844
ex:P20844 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDevelopment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Integrate all forms of changes in IT in order to make more efficient use of resources and down time, and optimizing results." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20844" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDevelopment (Planned Act). Operations category: the consolidated IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output (D4)." ;
          rdfs:label "Consolidate IT change" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Development that integrates all forms of IT change into a consolidated change to the IT service/solution so as to use resources and downtime more efficiently." ;
          skos:example "A release engineer batches several pending patches into a single maintenance window." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20845
ex:P20845 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and communicating the schedule for implementation to related stakeholders and functions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20845" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfScheduling (Act of Planning): defining a schedule yields a Directive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE); the communicate facet is a typical follow-on, left as comment per Phase-3 necessity." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and communicate deployment schedule" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that defines the implementation schedule and communicates it to related stakeholders and functions, producing a resource schedule." ;
          skos:example "A release manager publishes the deployment calendar to operations and business owners." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20846
ex:P20846 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ChangeReleaseApproval
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Permitting for the change/release deployment. Approve deployment based on the evaluation of business impact due to change/release." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20846" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): ratifying a single already-evaluated deployment is not a selection over a candidate set (per ex:ActOfSelection scope note), so it anchors at the generic Planned Act; its output is a Directive approval decision. Has the impact assessment (Descriptive ICE) as a typical input; left as comment per Phase-3 necessity." ;
          rdfs:label "Approve change/release deployment" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that permits a change or release deployment on the basis of its evaluated business impact and produces a change/release deployment approval." ;
          skos:example "A change manager signs off the production go-live after reviewing the impact assessment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20847
ex:P20847 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDataManagement ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITChangeControlRecord
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Recording outcomes related to the change/release deployment." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.3.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20847" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDataManagement (Act of Information Processing): recording outcomes stores a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). Gate-F fix (output mismatch): output filler corrected from ex:ITServiceSupportRecord (scoped to 8.7.8 incident/request resolution) to the dedicated ex:ITChangeControlRecord for change/release outcome documentation, matching the source ('Recording outcomes related to the change/release deployment')." ;
          rdfs:label "Document IT change/release outcome" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Data Management that records the outcomes of a change or release deployment and produces an IT change-control record." ;
          skos:example "A release engineer files the post-deployment record with results and incidents." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20848
ex:P20848 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20849
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20850
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20851
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20852
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20853
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20854
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20855
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20856
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20857
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Deploy the identified solutions for information technology important for healthy business operations. Confirm status and operational availability of IT resources. Perform testing and distribution of change. Execute roll-back protocol if necessary." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20848" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Operations category: the IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057), not has output (D4)." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement technology solutions" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that puts identified IT solutions into operational use, confirming their status and availability, distributing and testing changes, and rolling back where necessary." ;
          skos:example "An operations team installs and validates a new service across the production estate." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20849
ex:P20849 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Confirm if hardware/software are operating as per the expectation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20849" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (Act of Appraisal): confirming operating status yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE). The hardware/software is a typical Material Entity subject; left as comment per Phase-3 necessity." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm hardware/software operational status" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks whether deployed hardware and software are operating as expected and produces an IT solution validation result." ;
          skos:example "An engineer checks that the new server cluster is healthy after install." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20850
ex:P20850 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Confirm if operational activities of IT services could be performed." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20850" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (Act of Appraisal): confirming availability yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm operational availability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that checks whether the operational activities of deployed IT services can be performed and produces an IT solution validation result." ;
          skos:example "A team runs smoke tests to confirm core transactions succeed post-deployment." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20851
ex:P20851 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing IT implementation plan to make the IT services and solutions available for internal use." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20851" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Consumes the deployment plan (Directive ICE) as a definitional input; the resulting IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute internal IT implementation plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that executes the IT implementation plan to make IT services and solutions available for internal use." ;
          skos:example "An operations team runs the documented cutover to enable a service for staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20852
ex:P20852 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Confirming the completion of IT implementation." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20852" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (Act of Appraisal): confirming completion yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Confirm implementation completion" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that confirms the completion of an IT implementation and produces an IT solution validation result." ;
          skos:example "A project lead signs off that all implementation tasks are complete." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20853
ex:P20853 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing changes in software and services as per change/release schedule." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20853" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Consumes the release schedule (Directive ICE) as a definitional input; the IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Implement software change/release" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that executes changes to software and services according to the change/release schedule, modifying the IT service/solution." ;
          skos:example "A deployment pipeline applies the scheduled release to production." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20854
ex:P20854 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Perform testing after installation to confirm expected performance is met." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20854" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (Act of Appraisal): testing to confirm performance yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform post-installation testing" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that tests an installed IT solution to confirm that expected performance is met and produces an IT solution validation result." ;
          skos:example "A QA engineer runs the post-install performance suite against the new build." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20855
ex:P20855 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Distributing and implementing the release of changed IT solutions. Administer, implement, and install the releases onto internal systems. Provide methods for installing releases on client users." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20855" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Operations category: the distributed IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Distribute software components network-wide" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that distributes and installs the release of changed IT solutions onto internal systems and client users across the network, updating the IT service/solution." ;
          skos:example "A configuration manager pushes the new client package to every workstation." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20856
ex:P20856 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfVerification ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITSolutionValidationResult
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Confirming that the release has met expectations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "20856" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfVerification (Act of Appraisal): confirming success yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Verify change/release implementation success" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Verification that confirms a change or release has met expectations and produces an IT solution validation result." ;
          skos:example "A release owner verifies success criteria against the deployment's acceptance tests." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20857
ex:P20857 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:RemediationPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Execution of plan to return to the previous operating state if the change/release impedes operational expectations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.4.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "20857" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:ITRollBackManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Consumes a remediation (roll-back) plan (Directive ICE) as a definitional input; restores the IT service/solution (material participant, obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute roll-back plan" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that executes a roll-back plan to return the environment to its previous operating state when a change or release impedes operational expectations." ;
          skos:example "An operator reverts the production deployment after a failed go-live." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20858
ex:P20858 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20859
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20860
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20862
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20865
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Strategizing and executing changes in IT solutions and services. Create a plan for deploying the changes. Communicate with stakeholders about the changes. Administer and implement the changes. Train the resources who will be affected by these changes. Install changes and verify their effect." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20858" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Operations category: the rolled-out IT service/solution is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform service and solution rollout" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that rolls out IT services and solutions to the organization's end-user base, training users, communicating changes, executing the rollout, and monitoring issues." ;
          skos:example "An IT team rolls a new collaboration suite out to all staff with training and support." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20859
ex:P20859 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000234 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITTrainingProgram
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing users for changes in IT solutions. Conduct training sessions and engagement activities to familiarize users with the new changes. Implementing the programs for training IT employees." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.5.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20859" ;
          rdfs:comment "Reuse cco:ont00000234 (Act of Training): 'A Planned Act in which knowledge, skills or values are imparted from one or more Agents to at least one other Agent' fits conducting user training exactly (D5)." ;
          rdfs:label "Conduct IT training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training in which knowledge of new IT solutions is imparted to users through training sessions and engagement activities to familiarize them with the changes." ;
          skos:example "An L&D team runs hands-on sessions for staff on the newly deployed HR portal." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20860
ex:P20860 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfCommunication ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITDeploymentCommunication
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Coordinating communications regarding the changes in IT services and solutions with employees in the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.5.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20860" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to the shared ex:ActOfCommunication (wraps the D6-VERIFIED cco:ont00000402 'Act of Communication'; verification recorded in the §6 record at the ex:ActOfCommunication declaration). Gate-F consistency: re-anchored from the per-class raw IRI + redundant cco:ont00000228 co-anchor to the shared genus, which supplies the chain to the allowlisted Planned Act for the SHACL S2 graph. Has-output ex:ITDeploymentCommunication." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare and distribute service/solution communications" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Communication that prepares and transfers communications regarding changes in IT services and solutions to employees in the organization, producing an IT deployment communication." ;
          skos:example "A communications lead emails the rollout schedule and what-changes summary to all staff." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20862
ex:P20862 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDeployment ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceSolution
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:DeploymentPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Executing a plan for introducing the IT services and solutions to the organization's end user base." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20862" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfDeployment. Consumes the rollout/deployment plan (Directive ICE) as a definitional input; the IT service/solution made available is a material participant (obo:BFO_0000057)." ;
          rdfs:label "Execute rollout plans" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Deployment that executes a plan for introducing IT services and solutions to the organization's end-user base." ;
          skos:example "An IT team enables the new service for successive user cohorts per the rollout plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20865
ex:P20865 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfMonitoring ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITIssueRequest
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Track and record any issues being faced due to rollout. Define methodology of assessment for measuring and monitoring issues." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.6.5.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20865" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfMonitoring (Act of Information Processing): tracking and recording issues yields a Descriptive ICE (GOLDEN PRINCIPLE)." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and record rollout issues" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Monitoring that tracks and records the issues encountered during a rollout and produces IT issue/request records." ;
          skos:example "A support lead logs and trends the tickets raised in the first week after rollout." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20866
ex:P20866 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20867
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20873
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20880
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20888
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20895
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20905
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20921
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing and managing services for providing support to users of IT services and solutions. Define the plethora of services by which the organization assists users of computers, software products, or other information technology products." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "20866" ;
          rdfs:comment "R5/R6: the process-group node names a standing capability (no natural end), not a bounded occurrent. Modeled as cco:ont00000568 (Organization Capability) realized in its bounded child acts; no has-process-part is asserted to children (R3-style), avoiding a false universal restriction. The child 8.7.7 [20914] is itself a capability (continuant), not an act, so it takes no obo:BFO_0000054 (realized-in) edge here — that property's range is process; the partonomy to it is carried by the catalog node ex:PCF_20914." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and manage support services/solutions" ;
          skos:definition "An Organization Capability that an organization realizes in the acts by which it establishes and manages services for supporting users of IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "An IT organization's standing ability to run and govern its support-services portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20867
ex:P20867 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20868
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20869
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20870
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20871
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20872
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and establishing strategy for delivering IT services and solutions to the users. Design an IT service delivery model that defines the processes and procedures needed to deliver the IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20867" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output) because it composes a delivery strategy, a prescriptive course of action." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and establish service delivery strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input business objectives and has as output an IT strategy prescribing how IT services and solutions are delivered to users." ;
          skos:example "An IT leadership team articulates a multi-year service-delivery strategy and delivery model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20868
ex:P20868 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the goals and objectives of IT service delivery and how it contributes to the overall business objectives. Align with the business objectives of the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20868" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): it evaluates/judges contribution, yielding a Descriptive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess business objectives and IT service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input business objectives and has as output an IT value contribution assessment judging how IT service delivery contributes to overall business objectives." ;
          skos:example "An analyst appraises how the service-delivery roadmap supports corporate objectives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20869
ex:P20869 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPortfolioPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and establishing a repository of IT service delivery offerings." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20869" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): the portfolio prescribes the catalog of offerings the organization commits to deliver." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT service delivery portfolio" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT portfolio plan establishing a repository of IT service delivery offerings." ;
          skos:example "A service manager compiles the catalog of IT service-delivery offerings into a delivery portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20870
ex:P20870 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Design and maintaining an IT service delivery model that defines the processes and procedures needed to deliver the IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20870" ;
          rdfs:comment "Design (Directive output): the delivery model is a prescriptive specification of delivery processes and procedures." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and maintain IT service delivery model" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that has as output an IT service management plan defining the processes and procedures needed to deliver IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "An architect drafts and revises the IT service-delivery operating model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20871
ex:P20871 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfAnalysis ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITLandscapeData
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITRequirementsAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining locations and types of IT services and solutions which need to be delivered." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20871" ;
          rdfs:comment "Analysis (Descriptive output): it discerns and represents where and what is delivered rather than prescribing a plan." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine IT service delivery locations and activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Analysis that has as input IT landscape data and has as output an IT requirements analysis identifying the locations and types of IT services and solutions to be delivered." ;
          skos:example "A team maps which sites require on-premise versus cloud delivery." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20872
ex:P20872 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining a strategy for sourcing delivery of IT services and solutions. Examine the pros and cons of various sources that can support the delivery process. Select the most feasible and cost-effective sources." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20872" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): examining and selecting sources culminates in a prescriptive sourcing strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT service delivery sourcing strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT strategy prescribing the sources to be used for delivering IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A sourcing lead weighs in-house versus vendor options and commits to a sourcing strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20873
ex:P20873 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20874
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20875
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20876
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20877
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20878
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20879
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and creating a strategy for provision of support to users of IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20873" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): composes a support strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and develop service support strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input business objectives and has as output an IT strategy prescribing how support is provided to users of IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A support director defines the organization's IT service-support strategy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20874
ex:P20874 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:BusinessObjectives
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITValueContributionAssessment
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Assessing the goals of IT service support delivery and how it aligns to contribute to the overall business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20874" ;
          rdfs:comment "Appraisal (Descriptive output): evaluates alignment/contribution." ;
          rdfs:label "Assess business objectives and IT service support delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that has as input business objectives and has as output an IT value contribution assessment judging how IT service support delivery aligns with overall business objectives." ;
          skos:example "An analyst appraises how the support function advances business goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20875
ex:P20875 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPortfolioPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining different IT support services and solutions such as remote support and cloud support. Include planned IT initiatives and ongoing IT services (such as application support)." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20875" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): defines the committed support offerings." ;
          rdfs:label "Define IT service support portfolio" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT portfolio plan establishing the set of IT support services and solutions offered." ;
          skos:example "A support lead enumerates remote, cloud, and application support offerings into a support portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20876
ex:P20876 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfDesign ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Design and maintaining an IT support model that defines the processes and procedures needed to support users of IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20876" ;
          rdfs:comment "Design (Directive output): the support model is a prescriptive specification of support processes." ;
          rdfs:label "Create and maintain IT support model" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Design that has as output an IT service management plan defining the processes and procedures needed to support users of IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "An architect drafts and revises the IT support operating model." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20877
ex:P20877 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing a strategy for sourcing resources to support users of IT services and solutions. Establish sources that will make use of e-mail, live support software online, or a tool where users can log a call or incident in order to retrieve IT support." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20877" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): composes a support sourcing strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop IT support service sourcing strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT strategy prescribing the sources of resources used to support users of IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A manager defines the channels (email, live chat, ticketing) sourcing the support function." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20878
ex:P20878 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating an agenda for the rules and regulations of support service that deal with providing support to users of IT services and solutions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20878" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): a rules/regulations framework is a prescriptive policy." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish support service framework" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT policy prescribing the rules and regulations governing the provision of support to users of IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A governance team codifies the support-service rulebook." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20879
ex:P20879 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfSelection ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:TechnologyAssessment
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing the tools and techniques to support users of IT services and solutions, and choosing the most appropriate tools and techniques. Evaluate the pros and cons of all the methodologies and tools available. Choose the most efficient and effective methodology." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20879" ;
          rdfs:comment "Selection (ex:ActOfSelection): evaluates candidate tools/methodologies and commits to the chosen set; the choice is a Directive ICE." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide service support tools and technology" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Selection that has as input technology assessment data and has as output an IT standard specifying the chosen support tools and technologies provisioned to the support function." ;
          skos:example "A support team evaluates ticketing platforms and selects one to deploy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20880
ex:P20880 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20881
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITCustomerRequirements
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine and manage service delivery flow across different business functions. Understand the level of services needed by different stakeholders. Identify major service delivery touch points and criticality associated. Ensure timely communication with users." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20880" ;
          rdfs:comment "Lead verb Plan; Formulation (Directive output). Children are planning sub-acts under this control plan." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan and manage service delivery control" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as input IT customer requirements and has as output an IT service management plan governing the flow and control of service delivery across business functions." ;
          skos:example "A delivery manager plans service-delivery touchpoints and control mechanisms across functions." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20881
ex:P20881 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20882
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20883
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20884
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20885
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20886
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20887
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITServiceManagementPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning different delivery services for operational activities within the IT function. Use service delivery systems to manage the IT service delivery services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20881" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output). Its scheduling sub-acts are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Plan operational activities for IT service delivery" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT service management plan prescribing the operational activities for delivering IT services." ;
          skos:example "An operations lead lays out the daily/periodic IT delivery operations plan." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20882
ex:P20882 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Scheduling resources to provide service delivery to IT users. Ensure design, development, deployment, and operations are aligned with the business objectives." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "20882" ;
          rdfs:comment "Scheduling (Directive output): a resource schedule prescribes when/which resources act." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule service delivery resources" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that has as output a resource schedule assigning resources to deliver IT services to users over time." ;
          skos:example "A coordinator builds the weekly roster of delivery resources." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20883
ex:P20883 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Maintaining and scheduling batch jobs to run in the background at a certain date and time." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "20883" ;
          rdfs:comment "Scheduling (Directive output): the batch schedule prescribes job execution times." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain/optimize batch job schedule" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that has as output a resource schedule specifying when batch jobs run in the background." ;
          skos:example "An operator tunes the nightly batch window to avoid contention." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20884
ex:P20884 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determine the timely change or release of IT services or support. Assign periodic release/change to IT systems or services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "20884" ;
          rdfs:comment "Scheduling (Directive output): change/release windows are prescribed time slots." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule change/release windows" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that has as output a resource schedule assigning the windows for changes and releases to IT systems or services." ;
          skos:example "A release manager allocates the monthly maintenance window." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20885
ex:P20885 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfScheduling ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ResourceSchedule
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Schedule or optimize backup and archive activities for IT services and solutions. Use a backup system or application and archive operations data for future retrieval." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "20885" ;
          rdfs:comment "Scheduling (Directive output): backup/archive timing is prescribed." ;
          rdfs:label "Schedule/optimize backup and archive activities" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Scheduling that has as output a resource schedule specifying when backup and archive activities run for IT services and solutions." ;
          skos:example "A storage admin sets the incremental and full backup cadence." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20886
ex:P20886 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfServiceProvision ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITInfrastructureComponent
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Balancing workloads of all the processes and services that are provisioned to their internal or external clients, across available components of IT infrastructure. No component should be over or under utilized with the workflow of the IT operations." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "20886" ;
          rdfs:comment "Service Provision (operations): acts on material IT infrastructure components, attached via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), legal in operations category 8.0 (D4)." ;
          rdfs:label "Balance operational workloads across available infrastructure components" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Service Provision that distributes operational workloads across available IT infrastructure components so that no component is over- or under-utilized." ;
          skos:example "A capacity engineer rebalances VM workloads across the cluster." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20887
ex:P20887 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ITStandard
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Determining process and procedure to provide support for specific IT service problems." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "8.7.3.1.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "20887" ;
          rdfs:comment "Formulation (Directive output): support procedures are prescriptive." ;
          rdfs:label "Determine specific problem support procedures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that has as output an IT standard prescribing the processes and procedures for supporting specific IT service problems." ;
          skos:example "A support lead documents the runbook for a recurring database fault." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P20888
ex:P20888 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20889
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
