                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12182
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12183
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12184
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12185
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12186
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P12187
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:HazardousMaterial
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Planning and performing waste and hazardous goods management. In compliance with all legal, regulatory, and social/environmental requirements, plan, document, and conduct hazardous material handling, disposal, and reporting." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "10.4.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "21583" ;
          rdfs:comment "Parent of eight sub-activities (process parts). Anchored at ex:ActOfDisposition because its endpoint is the compliant removal/disposal of hazardous materials and waste." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform waste and hazardous goods management" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Disposition that plans, documents, and conducts the compliant handling, disposal, and reporting of waste and hazardous materials." ;
          skos:example "A facility's hazardous-waste program: characterizing, manifesting, shipping, and reporting each waste stream to disposal." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21584
ex:P21584 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11072
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P20147
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21585
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and managing measurement and benchmarking. Measure and benchmark the performance of internal processes, as well as the organization as a whole." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "21584" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:BenchmarkingCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Models APQC process group 13.6 as a bounded enterprise measure-and-benchmark cycle. RE-ANCHORED from cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring) to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): Act of Measuring is too narrow a genus for a group aggregate whose children also include strategy formulation (13.6.1 ex:P21585) and appraisal (13.6.2 ex:P11072), not just measurement; the broad Planned Act covers the heterogeneous cycle. R5 / SIBLING-CONSISTENCY note: 'Defining and MANAGING measurement and benchmarking' carries a standing-function signal like the 13.1 (16378) and 13.5 (11073) group nodes that are capability-only; 13.6 is modeled with the 13.4 (P11074) DUAL precedent instead -- the standing capacity is ex:BenchmarkingCapability (an Organization Capability, which the catalog could alternatively bridge), and this Planned Act is the bounded annual cycle that realizes it. ex:BenchmarkingCapability carries an explicit obo:BFO_0000054 (realized in) link to this act so the dual model is coherent. Its APQC children are process parts, not subclasses." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure and benchmark" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that constitutes an organization's bounded enterprise cycle of defining performance strategy, measuring, and benchmarking the performance of its internal processes and of the organization as a whole against standards and other organizations." ;
          skos:example "An enterprise's annual performance measurement and benchmarking cycle covering process and organization-level metrics." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21585
ex:P21585 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11075
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21586
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:OrganizationalPerformanceStrategy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating and implementing a strategy for managing organizational performance. The strategy should include approaches for measuring, tracking, streamlining, and improving internal performance. It encompasses a blueprint for the tactical measurement of internal processes and work force improvement, in alignment with Employee Metrics Developed and Managed [10526]." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "21585" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (inlined) because its definitional output is a Directive ICE (strategy). The 'and manage'/implementation facet is carried by its child processes; the parent itself produces the strategy." ;
          rdfs:label "Define and manage organizational performance strategy" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes an organizational performance strategy prescribing how an organization measures, tracks, streamlines, and improves its internal performance." ;
          skos:example "A performance management office drafts and ratifies the firm's organizational performance strategy for the planning cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21586
ex:P21586 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseMeasurementModel
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:EnterpriseMeasurementModel
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Reviewing, evaluating, and updating enterprise measurement models. Align measurement models to current and future goals and performance targets, and make adjustments to support visibility and reporting needs across the organization." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.6.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "21586" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfImprovement to ex:ActOfFormulation. ex:ActOfImprovement's differentia is modifying an existing PROCESS, SYSTEM, or CAPABILITY to raise its performance; but the object here is an Enterprise Measurement MODEL -- an Information Content Entity (Directive ICE), not a process/system/capability. The source verb 'Reviewing, evaluating, and updating' an ICE is the revision/recomposition of a directive artifact, i.e. formulation/information-processing, not improvement-of-a-system. Contrast sibling P11084, which correctly uses ex:ActOfImprovement on a CAPABILITY. The existing measurement model is the definitional has-input; the revised model is the has-output (both Directive)." ;
          rdfs:label "Maintain enterprise measurement models" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that reviews, evaluates, and recomposes an existing enterprise measurement model to align it with current and future goals, performance targets, and reporting needs." ;
          skos:example "An annual review updates the enterprise measurement model to reflect new strategic targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21587
ex:P21587 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11182
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11193
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11194
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11195
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11196
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P11197
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing the performance, costs and benefits of EHS. Measure and report the performance of EHS. Implement plans for emergency response and pollution prevention. Train and educate employees. Provide EHS support." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.8.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "21587" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:EHSManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from ex:ActOfMonitoring to cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): Act of Monitoring is too narrow a genus for this heterogeneous group aggregate, whose children are mostly NOT monitoring -- appraisal (13.8.3.1 ex:P11193 cost-benefit), implementation (ex:P11196/ex:P11197 enacting directive programs), training (ex:P11182), and generic support (ex:P11195); only ex:P11194 'Measure and report' is genuinely monitoring/measuring. Per the documented 13.6 precedent (ex:P21584: 'Act of Measuring is too narrow a genus for a group aggregate whose children also include ... appraisal ... the broad Planned Act covers the heterogeneous cycle'), the 13.8.3 aggregate is anchored at the broad Planned Act. R5 DECISION retained: this is the repeatable bounded oversight CYCLE that realizes the standing ex:EHSManagementCapability (which carries an explicit obo:BFO_0000054 realized-in link to this act), not the capability itself. Any monitoring facet lives only on the genuinely-monitoring child ex:P11194. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Monitor and manage EHS program" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that constitutes an organization's bounded EHS management and oversight cycle -- measuring and reporting EHS performance, appraising costs and benefits, implementing emergency-response and pollution-prevention programs, training employees, and providing support." ;
          skos:example "An EHS office runs the quarterly cycle of measuring, reporting, training, and supporting the EHS program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21589
ex:P21589 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21590
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21594
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21595
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21596
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21597
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Developing sustainability (ESG) capabilities for the organization. Understand and communicate legal, regulatory, and social/environmental requirements. Establish policies, objectives, guidelines and approaches for ESG efforts and reporting." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "21589" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:SustainabilityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): its definitional children produce Directive ICEs (requirement spec, goal spec, policy, measure spec, plan), so this aggregating planning parent is a bounded Formulation act, not a standing capability. (R5: 'Develop ... capability' here is the bounded composing effort; the standing capacity is ex:SustainabilityManagementCapability, which is realized in this act.) Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Develop sustainability capability" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that develops an organization's sustainability (ESG) capability by establishing its requirements, goals, policies, measures, and plans." ;
          skos:example "An ESG office stands up the sustainability program: requirements, goals, policies, measures, and plans." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21590
ex:P21590 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21591
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21592
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21593
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Identifying, documenting, and communicating sustainability requirements. Closely examine all standards and matters of compliance relating to ESG. Determine protocols or standards to comply with, set by regulatory agencies or the organizations stakeholders." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "21590" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation, NOT ex:ActOfIdentification despite the 'Identify' label: the output ex:SustainabilityRequirementSpecification is a DIRECTIVE ICE, and per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE the directive output forces a formulation genus, not identification. The 'document and communicate' clauses confirm composition of a prescriptive artifact. Its APQC children (the three Define-requirement tasks) are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Identify sustainability requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that identifies, documents, and composes the disclosure, governance, functional, and performance requirements for sustainability, producing a sustainability requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An ESG analyst documents the disclosure, governance, and performance requirements the firm must satisfy." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21591
ex:P21591 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining and communicating sustainability disclosure requirements. Clarify and align disclosure requirements to other organizational reporting requirements and needs. Integrate preparation and reporting activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.1.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "21591" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: the output is a Directive ICE (the disclosure-requirement facet of the sustainability requirement specification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define sustainability disclosure requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines and aligns the sustainability disclosure requirements an organization must satisfy, producing a sustainability requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An ESG team specifies the firm's sustainability disclosure obligations and aligns them to financial reporting." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21592
ex:P21592 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining governance requirements for sustainability. Include structure, roles, alignment to organization models, processes and standards to be applied." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "21592" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: Directive output (the governance-requirement facet of the sustainability requirement specification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define sustainability governance requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the governance requirements for sustainability -- structure, roles, and standards -- producing a sustainability requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An ESG lead specifies the governance structure and roles for the sustainability program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21593
ex:P21593 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityRequirementSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining functional and performance requirements for sustainability. Align with ESG strategies, goals, and the implementation of sustainability efforts across the organization, provide a roadmap and visibility to shared and collective requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "21593" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: Directive output (the functional/performance-requirement facet of the sustainability requirement specification)." ;
          rdfs:label "Define sustainability functional and performance requirements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that defines the functional and performance requirements for sustainability, aligned to ESG strategies and goals, producing a sustainability requirement specification." ;
          skos:example "An ESG analyst specifies the functional and performance requirements and roadmap for sustainability efforts." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21594
ex:P21594 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityGoalSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing organizational sustainability goals/objectives. Gather, align, and promote organization-wide sustainability goals that collectively address the overall sustainability requirements. Ensure the goals are measurable and have qualitative and quantitative targets." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "21594" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: 'Establish ... goals' composes a Directive artifact. Output is the Directive ex:SustainabilityGoalSpecification." ;
          rdfs:label "Establish sustainability goals/objectives" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the organization's measurable sustainability goals and targets, producing a sustainability goal specification." ;
          skos:example "An ESG committee sets organization-wide, measurable sustainability targets." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21595
ex:P21595 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityPolicy
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Establishing, documenting, and communicating sustainability policies. Develop policies, written procedures, and supporting tools to dictate how the organization will meet policy requirements." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "21595" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: creating policies/written procedures composes a Directive artifact. Output is the Directive ex:SustainabilityPolicy." ;
          rdfs:label "Create sustainability policies" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes the written sustainability policies and procedures dictating how an organization will meet its sustainability requirements, producing a sustainability policy." ;
          skos:example "An ESG office issues the corporate sustainability policy and supporting procedures." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21596
ex:P21596 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityMeasureSpecification
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Defining sustainability measures. Provide organization-wide measures, to include data collection strategies, calculations, analytics, and reporting formats." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "21596" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation: this is the act of SPECIFYING measures (a Directive measure spec), NOT the act of measuring. FALSE-FRIEND caution observed: 'measures' could lure cco:ont00000345 'Act of Measuring', which would be wrong here (the act produces a measure SPEC, not measurement data). Act of Measuring is reserved for 21602, which actually collects data. Output is the Directive ex:SustainabilityMeasureSpecification." ;
          rdfs:label "Define sustainability measures" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes organization-wide sustainability measures -- including data-collection strategies, calculations, and reporting formats -- producing a sustainability measure specification." ;
          skos:example "An ESG analyst defines the organization-wide sustainability metrics and their data-collection and reporting formats." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21597
ex:P21597 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfFormulation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityPlan
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Creating sustainability plans. Develop and socialize sustainability plans for the organization, functional units, and support services. Ensure alignment to sustainability requirements, goals, and governance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.1.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "21597" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfFormulation (under cco:ont00000511 Act of Planning): plan composition is planning/formulation. Output is the Directive ex:SustainabilityPlan." ;
          rdfs:label "Create sustainability plan(s)" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Formulation that composes sustainability plans for the organization, its functional units, and support services, aligned to sustainability requirements, goals, and governance, producing a sustainability plan." ;
          skos:example "An ESG team develops the enterprise and functional-unit sustainability plans." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21598
ex:P21598 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21599
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21600
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21601
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Managing sustainability across the organization. Provide training, support, reporting, and oversight to the distributed sustainability efforts across functional units and support services." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "21598" ;
          ex:requiresCapability ex:SustainabilityManagementCapability ;
          rdfs:comment "R5 DECISION (explicit, sibling-consistent): modeled as a bounded Planned Act mirroring 13.1.4 ex:P16392 'Manage process performance' -- a bounded administration cycle aggregating training/support/reporting children with no single definitional ICE output. Although 'Manage' carries a standing-function signal, the standing capacity is ex:SustainabilityManagementCapability (which is realized in this act); this Planned Act is its repeatable bounded realization. Its APQC children are process parts." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage sustainability capability" ;
          skos:definition "A Planned Act that administers distributed sustainability efforts across an organization by providing training, support, and reporting and oversight to functional units and support services." ;
          skos:example "Each period an ESG office trains, supports, and reports on the distributed sustainability efforts." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21599
ex:P21599 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000234 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:Stakeholder
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing sustainability training and awareness. Plan, prepare, and oversee delivery of sustainability education and enablement activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.2.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "21599" ;
          ex:requiresRole ex:StakeholderRole ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000234 (Act of Training, VERIFIED §6; parent cco:ont00000228) with explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent so Gate C sees the Act anchor -- matching the sibling-analog ex:P16393 'Provide process training'. Sustainability trainees/manager are definitional participants." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide sustainability training" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Training in which sustainability education and enablement are imparted to an organization's personnel." ;
          skos:example "An ESG trainer runs sustainability enablement workshops for functional teams." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21600
ex:P21600 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfImplementation ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Providing support for sustainability activities. Augment functional units and support teams with coaching, mentoring, and SME capacity to perform sustainability projects and activities." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.2.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "21600" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to ex:ActOfImplementation (under cco:ont00000228), mirroring the sibling-analog ex:P16394 'Support process execution': coaching/SME support enacts rather than producing an ICE; no definitional has-output." ;
          rdfs:label "Provide sustainability support" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Implementation that augments functional units and support teams with coaching, mentoring, and subject-matter-expert capacity to carry out sustainability projects and activities." ;
          skos:example "An ESG center of excellence embeds SMEs to help business units run sustainability initiatives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21601
ex:P21601 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfReporting ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21602
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001777 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:P21603
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Conducting and supporting sustainability reporting. Collect, analyze, and report sustainability performance to requirements. Align reporting across functional units and support teams." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "21601" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) to ex:ActOfReporting (subClassOf cco:ont00000379 + cco:ont00000228): as the aggregating reporting parent its definitional act is reporting performance OUT ('Collect, analyze, and report sustainability performance to requirements. Align reporting across functional units and support teams') -- a DISSEMINATE signature. The COMPILE sub-step (assembling the statement) is delegated to child ex:P21603 (which stays cco:ont00000366); measurement to ex:P21602. The has_output ICE restriction (ex:SustainabilityStatement) and both has-process-part restrictions are retained." ;
          rdfs:label "Perform sustainability reporting" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Reporting that collects, analyzes, and reports sustainability performance against requirements, aligning reporting across functional units, and disseminates the resulting sustainability statement to its reporting audiences." ;
          skos:example "An ESG reporting team consolidates measured sustainability data into the annual statement and reports it across functional units." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21602
ex:P21602 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityPerformanceMeasurement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Measuring sustainability performance. Setup, collect, and validate sustainability data. Conduct audits and inspections. Evaluate results to requirements and targets. Identify and track resolution of gaps and variances." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.2.3.1" ;
          ex:pcfID "21602" ;
          rdfs:comment "RE-ANCHORED from cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring) to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal, VERIFIED in vendored CCO: 'An Act of Measuring that involves evaluating, assessing, ... or judging the ... condition, or quality of something'; rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000345 -> ... -> cco:ont00000228 Planned Act). The source is broader than pure quantification: 'Conduct audits and inspections. Evaluate results to requirements and targets. Identify and track resolution of gaps and variances' are canonical appraisal signals (assessment of condition/value against a standard) and form the bulk of the description, not an aside. Both Measuring and Appraisal yield Descriptive ICE outputs, so the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE does not disambiguate; the appraisal genus is chosen on the de-conflated verb. REJECTED the narrower cco:ont00000345 reading and the cited analog ex:P10272 'Calculate performance measures' (pure quantification: 'Quantify ... record results'), which lacks the audit/evaluate-against-target language and so is not a clean precedent. The explicit cco:ont00000228 co-parent (now redundant via the appraisal->measuring->planned-act chain) is retained so Gate C sees the Act anchor without the CCO closure. Output is the descriptive ex:SustainabilityPerformanceMeasurement (an appraisal record)." ;
          rdfs:label "Measure sustainability performance" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that collects and validates sustainability data, conducts audits and inspections, and evaluates sustainability performance against requirements and targets -- tracking gaps and variances -- producing a sustainability performance assessment." ;
          skos:example "An ESG auditor inspects emissions data, evaluates results against targets, and logs gaps for resolution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21603
ex:P21603 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityPerformanceMeasurement
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:SustainabilityStatement
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Preparing sustainability statements. Given the multitude of potential audiences for reporting, alignment and consistency of sustainability statements provides clarity and reusability for those audiences." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "13.9.2.3.2" ;
          ex:pcfID "21603" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing), mirroring the sibling-analog ex:P10275 'Prepare performance reports': input ICEs are assembled into an output Descriptive ICE. Input is ex:SustainabilityPerformanceMeasurement; output is ex:SustainabilityStatement. COMPILE-class (kept at 366): lead verb is 'Preparing ... statements' (composing the ICE); 'audiences' is cited only as the rationale for alignment/consistency, not as a share-action. This is the compile sub-step under the DISSEMINATE parent ex:P21601 (re-anchored to ex:ActOfReporting), giving a clean compile/disseminate split." ;
          rdfs:label "Prepare sustainability statements" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing that assembles measured sustainability performance into aligned, consistent sustainability statements for an organization's reporting audiences." ;
          skos:example "An ESG reporting analyst compiles the validated metrics into the published sustainability statement." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21604
ex:P21604 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000950 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:ReturnedProduct
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Administering the reinstatement of the returned product in order to return them back to customers. Repair or remanufacture the defective or ineffective products returned by the customer. Process the delivery of the repaired or remanufactured products back to the customer." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.4.2.5.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "21604" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored at cco:ont00000950 (Act of Maintenance): the returned Material Artifact is modified to restore its functions. Returned product participates via has participant; redelivery to the customer is a non-definitional downstream sub-step." ;
          rdfs:label "Manage repair/refurbishment" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Maintenance in which defective or ineffective returned products are repaired or remanufactured to restore their designed qualities for return to customers." ;
          skos:example "A refurbishment center remanufactures returned units and routes them back to customers." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21605
ex:P21605 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf ex:ActOfTransportation ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000057 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:InventoryItem
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Moving a returned product back to inventory or stock. Whether a product is sufficient as returned, repaired, or refurbished, moving that product back to inventory for resale or returning to customer is the fnal step in Manage disposition of returned products." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "4.4.2.5.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "21605" ;
          rdfs:comment "Operations material I/O (section 4.0): the inventory item participates via has participant. Final step of disposition." ;
          rdfs:label "Return to finished goods inventory" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Transportation that moves a returned, repaired, or refurbished product back into finished-goods inventory for resale." ;
          skos:example "A warehouse operator restocks a refurbished unit into sellable inventory." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21606
ex:P21606 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating future business to business opportunities against past and current approaches and performance. Gather insights into what competitors and other similar organizations are doing and the needs, goals, and expectations of stakeholders and partners to understand potential future impact." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.3" ;
          ex:pcfID "21606" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). Performance records are the definitional comparison baseline; stakeholder/partner expectations are typical inputs recorded informally." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate B2B options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates future business-to-business opportunities against current performance and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "Strategists weigh new B2B channels against the firm's historical B2B performance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21607
ex:P21607 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001921 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:PerformanceRecord
                          ] ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating future business to customer opportunities against past and current approaches and performance. Gather insights into what competitors and other similar organizations are doing and the needs, goals, and expectations of customers and partners to understand potential future impact." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.4" ;
          ex:pcfID "21607" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal). Performance records are the definitional baseline; customer needs/partner expectations are typical inputs recorded informally." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate B2C options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates future business-to-customer opportunities against current performance and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "Strategists assess new direct-to-consumer offerings against historical B2C results." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21608
ex:P21608 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating partnership and alliance opportunities to deliver products/services. Understand existing product and market models in use across the markets you serve, evolving trends, and the cost/benefit of potential new/updated partnership/alliance options." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.5" ;
          ex:pcfID "21608" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): cost/benefit evaluation of partnership options." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate partner/alliance options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the cost and benefit of partnership and alliance opportunities and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "An alliance team weighs the cost and benefit of candidate distribution partners." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21609
ex:P21609 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating intellectual property acquisition options available to scale, modernize, and/or extend product/service reach. Understand the cost, risk, timing and lifecycle value of candidate acquisitions." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.6" ;
          ex:pcfID "21609" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): evaluation of cost/risk/value of candidate IP acquisitions." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate IP acquisition options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates the cost, risk, and lifecycle value of intellectual-property acquisition options and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "A team appraises licensing versus acquiring a patent portfolio." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21610
ex:P21610 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating innovation options to advance technology, products/services, and/or operational performance." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.7" ;
          ex:pcfID "21610" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): evaluation of candidate innovation options." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate innovation options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates innovation options for advancing technology, products, services, or operational performance and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "An innovation board weighs candidate R&D bets for the coming cycle." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21611
ex:P21611 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating sustainability requirements, stakeholder expectations, and value proposition for options. Understand the potential activities and changes across environmental, social, and governance, the effort required, cost to implement, and benefits gained. The analysis should consider sustainable product/service lifecycles, operations, infrastructure, performance, and workforce." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.8" ;
          ex:pcfID "21611" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): cost/benefit/effort evaluation of ESG options." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate sustainability options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates sustainability requirements and stakeholder expectations across environmental, social, and governance dimensions and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "A sustainability office appraises the cost and benefit of carbon-reduction initiatives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21612
ex:P21612 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating options for global support services and functions. This should include structure, scale, adaptability to change, and alternative delivery models to balance cost, performance, and customer value." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.9" ;
          ex:pcfID "21612" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): evaluation balancing cost, performance, and customer value of global-support options." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate global support options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates options for global support services and delivery models and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "A shared-services team appraises centralized versus regional global support models." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21613
ex:P21613 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating options for shared services and support functions. This should include structure, scale, adaptability to change, and alternative delivery models to balance cost, performance, and operational efficiencies." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.10" ;
          ex:pcfID "21613" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): evaluation balancing cost, performance, and operational efficiency of shared-services options." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate shared services options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates options for shared services and delivery models and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "A team appraises consolidating finance and HR into a shared-services center." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#P21614
ex:P21614 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000636 ,
                          [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                            owl:onProperty cco:ont00001986 ;
                            owl:someValuesFrom ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis
                          ] ;
          ex:apqcSourceText "Evaluating options to enhance and optimize processes and functional areas. Understand alternatives to strengthen business capabilities, enhance process efficiencies, and advance performance standards." ;
          ex:hierarchyID "1.2.2.11" ;
          ex:pcfID "21614" ;
          rdfs:comment "Anchored to cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal): evaluation of process-improvement alternatives." ;
          rdfs:label "Evaluate lean/continuous improvement options" ;
          skos:definition "An Act of Appraisal that evaluates options to optimize processes and functional areas and produces a strategic-option analysis." ;
          skos:example "A continuous-improvement office appraises lean initiatives for the operations division." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PackagingStrategy
ex:PackagingStrategy rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                     rdfs:comment "Output of 3.3.7.1, 3.3.7.4. Directive (Formulation)." ;
                     rdfs:label "Packaging Strategy" ;
                     skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes how products and services are bundled and wrapped into marketable offerings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartTrackingRecord
ex:PartTrackingRecord rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cco:ont00001808 ;
                                        owl:someValuesFrom ex:AssetPart
                                      ] ;
                      rdfs:label "Part Tracking Record" ;
                      skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity, about the parts of end-of-life assets, that records each part's source, rationale for disposition, and destination as an audit trail." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnerEvaluation
ex:PartnerEvaluation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ,
                                     [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                       owl:onProperty cco:ont00001808 ;
                                       owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPartner
                                     ] ;
                     rdfs:comment "Output of 3.2.3.6 and 3.5.5.3 (evaluate partner/alliance results). Descriptive (Appraisal); is about the SalesPartner." ;
                     rdfs:label "Partner/Alliance Evaluation" ;
                     skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the assessed performance of an organization's sales partners and alliances." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnerManagementCapability
ex:PartnerManagementCapability rdf:type owl:Class ;
                               rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
                               ex:enablesProcess ex:P10130 ,
                                                 ex:P10187 ;
                               rdfs:comment "Standing capability behind 3.4.2 and 3.5.5 (R6)." ;
                               rdfs:label "Partner and Alliance Management Capability" ;
                               skos:definition "An Organization Capability that is realized in Acts of developing and managing sales partner and alliance relationships." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnerMasterData
ex:PartnerMasterData rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ,
                                     [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                       owl:onProperty cco:ont00001808 ;
                                       owl:someValuesFrom ex:SalesPartner
                                     ] ;
                     rdfs:comment "Subject of 3.5.5.4 (manage partner/alliance master data). Descriptive; is about the SalesPartner." ;
                     rdfs:label "Partner/Alliance Master Data" ;
                     skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the maintained corpus of data on an organization's sales partners and alliances." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnerOrganization
ex:PartnerOrganization rdf:type owl:Class ;
                       rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00001180 ,
                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                         owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000196 ;
                                         owl:someValuesFrom ex:PartnerRole
                                       ] ;
                       rdfs:label "Partner Organization" ;
                       skos:definition "An Organization that bears a partner role in relation to a focal organization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnerRequirementSpecification
ex:PartnerRequirementSpecification rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                                   rdfs:comment "Minted: output of 2.3.1.1.1; not in shared list. Directive." ;
                                   rdfs:label "Design/Development Partner Requirement Specification" ;
                                   skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the essential requirements for collaborators involved in the design or development of a product or service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnerRole
ex:PartnerRole rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf obo:BFO_0000023 ;
               rdfs:label "Partner Role" ;
               skos:definition "A Role that is borne by an Organization in virtue of entering a partnership or alliance with a focal organization to deliver products or services." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PartnershipSelectionDecision
ex:PartnershipSelectionDecision rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                                rdfs:comment "Minted (Gate-F) for P18083 'Select partnerships and relationships' as the Directive chosen-option output required by the ex:ActOfSelection genus (the Descriptive ex:StrategicOptionAnalysis alone did not satisfy it)." ;
                                rdfs:label "Partnership Selection Decision" ;
                                skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes which partnerships, alliances, and make-versus-buy relationships an organization will pursue to support its extended enterprise." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PayStatement
ex:PayStatement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ,
                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                  owl:onProperty cco:ont00001808 ;
                                  owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                                ] ;
                rdfs:comment "Pay slip output of payroll administration (7.5.4); about the paid Employee." ;
                rdfs:label "Pay Statement" ;
                skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that records an employee's wages, bonuses, deductions, gross pay, and net pay for a pay period." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PaymentApproval
ex:PaymentApproval rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                   rdfs:comment "Directive: an approval authorizes (prescribes) an action; covers approve-payments, approve-reimbursements, approve credit-limit changes." ;
                   rdfs:label "Payment Approval Decision" ;
                   skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes that a particular payment, reimbursement, or credit change is authorized to proceed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PaymentAuthorization
ex:PaymentAuthorization rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                        rdfs:comment "Output of 6.3.2.8 (Authorize payment)." ;
                        rdfs:label "Payment Authorization" ;
                        skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes that a payment be made to a claimant." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PaymentInstrument
ex:PaymentInstrument rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000537 ;
                     rdfs:comment "Material input/participant of Acts of Financial Transaction (payments, salary disbursements, deposits, remittances) in 9.2, 9.5, 9.6, 9.7, 9.10, 9.11. Renamed from ex:PaymentInstrument, whose label misread as the payment EVENT; this class is the transferred MONEY (a material filler), never the act. Anchored to cco:ont00000537 to match CCO's treatment of money as a Financial Instrument (cf. Portion of Cash cco:ont00000475 subClassOf 537)." ,
                                  "Material participant of the Act of Payment in 12.4.5.5 (Process payment for legal services): the transferred MONEY moved by the act (obo:BFO_0000057), never the act, while the act's informational has-output is the separate Descriptive ICE ex:PaymentRecord (process outputs in this domain are ICEs, S3). Renamed from ex:Payment and re-anchored to cco:ont00000537 to mirror slice 9 and match CCO's treatment of money as a Financial Instrument (cf. Portion of Cash cco:ont00000475 subClassOf 537)." ;
                     rdfs:label "Payment Instrument" ;
                     skos:definition "A Financial Instrument consisting of a quantity of money (cash or funds) transferred from one Agent to another in settlement of an obligation or exchange." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PaymentMatchResult
ex:PaymentMatchResult rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                      rdfs:comment "Minted locally for 9.6.1.1: descriptive judgement of AP three-way matching. Descriptive, not Directive, because it represents a match state rather than prescribing action." ;
                      rdfs:label "Payment Match Result" ;
                      skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that records whether an accounts-payable pay-file entry matches the corresponding vendor master and purchase-order record." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PaymentRecord
ex:PaymentRecord rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                 rdfs:comment "Definitional informational output of 12.4.5.5 (Process payment for legal services). The remittance/payment record is the ICE output of the act; the transferred money itself is the material entity ex:PaymentInstrument, modeled as a definitional participant rather than as an informational output (per S3 OutputIsICE: process outputs in this domain are ICEs)." ;
                 rdfs:label "Payment Record" ;
                 skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that records a payment made to a service provider in settlement of an obligation, including payer, payee, amount, and the invoice settled." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PayrollDeductionRecord
ex:PayrollDeductionRecord rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                          rdfs:label "Payroll Deduction Record" ;
                          skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the deductions applied to an employee's salary on the basis of expenses, investments, and tax rules." ;
                          skos:example "A record of an employee's statutory and voluntary deductions for the year." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PayrollInquiryResponse
ex:PayrollInquiryResponse rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                          rdfs:label "Payroll Inquiry Response" ;
                          skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the answer given to an employee's salary-related query." ;
                          skos:example "A help-desk reply explaining a deduction that reduced an employee's net pay." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PenetrationTestFinding
ex:PenetrationTestFinding rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                          rdfs:comment "8.3.8.7 output. Descriptive." ;
                          rdfs:label "Penetration Test Finding" ;
                          skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes security weaknesses in an IT environment discovered through an authorized simulated attack." ;
                          skos:example "A pen-test report listing an exploitable misconfiguration and its severity." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PeopleObjectives
ex:PeopleObjectives rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                    rdfs:comment "Shared section-5.0 output (5.3.1.6.1). Directive: objectives prescribe intended ends for personnel." ;
                    rdfs:label "People Objectives" ;
                    skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the goals and plan of action assigned to the workforce delivering a service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceAppraisal
ex:PerformanceAppraisal rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ,
                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                          owl:onProperty cco:ont00001808 ;
                                          owl:someValuesFrom ex:Employee
                                        ] ;
                        rdfs:comment "Descriptive (Appraisal/judgement output, GOLDEN PRINCIPLE) and about the appraised Employee." ;
                        rdfs:label "Performance Appraisal" ;
                        skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes a judgement of an employee's performance against defined objectives." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceAssessment
ex:PerformanceAssessment rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                         rdfs:label "Performance Assessment" ;
                         skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes a judgement of the performance of people, processes, or other areas the Organization wants to benchmark or track." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceData
ex:PerformanceData rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                   rdfs:label "Performance Data" ;
                   skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes consolidated metrics and trends collected on the performance of a process, function, or organization." ,
                                   "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that records the performance of employees or of an HR program against defined measures." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceImprovementPlan
ex:PerformanceImprovementPlan rdf:type owl:Class ;
                              rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                              rdfs:label "Performance Improvement Plan" ;
                              skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the actions for bridging identified performance gaps." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceIndicatorSpecification
ex:PerformanceIndicatorSpecification rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Output of 2.1.2.4 and 2.3.1.13. Directive: it stipulates how performance is to be measured." ,
                                                  "Shared across 13.1.4.3, 13.2.3.1.5, 13.6.3.1, 13.8.3.2 -- one definition of 'measures/indicators' as a prescriptive artifact." ;
                                     rdfs:label "Performance Indicator Specification" ;
                                     skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the indicators and measures used to evaluate the performance of a process, project, program, or organization." ,
                                                     "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the parameters and indicators used to measure product/service or development performance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceMeasure
ex:PerformanceMeasure rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                      rdfs:comment "Modeled as Descriptive ICE when it records/reports a quantified performance value; a KPI specification prescribing what to measure, how, and against what target should be modeled separately as a Directive ICE (cco:ont00000965)." ,
                                   "Output of 3.2.4.1, 3.3.1, 3.4.4. Directive: establishing a measure prescribes what to track and the target to meet (Formulation genus)." ;
                      rdfs:label "Performance Measure" ,
                                 "Performance Measure Specification" ;
                      skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes a quantified measure of financial or operational performance." ,
                                      "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the metrics, benchmarks, and targets used to gauge performance." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceMeasurement
ex:PerformanceMeasurement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                          rdfs:comment "Genus is generic Descriptive ICE rather than CCO Measurement ICE leaf, per GOLD house style of anchoring at the descriptive parent." ;
                          rdfs:label "Performance Measurement" ;
                          skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the quantified performance of a process or organization relative to defined indicators." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceMetric
ex:PerformanceMetric rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                     rdfs:comment "Covers APQC baseline metrics, KPIs, business-value drivers, and high-level measures (1.2.6, 1.3.4). Directive because a metric/target prescribes the standard to be met." ;
                     rdfs:label "Performance Metric" ;
                     skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes a standard measure and target against which the performance of a function, process, or initiative is assessed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceMonitoringMethodSpecification
ex:PerformanceMonitoringMethodSpecification rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                            rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                                            rdfs:comment "Minted (Gate-F) for P19955 'Monitor performance against objective', whose lead verb is 'defining methodology and frequency' (a formulation act producing a Directive monitoring-method spec), not the appraisal that produces a ex:PerformanceReport." ;
                                            rdfs:label "Performance Monitoring Method Specification" ;
                                            skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the methodology and frequency by which the performance of functions, processes, and activities is to be measured and monitored against set goals." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceObjective
ex:PerformanceObjective rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                        rdfs:label "Performance Objective" ;
                        skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes a target state of employee performance against which performance is to be assessed." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceProgramEvaluation
ex:PerformanceProgramEvaluation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                                rdfs:comment "Minted locally (group 7.3, used by P10481)." ;
                                rdfs:label "Performance Program Evaluation" ;
                                skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes a judgement of the effectiveness of an organization's employee-performance-management program and the instruments used to measure performance." ;
                                skos:example "An HR review report concluding that the appraisal rubric should be revised." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceRecord
ex:PerformanceRecord rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                     rdfs:label "Performance Record" ;
                     skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes recorded performance levels of an organization's processes, functions, or units over a period." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceReport
ex:PerformanceReport rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                     rdfs:comment "Output of 3.2.4.2, 3.2.4.3, 3.2.6.4 monitoring acts. Descriptive (Monitoring genus)." ;
                     rdfs:label "Performance Report" ;
                     skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes monitored performance of functions, processes, or initiatives against established baselines or objectives." ,
                                     "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes performance, including performance gaps, trends, and analysis, for the appropriate authority." ,
                                     "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes tracked performance trends and deviations for a process, channel, or program." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PerformanceTrendAnalysis
ex:PerformanceTrendAnalysis rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                            rdfs:label "Performance Trend Analysis" ;
                            skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the trends discerned in performance results over time." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PeriodEndAdjustmentRecord
ex:PeriodEndAdjustmentRecord rdf:type owl:Class ;
                             rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                             rdfs:label "Payroll Period-End Adjustment Record" ;
                             skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes corrections to salary deductions reconciled at the close of a tax period." ;
                             skos:example "A year-end recalculation adjusting an employee's tax-deduction shortfall or surplus." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PipelineStatusAssessment
ex:PipelineStatusAssessment rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                            rdfs:comment "Minted locally (5.2.1.1): no shared-vocab ICE captures the per-stage status output of pipeline monitoring. Descriptive because it represents observed state." ;
                            rdfs:label "Pipeline Status Assessment" ;
                            skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the current stage and status of potential opportunities tracked through a sales or delivery pipeline." ;
                            skos:example "A weekly pipeline report listing each opportunity and the stage it currently occupies." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PlanAuthoringCapability
ex:PlanAuthoringCapability rdf:type owl:Class ;
                           rdfs:subClassOf ex:Capability ;
                           ex:enablesProcess ex:AuthorImplementationPlan ,
                                             ex:AuthorRoadmap ;
                           rdfs:label "Plan authoring capability" ;
                           skos:definition "Competence to author phased roadmaps and tactical implementation plans from a normative spec, with falsifiable acceptance criteria." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PlannerRole
ex:PlannerRole rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf ex:Role ,
                               cco:ont00000984 ;
               rdfs:label "Planner role" ;
               skos:definition "The occupation role of an agent producing planning documents in a delivery loop." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PolicyAndProcedure
ex:PolicyAndProcedure rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                      rdfs:comment "Output of 3.2.3.7.3 and 3.2.5.8. Directive (Formulation)." ;
                      rdfs:label "Policy and Procedure" ;
                      skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes detailed policies and procedures to be followed in conducting an activity." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PollutionPreventionProgram
ex:PollutionPreventionProgram rdf:type owl:Class ;
                              rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                              rdfs:label "Pollution Prevention Program" ;
                              skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes how an Organization reduces or eliminates the creation of pollutants through increased efficiency in resource use." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PortfolioGovernanceFramework
ex:PortfolioGovernanceFramework rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                                rdfs:label "Portfolio Governance Framework" ;
                                skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the rules, metrics, and procedures for identifying, selecting, prioritizing, and monitoring portfolio components." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PortfolioManagementCapability
ex:PortfolioManagementCapability rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                   owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                                                   owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16402
                                                 ] ,
                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                   owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                                                   owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16403
                                                 ] ,
                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                   owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                                                   owl:someValuesFrom ex:P16404
                                                 ] ;
                                 ex:enablesProcess ex:P16402 ,
                                                   ex:P16403 ,
                                                   ex:P16404 ;
                                 rdfs:comment "Standing-function reading of APQC 13.2.1 'Manage portfolio' (PCF 16401). No ex:P16401 process is minted; the catalog node ex:PCF_16401 designates this capability. Wired with obo:BFO_0000054 (realized in) to its constituent acts ex:P16402/ex:P16403/ex:P16404, mirroring the 13.1/13.5 capability pattern." ;
                                 rdfs:label "Portfolio Management Capability" ;
                                 skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to establish strategy for, govern, and monitor its business portfolio of investments, holdings, products, businesses, and brands, realized in its constituent acts." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PortfolioManagerRole
ex:PortfolioManagerRole rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000984 ;
                        rdfs:comment "Minted for recurring APQC 13.2.1 participant." ;
                        rdfs:label "Portfolio Manager Role" ;
                        skos:definition "A Role that is borne by an Agent in virtue of being responsible for governing and monitoring an Organization's business portfolio of investments, holdings, products, businesses, and brands." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability
ex:PortfolioProgramProjectManagementCapability rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ;
                                               ex:enablesProcess ex:P11119 ,
                                                                 ex:P16402 ,
                                                                 ex:P16403 ,
                                                                 ex:P16404 ,
                                                                 ex:P16406 ,
                                                                 ex:P16407 ,
                                                                 ex:P16408 ,
                                                                 ex:P16409 ,
                                                                 ex:P16411 ,
                                                                 ex:P16413 ,
                                                                 ex:P16414 ,
                                                                 ex:P16417 ,
                                                                 ex:P16418 ;
                                               rdfs:comment "Aggregate standing-function reading of APQC group 13.2 'Manage portfolio, program, and project' (PCF 16400). Sits above the three sub-capacities ex:PortfolioManagementCapability / ex:ProgramManagementCapability / ex:ProjectManagementCapability. The catalog node ex:PCF_16400 designates this aggregate. Per D8 the ProcessGroup level gets an aggregate capability node (not a process) consistent with the standing-function reading of its 'Manage X' children. No ex:P16400 process is minted." ;
                                               rdfs:label "Portfolio, Program, and Project Management Capability" ;
                                               skos:definition "An Organization Capability that inheres in an Organization in virtue of its capacity to manage its portfolio of investments and brands, its programs of related projects, and its individual projects." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PortfolioStatusReport
ex:PortfolioStatusReport rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                         rdfs:label "Portfolio Status Report" ;
                         skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the health and progress of an Organization's business portfolio as observed through monitoring." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PortfolioStrategy
ex:PortfolioStrategy rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                     rdfs:label "Portfolio Strategy" ;
                     skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes an Organization's plan for managing its portfolio of investments, holdings, products, businesses, and brands." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PositionClassification
ex:PositionClassification rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                          rdfs:comment "Minted locally (group 7.2, used by P20124): no shared-vocab ICE captured a position's classification/level-of-experience determination. Descriptive because it represents requirements rather than prescribing action." ;
                          rdfs:label "Position Classification" ;
                          skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the classification of a position together with the experience and skills required to perform it." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PostLaunchReview
ex:PostLaunchReview rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ,
                                    [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                      owl:onProperty cco:ont00001808 ;
                                      owl:someValuesFrom ex:ProductServiceOffering
                                    ] ;
                    rdfs:comment "Output of 2.1.2.5 and its task-level reviews (2.1.2.5.1-.7)." ;
                    rdfs:label "Post-Launch Review" ;
                    skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the measured market acceptance, performance, and supply-chain effectiveness of a newly launched product or service." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PreparedDataset
ex:PreparedDataset rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                   rdfs:comment "Descriptive: the validated, analysis-ready dataset. Minted distinct from ex:AnalyticsDataset (the collected/cleaned dataset of 13.7.4) so the parallel pipeline steps 20961 'Collect data' and 21461 'Prepare data' have distinct outputs. Output of ex:P21461." ;
                   rdfs:label "Prepared Dataset" ;
                   skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity consisting of a validated dataset created and verified to be fit for the initiation of analysis." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PressRelease
ex:PressRelease rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                rdfs:comment "Output of 12.5.4 (Create press releases) and subject of 12.5.5 (Issue press releases)." ;
                rdfs:label "Press Release" ;
                skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes an official statement issued to the media to announce a newsworthy development of an organization." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PreventiveLawProgram
ex:PreventiveLawProgram rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                        rdfs:comment "Output of 12.4.3 (Develop and perform preventive law programs)." ;
                        rdfs:label "Preventive Law Program" ;
                        skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes programs and activities encouraging adherence to preventive laws such as environmental, corporate-compliance, and property-transaction law." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PreventiveQualityActivitySpecification
ex:PreventiveQualityActivitySpecification rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                          rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                                          rdfs:comment "Minted: distinct from event-triggered Corrective and Preventive Action Specification; this is requirement-gap-driven prevention (output of ex:P17474)." ;
                                          rdfs:label "Preventive Quality Activity Specification" ;
                                          skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes preventive quality activities and the standard methodology for designing or conducting them in order to mitigate the risk of not meeting critical-to-quality characteristics." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PriceList
ex:PriceList rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
             rdfs:comment "Output of 3.3.3.4 (execute pricing plan), 3.3.3.7, 3.3.3.9. Directive: a price prescribes what is to be charged (Formulation genus)." ;
             rdfs:label "Price List" ;
             skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the set prices for an organization's offerings." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PricingAnalysis
ex:PricingAnalysis rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000853 ;
                   rdfs:comment "Output of 3.2.2.1 and 3.5.3.9 pricing work. Descriptive (Analysis genus); feeds the directive PricingStrategy/PricingGuideline." ;
                   rdfs:label "Pricing Analysis" ;
                   skos:definition "A Descriptive Information Content Entity that describes the analysis of demand, attributes, competitor pricing, and trends used to determine optimum prices, including estimated delivery costs, fees, and timelines for a proposed solution." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PricingApproval
ex:PricingApproval rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000965 ;
                   rdfs:comment "Output of 3.2.2.4 and 3.3.3.10. Directive: an approval is a prescriptive decision authorizing action." ;
                   rdfs:label "Pricing Approval" ;
                   skos:definition "A Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes ratification of a pricing strategy, policy, or target as authorized for use." .


###  http://example.org/apqc#PricingCapability
ex:PricingCapability rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000568 ,
                                     [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                       owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000054 ;
                                       owl:someValuesFrom ex:P10163
                                     ] ,
